window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4001,"title":"Chapter 4001 - Ancient Yuan Star","paragraphs":["“The 13th leader of Ancient Yuan Star, right? I don’t care where you’re from, but I promise you, that couple just now. If you know what’s good for you, get lost. If you dare to say another word, all of you can stay here.”","A cold voice came from within the universe boat, carrying a sense of ruthlessness. When the muscular old man heard this, his expression instantly became extremely unsightly.","He stared fixedly at the universe boat in front of him, and there was a hint of anger hidden in his eyes. However, no matter how angry he was, he did not dare to flare up. He could only suppress his anger and retreat to the side.","There was nothing he could do. After all, he was only a second-level Ruler. Faced with a mysterious great being who owned a universe boat, the only thing he could do was to bring out his own Ancient Yuan Star and see if he could intimidate the other party.","However, it was obvious that the other party did not care about Ancient Yuan Star at all.","!!","The other party was extremely tough, but he had to make a concession.","“Humph, you are quite tactful.”","Jian Wushuang sat in the universe boat and coldly glanced at the strong elder. Then, the universe boat continued to move forward and soon disappeared from the battlefield.","In the universe boat, the couple that Jian Wushuang had saved earlier had appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Thank you for saving us, sir.” The cold man bowed respectfully to Jian Wushuang with his wife.","He knew very well that if it were not for this mysterious expert, he and his wife would have died at the hands of those Space Pirates. They had indeed saved their lives, but he did not know why they had saved them.","“Get up.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand and asked, “How long have you and your wife been wandering in the universe?”","“It’s been more than 100,000 years, sir. Of course, they spent most of their time in the dark void and didn’t come to the outside of the Purple Micro Galaxy until recently,” the cold man replied.","“More than 100,000 years?” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","In fact, if he did not have a universe boat, it would take him more than 100,000 years to travel from his hometown to the outside of the Purple Micro Galaxy.","“Where are you going?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","“We want to go to the Winged Fire Star Field. One of my masters and elders is there,” the cold man said, “unfortunately, to go to the Winged Fire Star Field, we have to go through the Purple Micro Star River. However, there are countless pirates in the Purple Micro Star River. We know the dangers of the Purple Micro Star River, so we have been waiting outside the Star River until we joined a strong team. We thought we could go to the Winged Fire Star Field safely, but who would have thought...”","The cold-faced man did not continue, but Jian Wushuang already understood.","The team that the couple was in was indeed not weak. There were more than a dozen masters. In the Purple Micro Galaxy, ordinary star-island groups did not want to provoke them, but the Ancient Yuan Star they encountered this time...it was obvious that it was a very large star-island group that dared to directly attack and rob them.","“My universe boat’s destination is the Purple Micro star field. We’ll pass by the Winged Fire Star Field along the way. You and your wife can choose to stay on the universe boat. You can leave when you pass by there,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Thank you, thank you, sir!”","The cold-faced man and the red-clothed woman were overjoyed.","Their team had been killed and fled. Although they were still alive, they did not have the ability to survive in this galaxy with their strength alone, they would be easily killed by the Space Pirates.","However, if they could ride this universe boat, it would be completely different.","This cold-looking man was, after all, a Ruler. Although he had just left his hometown not long ago, he had a master and an elder who had roamed the universe for a long time. He knew some things more or less.","He was very clear that to be able to own a universe boat, this person could practically walk unhindered within the Purple Micro Star Field.","Of course, he and his wife were overjoyed to be able to follow such an important person to the Winged Fire Star Field.","“You don’t have to be so polite. We have just left our hometown to explore the universe, and the journey has been a little too boring. Now that the two of you are on this boat, you can be our companions,” Leng Rushuang said.","“You are also husband and wife?”","The cold man and the red-clothed woman seemed to understand why the master of the universe boat would save them.","...","While Jian Wushuang drove the universe boat and continued to fly in the galaxy.","Somewhere in the Purple Micro Galaxy, there was a piece of land floating quietly.","In the universe galaxy, there was neither an astral world nor a land. The reason why there was a land here was that powerful cultivators had forcibly settled a land here.","And on this continent, there were countless palaces and pavilions.","This was Ancient Yuan Star’s nest.","And Ancient Yuan Star was ranked in the top ten among the countless pirate gangs in the Purple Micro Galaxy!","Sou! Sou! Sou! Sou! Sou!","A large group of figures returned to Ancient Yuan Star under the lead of the thirteen leaders, the muscular old man.","“13th, why did you return so quickly from the hunt this time?” A hearty laughter rang out as a silver-haired, long-robed middle-aged man came forward to welcome them.","There were a total of 17 leaders on Ancient Yuan Star, and their rankings were determined by their strength.","For example, the muscular old man ranked 13th was at the peak of the 2nd tier, but he was only ranked 13th. The silver-haired, long-robed middle-aged man who appeared was also a leader of Ancient Yuan Star, being ranked 10th, it was obvious that he was already a third tier Ruler.","“Don’t mention it. It’s bad luck.” The sturdy old man said impatiently.","“Bad luck?” The silver-haired middle-aged man couldn’t help but be surprised. “What’s going on? Did we meet a tough nut on the way to hunt?”","“That’s not it.” The sturdy old man shook his head. “It’s not that you don’t know how I do things. Before I make a move against a team, I’ll first think of a way to find out the specific strength of the other party. Once I have a certain degree of confidence, I’ll make a move. It’s the same this time. Although the lineup of the team I met wasn’t bad, the people I brought out could have completely slaughtered them. But in the end, something happened on the way.”","“Unforeseen circumstances? What unforeseen circumstances?” The silver-haired, long-robed middle-aged man asked.","“When we were on the way to slaughter that team, a universe boat actually headed straight for us, and it landed on the battlefield and took away the two Rulers of that team. Those two Rulers were already on our lips,” the muscular old man said, somewhat indignant.","“Universe boat?” The silver-haired, long-robed middle-aged man was secretly shocked, then he said seriously, “Thirteen, they are just two ordinary Rulers. It is not a big deal. Since a great being with a universe boat has come forward to protect them, you can just take a step back.”"]},{"number":4002,"title":"Chapter 4002 - Unreconciled","paragraphs":["“I know great beings who own universe boat are not to be trifled with, but I am still unreconciled to the meat on the tip of my tongue. So I went forward to negotiate with the great beings in universe boat, and I even brought up my Ancient Yuan Star. Who would have thought that the other party did not care about my Ancient Yuan Star at all? He even directly asked me to get lost, and if I were to say one more word, he would kill all of us.” The sturdy old man clenched his hands tightly, in a low voice, he said, “No matter what, he is still snatching the meat from our mouths, yet he is still so overbearing, completely disregarding our Ancient Yuan Star. Of course, this makes me angry. I have been unable to swallow this anger, so naturally, I do not have the mood to continue hunting.”","“Is that so?” The silver-haired middle-aged man in the long robe nodded slightly, but then he smiled. “Why, are you not happy? Don’t tell me you want to drag out the great beings in universe boat and kill them?”","The muscular old man was stunned, but then he shook his head. “I’m not stupid. How could I dare to attack him directly? Even if I’m angry, I can only endure it.”","“It’s good that you know.” The middle-aged man in the silver-haired robe laughed, “In the universe, to be able to own a universe boat is enough to show his identity and power. Unless we have absolute confidence to figure out his true power and means, we shouldn’t provoke such a person.”","“I know, but this person has been hiding in universe boat and hasn’t shown himself. There are arrays on universe boat that block my soul probing, so I can’t find out his true power, so I don’t dare to act Rashly. However, the more this is the case, the more unwilling I am to accept it. If the other party is really a powerful great being, and he shows himself, or shows a little godly power or aura, and it really scares me, then it’s fine for me to be reprimanded by him, but what if the person in universe boat isn’t a great being, and he’s just using universe boat to put on airs? Then I’ll become a joke,” said the sturdy old man.","!!","In the universe, there were many people who relied on universe boat to put on airs.","Everyone knew that those who could own universe boat were all extraordinary, so naturally, very few people dared to provoke them.","However, the universe was so big that there were some weaker people who had obtained universe boat by chance.","In the Purple Micro Star Field alone, it had happened several times that the other party rode universe boat, but his own power was very ordinary. There was even a Principles Master who rode universe boat.","“Old man, do you think the person I met this time is a real great being, or is he just putting on an act with the help of universe boat?” Asked the muscular old man.","“I don’t know.” The silver-haired middle-aged man shook his head. “It’s hard to get a universe boat,” said the middle-aged man, “there’s no doubt about that. Under normal circumstances, those who own a universe boat must be real great beings or people with a big background. Of course, there are also some people who are lucky enough to get such a universe boat. However, such situations are rare. However, from what you just said, the other party didn’t show up at all. He didn’t even show his godly power or aura. That’s strange.”","“You think it’s strange too?” The muscular old man’s eyes lit up.","“A little, but I can’t be sure.” The silver-haired middle-aged man’s voice was calm, but his gaze suddenly turned toward the muscular old man. “Thirteen, if you’re really unhappy and feel aggrieved, and you can’t take this lying down, you can try to probe that universe boat, but don’t show yourself. Just send your subordinates to probe it, or use some other method to figure out the level of power of the great beings in the universe boat. Then you can decide whether to make a move or not.”","“Haha!” The old man laughed, “I’ve been waiting for you to say that. To tell you the truth, I’ve been planning to do that for a long time. However, I don’t need my men to test it out. I just need to wait quietly. I’ve known for a long time that the couple saved by the great beings in universe boat are going to wing fire star field. When my men fought with this couple, they used some special methods to sense their location.”","“If I’m not mistaken, this couple should have been on that universe boat the whole time. When they arrive at the wing fire star field, they will come down from the universe. We just need to go to the wing fire star field in advance and wait. Once that couple leaves the universe boat, we will immediately capture them. By then, we will be able to get information about the great being on that universe boat from this couple.”","“That’s a good idea.” The silver-haired middle-aged man in the long robe could not help nodding his head.","“However, that couple rode on the universe boat. The speed of the universe boat traveling through the universe void space isn’t something we can compare to. Whether we want to arrive at the Winged Fire Star Field ahead of time or catch up with that universe boat later, we’ll probably have to use the few universe passages in Ancient Yuan Star.” The muscular old man frowned.","The price of creating a universe passage was extremely high.","However, as a large-scale pirate force that could be ranked in the top ten in the Purple Micro Galaxy, there were indeed a few hidden universe passages in the Purple Micro Galaxy. However, they were rarely used unless there was a big deal.","“The price of using this universe passage is extremely high. Although I am also a leader of the Ancient Yuan Star, my ranking is relatively lower. If I want to use the universe passage, I have to get the approval of those few people. Old Ten, you have to help me talk to them when the time comes,” said the strong old man.","“Okay, leave it to me. When I understand the strength of the great being on the universe boat, if the other party is really putting on airs, I will go with you to deal with that person. If it is not enough, call Old Seven and Old Five,” said the silver-haired middle-aged man in a long robe.","“Haha, then thank you very much.” The strong old man finally laughed.","In the Purple Micro Galaxy, the speed of the universe boat was naturally not as fast as when it was in the dark void of the universe. Moreover, because of the frequent encounters with Space Pirates, it would more or less be affected, but the speed was still very fast, at least, it was many times faster than the speed of the cultivators.","Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang stayed in the universe boat, along with the couple.","The couple had only stayed in the universe boat for 40 years, and they had already reached the edge of the galaxy near the Winged Fire Star Field.","“Good luck, you two.”","Jian Wushuang’s laughter came from the universe boat, and then the universe boat sped up and flew directly toward the galaxy ahead.","The cold-looking man and the red-clothed woman watched the universe boat leave with gratitude.","After the universe boat completely disappeared from their sight, the couple also prepared to leave the galaxy and go to the Winged Fire Star Field.","However, they had just left.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","A large number of Space Pirates suddenly appeared and blocked the way of the couple.","..."]},{"number":4003,"title":"Chapter 4003 - Killer Coming up to You","paragraphs":["The giant universe boat continued to sail in the galaxy with the Purple Micro Star Field as its goal.","Jian Wushuang spent a lot of time on the universe boat with his wife, but he did not neglect his cultivation.","Over the years, he had refined the Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm. With the help of the Heavenly Dao will, his speed of comprehending the principles and the universe principles was ridiculously fast, especially the universe principles, he had improved at an amazing speed.","“When I was in the state of enlightenment, I comprehended both the principle of gold and the principle of darkness. The principle of gold has perfectly fused with the other principles, so I broke through to become a Ruler. Although I have comprehended the principle of darkness, I haven’t really fused it. Over the years, I have comprehended a lot of the seventh and eighth principles, but I still haven’t completely fused the principle of darkness. I feel that I’m still a little short.” Jian Wushuang sat there alone with his legs crossed, he muttered to himself.","The improvement of a Ruler’s realm was determined by the fusion principles.","He had fused five principles, so he could only be considered a second-level Ruler. Although he had comprehended the sixth principle, and even the seventh and even the eighth principle, as long as he did not fuse them...he would still be at the second-level.","Over the years, Jian Wushuang had also tried to fuse the dark principle, and he had found a way to do so. However, he was still a step away from the actual fusion.","Jian Wushuang estimated that he could break through this window at any time. When he fused the six principles, even a third-level Ruler would have a sudden increase in his overall strength.","“Under normal circumstances, the more principles I fuse, the more difficult it will be. Most Rulers in the universe have to stay at one level for a very long time before they can reach the next level. But for me, with the help of the divine realm’s will of Heavenly Dao, it’s much easier for me to fuse the principles than others.” Jian Wushuang chuckled, although he had not done anything in the past few years, he had gained a lot of benefits from the Divine Beginning Realm, and his overall strength had been increasing rapidly.","Suddenly...","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang raised his head.","He was in control of the universe boat, but his soul power had been spreading all the time. Because he had broken through to become a Ruler, his soul had also undergone a transformation. Now, his soul power could detect a wide area.","He could now sense that a large number of experts’ auras were rushing toward the universe boat.","“From the looks of it, they seem to be Space Pirates. Are they coming for me? It can’t be, right?” Jian Wushuang’s expression was strange.","However, he could sense that the Space Pirates were getting closer to the universe boat, but they still did not stop. Instead, they continued to fly straight toward the universe boat.","“Are they really coming for us?”","In the universe boat, Jian Wushuang, Leng Rushuang, and Devil Flame had gathered together. The three of them had a strange look on their faces.","“Under normal circumstances, no Space Pirates would be so blind as to come to trouble the universe boat. But these Space Pirates...” Devil Flame frowned.","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang noticed that there were many familiar auras among the Space Pirates. Among them was the 13th leader of the Ancient Yuan Star, the robust elder.","“It seems that we have caused some trouble by saving that couple last time. These pirates are from the Ancient Yuan Star.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","The universe boat had already stopped in the galaxy.","The pirates had already come to the front of the universe boat. They saw a large number of pirates gathered there. At a glance, there seemed to be no less than 200 people. Among these pirates, nearly half of them were Rulers, although most of them were only first-tier Rulers, there were still more than 20 second-tier Rulers. There were even three third-tier Rulers.","The three third-tier Rulers were clearly in the lead, and aside from them, the muscular old man was standing with them.","“This is the universe boat.” The muscular old man’s gaze was cold as he stared at the universe boat that had already come to a halt.","“Tsk, tsk, this universe boat is quite big, and its value is probably not low. It’s not a waste for us to take the universe passage to get here.” Among the three third-level Rulers, a man in black armor smiled wickedly.","“Don’t be happy too early. Let’s wait until we kill the people in the universe boat.” The silver-haired middle-aged man in a long robe said.","The many Space Pirates from the Ancient Yuan Star were staring at the universe boat with a hint of excitement in their eyes.","In the universe boat, Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to show himself. Instead, he said in a cold voice, “How dare you block my way? Are you tired of living?”","“Humph, boy, don’t put on airs. I’ve figured it out long ago. There are only three people in this universe boat. Two of them are only at the level of a second-level Ruler, and one of the guards may be stronger, but he’s probably only at the level of a third-level Ruler. How dare you say that we’re tired of living with such little strength?” The robust elder snorted.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","From the moment he entered the Purple Myrtle Star River, he had never shown his face or revealed his divine power.","After all, there was a magic formation on the universe boat, which would block the soul detection of ordinary experts. In other words, no one could tell how many people were on the universe boat from outside, what level of strength they were at?","However, the robust elder knew, and he even told them the truth.","“It’s that couple.” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","“That couple betrayed us?” Leng Rushuang frowned.","“It should be, but it’s hard to say if there’s a secret.” Jian Wushuang shook his head, and then he walked out of the universe boat.","Devil Flame wanted to go up, but he was ordered by Jian Wushuang to stay in the universe boat.","The cabin door of the universe boat opened, and Jian Wushuang slowly walked out of the cabin and appeared in front of the Space Pirates.","The Space Pirates immediately fixed their eyes on Jian Wushuang. Jian Wushuang had only fused five principles and was a second-level Ruler. The invisible pressure he gave people was also at the second-level Ruler level.","The moment the leaders saw Jian Wushuang, they immediately saw his realm.","“The couple didn’t lie. The Ruler of the universe boat is indeed a second-level Ruler!” The eyes of the strong elder lit up, and his face became a little ferocious.","The three third-level Rulers next to him also smiled.","Under normal circumstances, they would not dare to cause trouble for the experts on the universe boat. But when they learned that there were only three people on the universe boat, and that there were two second-level Rulers...and that there was a guard who was suspected to have the combat power of a third-level Ruler, they could not help it."]},{"number":4004,"title":"Chapter 4004 - Was Instantly Destroyed!","paragraphs":["“Boy, you are the owner of this universe boat, right?” The strong elder stared at Jian Wushuang with a ferocious face.","“I am.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “Where is the couple?”","“Dead,” the strong elder said directly.","“Dead?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Keke, that couple didn’t know. When they were fighting with my men, my men had left a special mark on them. As soon as they left universe boat, they were caught by us. I forced them to tell me about the experts on universe boat. At first, they were very stubborn, but you know that they are husband and wife, and they love each other very much. I directly threatened them, so it was easy for them to compromise. After I learned about your information from them, they were useless, so I naturally killed them,” the muscular elder said with a sneer.","Jian Wushuang was silent and shook his head secretly.","He did not blame the couple. After all, if he knew that Leng Rushuang’s life was in their hands, he would probably compromise.","However, the Space Pirates of Ancient Yuan Star were not weak. Not only could they kill the couple so quickly, but they could also catch up with his universe boat. It seemed that there were some hidden universe passageways in this galaxy, moreover, Ancient Yuan Star must have a few of these universe passageways.","“Boy, do you think you are so lucky to get a universe boat that you can do whatever you want in this galaxy?","“Today, I want you to taste the consequences of putting on airs in front of me. Old Ten, Old Seven, Old Five, I’ll leave them to you,” said the strong elder.","The three third-level Rulers glanced at Jian Wushuang.","“He’s only a second-level Ruler? Such a piece of trash is not qualified for me to kill him. Old Ten, kill him,” Old Five said.","“I’m a little interested in the guard beside him. Leave his guard to me later,” Old Seven said.","“If you don’t want to fight, I will.” The silver-haired middle-aged man smiled and prepared to fight.","“There’s no need to go through so much trouble.” Jian Wushuang’s voice suddenly sounded with a hint of coldness. At the same time, a black magic sword appeared in his hand.","As soon as the black magic sword appeared, a strong aura immediately spread out.","“This is...”","The Space Pirates from Ancient Yuan Star were shocked.","“A principle treasure!”","“It’s a principle treasure!”","The four leaders of Ancient Yuan Star were ecstatic. The eyes of fifth and seventh, who were not interested in Jian Wushuang, lit up.","However, before they could do anything, Jian Wushuang had already attacked.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang did not need any fancy moves at all. He just waved the Wuqi divine sword in his hand.","It was just a simple wave, and there was no astonishing aura.","Strangely, Jian Wushuang only waved the sword, but at this moment, a dazzling sword light appeared in front of the more than 200 Space Pirates in Ancient Yuan Star.","A sword light appeared in front of the more than 200 Space Pirates at the same time.","This sword light seemed to be the focus of the universe and attracted the attention of the Space Pirates.","The more than 200 Space Pirates widened their eyes.","Including the leaders, even the three third-level Rulers, their eyes were wide open and their faces were full of fear.","They stared at the sword light in front of them, trying to block it, but they found that they could not move at all.","No, it was not that they could not move, but they were moving like snails.","They were too slow, too slow to the extreme.","Of course, it was not that they were too slow, but the sword light was too fast, so fast that they did not have any chance to block it.","Chi! Chi! Chi! Chi! Chi! Chi! Chi! Chi!","The sound of the blade entering their bodies rang out almost at the same time. These Space Pirates were also wearing protective armor on their bodies. Most of these protective armor were top-tier and pinnacle true treasures, but a few of them were wearing the most powerful true treasure armor, however, at this moment, these armor were all cut open from the inside.","The Pinnacle True Treasure armor, the most powerful true treasure armor, was no different from a piece of paper in front of Wuqi divine sword.","In an instant, the eyes of more than 200 Space Pirates, including nearly half of the Rulers, including the three third-level Rulers, dimmed.","Their bodies also fell down and drifted in the galaxy.","The entire galaxy was completely silent at this moment.","More than 200 Space Pirates from the Ancient Yuan Star were turned into ashes in an instant.","Of course, one of them survived.","The one who survived was the 13 leaders, the robust elder. When Jian Wushuang waved his sword, the sword light appeared in front of all the Space Pirates at the same time, but there was no sword light in front of the robust elder.","Jian Wushuang deliberately spared a glance at the robust elder.","However, although the robust elder was still alive, he was completely shocked at this moment.","That moment just now, that sword, was still filling his mind, and it did not dissipate for a long time.","His eyes were fixed on the young man holding the godly sword in front of him, and his gaze had long become incomparably shocked.","Just a moment ago, he was still incomparably confident. He was merely a second-level Ruler, and there was no way he could cause any waves in his hands. After killing this person, that universe boat would be his.","However, he did not expect that in the blink of an eye, the three third-level Rulers and the experts from the Ancient Yuan Star he had brought with him had all died. He was the only one left alive.","After killing the experts from the Ancient Yuan Star, Jian Wushuang put away the Wuqi divine sword. He waved his hand and put the treasures left by the experts into his interspatial ring. Then he returned to the universe boat.","Seeing Jian Wushuang enter the universe boat, the strong old man did not dare to move. He was afraid that Jian Wushuang would kill him directly.","At this moment...","“Come in,” Jian Wushuang’s voice came from the universe boat.","The strong old man’s body trembled, and his heart was full of bitterness.","At this moment, he really wanted to run for his life, but he knew very well that since Jian Wushuang did not kill him directly, he must have a special purpose. If he chose to run now...he would be killed immediately.","But he did not think he could escape from the other party.","There was no other way. Although the strong elder was reluctant, he could only follow Jian Wushuang into the universe boat."]},{"number":4005,"title":"Chapter 4005 - Borrowing the Universe Passage","paragraphs":["Inside the universe boat.","“Ruler, your strength has improved a lot compared to before.” Devil Flame looked at Jian Wushuang and said with a smile.","“It’s okay.” Jian Wushuang just smiled faintly.","The burly elder who came in with Jian Wushuang curled his lips.","Jian Wushuang had killed more than 200 experts of Ancient Yuan Star, including three Rulers of the third level. How terrifying was his strength?","But this man only said that he was okay?","He did not know that Jian Wushuang had made tremendous progress in the tens of thousands of years since the end of the battle with Devil Cloud Star.","Now he was much stronger than when he had just broken through to the Ruler Realm and killed Star Demon Ancestor.","However, Star Demon Ancestor’s battle strength was already extremely terrifying among the fourth-level Rulers at that time, but Jian Wushuang was able to kill him relatively easily.","It was the same at that time, not to mention now.","Now, he did not even bother to look at Jian Wushuang, a Ruler below the fourth-level. Even if he was a fourth-level Ruler, only those who stood at the top were qualified to be taken seriously by him.","As for the Pirates of Ancient Yuan Star, the strongest one was only a Ruler of the third level. Killing them was no different from killing a group of ants to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang had already sat down on the throne above. He looked down at the trembling strong elder and asked, “How do you want to die?”","“Please spare my life, please spare my life.” The strong elder was so scared that he immediately knelt down.","“Spare my life?” Jian Wushuang’s lips curled up. “From the moment you brought Ancient Yuan Star’s Star Island to kill me, you were destined to die. No one could save you. Not to mention that you killed the couple that I saved. That’s even more heinous. The only thing you can hope for now is to die a quick death.”","Leng Rushuang, who was sitting with Jian Wushuang, also stared at the strong elder coldly.","They had saved the couple because they were touched by the fact that they had shared life and death together.","Although they did not have a close relationship with the couple, they knew that they had something in common with each other.","However, the couple was killed by the muscular elder.","“Destined to die?” The muscular elder’s face turned pale.","“Answer my question honestly. I can make your death easier.” Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold as he asked, “There should be many cosmic passages in this galaxy, right?”","“There are a few.” The robust elder’s expression had become dull. He had made up his mind and was only subconsciously answering Jian Wushuang’s question.","“Is there a universe passage that leads directly to the end of this galaxy, which is the Purple Micro Star Field?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“No.” The strong elder shook his head. “There are more top bandit forces in the Purple Micro Star Field than just our Ancient Yuan Star. Each top bandit force has their own territory. Although our Ancient Yuan Star is powerful, the universe passage can not cover the entire galaxy. The farthest one can only reach the vicinity of the heir Demon Star Field.”","“Heir Demon Star Field?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","He had a complete star map of the Purple Micro Galaxy, and he knew about the heir Demon Star Field. It was also a star field that he would pass by on this trip, but he was still a long way from it, even if he traveled by universe boat, it would take him two or three hundred years to reach it.","“It’s good that I can get to the heir Demon Star Field directly. It will save me at least 200 to 300 years.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Ruler, are you planning to go to Ancient Yuan Star and use their universe passage?” Devil Flame looked at him.","“I’m just borrowing it.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “Besides, I don’t have any enmity with Ancient Yuan Star before, but the leaders of Ancient Yuan Star actually led people to kill me. Ancient Yuan Star should at least give me an explanation, right?”","Devil Flame raised his eyebrows and understood what Jian Wushuang meant. “Not only should I give an explanation to Ruler, but they also have to pay a heavy price for it!”","“Haha, let’s talk about that later.” Jian Wushuang smiled and then continued to ask, “How many leaders do you have in Ancient Yuan Star? What is their actual strength?”","“Sir, there must be 17 leaders in Ancient Yuan Star, and the higher the ranking, the stronger they are. From the tenth leader, they are all Rulers of the third level. As for the strongest one, it is the boss of Ancient Yuan Star, a Ruler of the fourth level,” the robust elder answered truthfully.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang was a little surprised.","He did not expect that the leader of a pirate force in the Purple Micro Galaxy would have a fourth-level Ruler.","A fourth-level Ruler could become the Ruler of a second-level astral world.","“With 17 leaders and a fourth-level Ruler, they can even create a universe passage. Although this universe passage only covers a part of the Purple Micro Galaxy, it’s still quite impressive. Such a pirate force must have a lot of wealth after plundering and killing in the Purple Micro galaxy for so long.” Jian Wushuang revealed a cold smile, then he said coldly, “Take me to Ancient Yuan Star’s nest.”","The strong elder was shocked. He had vaguely guessed what Jian Wushuang was going to do. However, because of his own life, the strong elder did not dare to refuse and immediately began to lead the way.","Under the guidance of the strong elder, the universe boat immediately changed direction and headed toward Ancient Yuan Star’s nest.","Although the strong elder had used the universe passage to kill Jian Wushuang when he came from Ancient Yuan Star’s nest, he could only use the universe passage once. He had begged for a long time, the leaders of Ancient Yuan Star who were ranked higher finally agreed.","Therefore, the strong elder could not directly use the universe passage to return to Ancient Yuan Star. He could only rely on the universe boat to drive all the way.","After traveling for more than 30 years, the universe boat finally arrived near the old nest of Ancient Yuan Star.","“Sir, the old nest of Ancient Yuan Star is in front of us,” the sturdy elder said with some fear.","“Have we arrived?” Jian Wushuang looked over and indeed, there was a floating land in the void in front of them. The aura of many cultivators was transmitted from that land.","“You, go in and tell the leaders of Ancient Yuan Star the purpose of my arrival,” Jian Wushuang said.","“What?” The robust elder was startled.","“Why? You don’t want to go?” Jian Wushuang glanced at the robust elder.","“Yes, of course, I do.” The robust elder was ecstatic.","He had been staying in the universe boat before, and there was a special magic formation in the universe boat. He was greatly restricted and could not secretly communicate with them.","However, now that he was outside the nest of Ancient Yuan Star, the Ruler of universe boat actually wanted him to enter Ancient Yuan Star and personally report to the leaders of Ancient Yuan Star?"]},{"number":4006,"title":"Chapter 4006 - Give Me an Explanation","paragraphs":["The robust old man had been terrified on the universe boat for more than 30 years, because he knew that the Ruler of the universe boat would kill him sooner or later.","But now, the Ruler of the universe boat might not have the chance to kill him once he entered the Ancient Yuan Star and met the leaders there.","“Sir, I’ll inform the leaders of the Ancient Yuan Star immediately.”","The strong elder was afraid that Jian Wushuang would change his mind, so he immediately left the universe boat and rushed toward Ancient Yuan Star.","Jian Wushuang watched the strong elder leave, but he only smiled faintly.","He was not worried that the strong elder would play any tricks. After all, in front of absolute strength, any tricks were futile.","Jian Wushuang continued to wait on the universe boat, but the strong elder had already entered the Ancient Yuan Star. Soon, the Ancient Yuan Star became lively.","“Thirteen, what’s going on? When you went out with fifth, seventh, and tenth last time, why did you suddenly disappear without a trace?” A dark-skinned evil man stood in front of the strong elder, this evil man was the second leader of Ancient Yuan Star.","“The specific situation is not clear for a while. In short, Old Five, Old Seven, and Old Ten are all dead. All the people who went out with us to hunt are dead. Only I survived. The person who killed them is now outside,” the robust old man said in a low voice.","“What?” The second leader was shocked. His face suddenly turned cold. “Outside? Did you bring him here?”","“Let’s not worry about this for now. Quickly gather everyone,” the strong old man shouted.","The second leader frowned. Although he still had many questions, since he knew that the powerful enemy was already outside, he did not dare to delay. He immediately began to gather the great beings of Ancient Yuan Star.","Sou! Sou! Sou! Sou!","One after another, powerful energies rose. The leaders of Ancient Yuan Star who were staying in their lairs quickly gathered together.","A large number of figures gathered in the sky above Ancient Yuan Star, and their gazes could clearly see the gigantic universe boat not far away from Ancient Yuan Star.","“Universe boat?”","The leaders of Ancient Yuan Star were all shocked.","Under normal circumstances, Ancient Yuan Star would not dare to provoke a great being who owned a universe boat.","But now, the other party had taken the initiative to attack them.","“There are only three people on that universe boat. The strongest one is the Ruler of the universe boat. He is a second-level Ruler, but his true combat power is extremely terrifying. Old Five, Old Seven, and Old Ten all died at his hands,” the strong old man said in a low voice.","“Oh, right. where is the boss?” The strong old man looked around and suddenly realized that although the leaders of Ancient Yuan Star had almost gathered, the strongest big leader, who was the true boss of Ancient Yuan Star, had not appeared.","“As you know, boss went into closed-door cultivation not long ago, and he told us not to disturb him unless we ran into an extremely important matter,” said the second leader.","“Is today’s matter not important?” The muscular old man looked anxious. “Quick, call boss over. Only she can contend against the Ruler of universe boat.”","“Thirteen, aren’t you being a little too arrogant? You just said that the strongest person in universe boat is only a second-level Ruler. Even if he could kill fifth, seventh, and tenth, it wouldn’t be a big deal. Why would boss need to do it personally?” Said an ugly-looking young man, he had two pairs of wings on his back. This young man was the third leader of Ancient Yuan Star and had reached the peak of the third-level in terms of combat strength.","“What do you know?” The strong elder was extremely anxious.","But before he could continue, Jian Wushuang had already slowly walked out of universe boat.","As Jian Wushuang appeared, the leaders of Ancient Yuan Star immediately fixed their eyes on him.","“Thirteen, is this the Ruler of the universe boat you mentioned?”","“Indeed, judging from his aura, he is indeed a second-level Ruler. Haha, is it necessary for a mere second-level Ruler to make you so frightened?” The third leader said with contempt.","The strong elder was angry.","Jian Wushuang still opened his mouth and stared at the strong elder. “Thirteenth leader, have you told the other leaders of Ancient Yuan Star the purpose of my trip?”","Hearing this, the leaders of Ancient Yuan Star all looked at the strong elder.","“13th, you brought this man here. Why did he come here?” The second leader asked in a deep voice.","“His purpose...” The strong elder’s face was pale, he said in a deep voice, “He came to Ancient Yuan Star because he wanted to use the universe passage of Ancient Yuan Star to travel. Secondly...because I, Old Five, Old Seven, and Old Ten tried to kill him. He wanted me to give him an explanation.”","“What?” The leaders of Ancient Yuan Star were shocked and angry.","“He killed three leaders of Ancient Yuan Star, and now he dares to come here and demand an explanation from me?”","“How dare he!”","“He doesn’t even care about me.”","The leaders of Ancient Yuan Star were furious.","Many cold eyes stared at Jian Wushuang, and the third leader’s eyes were filled with killing intent.","“Why? Didn’t you tell them my purpose of coming here?” Jian Wushuang did not take these leaders seriously at all. He was still smiling lightly. “Forget it. I have no enmity with Ancient Yuan Star, but you, Ancient Yuan Star, actually dared to send people to rob me. You really don’t know what’s good for you. Ask your great leader to come out and apologize to me obediently and prepare a generous gift. Only then can you be kind.”","“You want the great leader of my Ancient Yuan Star to come out and apologize personally? And prepare a generous gift?” The anger of the leaders of Ancient Yuan Star grew even more.","“You’re courting death!” The third leader could not hold back and directly attacked.","The two pairs of wings on the back of the third leader stretched out like an eagle in the sky, swooping down on Jian Wushuang and attacking him like prey.","“Stop! Come back!”","Seeing the third leader suddenly attack, the strong old man became anxious.","He had seen the strength of the universe boat Ruler with his own eyes. Although the third leader was not weak and had peak level three battle strength, he was nothing in front of the universe boat Ruler.","In the entire Ancient Yuan Star, only their great leader could contend with the universe boat Ruler.","However, the third leader did not take his words to heart at all. His speed did not decrease, but instead, it increased explosively. A powerful killing intent burst forth from his body."]},{"number":4007,"title":"Chapter 4007 - The Great Leader","paragraphs":["“No matter what, he is only a second-level Ruler. How strong can he be?” The third leader thought.","Although he knew that the Ruler of universe boat had killed Old Five, Old Seven, and Old Ten, he could still kill the three ordinary third-level Rulers.","Of course, he did not think much of Jian Wushuang.","However, he did not know that Jian Wushuang did not kill the three leaders one by one. Instead, he killed them with one sword strike, together with more than 200 experts of Ancient Yuan Star.","If the third leader knew about this, he would not dare to attack so casually.","But now, since he had already attacked, he could not retreat.","Jian Wushuang glanced at the third leader. He did not even bother to use the Wuqi divine sword. With just a raise of his hand, an astonishing sword essence instantly rose.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Countless sword shadows formed out of thin air. They intersected and formed a huge sword net in the blink of an eye, directly covering the third leader.","The third leader did not pay much attention to this sword net until it appeared in front of him and covered him.","“What?”","The third leader only felt that everything around him was sealed. Countless sword shadows were crazily attacking him from the sword net.","He tried his best to resist. However, each of those sword shadows was so strong that they could hurt him badly. So many sword shadows were attacking him at the same time.","Chi! Chi! Chi!","The divine body of the third leader was crushed by the sword shadows, and his life force was instantly cut off.","Before he died, he did not know that he had the battle strength of a peak third-level Ruler, but why was he killed in front of a second-level Ruler without any chance to struggle?","Shocked!","All the leaders in Ancient Yuan Star were shocked when they saw this scene!","“How is this possible?”","“Third brother has the power of a third-level pinnacle. How could he be killed in an instant?”","“Is he really a second-level Ruler?”","All the leaders of Ancient Yuan Star were in disbelief.","Only the strong old man...he said in a low voice, “I told you, only the great leader of Ancient Yuan Star can fight against him. Although the Ruler of this universe boat is only a second-level Ruler on the surface, his power is incredible. He killed Fifth Brother, Seventh Brother, Tenth Brother, and more than 200 great beings of Ancient Yuan Star with just one sword attack. With just one sword attack, so many people died, and I’m the only one who survived. His power is definitely at the fourth-level, or even stronger!”","“One sword?”","The leaders of Ancient Yuan Star were all stunned.","They had thought that the Ruler of universe boat had killed Old Five, Old Seven, and Old Ten after a great battle, but they had not expected the truth to be like this.","“Quick, call the boss!”","“Quick, ask the big leader to make a move. Besides her, no one else in Ancient Yuan Star can go against the Ruler of universe boat.”","The entire Ancient Yuan Star was alarmed. The leaders of the Ancient Yuan Star felt an unprecedented pressure. This pressure came from the void in front of them. It came from the young man who appeared to be only a second-tier Ruler.","While the entire Ancient Yuan Star was in a state of panic, a powerful aura suddenly rose from within the Ancient Yuan Star.","The great leader of Ancient Yuan Star had come out of seclusion.","Buzz!","A white-robed, snow-white-skinned beauty over five meters tall appeared in front of the leaders of Ancient Yuan Star.","“Great leader!”","“Great leader!”","Upon seeing her, the experts of Ancient Yuan Star all bowed respectfully, including the leaders.","This five-meter-tall holy woman was the great leader of Ancient Yuan Star.","Although there were many leaders on Ancient Yuan Star, in fact, some of the leaders who ranked lower did not have much authority in Ancient Yuan Star, and they often changed their rankings.","Even the leaders who ranked second or third sometimes changed their rankings.","However, only this great leader had never changed her ranking since the creation of Ancient Yuan Star.","This great leader was the real leader of Ancient Yuan Star, and her strength was far above the other leaders.","Without a doubt, she was a Ruler in the fourth level, and she had been in the fourth level for a long time. In terms of battle strength, she was very strong among the fourth level Rulers.","This great leader was also the reason why Ancient Yuan Star was ranked in the top ten among the star pirate forces in the Purple Micro Galaxy.","The five-meter-tall holy woman looked cold and emotionless. She did not care about the leaders around her but looked straight at Jian Wushuang in the void.","Jian Wushuang stood there quietly with a huge universe boat behind him. Although his aura was only at the level of a second-level Ruler, for some reason...the holy woman felt a tremendous pressure from him.","“Sir, you have killed four leaders of Ancient Yuan Star. Is that enough?” The holy woman stared at Jian Wushuang.","She came out of seclusion after receiving a message from the second leader. When she came out of seclusion, she learned about what had happened from the second leader. Naturally, she also knew that Jian Wushuang had killed the four leaders.","The holy woman also knew that Jian Wushuang had killed the third leader with one sword strike.","In any case, the third leader had the battle strength at the peak of the third level, but he did not even take out a magic weapon. He just casually killed him with a wave of his hand. Such strength...the holy woman naturally did not dare to underestimate him.","She knew that he, or even a real expert, would not be weaker than her in terms of strength, and might even be stronger. Therefore, even though Jian Wushuang had killed the four leaders of Ancient Yuan Star...the holy woman did not have the slightest intention to punish him.","On the contrary, if he was willing to retreat now, she would be very happy to accept it.","“I didn’t expect that the great leader of Ancient Yuan Star was a woman.” Jian Wushuang looked at the holy woman in surprise and then smiled. “Your 13th leader has told you my purpose of coming here. I need you to give me a satisfactory explanation. In addition, I need to borrow the universe passage of Ancient Yuan Star.”","The holy woman slightly raised her eyebrows.","It was not a problem to borrow the universe passage, but Jian Wushuang wanted an explanation...four leaders had already died in Ancient Yuan Star, but he still needed to give an explanation. If word got out...it would become a big joke in the Purple Micro Galaxy."]},{"number":4008,"title":"Chapter 4008 - One Person Suppressed","paragraphs":["“Don’t you think you’ve gone too far?” The five-meter-tall holy woman said in a cold voice that echoed in the universe.","“Gone too far? Haha, you Ancient Yuan Star people know that I’m on the universe boat, but you still dare to rob me. You must have expected such consequences.” Jian Wushuang smiled coldly. “Besides, as long as you give me a satisfactory explanation, it’s already very polite that you didn’t directly destroy your Ancient Yuan Star.”","“In that case, as the great leader, it seems that I have to personally experience your methods.” The holy woman’s eyes were cold, and a cyan longsword appeared in her hand.","This holy woman was obviously a sword principle cultivator.","However, although she was a fourth-level Ruler and the great leader of Ancient Yuan Star, she did not have a principle supreme treasure in her hand. The divine sword she took out was only a supreme treasure divine sword.","Seeing the holy woman take out the divine sword, Jian Wushuang still looked at her with a smile.","“Humph, I want to see how you dare to ask me, Ancient Yuan Star, to give you an explanation.” The holy woman let out a low shout, and the holy aura on her body suddenly soared.","Buzz! A resplendent holy light rose up.","The entire universe was dyed white by this holy light, and this holy woman was like a goddess who had descended from the sky. However, this goddess held a long sword in her hand, and her eyes were filled with shocking ruthlessness, she was a war goddess.","The holy woman’s divine body suddenly expanded. Originally, she was only five meters tall, but in the blink of an eye, she suddenly expanded to several hundred meters tall. The divine sword in her hand also expanded infinitely, and then she waved her jade-like hand.","Whoosh!","A mighty and holy sword light suddenly slashed down.","The sword light seemed to be able to split the surrounding galaxy, and it was extremely powerful.","“Yes, this sword alone has the battle strength of the fourth level, and it is definitely not an ordinary battle strength of the fourth level. It has reached the upper level, and it should be very powerful among the advanced Rulers of the fourth level.” Jian Wushuang nodded secretly.","The holy woman was able to create a star island force like the Ancient Yuan Star, and she was able to survive in the Purple Micro Galaxy for a long time. Her strength was indeed extraordinary.","However, the holy woman’s strength was much weaker than that of Devil Cloud Star Master, who had killed her way to the Divine Beginning Realm.","After all, although Devil Cloud Star Master had just broken through to the fourth-level, he had a principle supreme treasure and had comprehended a trace of the universe principle. His battle strength was almost at the peak of the fourth-level.","However, even Devil Cloud Star Master, who was at his peak, could be easily killed after Jian Wushuang broke through to become a Ruler. Not to mention that he now controlled the will of Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm. With the help of the will of Heavenly Dao...after tens of thousands of years of meditation and cultivation, his strength had long reached a new level.","“Take my sword.”","Jian Wushuang also took out the Wuqi divine sword and waved it.","He did not even use the universe principles. He just used his comprehension of the universe origin of sword principle and the new power of his will.","Although Jian Wushuang was only a second-level Ruler, his divine power was no weaker than a third-level Ruler because of his perfect life, in addition, the power of his will, which was granted by the universal principle, was ten times stronger than that of a fourth-level Ruler.","In other words, in terms of divine power, he was the same as the holy woman. The only difference was his swordsmanship and his comprehension of the universe origin of sword principle.","Whoosh!","The sword light was not dazzling, but the moment the sword light flew out.","A suffocating murderous aura rose out of thin air. In the eyes of the holy woman, Jian Wushuang’s casual move seemed to represent the complete sword principle.","The rich universe origin of sword principle filled the entire world, making the entire universe void seem to be twisted into a huge sea of sword principle.","Even the sword shadow that she used was greatly affected at this moment.","“How is this possible?” Holy woman was shocked.","Her opponent’s attack had not collided with her, but she still felt that her swordsmanship was falling apart.","It was purely affected by the sword essence.","Boom!","Jian Wushuang’s sword light finally swept over. In just a moment, it completely crushed the holy woman’s mighty sword light.","The holy light in the surroundings immediately dimmed.","The holy woman’s divine body returned to five meters tall, and she was forced to retreat backward. It took her a great deal of effort to regain her balance.","The holy woman’s eyes were filled with astonishment.","“What a terrifying, terrifying sword!”","“His divine power is almost the same, and his sword is not a world-shaking sword skill. However, the sword essence contained in his sword skill is incredible. How could the sword essence directly affect my sword skill?”","“His understanding of sword principle is incredible. His understanding of the universe origin of sword principle is far better than mine. It’s even better than all the experts of sword principle that I’ve fought before. It’s too terrifying!","“Holy woman!”","The holy woman stared at Jian Wushuang in horror.","They were both experts in sword principle. When the holy woman had just fought with Jian Wushuang, she had already seen the unbridgeable gap between her and his understanding of sword principle.","According to her estimation, although the Master of the universe boat was only a second-level master, his comprehension of sword principle far exceeded that of a fourth-level master. Perhaps even among the fifth-level masters...there were few who could match up to him.","His understanding of sword principle origin was too high.","“Sir, this matter is all my fault. I, Ancient Yuan Star, am willing to give you an explanation and pay a price to appease your anger,” the holy woman quickly said.","As soon as she said this, Ancient Yuan Star was instantly shocked and in an uproar.","However, everyone immediately felt relieved.","The experts of Ancient Yuan Star were not fools. They had seen the scene just now. It was obvious that their great leader was also no match for him. In fact, the other party was much stronger than their great leader, they were on two completely different levels.","Such an expert was not someone that Ancient Yuan Star could afford to provoke.","Hence, at this moment, they could not care less about their reputation. Instead, they had to think of ways to appease the other party’s anger.","Otherwise, the other party alone could directly wipe out their Ancient Yuan Star."]},{"number":4009,"title":"Chapter 4009 - Suffer Serious Injury","paragraphs":["“If this had happened earlier, there would have been no need to go through so much trouble.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and put the Wuqi divine sword back into his interspatial ring.","The holy woman felt bitter in her heart. Although she knew that Jian Wushuang was not weak since he dared to come to her directly, she did not expect him to be so ridiculously strong, he was only a second-level Ruler, but he was so strong that even she, a fourth-level Ruler, could not resist him.","She did not know Jian Wushuang’s real strength before, so she did not want to bow her head so easily. But now that she knew his strength, she had to compromise.","“Sir, what can I do to satisfy you?” The holy woman asked directly.","“It’s simple. Take out 100 universe origin stones as an apology, and we’ll let this matter go,” Jian Wushuang said directly.","“100 universe origin stones?” The holy woman stared at him.","The leaders of Ancient Yuan Star were also shocked.","“What? Ancient Yuan Star has been in the Purple Micro galaxy for so many years and has robbed many experts along the way. He must have accumulated a lot of wealth over the years. Why can’t Ancient Yuan Star take out 100 universe origin stones?” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","The holy woman’s face was a little ugly.","100 universe origin stones was more than the total wealth of most fourth-level Rulers. Even some of the poorer fifth-level Rulers only had around 100 universe origin stones.","Although Ancient Yuan Star was a pirate force and had accumulated a lot of wealth over the years in the Purple Micro Galaxy, it was estimated that the total wealth was only a little more than 100 universe origin stones.","Now, Jian Wushuang asked for 100 universe origin stones. Even if Ancient Yuan Star could afford it, it would be a great loss.","“100 universe origin stones, no problem,” the holy woman suddenly said, with a hint of determination in her eyes.","The holy woman was able to create Ancient Yuan Star by herself not only because she was very strong, but also because she had a lot of courage. 100 universe origin stones was indeed a great loss to the entire Ancient Yuan Star, but it was not a price that she could not afford.","The holy woman pondered for a moment. She knew which was more important, 100 universe origin stones or enduring the anger of the universe boat Ruler in front of her.","“I also need to borrow the universe passage of Your Ancient Yuan Star,” Jian Wushuang said again.","“That’s even less of a problem,” the holy woman agreed readily.","“Well, do these two things well. I Won’t pursue the matter of your Ancient Yuan Star offending me, but those who offend me will die,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“No problem.” The holy woman nodded again, but her eyes directly looked at the burly elder among the experts of Ancient Yuan Star.","The other leaders of Ancient Yuan Star also looked at the burly elder.","The eyes, are extremely cold, and even some gnashing of teeth taste.","They all knew that it was this brawny old man who recklessly provoked the other party that brought this great disaster to Ancient Yuan Star, not only causing Ancient Yuan Star to lose several leaders, also let the Ancient Yuan Star had to pay the price of 100 cosmic source stones to be able to appease the other side’s anger.","This robust elder really deserved to die.","“No, no!”","“Great leader, save me, save me!”","At this moment, the robust elder was extremely crazy.","He thought that as long as he returned to Ancient Yuan Star, with the experts of Ancient Yuan Star and the great leader personally making a move, Jian Wushuang would not be able to kill him.","But now...","Yes, all the experts of Ancient Yuan Star had made a move, including the great leader of the fourth level. But in the end, he was suppressed by the other party alone. Now, the other party had to suppress Ancient Yuan Star by himself.","If she wanted to kill him now, Ancient Yuan Star could not stop her at all.","“Humph!”","The holy woman made a cold snort. She directly displayed her swordsmanship. The strong elder was only at the peak of the second level, so he could not resist the holy woman at all, he was killed in a flash.","“Sir, the person who offended you has been executed,” the holy woman said.","“That’s right.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. “Take me to the universe passage of your Ancient Yuan Star. Get the other 100 universe origin stones ready.”","“Of course.” The holy woman nodded.","After only an hour, Ancient Yuan Star handed an interspatial ring to Jian Wushuang.","There were only a few universe origin stones in the interspatial ring. Most of them were universe crystals, as well as various resources and treasures. All of them added together were worth 100 universe origin stones.","After taking the interspatial ring, Ancient Yuan Star opened another universe passage.","This universe passage led to the galaxy near the heir demon star field.","“Ancient Yuan Star, there’s no need to send me off.” Jian Wushuang smiled and led his wife and Devil Flame into the universe passage.","The leaders of Ancient Yuan Star were very respectful on the surface, but secretly, they gritted their teeth and were helpless.","It was not until Jian Wushuang completely disappeared in the universe passage that the experts of Ancient Yuan Star heaved a sigh of relief.","“This guy has finally left.”","“I, Ancient Yuan Star, am one of the top 10 Star Island forces in this galaxy. However, I was suppressed by this guy alone and had to bow my head to apologize. Moreover, he is only a second-level Ruler. If this news spreads, I, Ancient Yuan Star, will become a joke.”","“That’s true. However, although this person is only a second-level Ruler, his combat strength is truly terrifying.”","The experts of Ancient Yuan Star were all discussing.","“Enough, all of you shut up!”","A cold snort suddenly sounded. That holy woman’s gaze was ice-cold as she surveyed her surroundings.","The experts of Ancient Yuan Star were so frightened that they did not dare to make a sound.","The saintly woman said in a low voice, “This time, I, Ancient Yuan Star, have suffered a great loss. Not only did I lose several leaders, but I also paid the price of 100 cosmic origin stones. It can definitely be considered to be a bone-breaking injury. Fortunately, this person didn’t further oppress me. I, Ancient Yuan Star, have lost quite a lot this time, but my foundation is still intact. I can still think of ways to make up for these losses in the future.”","“But there is one thing you must remember.”","“In the future, when you hunt in the Milky Way, you must be clear about the target. Keep your eyes open and don’t provoke people you can’t afford to provoke.”","“Like this time, the other party was clearly riding on universe boat, and he was already destined to be extraordinary. Yet, I, Ancient Yuan Star, still provoked him. This is extremely stupid. I hope that such a thing won’t happen again in the future!”","“Do you all understand?”","The saintly woman scanned the surroundings coldly.","“Yes!”","The leaders of Ancient Yuan Star all lowered their heads in fear, not daring to look directly into the saintly woman’s eyes."]},{"number":4010,"title":"Chapter 4010 - Recognition","paragraphs":["With the help of the universe passage of the Ancient Yuan Star, Jian Wushuang arrived at the galaxy near the Devil Star Field.","However, the Devil Star Field was not Jian Wushuang’s destination. He still had to continue to travel along the galaxy.","The huge universe boat continued to shuttle through the galaxy.","Inside the universe boat.","“Husband, you are becoming more and more powerful. The great leader of Ancient Yuan Star was a fourth-level Ruler, and he was not weak in the fourth-level. But you still defeated her with only one sword strike. And if I’m not wrong, you didn’t use your real strength, did you?” Leng Rushuang looked at Jian Wushuang with interest.","As Jian Wushuang’s aura, she had some understanding of his strength and trump cards.","Jian Wushuang had comprehended the principles of the universe, and his comprehension was very high. However, when he fought with the great leader of Ancient Yuan Star, Jian Wushuang did not use the principles of the universe.","“Master’s strength is indeed getting stronger and stronger. Even if I fight with the great leader of Ancient Yuan Star, I’m not absolutely sure that I can win. But in front of master, I’m not qualified to resist at all,” Devil Flame said.","“Haha, don’t praise me too much. I’m going to lose my mind,” Jian Wushuang said with a chuckle, “Devil Flame, you’ve only recovered about 20% of your divine body. Your battle strength is indeed at the level of a fourth-level Ruler. But when we get to the Purple Micro Star Field, I’ll go to the Nine Emperor Pavilion and buy some special crystals for you to recover your divine body. When your divine body has recovered to about 30%, I’m afraid that your strength is not weaker than mine, or even better than mine.”","Although Jian Wushuang had the Nine Emperor Pavilion in his hometown, the star field he was in was too remote. Even in the nearby star field, there were very few high-level crystals.","It was too expensive to buy crystals from a star field that was too far away. Therefore, Jian Wushuang only spent 20% of his resources to restore his divine body to the Devil Flame. The battle strength that the Devil Flame could unleash...was the same as when he fought against the Devil Cloud Star Ruler.","However, if he went to the Purple Micro Star Field, it was a medium-sized star field after all. It had more resources and treasures, and they were of higher quality.","Jian Wushuang should be able to restore 30% of the divine body of the Devil Flame there, as long as he paid a certain price.","This was the real reason why Jian Wushuang forced Ancient Yuan Star to hand over 100 universe origin stones to make amends. He had no choice. He was poor. He needed universe origin stones, not only to cultivate, but also to restore the divine body of the Devil Flame, he also needed a large number of universe origin stones.","“However, my strength has improved a lot over the years. Even I don’t know what level my real strength has reached. After all, the strongest ones I’ve met before were only at the level of star demon ancestor and Devil Cloud Star Ruler. Now that I’ve finally met the great leader of Ancient Yuan Star, who also has the battle strength of a fourth-level Ruler, it’s obvious that experts at this level are no longer a challenge to me.”","“If I have the chance, I would like to fight with a real expert. I would like to know how strong I am now,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","He only had a rough estimate of his strength, but he could not be sure how strong he was without fighting with a real expert.","Therefore, he really wanted to meet some experts and fight with them.","For him, the one who could be called an expert and qualified to fight with him was at least a Ruler at the peak of the fourth level.","The universe boat continued to fly in the galaxy.","Along the way, he would meet many teams and the Space Pirates who were trying to kill them.","However, there was no doubt that these Space Pirates did not dare to rob or even block the way when they saw Jian Wushuang’s universe boat.","Time passed, and in a flash, the universe boat continued to sail in the galaxy for more than 500 years.","During these 500 years, Jian Wushuang had been unimpeded. No Space Pirates dared to block his way, nor did he encounter any unnecessary trouble.","On this day...","Universe boat sailed past a corner of the galaxy. In this corner, there was a team of no less than 100 people from Star Island. The moment they saw universe boat, they were so frightened that they immediately retreated to the surrounding void space, they did not dare to block universe boat’s way.","Universe boat did not stop at all. It soon disappeared from the sight of this team.","However, among the team of 100 people from Star Island, there was an unremarkable Ruler who suddenly widened his eyes.","“This universe boat...I’ve seen it before!”","“Blue River, what are you talking about?” A man in green armor looked over.","“Devil Cloud Star Ruler! It’s the universe boat owned by Devil Cloud Star Ruler!” The Ruler named Blue River exclaimed.","In the vast universe, there were many universe boats that looked very similar. Some of them were even standard universe boats, and there were many of them that looked exactly the same. Therefore, if one just looked at them through the mirror image...it would be impossible to tell which universe boat this universe boat belonged to.","However, this Blue River Ruler came from the star domain where Devil Cloud Star was located, and he had seen Devil Cloud Star Ruler display his godly power with his own eyes. He had even taken out this universe boat. Not only did it look exactly the same...even the energy of the arrays on the universe boat were identical.","It was precisely because of this that Blue River Ruler was able to recognize this universe boat with a single glance.","“Devil Cloud Star Ruler’s universe boat?” The green-armored man next to him frowned. “Why? Do you know the owner of this universe boat?”","“Yes.” Blue River Ruler nodded heavily. “This universe boat used to belong to a second-level star sector Ruler, Devil Cloud Star Ruler. Devil Cloud Star Ruler is a third-level pinnacle Ruler, and his combat power is quite impressive. Not long ago, a good friend of mine from the star domain where Devil Cloud Star is located contacted me and told me that this Devil Cloud Star Ruler is dead!”","“He went to attack a small, unrated star domain, but the great being from that star domain counterattacked and killed him with special methods. His universe boat seems to have fallen into the hands of a great being from that unrated star domain.”","“Oh?” The green-armored man’s expression changed. “Are you saying that the owner of this universe boat that just passed by us came from a small, unrated star field?”","“Yes.” Ruler Blue River nodded heavily.","“Are you sure?” The green-armored man asked.","“Of course I’m sure.” Ruler Blue River was absolutely certain.","“That’s interesting.” The green-armored man narrowed his eyes. “A universe domain that isn’t even a top-tier universe domain, and its supreme Rulers are only at the third level at most, right? They might even be at the second level, yet they own a universe boat?”"]},{"number":4011,"title":"Chapter 4011 - Nihility Star","paragraphs":["There were countless pirate forces in the Purple Micro Galaxy, and some of them were strong and some were weak.","For example, Ancient Yuan Star was recognized as one of the top ten star island forces in the Purple Micro Galaxy. However, although Ancient Yuan Star was not weak, compared to those star island forces that could be ranked in the top five or even the top three, he was much weaker.","The Nihility Star was widely recognized as one of the top three star island forces in the entire Purple Micro Galaxy. It was even faintly ranked first among the many star island forces in the Purple Micro Galaxy, the territory that the Nihility Star occupied in the Purple Micro galaxy was much larger than Ancient Yuan Star’s.","Ancient Yuan Star had a total of seventeen leaders. Their strength ranged from high to low, and these leaders often changed.","As for the Nihility Star, from its creation until now, there had only been three leaders. These three leaders were all powerful fourth-level Rulers, especially the first leader, Mo Chen, who had been famous for a long time, many years ago, he had already been regarded as the number one expert of the Purple Micro Star Field.","In terms of power, this first leader of the Nihility Star was definitely an extremely powerful fourth-level Ruler.","Within the towering palace, the three leaders of the Nihility Star were all gathered together.","“You said that universe boat came from an unrated small starfield?” The first leader of the Nihility Star, chief Ruler Mo Chen, looked down at the two kneeling people.","Those two were the green-armored man who had seen the universe boat earlier, and chief Ruler Blue River.","“It was Blue River who said it,” the green-armored man said.","“Leader, I can confirm that the universe boat belonged to Devil Cloud Star Master, and Devil Cloud Star Master did die in a small starfield. On the way back, I asked my good friends in Devil Cloud Star, and they confirmed it,” Blue River Ruler said.","Hearing Blue River Ruler’s confirmation, the three leaders of Nihility Star looked at each other.","The second leader said in a low voice, “Ordinary supreme masters are only second-level Rulers in a starfield that doesn’t even have a name. Very few might have a third-level Ruler. And this universe boat, since it comes from a starfield that doesn’t belong to the shooting star field, I’m afraid that the people on the universe boat aren’t very powerful.”","“That’s true,” the third leader said, “but the other party was able to kill Devil Cloud Star Master. Although he used some special methods or trump cards, who knows if he still has those methods and trump cards?”","“Blue River, tell us about the Devil Cloud Star Master’s actual strength and how he was killed. Have you figured it out?” The first leader, Ruler Mo Chen, looked down.","“Three leaders, my good friend is a Ruler under the command of the Devil Cloud Star Master. Forty thousand years ago, when the Devil Cloud Star Master led his army to that non-entering meteor field, my good friend did not follow them. Instead, he stayed in the Devil Cloud Star. Therefore, he does not know much about the specific situation. However, one thing is certain. There are indeed no experts in that star field. It is only because there are a few battlefields left behind that it appears somewhat special.”","“As for Devil Cloud Star Master, he was originally only at the pinnacle of the third level. However, when he went to that non-flowing star field, he seemed to have already broken through and reached the fourth level. The great beings in that non-flowing star field must have spent a tremendous amount of resources and methods. In addition, Devil Cloud Star Master himself had underestimated the enemy, which was why he died there. After his death, that universe boat seemed to have fallen into the hands of the Supreme Master of that Star Field, a second level Ruler,” said Blue River Ruler solemnly.","After listening to Blue River Ruler’s explanation, the three leaders’ eyes lit up.","“A second level Ruler, even if he has some trump cards, at most he can threaten an ordinary fourth level Ruler. That Devil Cloud Star Master only just broke through and was careless enough to be killed by him. But the three of us are different from that Devil Cloud Star Master.” The second leader smiled.","The three of them had not just broken through to the fourth-stage Ruler realm, but had spent a very long period of time in the fourth-stage.","The second and third leaders were both high-level fourth-stage Rulers, while the strongest first leader was definitely at the peak of the fourth-stage.","With such power, they naturally had sufficient capital.","“Big brother, are we going to do this deal or not?” The second and third leaders both looked toward Ruler Mo Chen.","“Of course.” Ruler Mo Chen laughed as well, “That is a complete universe boat. Even the lowest level universe boat is worth 60 universe origin stones. It is already worth the three of us personally making a move.”","“Big brother, you are going to personally make a move as well?” The second leader revealed a look of surprise.","In his opinion, the other party was merely a lucky second-level Ruler. Any one of the three of them could easily kill the other party and take back the universe boat. Why would the three of them need to act at the same time?","“There’s nothing wrong with being careful. Perhaps that universe boat master is really just a second-level Ruler. We can easily kill him. But what if that universe boat master isn’t as powerful as he is? Then when the three of us join forces, as long as we don’t encounter a fifth-level Ruler or a terrifying existence like Mr. Jiuxu, at the very least, we’ll be able to protect ourselves,” said Ruler Mo Chen.","“Yes, that’s true.”","The second and third leaders nodded.","The reason why the three leaders of the Nihility Star were able to live well in the Purple Micro galaxy was not only because they were extremely powerful, but also because they were very cautious and would not take risks easily.","Even though they knew that the other party came from a non-entering meteor field and that he was probably only a second-level Ruler, they still decided to move out at the same time to be safe.","Soon, the three leaders of the Nihility Star set off.","The Nihility Star had countless pirates under its command, but this time, the three leaders only brought a part of the stronger Rulers, which added up to less than 20 people. They directly used the universe channel.","Even the Ancient Yuan Star had a universe channel, but the Nihility Star, which was much stronger than the Ancient Yuan Star, had more and more perfect universe channels.","Through the universal channel, they had long arrived in front of Jian Wushuang.","In the beautiful galaxy, the ancient universe boat continued to drive. In the universe boat, Jian Wushuang and his wife were playing chess, while Devil Flame stood aside and watched quietly.","But suddenly...","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","Devil Flame suddenly raised his head.","They had already sensed that many experts were approaching at an extremely fast speed.","“I thought that other than Ancient Yuan Star, no one else would be so blind as to look for trouble with us. But now it seems that’s not the case.” Jian Wushuang sighed lightly.","He did not expect that someone would come to find trouble with him even though he was on the universe boat."]},{"number":4012,"title":"Chapter 4012 - The Three Leaders","paragraphs":["Universe boat had stopped, and more than ten experts from the Nihility Star had also appeared in front of universe boat.","Inside the boat.","“Husband, the people who came to our door this time seem to be very strong.” Leng Rushuang frowned slightly.","“Yes, they are very strong.” Jian Wushuang also nodded slightly. Although the other party had not taken the initiative to reveal his aura, with his sensing ability, he could more or less sense a lot of things.","“Ruler, should I do it?” Devil Flame asked.","“No, you two just stay in the universe boat.” Jian Wushuang smiled slightly, but he had already walked out of the boat.","Jian Wushuang came to the universe boat and looked at the more than ten figures in front of him.","The people of the void star were also staring at Jian Wushuang.","“He is really a second-level Ruler?”","The three leaders of the void star all laughed when they saw Jian Wushuang.","“Brother, it seems that your worries were unnecessary,” the third leader said with a smile.","“Be careful, it can’t be wrong,” Ruler Mo Chen said with a smile.","“You are the owner of this universe boat?” Ruler Mo Chen stared at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “Why are you blocking my way?”","“Humph, Devil Cloud Star Master is a second-level star-world Ruler and a fourth-level Ruler. How could he be defeated by someone like you?” The second leader of the Nihility Star sneered.","“Devil Cloud Star Master?” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","Obviously, Devil Cloud Star Master recognized his universe boat, which belonged to Devil Cloud Star Master.","“The Purple Micro galaxy is not too far from the star field where Devil Cloud Star is located, and Devil Cloud Star Master is very famous in that star field. All the experts who came from that star field probably know him. It’s normal for an expert from that star field to become a space pirate in the Purple Micro Galaxy,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","“Boy,” Ruler Mo Chen said, “leave the universe boat and you can go.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","Ruler Mo Chen did not kill him. He was more merciful than Ancient Yuan Star.","“What if I don’t agree?” Jian Wushuang said with a teasing smile.","“If you don’t agree, you can only die.” Ruler Mo Chen’s eyes turned cold. “Kill him.”","As soon as he finished his words, several experts from the void star around him could not hold themselves back anymore and attacked him.","There were five people who chose to attack. All of them were Rulers of the third level, and two of them had even reached the peak of the third level.","Five Rulers of the third level attacked at the same time to deal with a Ruler of the second level...in the eyes of the experts from the void star, Jian Wushuang was already a dead man.","But suddenly, Jian Wushuang attacked.","He did not take out the Wuqi divine sword. He just waved his finger as a sword casually.","In an instant, an extremely terrifying sword essence rose up.","The entire galaxy was swept into this shocking sword essence storm.","“What?”","The five third-level Rulers were shocked. They only felt that the sword essence storm they were trapped in was endless and extremely terrifying.","The storm of sword shadows crushed the five of them as easily as crushing dried twigs. Their godly bodies collapsed, and their lives were instantly cut off.","Just a casual sword attack had killed five third-level Rulers. This scene shocked many experts from the void star, including the three leaders.","“This is...”","“What a terrifying sword intent!”","“This man’s comprehension of the origin of the universe of sword principle has definitely reached an extremely high level.”","The eyes of the three leaders became solemn.","“It seems that it was not just an accident that he was able to kill Devil Cloud Star Master.” Ruler Mo Chen’s voice also became much deeper.","The second and third leaders also had a trace of solemnity on their faces.","They were not fools. Although they did not think much of Jian Wushuang, who was only at the second level and came from the non-entering meteor field, the strength that Jian Wushuang displayed at this moment...they had no choice but to be solemn.","Without a doubt, Jian Wushuang’s battle strength was at least at the fourth level.","“Second brother, third brother, you two attack together. Be careful!” Ruler Mo Chen said in a low voice.","The second and third leaders both nodded, and then two strong divine power auras rose.","The second leader directly turned into a huge black exotic beast. The black exotic beast was extremely ferocious, and its body emitted an endless brutal aura. In an instant, it rushed toward Jian Wushuang like a black lightning.","As for the third leader, he took out a broad-bladed broadsword, which was three meters long. As his body expanded, the three-meter-long broadsword also expanded and then came crashing down.","When the two leaders attacked at the same time, the power alone was enough to make people scared.","In the universe boat, Devil Flame had been watching the scene outside, but when he saw the two leaders attack, his pupils shrank.","“These two are very strong. I may not be a match for them in a one-on-one fight,” Devil Flame said solemnly.","“What?” Leng Rushuang’s expression changed. “Then husband...”","“Don’t worry, madam. These two may be very strong, but they are not strong enough in front of Ruler.” Devil Flame smiled.","Others did not know Jian Wushuang’s actual strength, but Devil Flame did. He was very clear that Jian Wushuang’s current combat strength was extremely strong. It was not something an ordinary fourth-level Ruler could compare to.","Jian Wushuang stood in front of the universe boat and watched the two leaders attack him. His expression was very strange.","“These two people clearly have the battle strength of fourth-level Rulers, and they are probably at the advanced level. They are probably slightly stronger than the great leader of Ancient Yuan Star whom I met before...just these two people have such strength, and the strongest one doesn’t seem to have made a move yet. Tsk, tsk, the Star Island forces in the Purple Micro Galaxy are quite strong. One force actually has three fourth-level Rulers at the same time.” Jian Wushuang praised, however, with a flip of his palm, the Wuqi divine sword appeared in his hand.","In the star river, Jian Wushuang directly fought with the two leaders.","Whoosh!","A brilliant sword light appeared out of thin air.","This sword light was even more dazzling than the surrounding star river, and it was huge and boundless. After it appeared, it instantly filled half of the surrounding star river, and in the blink of an eye, it collided with the black exotic beast, as well as the vast and mighty sword light that was slashing down."]},{"number":4013,"title":"Chapter 4013 - One Against Three","paragraphs":["Bang! Clang!","Two sounds of collision rang out in the galaxy.","The black exotic beast that the second leader had transformed into rolled backward after colliding with the sword light.","As for the mighty sword light that the third leader had displayed, it also dissipated, and the power on the surface of the third leader’s body was greatly suppressed.","“You two are too weak.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with disdain, but he slashed out with the Wuqi Divine Sword again.","It was still a casual slash.","However, in an instant, a shocking sword shadow that seemed to be able to split the galaxy in half hung out.","This shocking sword shadow emitted a suffocating and terrifying power.","Even though the second and third leaders of the Void Star were both fourth-level Rulers, their expressions changed when they saw this sword shadow.","“Not good.”","The great leader of the Void Star, Ruler Mo Chen, who had been standing outside the battlefield, was also shocked and immediately attacked.","Whoosh!","A sudden explosion was heard in the Starry River. A human figure descended from the sky like a Peerless War God from the universe. He held a giant axe in one hand and instantly slashed down as if he was splitting the sky and earth.","The same shocking axe instantly collided with the sword light that Jian Wushuang had swung out.","The two terrifying forces collided with each other, causing the surrounding vast galaxy to tremble violently. The brilliant galaxy seemed to have lost its color under the collision of the two forces.","After a while, the power was completely exhausted.","Jian Wushuang was still standing in front of the universe boat calmly. In front of him, the three leaders of the Void Star were standing side by side. The three leaders no longer looked down on him, on the contrary, their expressions were extremely grave.","“This man is very strong!” The second leader said in a low voice.","“Indeed, if only second brother and I joined hands, we would not be his match,” the third leader also said.","“I used almost all of my strength in that attack, but I didn’t gain the upper hand in the clash with his sword light. Only a Ruler at the peak of the fourth level could have such strength,” Ruler Mo Chen said.","Ruler Mo Chen himself was a Ruler at the peak of the fourth level. However, Jian Wushuang was not at a disadvantage in a head-on confrontation with him. His battle strength was naturally at the peak of the fourth level.","“Finally, someone who can stand out is here.” Jian Wushuang looked at the three people in front of him with a faint smile.","“Big brother, this kid is not weak. The three of us working together might be able to kill him,” the second leader said directly.","“Then let’s attack together.” Ruler Mo Chen’s eyes were cold. In the next moment...buzz!","A vast and surging dark air current swept out directly. This dark air current was cold, dark, and despairing.","As the dark air current swept out, the brilliant galaxy was covered in endless darkness. Endless dark air current filled the surrounding void, in the center of the dark air current, Ruler Mo Chen was the supreme God who controlled the endless darkness.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Ruler Mo Chen attacked directly. He held a giant axe in each hand. The two giant axes were both dark and cold. In the endless dark void, one after another, ice-cold axe shadows flashed and slashed toward Jian Wushuang.","They were extremely fast!","Moreover, each of the axe shadows was extremely powerful. Even Jian Wushuang did not dare to underestimate them.","“Interesting.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and waved the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand. He also slashed out sword lights that contained the profound universe origin of sword principle, easily blocking the axe shadows.","Around them, the second and third leaders were not idle either. The second leader transformed into a black exotic beast, which emitted a monstrous evil aura and directly merged into the Dark Void. Even with Jian Wushuang’s soul power, they could not even feel his presence.","Under the cover of the Dark Void, the second leader would strike from time to time with a fatal blow.","As for the third leader, his strength had also increased to a certain extent under the dark void. His figure soared like a heavenly demon descending into the world, and he directly slashed out with his huge saber.","The three leaders of the Void Temple, the three Rulers of the fourth level, all used their full strength at this moment. Naturally, their goal was to kill Jian Wushuang.","It had to be said that the three leaders were indeed very strong, and they cooperated very well. When the three of them joined hands, they could completely suppress an ordinary Ruler of the peak of the fourth level.","Now, when the three of them joined hands and went all out, Jian Wushuang seemed to have been completely suppressed by the three of them.","In the boundless dark void, Jian Wushuang just kept using his swordsmanship to resist the attacks around him. It seemed that he was completely trapped in the frenzied attacks of the three leaders.","After a while, Jian Wushuang shook his head and looked disappointed. “Is this the extent of your combined strength?”","“What?” The three leaders of the Void Temple were shocked.","It was indeed their strongest strength, but the Ruler of universe boat seemed to be very dissatisfied with their strength?","“With such strength, you are barely qualified for me to use my sword skills,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“Use your sword skills?” The three leaders were stunned. They realized that from the beginning until now, the other party had only casually waved his sword and attacked casually.","However, the other party had never used any powerful sword skills or ultimate moves.","After all, the three leaders could tell that although the universe boat Ruler’s realm was low, his divine power was no weaker than that of a fourth-level Ruler, the point was that his comprehension of the origin of the universe of sword principle was too high.","With such a high comprehension of the origin of the universe of sword principle, how could he not create powerful sword techniques or ultimate moves?","“If I’m not wrong, the three of you have more or less improved your strength under the dark void. Moreover, the cooperation of the three of you depends on the dark void to a large extent, right?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold, looking at the three people in front of him, he said, “In that case, I’ll break the dark void.”","“And my sword is called splitting the sky.”","Jian Wushuang’s voice slowly sounded in the dark void. He raised the Wuqi Divine Sword in his right hand, and a terrifying power began to gather in his divine sword."]},{"number":4014,"title":"Chapter 4014 - Two Dead and One Injured","paragraphs":["It had been more than 40,000 years since the end of the war with Devil Cloud Star. Jian Wushuang had been improving at a ridiculously fast speed because he had Rulered the will of Heavenly Dao in the divine beginning world.","His understanding of sword principle had reached an extremely high level. Naturally, he had also studied swordsmanship.","Over the years, he had created many different types of swordsmanship. Any one of them was enough to amaze the fourth-level Ruler.","Now, Jian Wushuang’s first move of heaven-opening had already surpassed the level of the fourth-level Ruler in terms of profundity.","This sword move was a terrifying swordsmanship that used force to crush people and tear everything apart.","Under the infusion of Jian Wushuang’s enormous divine power, this sword move became even more terrifying.","Whoosh!","Finally, this sword move was unleashed.","In an instant, the world became completely silent.","The three leaders of the Void Temple stared with their eyes wide open. They finally understood why Jian Wushuang had never displayed his true sword skill.","It turned out that his sword skill was too powerful and terrifying.","If he had used his sword skill earlier, the three of them would have fled in fear. But now...","The endless black air flow was cut off. The void, which was originally in endless darkness, seemed to have been re-created by living beings, dividing the day and night.","This endless dark void was directly cut open. Terrifying sword intent swept out, and even the three great leaders were affected. The strongest great leader was still fine, with his own strength, he was able to easily block this power that was affected.","However, the two leaders were unusually miserable under the impact of this sword intent. It was not easy for them to forcefully stop their bodies, and their bodies had already suffered a certain degree of damage under the impact of this sword intent.","“This...this is on a completely different level!” The second leader said, his face filled with terror.","“The power of his godly power is comparable, but his sword technique is simply too terrifying!” The third leader added.","“This sword technique is something that even many fifth-level Rulers who specialize in the Dao of the sword might not be able to compare to. With such a sword technique in hand, his combat power is definitely one of the most terrifying and top-tier fourth-level Rulers. With just the three of us, let alone killing him, it would be extremely difficult for us to fight him head-on.” Ruler Mo Chen’s gaze was cold. “Don’t think about universe boat anymore. Let’s go!”","“Retreat!” The second and third leaders did not hesitate.","That sword attack had indeed scared them.","However, just as they were about to move —","“Come and go as you please? How can it be so easy?” Jian Wushuang chuckled and waved the divine sword in his hand again.","In an instant, a hazy fog swept out.","The speed of the fog was extremely fast. At least, it was much faster than the three leaders’fleeing speed. In an instant, the fog had completely covered the three leaders.","After being covered by the fog, the three leaders immediately felt a terrifying sword essence from the surrounding fog, which made their hearts tremble. At the same time, it also carried a special magic formation power.","“A formation with sword essence? Is this a sword formation?” Ruler Mo Chen’s pupils constricted.","Yes, it was a sword formation!","No matter how many sword techniques Jian Wushuang had created over the years, and how powerful they were, it did not matter.","The first move of splitting the heavens just now, in terms of level and profundity, was already comparable to the most powerful move of many fifth-level Rulers.","However, the first move of splitting the heavens was not Jian Wushuang’s strongest sword technique.","Jian Wushuang’s strongest and most terrifying sword formation was the three sword formations he created!","The hazy sword formation, the Wave Light Sword Formation, and the Earth Protection Sword Formation, one for attacking, one for trapping and entangling, and one for absolute defense!","These three sword formations formed the most complete sword formation system. Over the years, while Jian Wushuang improved his comprehension of sword principle and created all kinds of sword skills, he never fell behind in his research of the three sword formations, after 40,000 years, the three sword formations had reached a new level.","Now that the hazy fog had swept out, what Jian Wushuang displayed was the most terrifying of the three sword formations, the Hazy Sword Formation!","“Since you’re here, don’t think of leaving so easily without paying a price.” Jian Wushuang smiled. The hazy sword formation had already displayed its terrifying power.","Within the hazy fog, terrifying sword lights attacked the three leaders of the Nihility Star without any warning.","Although the three leaders were all powerful, it was difficult for them to resist the sudden sword light because of the fog.","It was only a single exchange. Chi! Chi!","The second and third leaders were struck by the sword-light at the same time. Although they did not die immediately, their divine bodies instantly collapsed, and more than half of their divine power was consumed.","“No! No!”","After the second and third leaders recovered their divine bodies, they were both completely terrified.","“Second brother, third brother!” Ruler Mo Chen’s face turned pale with fright.","He was the most powerful of them all. Although his body had been damaged by the sword-light, he had not directly collapsed.","However, the second and third leaders were clearly unable to block it.","Yet another wave of sword-light swept over.","“Big brother, run!”","“Run!”","A hysterical howl rang out from the second leader’s mouth. The second leader was completely drowned out by the sword-light, and without the slightest chance of struggle, he died on the spot.","As for the third leader, he had similarly followed in the footsteps of the second leader.","When Ruler Mo Chen saw this scene, he instantly felt as if his eyes were about to explode. However, no matter how furious and crazed he was, he knew that the other party’s strength was simply not something he could contend against.","Even he himself was barely able to survive in this sword formation. There was no way for him to save the lives of the second and third leaders. He could only watch as these two great leaders died in front of him.","After all, the three leaders of the Void Temple had existed since the establishment of the Void Temple. Their relationship was incomparable.","But now, the two leaders had died in an accident. Even he was on the verge of death.","“Ahhh!”","With a furious roar, the desperate Ruler Mo Chen suddenly turned scarlet. A terrifying aura swept out from his body. His strength and speed had reached a whole new level, at this moment, his strength and speed had reached a whole new level.","This sudden change made Jian Wushuang slightly surprised, but before he could make a move, the scarlet-red Ruler Mo Chen had already rushed out of the range of the sword formation and fled frantically toward the surrounding galaxies, his speed was so fast that even Jian Wushuang did not have the slightest desire to chase after him."]},{"number":4015,"title":"Chapter 4015 - Revenge!","paragraphs":["“He ran away so fast!”","Jian Wushuang was surprised when he saw Ruler Mo Chen disappear from his sight.","It was obvious that Ruler Mo Chen had used his life-saving trump card, which was very powerful. Even Jian Wushuang had let him escape easily.","“However, killing two fourth-level Rulers is not bad.” Jian Wushuang smiled. With a wave of his hand, the treasures and interspatial rings left by the two leaders of the Void Temple came to him.","Jian Wushuang counted them slightly, and his eyes lit up.","“Not bad. As expected of a fourth-level Ruler, and a pirate leader who has been plundering in the Purple Micro Galaxy all year round. Although he doesn’t have any nomological treasures, his wealth is quite impressive. The total wealth of these two people is probably equivalent to 150 universe origin stones.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Previously, he had suppressed Ancient Yuan Star with his own strength and only obtained 100 universe origin stones. This was on the premise that Ancient Yuan Star was severely injured.","But now, the space pirates who came to kill him were obviously more powerful than Ancient Yuan Star, so their wealth was naturally thicker.","After collecting the treasures, Jian Wushuang returned to the universe boat. As for the space pirates who came at the same time as the three leaders, they were scared and fled in all directions. Jian Wushuang was too lazy to chase after them","Soon, the universe boat continued to move forward.","In the void far away from the battlefield, a scarlet blood light suddenly stopped, and a figure slowly emerged.","This figure was, of course, Ruler Mo Chen, who had just escaped from Jian Wushuang’s hands.","As the great leader of the Void Star and a Ruler at the peak of the fourth level, Ruler Mo Chen had been able to do whatever he wanted in the Purple Micro Galaxy for a long time. But today...","“Second brother, third brother!”","Ruler Mo Chen’s expression was terrifyingly dark. His icy cold eyes were filled with hatred.","The three great leaders of the Nihility Star were brothers who had walked through life and death together. Later on, the three of them had joined hands to create the Nihility Star. In terms of feelings, they were no less than brothers.","However, today, his second and third brothers had been killed right in front of him.","He had witnessed the whole process, but he could not do anything about it. Even he had to use his life-saving secret skill to survive.","“So powerful!”","“That man is only a second-level Ruler, but he is ridiculously powerful. Not only is his divine power as powerful as a fourth-level Ruler, but his understanding of the origin of sword principle and his terrifying swordsmanship, especially the sword formation he used at the end!”","The scene of Jian Wushuang using the hazy sword formation immediately appeared in Ruler Mo Chen’s mind.","As soon as the sword formation appeared, the hazy sword light suddenly attacked from every corner. It was incredibly fast, and the most important thing was that it was ridiculously powerful.","“That sword formation is too terrifying. Against such a sword formation, even if I’m several times stronger, I won’t have a chance to survive.” Ruler Mo Chen’s face was distorted, “The difference in strength is too great. Even if he killed my second and third brothers, I, I, I won’t be able to take revenge!”","There was no doubt that Ruler Mo Chen wanted to avenge his two brothers.","However, Jian Wushuang’s strength made him despair.","It was impossible for him to take revenge on his own, at least not now.","Jian Wushuang was riding on the universe boat and flying in the galaxy. It was obvious that he was just passing by the Purple Micro Galaxy. Moreover, his opponent was at the second level, so his talent and potential were far stronger than his, in other words, as long as he missed now, it was almost impossible for him to find Jian Wushuang in the future.","“No, he must die!”","“No matter what price I have to pay, even if it means risking my life, I will kill him and avenge my second and third brothers!”","Ruler Mo Chen clenched his hands tightly. His fingernails had already dug into his flesh and blood, causing blood to flow out.","He was desperately trying to think of a way to kill Jian Wushuang. At this moment, countless thoughts flashed through his mind, but most of them were not confident that he could kill Jian Wushuang.","Suddenly...Ruler Mo Chen’s eyes lit up.","“Mr. Nine Whiskers!” Ruler Mo Chen thought of a person.","This was a supreme figure who was enough to make Ruler Mo Chen feel fear and despair.","One had to know that with Ruler Mo Chen’s strength, he was almost invincible in the Purple Micro Galaxy. Although the large number of pirate forces in the Purple Micro galaxy were not ordinary fourth level Rulers...however, only one or two of them could match Ruler Mo Chen’s strength.","Although his strength could match Ruler Mo Chen’s, Ruler Mo Chen was not afraid of him.","However, that Mr. Nine Whiskers definitely had the qualifications to frighten Ruler Mo Chen. One could imagine how terrifying the other party’s strength was.","“Yes, find Mr. Nine Whiskers. With his strength, he should be able to kill the Ruler of the universe boat. As long as I can invite him, I will have the chance to avenge my second and third brother!” Ruler Mo Chen’s eyes flickered with a bright light, after making his decision, he immediately set off.","A space pirate faction occupied a part of the Purple Micro Galaxy. This space pirate faction was called the Ice Heart Valley.","In terms of strength, this Ice Heart Valley could not be compared to the large-scale space pirate factions like the Nihility Star and the Ancient Yuan Star. It was even inferior to many space pirate factions in the Purple Micro Galaxy, it was merely an insignificant small-scale space pirate faction in the Purple Micro Galaxy. There were only over a hundred people on the Star Island under its command. The previous leader was only a second-tier Ruler.","However, since the arrival of a mysterious expert thousands of years ago, the status of the Ice Heart Valley in the Purple Micro galaxy was completely different.","Although the overall strength of the current Ice Heart Valley was still far from the strength of the large-scale space pirates, the large-scale space pirate forces such as the Nihility Star and the Ancient Yuan Star would never dare to provoke the Ice Heart Valley.","The reason was that the mysterious expert in Ice Heart Valley was called Nine Whiskers!","Hu!","Ruler Mo Chen directly used the space passage of Nihility Star and arrived outside Ice Heart Valley at the fastest speed.","“Please report that the Great Leader of Nihility Star, Mo Chen, is here to pay his respects to Mr. Nine Whiskers.” Ruler Mo Chen did not put on any airs.","The space pirates of the Ice Heart Valley were all shocked when they heard Ruler Mo Chen’s words.","The great leader of the Nihility Star? He was the most supreme existence in the entire Purple Micro Galaxy. Normally, the entire Purple Micro galaxy would tremble if he stomped his feet. As for the Ice Heart Valley...they were not qualified to come into contact with such a supreme existence before. However, the other party had taken the initiative to come and pay him a visit. Instead, he was extremely obedient and did not put on any airs.","All of this was because of the Lord in Ice Heart Valley.","Soon, the space pirates of Ice Heart Valley went to report."]},{"number":4016,"title":"Chapter 4016 - Mr. Nine Whiskers","paragraphs":["Inside the Ice Heart Valley, in a simple wooden house, a white-haired man with a long beard was sitting on a futon. This white-haired man was thin and weak, as if he could be blown down by the wind.","However, even though he looked extremely thin and weak, he had an unprecedented reputation in the Purple Micro Galaxy. His name was enough to scare the leaders of the top pirate forces in the Purple Micro Galaxy, fear.","He was Nine Whiskers.","An Ascetic Cultivator who wandered alone in the universe.","According to the understanding of the pirates in Ice Heart Valley, Mr. Nine Whiskers had lived for several chaos cycles and had been wandering around the universe for several chaos cycles, his wandering was different from most people. People like Jian Wushuang who came from their hometown and wandered in the universe had a clear purpose, which was to go to a wider territory and see more of the world, he wanted to fight with more experts to improve his strength.","However, this was not the case for Mr. Nine Whiskers. He roamed the universe and did not think about where he was going.","He was a real person who could endure long years of lonely cultivation.","Now, Ruler Mo Chen had arrived in front of Mr. Nine Whiskers.","“The Nihility Star Mo Chen greets you, Mr. Nine Whiskers.”","Ruler Mo Chen was, after all, the great leader of the Nihility Star, but in front of this Mr. Nine Whiskers, he appeared to be extremely respectful.","“Ruler Mo Chen.” Mr. Nine Whiskers raised his head and glanced at Ruler Mo Chen. “Three thousand years ago, when I defeated you, I told you that if one day you made a great improvement in your strength or broke through to the fifth stage, you could come and challenge me. Could it be that you have already made a great breakthrough in your strength by coming here today?”","“That’s not true.” Ruler Mo Chen shook his head. “I came here today because I met an expert whose strength is extremely terrifying. I think you should be interested in him, Mr. Nine Whiskers.”","“Oh?” Mr. Nine Whiskers stared at Ruler Mo Chen.","Ruler Mo Chen, however, had an embarrassed smile on his face.","Ruler Mo Chen knew some things about Mr. Nine Whiskers. As soon as Mr. Nine Whiskers arrived at the Purple Micro Galaxy, he immediately went to look for the leaders of the various top pirate forces, he directly defeated the leaders who had already reached the peak of the fourth level.","They all left a message that if he made a great progress or had a great breakthrough, he could go to the Ice Heart Valley to look for him.","It was obvious that Mr. Nine Whiskers was not only an Ascetic Cultivator, but also an Ascetic Cultivator who loved to fight and was eager to fight with the strong.","None of the space pirates in the Purple Micro Galaxy could catch Mr. Nine Whiskers’s eyes. Even though Mo Chen was the Ruler, he was no different from an ordinary space pirate in Mr. Nine Whiskers’s eyes.","In the eyes of such a person, he only had himself and a strong opponent.","It was precisely because of this that Ruler Mo Chen dared to invite Mr. Nine Whiskers. According to what Ruler Mo Chen thought, the owner of the universe boat was also extremely powerful, at least much stronger than him. Such a strong person...this Mr. Nine Whiskers should be quite interested.","As expected, Mr. Nine Whiskers began to ask, “Who is the person you are talking about? where is he? What level of cultivation is he at?”","“He is currently within this galaxy. As for his name, I don’t know, but he has a universe boat in his hands. As for his level of cultivation...he should only be a second-tier Ruler,” Ruler Mo Chen said.","“What?” Mr. Nine Whiskers’s expression changed. He stared coldly at Supreme Ruler Mo Chen. “Are you playing with me?”","“No, no!”Supreme Ruler Mo Chen repeatedly shook his head, “Mr. Nine Whiskers, there is something you do not know. On the surface, that universe boat Ruler might only be a second-tier Ruler, but his true combat power is terrifyingly strong. He is definitely at the pinnacle of the fourth-tier, and he is also the most terrifying.”","“Not long ago, I joined forces with my second brother and third brother in an attempt to kill him and seize the universe boat. In the end, I was defeated by him head-on, and it was a crushing defeat. My second brother and third brother both died at his hands. Even I was only able to use my life-saving secret technique to escape with my life.”","“That person killed your second brother and third brother. You wanted revenge, so you came looking for me?” Mr. Nine Whiskers continued to stare at Supreme Ruler Mo Chen.","Supreme Ruler Mo Chen’s heart trembled. This was indeed his true goal. This lord Nine Whiskers had clearly seen through it with a single glance. However, he was not surprised.","“I indeed have this goal. However, that person’s strength is terrifying. There is no doubt about this. Although his divine power is only at the level of an ordinary fourth-level Supreme Ruler, his understanding of the universe essence of the Dao of the sword is probably at the peak of the fifth-level Supreme Rulers. In addition, his sword arts are even more terrifying. He also knows a sword formation. Once that sword formation is unleashed, in just two waves of attacks, my two brothers will die. They won’t be able to struggle at all. Even I will be heavily injured.”","“You have to understand that he was able to simultaneously activate his sword formation to deal with three of my brothers. If he had focused his sword formation on just one person, the power would have been even more terrifying.” Ruler Mo Chen sighed in amazement.","“Sword formation? He was able to deal with three people at the same time, and in just two attacks, he was able to kill two high-level Rulers of the fourth level?” Mr. Nine Whiskers’s eyes flickered. Clearly, he was already very interested.","Ruler Mo Chen’s guess was right. This Mr. Nine Whiskers was not only an Ascetic Cultivator, but also an extremely warlike Ascetic Cultivator.","It was precisely because of his warlike nature that he would think of ways to challenge the top-tier great beings of that star field every time he passed by a star field. Even when he came to this Purple Micro Star River, he did not hold back.","However, no one in the current Purple Micro Star River could be taken seriously by him. However, the universe boat Ruler mentioned by Ruler Mo Chen now had a strength that piqued Mr. Nine Whiskers’s interest.","“The three of you aren’t weak, especially when you join forces. Even an ordinary fourth-level pinnacle Ruler could be suppressed by you. In fact, you might even have a chance to kill him after a long time. However, when the three of you joined forces, you were easily defeated by the other party and even killed two people. Based on this point alone, that universe boat Ruler must be at the pinnacle of the fourth-level, or perhaps even stronger.”","“I do indeed wish to fight against such a great being.” Mr. Nine Whiskers laughed.","“That universe boat Ruler is very powerful, but to you, Mr. Nine Whiskers, he is probably nothing.” Ruler Mo Chen said respectfully.","“Take me to him.” Mr. Nine Whiskers stood up.","Ruler Mo Chen was instantly overjoyed.","“Don’t be too happy.” Mr. Nine Whiskers glanced sideways at Ruler Mo Chen. “I’m only going to find him because I want to fight him. As for whether or not I’ll be able to kill him, that will depend on my mood.”","..."]},{"number":4017,"title":"Chapter 4017 - Ascetic Cultivator","paragraphs":["“I went to find him just to fight with him. As for whether I can kill him or not, it depends on my mood.”","Ruler Mo Chen was shocked by Mr. Nine Whiskers’s words, but he did not dare to say anything.","Immediately, Ruler Mo Chen led the way personally and took Mr. Nine Whiskers to chase after Jian Wushuang’s universe boat.","The universe boat continued to move forward in the galaxy, but Jian Wushuang was always cultivating in the universe boat.","He knew that the universe was vast and dangerous. Although he had some strength now, it was only limited to the edge of the universe. If it were in the depths of the universe, there would be many stronger than him.","There were even many supreme experts in the true core of the universe.","Even a strong supreme expert would die. Even the founder of the Red Cloud lineage, Patriarch Red Cloud, who was a top supreme expert, died in the fierce battle.","Because of this, Jian Wushuang did not dare to slack off.","Only by becoming stronger and climbing to the top of the universe would he be able to reach the level of Lingyun Star Master or even stronger one day. Only then would he be qualified to truly roam the universe.","But now, he was still far from that level.","“Over the years, I’ve been trying to fuse the sixth law of darkness. I feel that I’m just a little bit away from fusing it, but I still feel that I can’t really fuse it. Maybe it’s because I’m too comfortable now, and I don’t have the oppressive feeling I had in the Divine Beginning Realm. That’s why I can’t really fuse it,” Jian Wushuang could not help thinking.","Indeed, he was now very comfortable.","In fact, ever since the crisis in the Divine Beginning Realm was resolved and he had Rulered the power of the divine will of the Divine Beginning Realm, he had been very comfortable. The burden that had been on his shoulders had been completely relieved.","However, when Jian Wushuang was weak, the reason why he was able to grow at an astonishing speed step by step was because of the burden on his shoulders. He had always felt great pressure, which was why he had made such great progress.","Now, although he had made greater progress with the help of the divine will of the Divine Beginning Realm, Jian Wushuang felt that it would not be so easy to make a breakthrough without the pressure.","“Now, even if I fight with a fourth-level Ruler, I can’t feel any waves in my heart. Although I came to the universe to search for my Ruler in the nine luminaries galaxy, I also came to fight with more powerful experts. However, even though I have fought several times, there are no experts who really make me look forward to it and make me feel pressure.” Jian Wushuang shook his head slightly.","Even though he was at the peak of the fourth level, he did not feel any pressure at all.","He had easily defeated Ruler Mo Chen. If he had been a little more serious, Ruler Mo Chen would not have been able to escape from him.","“I hope that I won’t be so dull in the following years. I also hope that I can meet some opponents that make me feel pressure and look forward to.” Jian Wushuang sighed quietly.","He longed to meet and fight with real experts, but he had never met any of them. This made Jian Wushuang inevitably feel a little disappointed.","At this moment...","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang suddenly raised his head.","His soul power had already sensed the void in front of him, and two figures were rapidly approaching.","He recognized one of the two figures. It was the one who had luckily escaped, Ruler Mo Chen, and the other one...","“That man...” Jian Wushuang stared at the thin, white-haired, long-bearded man who had stopped in front of the universe boat and was standing in front of Ruler Mo Chen.","Jian Wushuang had been extremely sensitive to experts since he came to this day from the Divine Beginning Realm.","The moment he saw the white-haired, long-bearded man, Jian Wushuang had a faint premonition that this man was an expert.","Although he looked extremely thin and weak and did not emit any aura, Jian Wushuang could feel the arrogance between his brows.","One had to know that he was not an ordinary person who could be so arrogant in the universe. In addition, Ruler Mo Chen had come with this man. He even stood behind this man and was obviously very respectful.","Obviously, this person was much stronger than Ruler Mo Chen.","It was not surprising that Ruler Mo Chen had specially invited an expert to avenge his two brothers.","“Ruler, that person gives me the feeling that he is very strong,” Devil Flame said solemnly.","“I have the same feeling.” Jian Wushuang nodded, but his face was still smiling, and there was a trace of expectation in the depths of his heart.","He longed to meet an expert. He longed to meet an expert who could really bring him pressure and make him treat him seriously.","And this person in front of him might be qualified to do so.","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang directly left the universe boat and appeared in front of the white-haired, long-bearded man.","“Mr. Nine Whiskers, he is the Ruler of the universe boat. Although he is only a second-level Ruler, his battle strength is extremely terrifying.” Ruler Mo Chen stared at Jian Wushuang with eyes that seemed to spew fire.","“Ascetic, Nine Whiskers!” The white-bearded man stared at Jian Wushuang calmly.","“Ascetic?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","It was the first time he had heard of the term Ascetic when he was adventuring in the universe.","“Ruler, Ascetic is the kind of person who roams around the universe all year round, without any purpose, just to cultivate and become stronger. Most Ascetic Cultivators like to challenge some experts in the star field every time they pass by, so as to constantly fight with them and constantly break through to improve their strength. It can be said to be extremely crazy!”","“In the universe, Ascetics are all real lunatics, but there is no doubt that they are all very strong!” Devil Flame’s voice sounded in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","Although Devil Flame stayed in the universe boat, he could still communicate with Jian Wushuang’s consciousness.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and secretly exclaimed in his heart.","It was indeed a crazy cultivation method to wander around the universe and challenge experts all year round.","“Blood Sword comes from an unrated star field,” Jian Wushuang said directly.","“I heard from Ruler Mo Chen that you defeated the three brothers by yourself. Your Sword Formation is even more terrifying. You killed two of his brothers in just two rounds of attacks, leaving him no choice but to use his life-saving secret skill to escape. You must be very strong. I look forward to seeing you,” Nine Whiskers said indifferently."]},{"number":4018,"title":"Chapter 4018 - Battle Nine Whiskers","paragraphs":["“Blood Sword, show me your full strength. If I am satisfied with your strength, I may spare your life.” Nine Whiskers stood there and said indifferently.","“Spare my life? How arrogant.” Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Me too. If you disappoint me, you don’t have to leave here alive.”","“Haha, interesting.” A smile appeared on Nine Whiskers’s face.","He was an extremely arrogant person, and his strength was indeed outstanding. Because of this, he was arrogant and said that he would spare Jian Wushuang’s life, but he did not expect Jian Wushuang to be so arrogant.","It was obvious that both of them were eager to fight with stronger opponents. In this regard, they were very similar.","!!","Without any more nonsense, Nine Whiskers had already made his move.","He slowly raised his right hand and pointed in Jian Wushuang’s direction.","This finger instantly formed a dazzling cyan light beam. The cyan light beam carried a destructive aura and directly shot toward Jian Wushuang through the void.","“Such powerful power.”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted when he saw Nine Whiskers’s attack.","Jian Wushuang had fought with several Rulers of the fourth level, including Star Ruler Mo Yun and Star Demon ancestor. He was very impressed, but now he could see it with just one glance, the terrifying power contained in Nine Whiskers’s finger.","In terms of divine power, Nine Whiskers had definitely reached the peak of the fourth level. He was at least much more powerful than Ruler Mo Chen, who was at the peak of the fourth level.","“I’m afraid that Nine Whiskers can crush most Rulers of the peak of the fourth level with just his brute force,” Jian Wushuang thought. However, his movements were not slow at all. With a flip of his hand, the Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand.","Above the void, Jian Wushuang waved his sword.","The sword light swept across the galaxy, as if it was about to be cut in half.","The sword light collided with the green beam of light. The terrifying power burst out, but in the end, the sword light and the green beam were destroyed.","“Yes, although the power of divine power is only at the level of an ordinary fourth-level Ruler, your comprehension of the origin of the sword principle universe is indeed very high. What you are holding in your hand should be a Principle supreme treasure, right?” Nine Whiskers stared at the divine sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","“Nine Whiskers, where is your weapon?” Jian Wushuang stared at Nine Whiskers.","He knew very well that Nine Whiskers had just casually attacked with his finger, relying purely on the power of divine power.","“Haha, I, Nine Whiskers, have roamed the universe for several chaos cycles and challenged countless experts. Even a Ruler at the peak of the fourth level must have fought with thousands of people. However, there are very few who are worthy of my weapon. If you don’t have enough strength, you are not qualified to ask me to take out my weapon.” Nine Whiskers laughed heartily.","“How arrogant.” Jian Wushuang sneered.","However, Ruler Mo Chen, who was at the edge of the battlefield, knew clearly that Nine Whiskers was not arrogant, but he did have the right to do so.","When Nine Whiskers first came to the Purple Micro Galaxy, he defeated many top experts in the Purple Micro Galaxy with his brute strength and few of the pirate forces in the galaxy, at that time, Mr. Nine Whiskers was empty-handed and did not take out his weapon.","However, even if he did not take out his weapon, Nine Whiskers was still able to sweep through everything. For example, in the Nihility Star, Ruler Mo Chen had joined hands with his two brothers, but he easily defeated Mr. Nine Whiskers empty-handed.","It was precisely because Mr. Nine Whiskers was so ridiculously strong that Ruler Mo Chen thought Mr. Nine Whiskers had the ability to kill Jian Wushuang, so he specially invited Mr. Nine Whiskers.","“Humph, how much of your strength can you display without using your weapon?” Jian Wushuang snorted. He did not bother with Nine Whiskers. If he did not take out his weapon, he would attack with lightning speed.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s body split into three. Three figures charged toward Mr. Nine Whiskers from three different directions at the same time.","At the same time, the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand burst out with a shocking sword essence! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Terrifying Sword Shadows attacked from three different directions at the same time.","Fast, incredibly fast!","Not only fast, but also extremely strange.","Although Mr. Nine Whiskers was extremely powerful and his soul perception was extremely sharp, he could not completely distinguish which of the three shadows was Jian Wushuang’s because in his eyes...the three shadows were exactly the same.","“It’s so fast to create three different illusions purely by relying on movement techniques. This movement technique is even more bizarre.” Nine Whiskers exclaimed, but he still did not show any intention of taking out his weapon. His body shook, green light rose from the sky, and he seemed to be bathing in a green ocean.","From the green ocean, terrifying green light beams shot out one after another.","Jian Wushuang relied on three figures to attack from three directions at the same time. However, the green ocean formed by Nine Whiskers was extremely vast. It could attack from all directions at the same time. Moreover, the green light beams that shot out were all extremely powerful, they were all extremely powerful.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","The dense sounds of collisions were heard in the galaxy. Ruler Mo Chen, who was at the edge of the battlefield, was already terrified.","“It’s too powerful. This Blood Sword is too fast, too strange, and its swordsmanship is extremely powerful.”","“However, Mr. Nine Whiskers seems to be even more powerful. It’s obvious that he’s just casually attacking and hasn’t shown his true abilities. However, the cyan ocean formed by him is already terrifying enough.”","Ruler Mo Chen was a Ruler at the peak of the fourth level. However, he felt suffocated by the strength of either of the two who were fighting on the battlefield.","At this moment...","“Break!”","Jian Wushuang suddenly shouted. In the center of the battlefield, a shocking sword essence suddenly burst out.","The entire galaxy was completely covered by this shocking sword essence. Then, an extremely violent and monstrous sword light with endless sword principle universe origin slashed down directly.","The sword light directly cut into the cyan ocean formed by Nine Whiskers. Immediately, the entire cyan ocean rippled wildly, and the cyan light dissipated. A moment later, a cyan figure condensed in the void next to him.","“You actually defeated my move head-on. Your sword skill is really amazing.”","Nine Whiskers’s eyes emitted a layer of bright light as he stared at Jian Wushuang. There was a trace of excitement on the corner of his mouth. “Haha, Blood Sword, I admit that you are qualified to make me take out my weapon!”","..."]},{"number":4019,"title":"Chapter 4019 - True Strength","paragraphs":["“Finally willing to take out a weapon?” Jian Wushuang looked at Nine Whiskers calmly.","The weapon Nine Whiskers took out was a purple long spear filled with cold air.","With the purple long spear in hand, Nine Whiskers also smiled wickedly. At this moment, he became extremely charming.","“That spear is a Principle Supreme Treasure.” Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank.","He had fought several fourth-level Rulers along the way in the Purple Micro Galaxy, but none of them had a Principle Supreme Treasure.","!!","For example, although Ruler Mo Chen was the great leader of the Nihility Star, he did not have a Principle Supreme Treasure or magic weapon.","However, as an Ascetic Cultivator, Nine Whiskers had been adventuring in various territories and was extremely powerful. It was not strange that he had a Principle True Treasure in his possession.","“Mr. Nine Whiskers, you’ve taken out your weapon.” Ruler Mo Chen, who was watching the battle from outside the battlefield, was excited.","Back when Nine Whiskers had come to Purple Micro Galaxy and swept through many space pirate forces, he had easily suppressed them with his bare hands.","Therefore, it was the first time that Ruler Mo Chen had seen Nine Whiskers’s magic weapon. It was a long spear that had reached the level of a Principle True Treasure.","“Blood Sword, I hope you can last longer in my hands. Don’t die immediately,” Nine Whiskers said with a smile.","“I told you, you’re too arrogant.” Jian Wushuang was too lazy to argue with Nine Whiskers. The moment he saw Nine Whiskers take out his magic weapon, he had already made his move.","His speed was still extremely fast, leaving a strange afterimage in the galaxy.","His body movement burst forth, and the swift and fierce sword light slashed toward Nine Whiskers.","Nine Whiskers only raised his head slightly, and the cold purple long spear in his hand stabbed forward.","Clang!","The sound of metal colliding rang out, and the sword light dimmed on the spot. Jian Wushuang also felt that his hands were a little numb, and he kept stepping back.","“This power...” Jian Wushuang looked at Nine Whiskers in surprise.","When he had not used the magic weapon, Nine Whiskers’s divine power was already extremely powerful. It could be said that he had reached the peak of the fourth-level Ruler. But now, he took out the Principle-based treasure magic weapon and casually stabbed out! The power was nearly ten times stronger than before!","Such terrifying power was no longer within the scope of the fourth-level Ruler.","“Although the fifth-level is only at the fourth-level realm, the power of Nine Whiskers’s divine power has definitely reached the threshold of the fifth-level.” Jian Wushuang’s expression became serious.","He had fought many fourth-level Rulers, but this was the first time he had encountered a fifth-level Ruler.","Although Nine Whiskers was not a fifth-level Ruler, his power had already reached the level of a fifth-level Ruler.","“Haha, Blood Sword, take a few of my spear attacks.” Nine Whiskers let out a hearty laugh. His body flickered, and the cold violet spear in his hand was like a flood dragon emerging from the sea. Endless power gathered at the tip of the spear.","As the terrifying cold light gathered, it exploded again.","One strike after another, the power of each strike exceeded that of a fourth-level Ruler.","Jian Wushuang also relied on his superior understanding of the universe origin of sword principle to use his powerful swordsmanship to block the incoming spear.","However, Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship was indeed very high-level, but in terms of divine power, he was only at the fourth-level Ruler level. Compared to Nine Whiskers, he was indeed a little inferior.","Nine Whiskers was still very casual. He did not use any extraordinary spear techniques. He just relied on his overbearing divine power to suppress Jian Wushuang.","“Nine Whiskers is only a Ruler at the peak of the fourth-level and is not a special life form, but his divine power is indeed beyond that of a fourth-level Ruler. He must have cultivated some special divine power secret skills,” Jian Wushuang thought.","Suppressed by Nine Whiskers’s spear skills, Jian Wushuang looked a little embarrassed.","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang retreated quickly and pulled away from Nine Whiskers as fast as he could.","“What? You can’t take it so fast and want to admit defeat? If so, you are disappointing me,” Nine Whiskers said in a low voice.","“Admit defeat?” Jian Wushuang smiled. “Nine Whiskers, you are indeed very strong. At least among the fourth-level Rulers I have met, you are the strongest. Therefore, you are qualified to let me use my full strength.”","“Oh?” Nine Whiskers’s expression changed. “You mean you haven’t used your full strength yet?”","A glimmer of light flashed in Nine Whiskers’s eyes.","He was an Ascetic Cultivator who loved to fight and yearned to fight with real experts.","At the beginning, Nine Whiskers did have a trace of anticipation for the battle with Jian Wushuang, but it was not too strong. After all, his own strength was too strong, there were not many fourth-level Rulers that he could take seriously.","In this fight with Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang forced him to take out his weapon, which was already very impressive in his eyes.","But now, Jian Wushuang said that he had not used his full strength until now?","This made Nine Whiskers a little excited.","“The Ruler of universe boat has not used his full strength? How is that possible?” Ruler Mo Chen was a little confused.","Jian Wushuang smiled coldly and said, “Nine Whiskers, as a fourth-level Ruler, you should be proud that you can force me to use my full strength.”","As soon as he finished his words, Jian Wushuang moved again.","He moved again, but this time, when he moved, there was a special power sweeping out.","This power was the power of principles.","That was right. From when Jian Wushuang came to the universe, including when he fought with the pirates in the Purple Micro Galaxy and even killed the two leaders in the Nihility Star, Jian Wushuang only relied on his divine power, which was comparable to the fourth-level Ruler’s, and his understanding of sword principle and swordsmanship.","Even so, he was the most extreme among the fourth-level Rulers.","He could barely fight against Nine Whiskers, who had burst out with the divine power of a fifth-level Ruler.","However, Jian Wushuang was known as an incredible genius because he had comprehended a trace of the universe principle!","He had comprehended a trace of the universe principle at the level of a Principle Ruler. Now that he had broken through to a Ruler, his comprehension of the universe principle had been constantly improving over the years because he had Rulered the Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm.","Until now, his comprehension of the universe principle had reached a completely new level.","The current him had truly stepped into the threshold of the universe principle."]},{"number":4020,"title":"Chapter 4020 - Killing Move!","paragraphs":["Stepping into the threshold of the universe principle and barely comprehending it were two completely different things.","The power of the universe principle that Jian Wushuang was using now was much stronger than before. Previously, he just barely integrated the universe principle into his attacks to increase its power.","But now, he had directly activated the universal principle, and even his body speed had a huge change.","Whoosh!","With the help of the universal principle, Jian Wushuang was completely strange. He easily released hundreds and thousands of illusionary bodies, which were all extremely real, even the soul power of the Ruler could not detect which one was the real body.","!!","Suddenly, a cold light shone, and one of the illusionary figures swung his divine sword down.","The cold and dazzling sword slashed down with the power of the universe principles.","Nine Whiskers narrowed his eyes. He had noticed that this sword was different from the sword skill that Jian Wushuang had used before. However, he was confident in his own strength, so he did not pay too much attention to it. He still stabbed the long spear in his hand.","Clang!","There was another sound of metal colliding. This time, Nine Whiskers’s expression changed abruptly.","He felt a tremendous power from Jian Wushuang’s sword light. This power not only made up for the gap between Jian Wushuang’s divine power and his, but also made Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship more profound and terrifying.","Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish!","Jian Wushuang’s body burst out several times, and each time he burst out, countless phantoms appeared at the same time.","Nine Whiskers could not keep up with Jian Wushuang’s speed at all. When Jian Wushuang collided with his spear, Nine Whiskers was shocked to find that he was completely at a disadvantage.","“Universe principle! It’s the universe principle!”","“This Blood Sword has actually comprehended the universe principle, and not just a little bit!”","Nine Whiskers’s eyes were filled with unprecedented shock.","He was an Ascetic, and his talent was not weak either. It was precisely because of this that he was able to display the battle prowess of a fifth-level Ruler at the fourth-level Ruler realm.","One had to know that in the universe, unless there was some special reason, it was almost impossible for a fourth-level Ruler to challenge a fifth-level Ruler. However, Nine Whiskers had done it.","He had always thought that he was powerful enough and a genius enough. However, no matter how powerful he was, he would not be so arrogant as to say that he was more heaven-defying than those who had comprehended the universe principles.","After all, that was the universe principle!","At the Ruler level, those who were able to comprehend a trace of the universe principle were all super strong. Under normal circumstances, they were all Rulers at the fifth or even the final level.","After all, the level of the universe principle was too high. Only those who had reached a certain level of strength could come into contact with the universe principle more easily and have a chance to comprehend it.","It could be said that even the Rulers at the fifth level or even the ultimate level could comprehend a trace of the universe principle. However, a Ruler at the second level had completely crossed the threshold of the universe principle! He was a monster among monsters!","Of course, Nine Whiskers did not know that Jian Wushuang had comprehended a trace of the universe principle at the level of a Principle Ruler. If he knew, he would be even more shocked.","On the battlefield, the situation changed in an instant.","Because of the power of the universe principle, Jian Wushuang’s strength instantly soared to a whole new level. Not only was his speed and figure much faster than Nine Whiskers’s, but his swordsmanship had also reached a whole new level, most importantly, the power of his swordsmanship had also reached a whole new level. At the very least, it was not weaker than Nine Whiskers’s spear technique, and it was even stronger.","“Haha, amazing, amazing!”","“Blood Sword, I was quite satisfied with your strength in this battle, but I didn’t expect you to completely exceed my expectations. Haha, I, Nine Whiskers, have comprehended the universal principle, and this is my first time fighting. I want to see how amazing the universal principle is.”","At this moment, Nine Whiskers was so excited that he was about to go crazy.","Universe principles!","Even in his dreams, he yearned to comprehend a trace of universe principles, but he did not even have the chance to touch them, let alone comprehend them.","He was not qualified to touch universe principles at all. Even though he had encountered countless experts during the past few chaos cycles, none of them could comprehend a trace of universe principles.","But Jian Wushuang was the first!","It could be said that this was the first time that Nine Whiskers had truly come into contact with the principles of the universe.","How could Nine Whiskers not be pleasantly surprised by such a rare opportunity?","“Nine Whiskers, I also hope that you won’t disappoint me!” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","He also hoped that Nine Whiskers could burst out with super strength and let him fight with his full strength.","However, the strength that Nine Whiskers had revealed was clearly not enough!","“Haha, come, come!” Nine Whiskers let out a maniacal laugh. At the same time, a large amount of green light rose from his body. This green light gathered together and vaguely formed a huge ancient green Buddha behind him.","This ancient Buddha was holding a green lamp in his hand.","Suddenly, the ancient Buddha opened his eyes. The cyan light in the sky completely replaced the light in the galaxy.","The aura on Nine Whiskers’s body suddenly soared.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The void collapsed one after another. The long spear in Nine Whiskers’s hand was like a huge star at this moment. This star also contained extremely terrifying power, as if it was about to explode at any time.","The long spear stabbed out one after another, as if stars were smashing toward Jian Wushuang one after another.","Before, Nine Whiskers had only attacked casually, but now, he had also used his strongest strength.","He also displayed his secret skills and spear techniques, fully unleashing his strength.","Under the support of the power of the universal principles, Jian Wushuang simultaneously burst out with astonishing strength.","The two figures collided with each other again and again in the galaxy. The battlefield was filled with afterimages, the power of divine power, and the terrifying shockwaves that spread out in all directions.","Ruler Mo Chen, who was outside the battlefield, was already stunned.","“So strong, so strong that it makes one’s hair stand on end!”","“This is definitely not the battle strength of the fourth level, but it has already reached the fifth level!”","“Mr. Nine Whiskers and the Ruler of the universe boat both have the combat strength of the fifth level!”","Ruler Mo Chen was trembling and roaring.","The fierce battle in the center of the battlefield had reached a climax.","Jian Wushuang had pushed his swordsmanship and the power of the universe principles to the extreme.","Nine Whiskers had also fully unleashed his spear skills and secret skills.","However, the two of them were still evenly matched. This intense battle lasted for a full 15 minutes."]},{"number":4021,"title":"Chapter 4021 - The Third One","paragraphs":["Clang!","Another fierce battle. The entire galaxy was under the violent impact of the energy, and Jian Wushuang and Nine Whiskers finally separated again.","“Haha, this is the battle that I long for.” Nine Whiskers’s eyes were red, and there was madness in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were full of excitement.","Nine Whiskers’s strength did not disappoint him. He had already exerted his comprehension of the universe principles to the extreme and used all his strength to display his swordsmanship, but in the end, he could only compete with Nine Whiskers.","The opponent’s battle strength was undoubtedly at the fifth level, and he should be able to stand firm among the fifth level Rulers.","“Nine Whiskers,” Jian Wushuang suddenly said, “since you were specially invited by that person, you should know that I used a sword formation when I killed the three brothers. Now, come and feel the power of my sword formation.”","Jian Wushuang planned to use the sword formation.","No matter how great his swordsmanship was or how powerful it was, Jian Wushuang knew clearly that his strongest sword formation was the three great sword formations he created.","And he had never used the three sword formations until now.","“Sword formations?” Nine Whiskers’s pupils constricted, with a hint of expectation in his heart.","Jian Wushuang made his move. An invisible power of the formation spread out, accompanied by a majestic sword essence.","Buzz!","The whole world suddenly became cold and icy.","An unprecedented killing intent filled the entire galaxy.","The hazy fog swept out like a tidal wave, covering the entire battlefield in the blink of an eye.","On the battlefield, which was the center of the sword formation, Nine Whiskers could clearly feel how powerful the killing sword essence was.","“What a terrifying killing sword essence. Just this sword essence alone is enough to make an ordinary third-level or even fourth-level Ruler lose the courage to resist.” Nine Whiskers was also secretly shocked.","Outside the battlefield, when Ruler Mo Chen saw Jian Wushuang use this sword formation, his body trembled.","When he and his two brothers joined hands to kill Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang used this sword formation and easily killed his two brothers. Even he could only use his life-saving secret skill to escape.","However, at that time, Jian Wushuang did not activate the universal principle.","Now that he had fully activated the universal principle, the power of the sword formation would naturally be stronger!","As the hazy sword formation took shape, endless killing intent filled the entire sword formation.","The vast expanse of fog had completely covered the galaxy. In the fog, a sword light lit up without any warning and directly chopped at Nine Whiskers’s head.","“So fast, and so sudden!”","Nine Whiskers was also shocked. He had not even seen how this sword light had been formed. All he knew was that this sword light had suddenly appeared in front of him.","It was so fast that he had not been able to react in time. He could only barely raise his hand and block the long spear in front of him.","Clang!","A low clashing sound rang out. The power contained within that sword light caused Nine Whiskers to feel a wave of shock. That power was completely comparable to the full power of a fifth level Ruler’s attack.","He was not afraid of such an attack in a head-on fight. He was confident that he could withstand it head-on.","However, in this sword array, the sword light had appeared too strangely, and it was too fast.","After blocking the first sword light, the second sword light quietly rushed over from the void space.","“Not good!”","Nine Whiskers widened his eyes and quickly turned around, but it was too late to block it. He could only try his best to activate the protective armor on his body and burst out with powerful protective power.","Peng!","The sword light directly hit Nine Whiskers’s divine body. Even though Nine Whiskers’s protective armor was a supreme-grade supreme true treasure armor, it could not withstand the attack of Wuqi Divine Sword, the terrifying power contained in the sword light had already exceeded the limit of this true treasure armor.","The vast power crazily spread into Nine Whiskers’s divine body. As an Ascetic, Nine Whiskers had all kinds of techniques involved. In terms of the strength of his divine body, he was also quite formidable. However, under such an attack, his divine body was also severely injured, puff!","A big mouthful of blood spurted out of Nine Whiskers’s mouth. Nine Whiskers’s body trembled crazily as he was pushed back.","This sword attack had consumed more than 10% of Nine Whiskers’s divine power.","However, after this sword attack, another silent sword light attacked.","“It’s too fast and strange!”","“This sword formation has completely blocked my soul power. I’m trapped in this sword formation and can’t find the location of the Blood Sword at all. I can’t even see where he attacked. Moreover, his sword technique is really terrifying!”","Nine Whiskers’s face was unsightly. He struggled in the sword formation with all his strength.","However, he was extremely passive in the face of the sword lights that suddenly attacked him from the surroundings.","Two sword lights had already injured him. He had only stayed in the sword formation for a short while, but he had already taken three sword lights head-on and lost nearly 40% of his divine power.","There was no doubt that Nine Whiskers had been seriously injured.","Boom!","Suddenly, a burst of violent power burst out, and the fog that had been in the sword formation was pushed away, revealing Jian Wushuang’s figure in front of the sword formation.","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang looked at Nine Whiskers in surprise. “That’s impressive. He was seriously injured by me, but he still managed to force his way into my sword formation and disperse the fog.”","“Blood Sword!”","Nine Whiskers, who was in the center of the Sword Formation, stared at Jian Wushuang with blood at the corner of his mouth, “Since I became an Ascetic Cultivator, I have challenged countless experts in various territories in the universe. Among them, there are some of the most brilliant geniuses at the peak of the fourth-level. I have even fought with several Rulers of the fifth-level. However, among all the experts I have fought, you are the third one who was able to seriously injure me and force me into this situation!”","“The first two are Rulers of the fifth level!”","“But you are only at the second level!”","“You are very terrifying. Your talent is the strongest one I have ever seen. You are qualified to see my strongest killing move!”","Although Nine Whiskers was severely injured, the fighting spirit in his eyes did not weaken at all. On the contrary, it became more and more vigorous.","“The strongest killer move?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","As for what Nine Whiskers said about the third killer move in a long time, he did not care at all. What he cared about was Nine Whiskers’s strength and what he said about the strongest killer move.","“Come on!”","Jian Wushuang shouted in a low voice. He was also looking forward to it."]},{"number":4022,"title":"Chapter 4022 - Red Mist","paragraphs":["“Blood Sword, be careful!”","Nine Whiskers kindly reminded him, but then the light in the galaxy around him completely dimmed.","The entire universe had turned into darkness. In this dark world, the long spear in Nine Whiskers’s hand suddenly turned into a dazzling purple light.","The purple light was extremely enchanting. As soon as it appeared, it immediately became the focus of the endless darkness.","Jian Wushuang could not help looking at the purple light.","“Darkness Demonic Light!” Nine Whiskers shouted. In an instant, the purple light shot out at a terrifying speed.","Jian Wushuang stood there. The moment the purple light shot toward him, he felt a tremendous pressure in his heart.","With his experience, he could naturally see how terrifying the power contained in the purple light was.","“This move is very strong, even stronger than the strongest sword skill I created!” Jian Wushuang could not help exclaiming.","In the next moment, the sword essence that filled the sky above his body rose directly.","The vast sword essence crazily condensed into substance on the surface of his body. In the blink of an eye, it condensed into a layer of sword essence barrier.","The power of the formation was still lingering on the sword essence barrier.","The earth-protecting sword formation —","It was the sword formation with the strongest protective ability, one of the three strongest sword formations created by Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang had never used this move to kill enemies, but only to protect his body and defend himself.","However, the defensive ability of the earth-protecting sword formation was extremely strong. When he was in the Divine Beginning Realm, Jian Wushuang could only form dozens of earth sword domains to form the sword formation.","However, since he had become a Ruler and grasped the power of the divine will of the Divine Beginning Realm, his understanding of sword principle and formation had improved to an unprecedented level, the power of his three sword formations was no longer the same as before.","Now, the Earth Guardian Sword Formation could instantly form 132 layers of sword essence barriers.","The reason why it was only 132 layers was that Jian Wushuang had improved the earth guardian sword array over the years. He did not purely increase the number of sword essence barriers, but focused on their quality.","Without a doubt, any one of the layers of sword essence barriers was terrifyingly strong. Even a fourth-level Ruler might not be able to break through a single layer of sword essence barrier, however, there were a total of 132 layers, and they were supported by the power of the formation. This made the Earth Guardian Sword Array Indestructible.","Perhaps the strongest killer move Nine Whiskers had used was indeed powerful and could pose a great threat to a fifth-level Ruler. However, Jian Wushuang was absolutely confident when the earth guardian sword array was used.","No matter how powerful Nine Whiskers’s strongest killer move was, he firmly believed that his earth guardian sword formation could completely block it.","Sure enough, the most dazzling purple light in the darkness struck the Earth Guardian Sword Formation ferociously. A terrifying power burst out, and layers of sword essence barriers collapsed instantly.","However, the purple light only broke through dozens of layers of sword essence barriers and could not advance any further.","“Sure enough, my Earth Protection Sword Formation has never let me down.” Jian Wushuang smiled, but the next moment, his smile froze","“Die!”","The killing intent in Nine Whiskers’s eyes burst out, and his face became extremely ferocious at this moment.","At the front of the dazzling purple light, the tip of the purple demonic spear had already entered the Earth Protection Sword Formation, but it was blocked by the layers of sword essence barriers of the Earth Protection Sword Formation, however, with Nine Whiskers’s low shout, the tip of the purple spear cracked without any warning.","After all, the purple spear was a principle treasure, so the spearhead should be extremely sturdy. Jian Wushuang had never expected that the spearhead would crack.","After the crack, a mass of red mist pounced toward Jian Wushuang like a ball of flame.","Most importantly, this red mist was not a material attack, but an invisible attack like a soul attack. Jian Wushuang’s earth protection sword formation could not withstand it.","Jian Wushuang was very close to the Nine Whiskers, so he did not have time to dodge.","Whoosh!","Like a breeze, the red mist covered Jian Wushuang’s divine body and entered his divine body through his pores.","A terrible pain rose in his body.","“Oh no!” Jian Wushuang’s face changed.","The moment the Red Mist entered his body, he felt his internal organs, blood, flesh, and bones being corroded crazily. Even his divine power was evaporated, when it came into contact with the Red Mist.","“Poison!”","“Even my perfect life can not ignore the unprecedented poison!”","Jian Wushuang’s body and mind trembled.","Yes, the perfect level of life practitioners, very scary, born with a strong divine body, poison-free!","When Jian Wushuang was wandering in the Divine Beginning Realm, he had been attacked by some strange poisons, but none of them could harm him.","Because his perfect life-level was too high, ordinary poison could not do much to a cultivator at the perfect life-level.","However, this was the universe after all!","The universe was unfathomable, and there were all kinds of methods. Even a cultivator at the perfect life-level could not resist some of the extremely powerful poisons in the universe.","For example, the poison used by Nine Whiskers was not something that a perfect life-level cultivator could ignore.","Boom! Boom!","The terrifying poison was corroding Jian Wushuang’s divine body crazily. At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s soul was trembling crazily.","Jian Wushuang endured the intense pain and immediately mobilized his vast divine power to rush toward the red fog that had invaded his body. Although his divine power would immediately evaporate when it came into contact with the red fog, the red fog was also being eroded by the endless divine power, however, as the endless divine power continued to attack, the red mist was also being worn down.","They continued to wear each other down. In the end, the amount of the red mist was not enough and was completely worn down by the divine power in Jian Wushuang’s body.","In order to wear down the red mist, Jian Wushuang had used up nearly 40 percent of his divine power!","Because of his perfect life, Jian Wushuang’s divine power was almost 1,000 times stronger than a normal Ruler’s after he broke through to become a Ruler.","Such a vast amount of divine power had been reduced by nearly 40% in an instant by the red fog.","What did it mean?","If it were any other Ruler, they would have died dozens or hundreds of times in the Red Fog?","Only Jian Wushuang, who relied on the innate advantage of his perfect life, could barely withstand it. However, the loss of divine power still made Jian Wushuang gasp.","Then, Jian Wushuang was shocked and angry!"]},{"number":4023,"title":"Chapter 4023 - Shock and Anger!","paragraphs":["Shock and anger!","Jian Wushuang was completely enraged at this moment.","Although he had been on guard against Nine Whiskers from the beginning and had been extra cautious in the fierce battle, Nine Whiskers had been extremely excited as the battle became more and more intense.","This excitement was purely because he had met a real opponent, and Jian Wushuang was the same.","The difference in strength between the two was not big. Nine Whiskers was an Ascetic Cultivator, and it was not easy for him to meet a decent opponent. Not to mention Jian Wushuang, he had not met a decent opponent on his way from the Divine Beginning Realm.","Now that he had finally met him, Jian Wushuang was pleasantly surprised by his opponent’s strength and methods. Naturally, he felt that they had a mutual understanding.","When Jian Wushuang had severely injured Nine Whiskers, he had intended to stop. He did not want to kill Nine Whiskers.","However, who would have thought that Nine Whiskers would directly kill him. Moreover, he had disguised himself well before he killed him. When he attacked, he even deliberately reminded Jian Wushuang to be careful, which made Jian Wushuang relax his vigilance.","But in the end —","“I was careless.” Jian Wushuang’s heart was cold.","He was indeed careless. Of course, it could also be said that he was too confident in his Earth Guardian Sword Formation.","He was confident that with the earth guardian sword formation, he could withstand Nine Whiskers’s strongest killing move, but he forgot that the Earth Guardian Sword Formation was not truly invincible. In the face of such a soul attack, or an immaterial attack like a soul attack, the Earth Guardian sword formation was unable to withstand it.","In addition, Nine Whiskers had disguised himself very well. He had been a battle-maniac since the beginning. He was so excited to meet a decent opponent that even Jian Wushuang was fooled.","Fortunately, he was at the perfect level of life and his divine power was vast enough to survive the corrosion of the red fog.","If it had been anyone else, they would have died a long time ago.","On the battlefield, Nine Whiskers’s face was ferocious. He looked at Jian Wushuang with cold eyes, but he was sneering in his heart.","“This Blood Sword is only a second-level Ruler, but his strength and means are definitely at the fifth-level. Even I am no match for him. With such a great leap in realm, he must have gotten a great opportunity before. He must have some big secrets. As long as I kill him, I will know what secrets he has.”","Nine Whiskers had always been a fighter. He appeared to be open and aboveboard and wanted to fight Jian Wushuang with strength.","But in fact, his heart was very dark and his mind was clear.","From the moment Jian Wushuang showed his real strength, he had made up his mind to find a way to kill Jian Wushuang.","Unfortunately, Jian Wushuang was too strong. He could not do anything to him even if he tried his best. He was even heavily injured by his opponent, he had no choice but to use his strongest killing move!","His strongest killing move looked like that extremely terrifying spear move. The power of that Spear move was indeed extremely powerful. There was no doubt about it, but in fact, this terrifying spear move was just a pretense.","His true killing move was hidden under that spear strike. It was the sudden explosion of red mist.","That red mist was a treasure left behind by an Ultimate Ruler in a secret realm of heaven and earth. That Ultimate Ruler was an expert skilled in using poison, that red mist was one of the poisons left behind by that expert.","Only a small part of the poison was enough to kill a fifth-level Ruler. Even an Ultimate Ruler would die if he was accidentally corroded by the red mist.","It was Nine Whiskers’s trump card that had kept him alive for so many years. He had relied on this move to travel around the universe.","Before meeting Jian Wushuang, Nine Whiskers had encountered two real crises. Both times, his opponent was a fifth-level Ruler, who was much stronger than him. In the end, he had relied on this strongest killing move, he had relied on the red fog to successfully kill the two fifth-level Rulers.","Now, Jian Wushuang had also suffered the same move. Seeing the red fog entering Jian Wushuang’s body, he knew that he had won the battle.","Not only did he win, but after Blood Sword died, all his secrets, including the treasures he had left behind and the universe boat, would be his.","According to his estimation, he would gain more from killing Jian Wushuang than killing the two fifth-level Rulers.","Nine Whiskers could not wait any longer.","Suddenly —","Jian Wushuang, who was standing in front of him, opened his eyes.","“Nine Whiskers, you’re doing well,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“How is that possible?” Nine Whiskers widened his eyes in disbelief. “Even a fifth-level Ruler would die if he inhaled that much fog. How could a second-level Ruler survive?”","Nine Whiskers was puzzled and could not believe it.","But in fact, it was right in front of him.","“I’m not dead, but you are going to die soon.” Jian Wushuang showed no mercy. Boom! Boom! Boom!","Three dazzling golden lights suddenly lit up, and three huge Heaven Suppression Tablets rose up.","The three Heaven Suppression Tablets immediately flew to three different places and combined with each other. Boom! A huge golden formation was formed in an instant.","The Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation immediately activated its power at this moment.","“Is this a suppression-type principle treasure?”","“Three of them?”","Nine Whiskers turned pale with fright.","He was horrified to find that under the golden formation, he was actually enduring a huge suppressive force, which greatly weakened the strength he could exert.","Then, Jian Wushuang struck out with his sword.","Splash!","An endless sea of sword essence swept out at this moment.","The sea of sword essence was vast and boundless, spreading across the entire galaxy.","It was the wave sword formation of the three strongest sword formations created by Jian Wushuang!","Although the wave sword formation was only one of the three sword formations, which Jian Wushuang created to trap and entangle his enemies, since Jian Wushuang obtained the three Heaven Suppression Tablets and was able to activate the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation...he relied on the combination of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation and the Wavelight Sword Formation.","This Wavelight Sword Formation had undoubtedly become Jian Wushuang’s most powerful killing move!","Even the obscure sword formation, which focused on attacking power, was far inferior to the Wavelight Sword Formation in killing enemies.","Previously, Jian Wushuang had already used the obscure sword formation and the Earth Protection Sword Formation. As for the Wavelight Sword Formation, he had never used it.","Until now, after Nine Whiskers had truly angered him, Jian Wushuang did not hold back any of his strength. In an instant, the Divine Devil Heaven Suppression Formation and the wave light sword formation were perfectly combined.","Jian Wushuang’s strongest killing move was truly displayed in the universe."]},{"number":4024,"title":"Chapter 4024 - Beheading","paragraphs":["“What is it?”","Nine Whiskers looked at the vast ocean of golden sword intent in front of him in shock.","This ocean of golden sword intent was endless and had an indescribable power. Moreover, this ocean of sword intent was obviously perfectly integrated with the golden formation around it.","Hualala! The enormous golden sea churned, and endless waves of golden sword intent surged toward Nine Whiskers one after another.","Nine Whiskers did not have time to be shocked, and he could only hurriedly use a method to block the attack of this golden sword intent.","!!","However, just one wave of golden sword intent was enough to shock Nine Whiskers.","“At the fifth level, the power contained in this wave of golden sword intent is absolutely not inferior to the full-force attack of a Ruler at the fifth level. Even I have to go all out and use my ultimate move to block it!”","If it was just one or two golden sword essence waves, Nine Whiskers would not care. But the key point was that under the golden sea of sword essence, the mighty golden sword essence waves followed one after another, they surged toward him in an earth-shaking manner.","In just a moment, he was hit by more than ten waves of golden sword essence.","Under such an impact, he had to use his full strength to block it. However, using his ultimate move more than ten times in a row consumed a lot of his divine power.","In addition, Nine Whiskers had been severely injured by Jian Wushuang in the hazy sword formation and had lost nearly half of his divine power. Now, he was trapped in the wave light sword formation and suppressed by the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, Nine Whiskers was completely terrified by the waves of golden sword essence.","“It’s endless. The waves of sword essence are endless. Even if I’m at the peak of my strength, I can barely hold on for a while in this sword formation, not to mention that I’m severely injured.”","“Run, run!”","Nine Whiskers did not want to kill Jian Wushuang anymore. He was completely terrified and just wanted to escape.","Although he had encountered several crises over the years, he was able to turn defeat into victory with his skills. But now, facing Jian Wushuang, there was nothing he could do.","He could only run.","However, he was now trapped in the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation.","With Jian Wushuang’s current strength, the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation activated by the three Heaven Suppression Tablets was so powerful that it directly suppressed the galaxy. Even though Nine Whiskers was the Ultimate Ruler of the fourth level, his battle strength was comparable to that of the fifth level, however, it was not so easy for him to escape the suppression of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation.","“No, no!”","Nine Whiskers cried out in alarm. He wanted to escape, and he had even used his life-saving secret art.","However, facing the golden sea of sword intent that was crazily sweeping over him, he did not have any space or opportunity to escape. He could only watch as his divine power was constantly being consumed, and the aura on his body was constantly weakening.","“It’s over!”","Nine Whiskers was in despair. He was even wailing in his heart.","He was unwilling to die, let alone at the hands of a second-level Ruler.","However, no matter how unwilling he was, the gap between his strength and Jian Wushuang’s was still there.","Before Jian Wushuang had used the three sword formations, Nine Whiskers could have fought Jian Wushuang equally. However, once Jian Wushuang used the three sword formations, Nine Whiskers was no longer Jian Wushuang’s opponent.","In fact, if Nine Whiskers had not been too greedy and did not want to kill Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang would have spared his life. It was a pity that Nine Whiskers had sought his own death.","He thought that his most powerful killing move, even the fifth-level Ruler, would be dead for sure. It should be easy for him to kill Jian Wushuang, a second-level Ruler. However, Jian Wushuang survived.","Buzz!","Another wave of golden sword essence rushed toward him. Nine Whiskers’s divine body could not hold on any longer and collapsed. His life was instantly cut off.","After Nine Whiskers died, his long spear, armor, and treasures that had merged with his body floated in the void, leaving behind his interspatial ring.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and took all the treasures.","Then Jian Wushuang put away the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation and the three Heaven Suppression Tablets into his interspatial ring.","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang looked at the Void to the side.","In that direction, Ruler Mo Chen from the Nihility Star had been standing there watching the battle. However, as the battle progressed to the final stage, Nine Whiskers fell into the wave light sword formation and made his final struggle, naturally, Ruler Mo Chen had also seen it.","Ruler Mo Chen had never expected that even Nine Whiskers was no match for Jian Wushuang. Moreover, it seemed that he was about to die at Jian Wushuang’s hands.","After all, Nine Whiskers was invited by him to avenge his two brothers. Now that Nine Whiskers was about to die, how could he dare to stay any longer?","Therefore, while Nine Whiskers was still struggling, Ruler Mo Chen had already sneaked away.","It could not be helped. He was not on the battlefield. When Jian Wushuang activated the Divine Devil Heaven Suppression Formation, it did not cover him. Jian Wushuang was so focused on Nine Whiskers that he did not have time to pay attention to him, so he let him escape.","“Humph, he’s lucky.”","Jian Wushuang snorted and waved his sleeve. He turned around and walked into the universe boat.","...","In the galaxy not far from the battlefield, Ruler Mo Chen turned into a stream of light and sped through the galaxy.","He did not dare to stop for a moment, afraid that the Ruler of the universe boat would chase after him after he killed Nine Whiskers.","His eyes were filled with unprecedented shock.","“Even Mr. Nine Whiskers is no match for the Ruler of the universe boat? And it seems that he is going to die soon!”","The shock in Ruler Mo Chen’s heart could not be any more intense.","One had to know that when he went to invite Nine Whiskers, he had absolute confidence in the latter.","The latter’s power was so strong that it made him feel despair. However, he had not expected that even such a supreme being would be killed by that universe boat Ruler.","“Even Mr. Nine Whiskers was killed by him. In this Purple Micro Galaxy, there really isn’t anyone else who can threaten that universe boat Ruler. If I want to take revenge for my two brothers, I’m afraid it will be impossible.” Ruler Mo Chen sighed heavily.","He wanted to take revenge, but the other party was too strong.","He was so strong that he despaired. Most importantly, the other party showed his talent and potential.","After all, the other party was only a second-level Ruler. If a second-level Ruler could kill Nine Whiskers, who had a fifth-level Ruler, it would be amazing in the future.","It could be said that Jian Wushuang’s strength and talent made him lose the desire to take revenge.","..."]},{"number":4025,"title":"Chapter 4025 - Was Published","paragraphs":["In the universe boat.","As soon as Jian Wushuang entered, Leng Rushuang and Devil Flame immediately came up to him.","“Darling, are you okay?” Leng Rushuang asked with a hint of worry in her eyes.","“I’m fine, but it was really dangerous. If I wasn’t at the perfect life-level, I would have died,” Jian Wushuang said.","Leng Rushuang’s face darkened.","!!","Although she and Devil Flame had stayed in the universe boat, they had clearly seen the battlefield outside.","Nine Whiskers had used his most powerful killing move, especially the attack of the hidden red fog. It was beyond everyone’s expectations. She had seen Jian Wushuang get hit, and she had almost run out of the universe boat, it was the Devil Flame that held her back.","“I was careless,” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice, “I underestimated the experts in the universe.”","He had risen from the Divine Beginning Realm and encountered countless crises along the way.","However, he was mentally prepared for many of those crises. Jian Wushuang knew most of the techniques of the experts in the Divine Beginning Realm, so he was confident.","But the universe was different.","The universe was vast and boundless, and there were countless experts.","Because of this, there were all kinds of strange techniques in the universe.","Not only were there many kinds of techniques, but they were also terrifying and impossible to guard against.","This time, Jian Wushuang saw it for himself.","Nine Whiskers was a fighter just now and wanted to use his strongest move to fight with him. Who would have thought that there was a terrifying killer move hidden in his strongest move? Even he was accidentally hit by it.","“The vast universe is much more cruel than the Divine Beginning Realm. Although I have experienced many storms in the Divine Beginning Realm, I have just entered the universe and don’t know much about it. I am still very young compared to the entire universe,” Jian Wushuang thought.","Young, he could only use this word to describe himself.","Even though he had lived for hundreds of thousands of years and experienced many storms, it was still his first time venturing into the universe.","“Ruler, the cruelty of the universe is far beyond what you can imagine. What you are seeing now is just the surface of the entire universe. I once ventured into the universe for a very long time. During this long period of adventuring, I summed up a sentence, that is, in the universe, other than yourself, don’t trust anyone else!”","“Except for yourself, everyone around you can be your enemy.”","“You have to be vigilant and careful in order to live longer.”","“As for those who are merciful in fierce battles, they won’t live long,” Devil Flame said in a low voice.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","He had learned from his mistakes. This time, Jian Wushuang had learned a lesson.","In the future, no matter who his opponent was in the universe, even if he did not have the intention to kill, he had to be careful that his opponent might use his killer move at any time.","Even if the person in front of him was a well-known good man, he could still suddenly reach out to him with his dark and cold cprinciples.","“By the way, Nine Whiskers is an expert at the pinnacle of the fourth level, and his battle strength is comparable to a fifth-level Ruler. He is also an Ascetic, so he must be rich. Although I killed him, I haven’t checked his treasures.” Jian Wushuang smiled, then he waved his hand and took out the treasures and interspatial ring that Nine Whiskers had left behind after his death.","Jian Wushuang first looked at the treasures that were revealed from Nine Whiskers’s divine body after his death.","Nine Whiskers had already recognized and refined these treasures, so Nine Whiskers used them directly. For example, the long spear and armor, a black ring, and a strange gray bead.","Jian Wushuang already knew about the long spear and armor.","The purple long spear was a Principle Supreme Treasure, but judging from its aura, it was only a low-grade Principle Supreme Treasure. Its value was estimated to be between 100 and 200 universe origin stones.","As for the armor, it was a supreme-grade supreme treasure, so it was not worth much.","Jian Wushuang was mainly looking at the black ring and the strange gray bead.","He first looked at the black ring, and his consciousness directly merged with it.","“Is it a domain type supreme treasure?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and then shook his head.","Although a domain type supreme treasure was a supreme-grade supreme treasure, since it was not a Principle Supreme Treasure, it could not interest Jian Wushuang.","Then Jian Wushuang looked at the strange gray bead. With a simple sweep of his consciousness, Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","“A principle-type supreme treasure!”","“And it’s an extremely precious one, a soul-defense type supreme treasure!”","Jian Wushuang was excited both physically and mentally.","A principle-type supreme treasure was extremely precious. Any attack-type supreme treasure was worth more than 100 universe origin stones.","However, an attack type Principle Supreme Treasure was only an ordinary Principle Supreme Treasure. A Principle Supreme Treasure armor, a domain type, and a suppression type Principle Supreme Treasure were naturally more valuable.","For example, Jian Wushuang’s Heaven Suppression Tablet was much more valuable than an ordinary attack type Principle Supreme Treasure. Of course, because the Heaven Suppression Tablet was a standard Principle Supreme Treasure, it was not very valuable.","As for a soul-defense-type principle treasure, it was precious.","After all, the soul was the core of a cultivator.","In the universe, it was necessary to protect one’s soul when one’s strength reached the Ruler level. After all, there were many experts in the universe who specialized in the soul aspect. When such experts used soul attacks, it was impossible for them to defend themselves, they could only rely on their own soul power to withstand it.","At this time, a soul-defense type true treasure, nine, was particularly important.","In terms of value, a soul-defense type true treasure was definitely the most precious among all true treasures of the same level.","The gray Ruler and the purple spear Jian Wushuang had obtained from the treasures left behind by Nine Whiskers were both Principle True Treasures. However, in terms of value, the gray Ruler was definitely more than ten times as valuable as the purple spear!","If the gray pearls were sold in the Nine Emperor Pavilion, they could be sold for more than 1,000 universe origin stones.","“Haha, I’m rich, I’m rich!” Jian Wushuang laughed.","“A Principle True Treasure of the soul defense type?” Devil Flame’s eyes lit up. “A Principle True Treasure of this level is enough to attract many fifth-level Rulers. Even an ultimate-level Ruler would take it seriously. How could Nine Whiskers, a fourth-level Ruler, have such a treasure?”","It was apparent that Devil Flame was also quite shocked.","One had to know that even when he was at his peak, he had many Principle True Treasures in his possession. However, a soul-defense type Principle True Treasure, even if it was only a low-level one, was enough for him to take it seriously.","After all, the highest-level true treasure he had used at his peak was only a middle-level Principle True Treasure. This low-level soul-defense type Principle True Treasure was very close to a middle-level Principle True Treasure.","..."]},{"number":4026,"title":"Chapter 4026 - Arrived at the Purple Micro Star Field","paragraphs":["“This soul-defense-type Principle treasure alone is priceless, but I haven’t checked Nine Whiskers’s interspatial ring yet. I hope it will give me a surprise.” Jian Wushuang was full of expectation, he began to check Nine Whiskers’s interspatial ring again.","He sank his consciousness into the interspatial ring and just glanced at it briefly. Jian Wushuang could not help but look pleasantly surprised.","“Good man, Nine Whiskers is really rich,” Jian Wushuang praised.","He was indeed rich. There were a mountain of universe crystals and a large number of universe origin stones in the interspatial ring. All of them added up to an estimated 1,300 universe origin stones.","In addition, there were all kinds of treasures in the interspatial ring, each of which was worth a lot.","!!","For example, there were three Principle Supreme Treasures in the interspatial ring.","Of course, these three Principle Supreme Treasures were just ordinary attack Principle Supreme Treasures, which were worth as much as the purple long spear used by Nine Whiskers.","But when all of them were added together, their value was also very shocking.","“Although Nine Whiskers is an Ascetic Cultivator, he is only a Ruler at the ultimate level of the fourth level. How could he be so rich?” Jian Wushuang could not help exclaiming in admiration.","The value of the soul-defense-type principle-type true treasure, together with the treasures in Nine Whiskers’s interspatial ring, was close to 3,000 universe origin stones.","3,000 universe origin stones was more than the wealth of most fifth-level Rulers.","It was known that many poor fifth-level Rulers could not even get an attack-type principle-type true treasure.","“Ruler, if I’m not wrong, Nine Whiskers must have killed many experts, and he must have obtained some special opportunities. Otherwise, he would not be so rich as a fourth-level Ruler,” Devil Flame said.","“Maybe.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","What he did not know was that Nine Whiskers had indeed obtained some opportunities. He had obtained the cave mansion of an Ultimate Ruler and obtained a lot of benefits from the cave mansion.","In addition, he was very strong and had been roaming around the universe for a long time. He had killed a lot of experts, including two fifth-level Rulers, all of the experts he had killed had a lot of wealth. With the help of the Ultimate Ruler, it was normal for him to have such wealth.","However, since Nine Whiskers had been killed by Jian Wushuang, his life’s gains had benefited Jian Wushuang.","“Previously, I was worried that I didn’t have enough money. Even if I went to the Nine Emperor Pavilion in the Purple Micro Galaxy, I wouldn’t be able to exchange for what I wanted. But now, it should be enough.” Jian Wushuang smiled, he glanced at Devil Flame and said, “Devil Flame, when we arrive in the Purple Micro Galaxy, I’ll go to the Nine Emperor Pavilion to exchange for some special crystals to help you recover 30% or even 40% of your divine body.”","“Thank you, Ruler.” Devil Flame was delighted.","“Shuang ‘er.” Jian Wushuang looked at his wife and said, “Have you refined this gray bead?”","Jian Wushuang directly handed the gray bead to Leng Rushuang.","“Husband, this bead is a principle treasure for soul defense. Aren’t you going to use it?” Leng Rushuang frowned.","“Haha, Shuang ‘Er, you should know that I’m a perfect life-level cultivator. I’m already invincible in the aspect of soul. No one can attack me from the aspect of soul. Naturally, this soul defense type principle treasure is useless against me. On the other hand, if you want to explore the universe with me in the future, you’ll inevitably encounter some dangers. And you only have enough self-protection ability to not distract me.”","“Yes, I understand.” Leng Rushuang nodded and took the gray bead.","She knew what Jian Wushuang said made sense. In terms of strength, although her divine body and soul had been transformed because of the astral heart, and she had great potential after receiving the legacy of supreme fog, in terms of strength...she was still far from Jian Wushuang.","She wanted to follow Jian Wushuang around. She did not want to say whether she could help him or not, but at least she could not hold him back. This was Leng Rushuang’s own opinion.","With the gray bead, her life-saving ability could be improved a lot.","“Well, let’s continue.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Immediately, the huge universe boat continued to move forward toward the galaxy.","The speed of the universe boat was still extremely fast. Even Ancient Yuan Star and Nihility Star, which were the overlords in the Purple Micro Galaxy, were defeated by Jian Wushuang, even Nine Whiskers, who was previously recognized as the strongest expert, died at Jian Wushuang’s hands. After that, no one in the Purple Micro Galaxy dared to look for trouble with them.","In a flash, another 400 years had passed.","The universe boat had finally reached the end of the Purple Micro Galaxy.","“After 700 years, I’ve finally reached the end of the Purple Micro Galaxy?” Jian Wushuang looked at the end of the galaxy in front of him, where the vast universe void appeared, and a smile appeared on his face.","He had traveled through the Purple Micro Galaxy by universe boat for more than 700 years, and he had also traveled through the universe passage of the Ancient Yuan Star, saving him 200 to 300 years. Now, he had finally crossed the galaxy completely.","At the end of the galaxy was the Purple Micro Galaxy, which was one of Jian Wushuang’s two goals.","The Purple Micro Galaxy was a medium-sized galaxy. It was much more powerful than Jian Wushuang’s shooting star field, which was located at the edge of the universe and the most barren place.","Jian Wushuang had learned the complete information about the Purple Micro Galaxy from the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","There were more than 1,000 star worlds in the Purple Micro Galaxy alone. Although most of them were third-level star worlds, there were still more than 10 second-level star worlds.","Although the Purple Micro Galaxy was still not in the depths of the universe, it was no longer the edge of the universe. The overall strength of the second-level star worlds here was much stronger than that of the Devil Cloud Star Lord, the Ruler of the second-level Star Worlds, in terms of strength, he was also much stronger than the Devil Cloud Star Lord. According to Jian Wushuang’s information, almost all the Rulers of the second-grade astral world in the Purple Micro Galaxy were fifth-grade Rulers.","Jian Wushuang’s target in the Purple Micro Galaxy was Ruler star Luo and her disciple Leng Ruxue. Jian Wushuang had long received complete information.","Ruler Star Luo came from a second-grade astral world in the Purple Micro Galaxy, the top force in the Thunder Star Field, the Universal Poison Demon Sect.","The leader of the Universal Poison Demon Sect was one of the top three super powerhouses in the Lei Heng Galaxy. It was said that his strength was only second to the leader of the Lei Heng Galaxy.","..."]},{"number":4027,"title":"Chapter 4027 - Ballmer","paragraphs":["“The name of the Universal Poison Demon Sect tells me that it’s a sect that specializes in using poison. Leng Ruxue, on the other hand, was born with a body of woe poison derived from a great sin. The Universal Poison Demon Sect is perfect for her,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","Jian Wushuang knew where Leng Ruxue was, but he was not in a hurry to go to the Thunder Star World. Instead, he went to the Nine Emperor Pavilion in the Purple Micro Galaxy.","The Nine Emperor Pavilion had influence in all the territories in the universe.","The Purple Micro Star River was a medium-sized star field. The scale of the Nine Emperor Pavilion in that star field was far beyond that of the Nine Emperor Pavilion in Jian Wushuang’s star field.","On a huge and boundless earth star, there were towering pavilions and palaces, and the entire earth star was covered by a huge magic array.","!!","The magic formation exuded an ancient and majestic aura. Just from the aura alone, one could tell that the magic formation was extremely powerful. Even a fourth-level or even fifth-level Ruler would not be able to shake it.","Flying was prohibited in the Nine Emperor Pavilion, so cultivators who came to the pavilion to trade had to enter through the entrance. After entering the pavilion, they could only walk.","Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang walked into the Nine Emperor Pavilion side by side, arm in arm. Devil Flame followed them respectfully. As for the universe boat, Jian Wushuang had put it back into his interspatial ring.","When they came to the center of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, they could see the treasures displayed around them and the cultivators passing by.","There were a lot of cultivators trading in the Nine Emperor Pavilion. Although most of them were still Principle Rulers, there were still a lot of Rulers. Some of them were in the second or third level.","Rulers...in the inhospitable shooting star field where the absolute beginning divine realm was located, they were naturally top experts. It was rare to see one on a normal day.","However, Rulers were nothing in the vast universe. The Purple Micro Galaxy was a medium-sized star field with a lot of Rulers, and the Nine Emperor Pavilion was the largest trading center in the entire Purple Micro Galaxy, naturally, there were many Rulers.","As soon as Jian Wushuang and the other two entered the trading center, the attendants in the Nine Emperor Pavilion noticed their extraordinary auras and immediately came forward to welcome them.","“My lords, is there anything that the Nine Emperor Pavilion can do for you?” The attendant, who was only a Principle Ruler, was very respectful.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything but took out a token.","The moment he saw the token, the servant of the Nine Emperor Pavilion glared at him, and then his expression became even more respectful.","“My lords, please follow me.”","Under the guidance of the servant, the three of them came to an independent secret room where a purple-clothed man received them.","“My young friend Blood Sword, I am one of the three supervisors of the Nine Emperor Pavilion in the Purple Micro Galaxy. My name is Ballmer,” the purple-clothed man said with a smile.","As one of the supervisors of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, Ballmer had the battle strength of a fourth-level Ruler. In terms of aura, he was much stronger than the three of them. However, when he faced Jian Wushuang, he did not put on airs at all. On the contrary, he was extremely enthusiastic.","“Hello, supervisor Ballmer,” Jian Wushuang greeted with a smile.","“What do you need, Blood Sword?” Ballmer asked.","“I need some high-level special crystals. You’d better give me a list and let me choose,” Jian Wushuang said.","“No problem.” Ballmer quickly organized a list and handed it to Jian Wushuang. “Blood Sword, the crystals on this list are all owned by the Nine Emperor Pavilion in the Purple Micro Starfield. As long as you need them, they can be sent to you immediately. As for the level, it’s not low either.”","Jian Wushuang took the list and glanced at it briefly. He nodded slightly and handed it to Devil Flame behind him. “Devil Flame, take a look.”","Devil Flame took the list and began to read it.","After a while, Devil Flame spoke, “Ruler, the quality of the crystals on this list is very high. Many of them are even higher than gold-fire magic stones and Ice Essence Crystals. The highest-level crystals are very useful for my divine body recovery, especially the three types of crystals. If you give me 20 of them, my divine body will recover to about 40%.”","“That’s good.” Jian Wushuang smiled. He pointed at the three gems mentioned by Devil Flame and said, “Give me 20 gems for each of them.”","“No problem.” Ballmer nodded. “Give me 20 gems for each of them. I’ll give you 300 universe origin stones.”","“300?” Jian Wushuang smiled. “It’s not expensive.”","It was indeed not expensive. When he bought the gold-fire magic stone in his star field, one gold-fire magic stone was calculated as one universe origin stone.","The gold-fire magic stone was far less valuable than the three gems that Devil Flame had chosen.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang bought 60 of these gems at one time, but he only needed 300 universe origin stones, which was cheap enough.","Of course, this was also because the gems Jian Wushuang needed now were already available in the Purple Micro Galaxy. He did not need to send them from other star fields, so the price was indeed much cheaper.","“I need a few more Principle Supreme Treasures...”","Jian Wushuang began to pick Principle Supreme Treasures again.","Of course, he was not picking Principle Supreme Treasures for himself. After all, he already had the Wuqi Divine Sword, which was an upper-grade Principle Supreme Treasure. It was very valuable and was enough for him to use.","He also had three Heaven Suppression Tablets and a suppression type Principle Supreme Treasure.","If he really wanted a Principle Supreme Treasure, he would probably need a supreme treasure armor, or a domain type or a flying type Principle Supreme Treasure.","However, that type of Principle Supreme Treasure was too valuable. Any one of them was estimated to be worth thousands of universe origin stones. Jian Wushuang had killed Nine Whiskers, and although he had obtained a considerable amount of wealth...however, he was not so extravagant as to directly choose armor, domain, or flying Principle treasures for himself.","He was now choosing treasures for his aura, which was as cold as frost, and Devil Flame.","Needless to say, Devil Flame’s battle strength was very important to Jian Wushuang. Jian Wushuang had spent 300 universe origin stones just to let Devil Flame recover more strength, as long as Devil Flame got the crystals and restored his divine body to 40%, his strength would be restored to the highest level of the fourth level, or even the fifth level, by then, he would have a very strong battle strength even in the fifth level.","If he had a Principle Supreme Treasure suitable for him to use, his battle strength would be stronger.","Leng Rushuang was his wife. Jian Wushuang was not stingy with his aura. He had given Leng Rushuang the soul-defense Principle Supreme Treasure he had obtained after killing Nine Whiskers, now, he would naturally give Leng Rushuang an attack Principle Supreme Treasure.","After all, he had come to the Purple Micro Galaxy to end things between his wife and Leng Rushuang."]},{"number":4028,"title":"Chapter 4028 - Venom","paragraphs":["Soon, Jian Wushuang selected the Principle Supreme Treasures for Leng Rushuang and Devil Flame.","Leng Rushuang chose the long whip, while Devil Flame chose a blood-red cprinciple divine weapon. These two Principle Supreme Treasures greatly improved their strength.","The two Principle Supreme Treasures, together with the special gems, only cost Jian Wushuang around 600 universe origin stones. Jian Wushuang had needed the golden origin divine fruit to cultivate the supreme eternal celestial body, therefore, he owed the Nine Emperor Pavilion a sum of universe origin stones.","This time, Jian Wushuang also paid them back. Even so, he still had some single origin stones left from the interspatial ring. In addition, Jian Wushuang had obtained them from Star Demon ancestor and Devil Cloud Star Ruler, in addition to his years of collection, Jian Wushuang still had about 500 universe origin stones left in his hand.","“Chief Ballmer, I have a list of treasures here. See if you can gather all the treasures on this list in a short time.” Jian Wushuang handed over another list of treasures.","!!","Ballmer took it with a smile. His eyes swept over it, but the smile on his face instantly froze.","“Blood, Blood Sword...” There was something wrong with Ballmer’s voice.","“Why? Don’t you have any treasures in the Nine Emperor Pavilion?” Jian Wushuang looked at him.","“No.” Ballmer shook his head. “As long as there are treasures in the universe, the Nine Emperor Pavilion can basically get them. It’s just a matter of time. Blood Sword, I can gather 70-80% of the treasures on your list, but there are still a few treasures that need to be transferred to other territories. But I can guarantee that I can gather all of them and send them to you within 1,000 years.”","“Within 1,000 years?” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","“Blood Sword, do you think that time is too long?” Ballmer looked over.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","1,000 years was indeed too long for him.","However, Ballmer gave a strange smile. “Blood Sword, you don’t have to worry about the time. After all, with the existence of the universe passage, it’s not impossible to speed up. What you should really care about is the value of these treasures.”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. He could tell from Ballmer’s words that the treasures on this list were of extraordinary value.","Jian Wushuang was not surprised by this.","The list of treasures he took out was exactly what he needed to cultivate the fourth level of the supreme imperishable celestial body.","The supreme imperishable celestial body was an internal star secret skill from the Lingyun Star. It was of a very high level. He had already cultivated the first three levels at the level of a Principle Ruler, and his divine body was comparable to the most powerful supreme treasure, which was considered heaven-defying.","From the fourth stage, the supreme eternal celestial body could only be cultivated in the Ruler realm. Naturally, Jian Wushuang had now reached the threshold of cultivation. However, he had enough cultivation conditions, but he needed supplementary treasures to cultivate, he did not have them, so he could only place his hopes on the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","However, in order to Ruler the third stage, he needed many treasures, including a golden origin divine fruit.","The value of the golden origin divine fruit was very high. If it was auctioned well, it could be sold for nearly 100 universe origin stones.","Many of the treasures needed to cultivate the fourth level of the supreme eternal celestial body were on the same level as the golden origin divine fruit, and there were more than a dozen treasures more valuable than the golden origin divine fruit.","Naturally, it was very difficult to gather all the treasures on the list.","“Ballmer, just tell me, how many universe origin stones do you need to gather all the treasures on this list?” Jian Wushuang asked. He was mentally prepared.","“Blood Sword, you’re on the Nine Emperor List and a guest of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. I won’t hide it from you. If you gather all the treasures on this list, you’ll need at least 8,000 universe origin stones. This is because of your identity and there’s no time limit. If it’s someone else who needs to send them over as soon as possible, they’ll need to wait even longer!” Ballmer said.","“8,000 universe origin stones?”","Even though Jian Wushuang was mentally prepared, he was still shocked when he heard this number.","“8,000 universe origin stones?” Devil Flame could not help but sigh, “An ordinary fifth-level Ruler only has hundreds of universe origin stones, while some peak fifth-level Rulers only have about 2,000 to 3,000 universe origin stones. 8,000 universe origin stones is comparable to the total wealth of an Ultimate Ruler.”","“For me, at my peak, my total wealth is only about 10,000 universe origin stones.”","“I thought I had killed Nine Whiskers and obtained his interspatial ring. In addition to my previous collection, my wealth is relatively rich, but I didn’t expect it to be so far behind.” Jian Wushuang shook his head with a bitter smile.","“Blood Sword, you’re a friend of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, and you’re listed on the Nine Emperor List. Therefore, you have some privileges in the Nine Emperor Pavilion. You can apply to get these treasures first and then pay back the universe origin stones in the future. However, there are more than 8,000 universe origin stones, so the amount is a bit too big. You need to get the approval of some higher-ups of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. I can help you apply, but it’ll take some time to get an answer,” said Ballmer...","“No need.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand.","He was not that eager to get the treasures. He also knew that although he was on the Nine Emperor List, it would not be easy for him to borrow more than 8,000 treasures from the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","“By the way, Ballmer, I have some special items. I don’t know their specific value. I wonder if you can appraise them for me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Of course, no problem.” Ballmer was very enthusiastic and patient.","“I just got these things not long ago,” Jian Wushuang said while waving his hand and taking out jade bottles.","There were 12 jade bottles in total. Each of them was made of a very special material and even had the effect of shielding the soul power from detection.","If the stopper was not opened, it was impossible to know what was inside the jade bottles.","Looking at the jade bottles floating in front of him, Ballmer felt a little curious. Then, he opened one of the jade bottles and poured his soul power into it.","“This is...” Ballmer suddenly widened his eyes.","There was only a drop of scarlet liquid inside the jade bottle. Although it was liquid, it gave off an extremely cold feeling. The moment Ballmer’s soul power touched this drop of liquid...he instantly felt as if his entire soul was about to be completely frozen.","“Poison? Is this poison?” Ballmer looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","“Yes, it’s poison.” Jian Wushuang smiled slightly.","..."]},{"number":4029,"title":"Chapter 4029 - Poison Ruler","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang had also obtained the poison from the interspatial ring that Nine Whiskers had left behind.","When Jian Wushuang had fought Nine Whiskers, Nine Whiskers had hidden the poison fog under his killing move. Jian Wushuang had not been able to resist the sudden red poison fog and had been struck by it.","The red poisonous fog was so poisonous that even Jian Wushuang’s perfect life divine body could not defend against it. Fortunately, he had abundant divine power, so he was able to survive.","After killing Nine Whiskers, Jian Wushuang found these poisonous liquids in Nine Whiskers’s interspatial ring. There were 12 jade bottles in total, and each jade bottle contained a drop of poison.","These poisonous liquids were not exactly the same, but there were three types. Jian Wushuang recognized one of the scarlet poisonous liquids. It was similar to the red poisonous fog that had eroded his divine body, but it was more intense.","!!","Nine Whiskers must have spent some money to decompose part of the red poison into a red fog and hide it in his magic weapon.","“Ballmer, look at this poison. How valuable is it?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Poison, especially high-level poison, is very valuable in the universe. The poison you have is obviously very high-level, so it should be very valuable. However, I can identify many kinds of treasures, but I’m not good at poison,” Ballmer said with a smile.","“Blood Sword, wait here for a moment. I’ll show this venom to another supervisor of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. He has some experience in appraising the venom.”","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “There are three different kinds of venom here. Take a drop each and let him appraise it.”","Ballmer immediately took the three jade bottles containing the different kinds of venom and walked out of the secret chamber.","Jian Wushuang and the other two were waiting there quietly.","Not long after, Ballmer returned to the secret chamber and came to Jian Wushuang.","“My friend Blood Sword, the identification results are out.” Ballmer looked at Jian Wushuang with a smile. “The three kinds of poison you took out are basically on the same level. It’s not surprising that the three kinds of poison were refined by the same Ultimate Poison Ruler. It’s just that there is a slight difference in the nature and the use process.”","“Poison Ruler?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. This was the first time he had heard this title.","“Ruler, the universe is vast and there are countless cultivators. Among the countless cultivators, there are naturally some special professions, such as alchemy, weapon refining, array formation, or soul attack. These are all common, but there are also some rare ones, such as Poison Rulers!” Devil Flame said, “Poison Rulers are good at using poison, and they usually adjust all kinds of poison to kill their enemies.”","“In the universe, Poison Rulers are very terrifying because the poison that they adjust is usually very terrifying. If you are not careful, even if you are obviously stronger than the other party, you may die at the hands of the Poison Ruler. A Poison Ruler who has reached the level of an Ultimate Ruler is absolutely the most terrifying among Ultimate Rulers. Even an autarch would not dare to underestimate such a Ruler.”","“So powerful?” Jian Wushuang was secretly shocked.","“Ruler was ambushed by Nine Whiskers. Fortunately, Nine Whiskers can’t really use the venom. Otherwise, even though you have a special physique, I’m afraid you won’t be able to resist the erosion of this drop of venom,” Devil Flame said solemnly.","Jian Wushuang understood.","He could see that any drop of Venom from this jade bottle was extremely terrifying. Even killing an Ultimate Ruler with this drop of venom would be very easy, let alone him.","However, although the poison had the ability to kill an Ultimate Ruler, ordinary people could not use it at all.","Nine Whiskers, for example, could not use the poison completely. He had spent a long time to dilute the red poisonous fog that had ambushed Jian Wushuang, it only took one percent of the entire drop of poison.","Even so, the red poisonous fog still caused Jian Wushuang great trouble.","One could imagine how terrifying a complete drop of venom was.","Most importantly, the venom could only be stored in a special material and could not exist in the void for long. Even if he wanted to smear the venom on his weapon to kill the enemy, the level of the venom was too high, ordinary Supreme Treasures and magic weapons would be corroded and destroyed upon contact with the venom. They would not even have a chance to attack.","Even if it was a principle-type supreme treasure, an ordinary low-grade principle-type supreme treasure, if it was smeared with a drop of the venom, the low-grade principle-type supreme treasure would suffer great damage and might even collapse over time.","Because of this, Nine Whiskers was unable to smear a complete drop of venom on his long spear to attack.","“The spear in Nine Whiskers’s hand is only a low-grade principle treasure, but my Wuqi Divine Sword is an upper-grade principle treasure. If I apply a complete drop of poison to it, it should be able to withstand it, right?” Jian Wushuang could not help thinking.","After all, this was a poison concocted by an Ultimate Ruler-level Poison Ruler. One drop of this poison could kill an Ultimate Ruler. If it could be applied to a weapon and used as an attack...as long as the weapon touched the other party’s divine body, the venom would immediately seep into it. Then, even an Ultimate Ruler-level would have a hard time surviving.","This meant that if he was lucky, he would have the opportunity to kill an Ultimate Ruler-level with this venom!","Of course, this was just a thought. He did not really intend to do it.","After all, he did not have much confidence that the Wuqi Divine Sword would be able to withstand a single drop of the venom. If it could not withstand it and caused the Wuqi Divine Sword to be damaged, then he would suffer a great loss.","Unless he was in a real crisis and had no other choice, he would not make such a choice.","“Blood Sword, your poison is indeed very precious. If you want to sell it, the Nine Emperor Pavilion can collect one drop of it for 1,000 universe origin stones,” said Ballmer.","“One drop of 1,000 universe origin stones?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","“So precious?” Leng Rushuang and Devil Flame were also shocked.","One drop of poison for 1,000 universe origin stones.","He had taken out 12 jade bottles and 12 drops of poison, which meant that if he sold all the poison, it would be 12,000 universe origin stones.","Previously, he was worried about the value of the treasures needed to cultivate the fourth level of the supreme imperishable body, but in the blink of an eye, he knew that he had such a great wealth.","12,000 origin stones. Even if he used up 8,000, he still had 4,000 origin stones left."]},{"number":4030,"title":"Chapter 4030 - Refining Conditions","paragraphs":["“Blood Sword, this venom...” Ballmer looked at Jian Wushuang. He hoped that Jian Wushuang would sell it to him.","After all, such high-level venom had always been rare in the universe. The Nine Emperor Pavilion’s forces were all over the universe, and even higher-level venom could be found everywhere. However, they were all in the depths of the universe, or in some large territories.","And in the Purple Micro Galaxy, this was the highest-level poison that Ballmer had come into contact with.","“No.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand. “I just asked you to help me identify the value of this poison, but I didn’t want to sell it to you.”","Hearing this, Ballmer shrugged, feeling helpless in his heart.","“By the way, Ballmer, is there any way for me to refine the venom?” Jian Wushuang suddenly asked.","“Refine?” Ballmer was stunned. “Blood Sword, do you want to completely refine the venom?”","“Of course.” Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile.","If he did not refine it, then all he could do was to forcibly smear a drop of venom on the Wuqi Divine Sword and find an opportunity to kill the enemy, at the risk of the Wuqi Divine Sword being corroded and damaged.","Or he could be like Nine Whiskers. He could spend the years on the drill ground to slowly dilute the poison and decompose it into some lower-level poisonous fog or gas to kill the enemy.","However, there were many flaws in these two ways of using it.","For example, if he was in a fierce battle, the other party would not give him the chance to apply the poison on the divine sword. He would really find an opportunity to do it under the other party’s nose, the opponent knew that you had applied a lethal poison on the divine sword, so he would naturally be vigilant. It would not be so easy for you to succeed.","As for the second type, not only would it take a lot of time, but the final product, such as the red fog of Nine Whiskers, was also powerful, but its effect was far less amazing than a drop of complete venom.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang wanted to completely refine the venom.","As long as he completely refined and Rulered the venom, he could use the venom as he pleased. He could even directly integrate the venom into the Wuqi Divine Sword without harming it at all, normally, he would activate the Wuqi Divine Sword as usual. As long as he willed it, the venom in the Wuqi Divine Sword would fully display its power. This was the most appropriate way to use it.","When Jian Wushuang was still very weak, he would fuse some of the venom into his divine weapon and use it to corrode the opponent’s divine body and divine power to kill the enemy instantly.","“Blood Sword friend, the venom in these jade bottles contains incredible corrosive power. Any drop of it can easily kill a Ruler at the peak of the fifth level, and it can even pose a great threat to an ultimate level Ruler. If you are not careful, an ultimate level Ruler will die.”","“However, because the poison is too terrifying, it’s extremely difficult to refine it. Under normal circumstances, a Ruler at the peak of the fifth level would have a chance of success if he took the risk. However, if a cultivator below the peak of the fifth level tried to refine the poison by force, the result would be certain death,” Ballmer said seriously.","“Is it really impossible to be so sure?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Blood Sword, you don’t know that this venom not only corrodes a cultivator’s divine body, but it can also directly destroy a cultivator’s soul. To complete the venom, not only do you need a lot of divine power to nourish your soul, but most importantly, your soul is strong enough to withstand the corrosion of the venom, so that you can refine it!”","“However, even the most extreme Ruler of the fifth level will be corroded by the venom once his soul comes into contact with it. If he is lucky, his soul will be severely damaged. If he is unlucky, his soul will be completely annihilated. There is only a slim chance of success.”","“But Blood Sword, if I’m not mistaken, you are only at the second level. A second level Ruler’s soul has no chance of refining the venom.”","Ballmer looked at Jian Wushuang with a faint smile. He did not mean to belittle Jian Wushuang, but what he said was the truth.","Under normal circumstances, to refine the poison at this level, the most important thing was to have an extremely strong soul that could withstand the corrosion of the poison. However, Ballmer was sure that Jian Wushuang’s soul could not meet the requirements.","However, after hearing Ballmer’s words, Jian Wushuang’s face was calm, but his heart was filled with ecstasy!","“Soul?”","“To refine this poison, I need to rely on my soul?”","“The thing I’m least afraid of is my soul!”","Jian Wushuang’s body and heart were trembling.","After all, he was a perfect life-level cultivator. In terms of soul, he was already invincible.","The damage to the soul, to him, was only a slight loss of divine power that could be completely repaired.","Even if his soul was completely destroyed, it wouldn’t have any effect on him.","This also meant that he could try to refine this poison without restraint, just like how his Ruler Xuan Yi had tried countless times to take over the absolute beginning divine realm.","For other cultivators, if they tried to refine the venom by relying on their souls, they would die if they failed. However, even if they failed, they would only lose a small part of their divine power, he could try again and again until he finally succeeded.","“Ballmer, thank you for telling me this.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “Please prepare the things I asked for before.”","“No problem. Blood Sword, you can wait in the Nine Emperor Pavilion for a while. I’ll send the gems and two Principle Supreme Treasures to you right away.” Ballmer smiled, he went down to prepare them for Jian Wushuang.","In just an hour, Ballmer had sent all the things to him.","“Devil Flame, I’ll give you all the gems. Take the time to recover your divine body,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Devil Flame’s eyes lit up.","“Shuang ‘er, this nomological treasure, the long whip, is much stronger than ordinary supreme treasures. You just got it, so I’m afraid you’re not used to it yet. Let’s find a place to get used to it. We’ll go to the Universal Poison Demon Sect in a few days,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Leng Rushuang nodded.","“Supervisor Ballmer, I need more detailed information about someone. Her name is Leng Ruxue, and she’s from the Universal Poison Demon Sect,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Leng Ruxue? The witch of the Universal Poison Demon Sect?” Ballmer was stunned, and he could not help looking at Leng Rushuang with a strange look."]},{"number":4031,"title":"Chapter 4031 - Sorceress","paragraphs":["“Sorceress?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","“My friend Blood Sword, this should be your wife, right?” Ballmer asked.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“You didn’t mention the Sorceress. I haven’t noticed it yet. Your wife and the Sorceress are very similar. Not only in appearance, but also in temperament,” Ballmer said.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help laughing.","It was certain that Leng Rushuang was similar to the Sorceress. After all, Leng Rushuang and Leng Ruxue were originally two souls derived from the same body.","They used to occupy the same divine body, but after Leng Rushuang reincarnated, their souls were separated from that body.","But now, Leng Rushuang’s new body was also molded according to the original appearance, so they were naturally similar in appearance and temperament.","“Is Leng Ruxue in the Universal Poison Demon Sect now?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“No.” Ballmer shook his head. “As far as I know, Leng Ruxue left the Universal Poison Demon Sect hundreds of years ago. She even left the Thunder Star Field and went to a special secret land. She hasn’t returned. But if I’m not mistaken, Leng Ruxue should return to the Universal Poison Demon Sect in a few years.”","“In a few years? Why?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Because in a few years, there will be a feast in the Thunder Star Field. Leng Ruxue will definitely attend it,” Ballmer said.","“I understand. Thank you,” Jian Wushuang thanked him. Then he left the Nine Emperor Pavilion with Leng Rushuang and Devil Flame and headed toward the Thunder Star Field.","In a tavern at the foot of the Universal Poison Demon Sect in the Thunder Star Field, Jian Wushuang and the other two sat together and casually ate and drank.","“The space of the second-grade astral world is much more stable than that of the third-grade astral world. We, the Rulers from the astral world, are not restricted by any restrictions in the Thunder Star Field,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","He had been worried that he would be restricted by the Heavenly Dao will of the Thunder Star Field after entering the Thunder Star Field since he was an external Ruler.","Just like the Divine Beginning Realm.","The Divine Beginning Realm could not withstand the battle strength of a Ruler, so even a local Ruler in the Divine Beginning Realm could not use all of his strength. Only a Principle Ruler could fight recklessly, he could use all of his strength.","However, it was clear that the Thunder Star Field did not have too many restrictions on cultivators at the Ruler level.","At least, Jian Wushuang did not feel the restriction of the will of heaven as he was standing here. He could fully exert his strength to the peak.","This was impossible in the Divine Beginning Realm.","“Ruler, in the vast universe, the star worlds are divided into different levels not only because the quality of the experts born in different star worlds is different, but also because it represents the space stability of this star world and the strength of the experts it can withstand!” Devil Flame began to explain.","“Under normal circumstances, a normal third-grade astral world would not be able to withstand the battle prowess of a Ruler. Therefore, a Ruler would not be able to unleash his full power within a third-grade astral world. Of course, Ruler, you were able to unleash the battle prowess of a Ruler back then because you were only a Ruler of principles. The Divine Beginning Realm did not restrict you, but after you broke through to become a Ruler, you would be restricted.”","“As for a second-grade astral world, its spatial stability is naturally far greater than that of a third-grade astral world. A second-grade astral world is capable of withstanding the power of a Ruler, and not just ordinary Rulers. A second-grade astral world is capable of withstanding the power of a fourth-grade, fifth-grade, or even an Ultimate Ruler!","“In other words, in a second-grade astral world, any Ruler is capable of unleashing his full power!","“As for the higher-level first-level astral world, you can let the supreme experts fight recklessly.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood and a smile appeared on his face. “That’s good. I was worried that if I couldn’t unleash my strongest strength in the Thunder Star Field, I might not be able to intimidate the Universal Poison Demon Sect. But now, I don’t have to worry about that.”","The most powerful sect Ruler of the Universal Poison Demon Sect was only an expert at the pinnacle of the fourth level. He had not even reached the fifth level.","Jian Wushuang did not care about a Ruler at this level.","Someone as strong as Nine Whiskers, whose battle strength was comparable to a fifth level Ruler, had died at his hands.","“Ruler, hasn’t Leng Ruxue returned to the Universal Poison Demon Sect yet? Why are we here so early?” Devil Flame asked.","“There’s nothing to do anyway. Just wait here.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","On the surface, he was eating and drinking with Leng Rushuang and Devil Flame, but in fact, Jian Wushuang had been secretly trying to refine the venom.","Especially on the way to the Thunder Star Field, he had been trying. His soul had been destroyed hundreds of times, but Jian Wushuang continued to try.","Although he had failed time and time again, his soul’s ability to withstand the venom was improving. He believed that if he kept trying, one day...he would be able to truly refine the venom.","In the tavern, Jian Wushuang and the other two were not the only ones eating and drinking. There were also some other cultivators.","After all, they were at the foot of the Universal Poison Demon Sect. Most of the cultivators who came here were strong, and there were even many Rulers.","“Haha, brother Moteng, you’re here too?”","A hearty laughter rang out. A middle-aged man in green stood up in the tavern. He was greeted by a mysterious-looking man in a black robe whose entire face was covered by a layer of black fog.","“After all, this is a grand gathering that only happens once every ten million years. Moreover, I heard that even the star lord would pay attention to this grand gathering. My residence is not far from the Universal Poison Demon Sect, so I naturally came over to take a look.” The man under the black robe let out a hoarse voice.","“Hehe, I heard that the reason why this event is so well-received is because an extraordinary genius has appeared within the Universal Poison Demon Sect. It is said that she has a rare woeful poison body, and then she has cultivated the most powerful enchantment within the Universal Poison Demon Sect, the ten thousand poison scripture. Although she is only a second level Ruler now, her battle prowess is even stronger than many third level Rulers. Most importantly, she has only cultivated for a few hundred thousand years. Her potential is truly limitless.” The green-robed middle-aged man praised.","“Yes, he is very powerful. If nothing unexpected happens, all the forces, including the geniuses from the other two top forces, will become a foil to this grand gathering. This peerless genius from the Universal Poison Demon Sect is the true protagonist!” The black-robed man said."]},{"number":4032,"title":"Chapter 4032 - Wrong Person","paragraphs":["The middle-aged man and the black-robed man did not try to hide their conversation. Everyone in the tavern could hear them clearly.","When they heard their conversation, most of the guests in the tavern agreed with them.","Most of these guests were here for the grand event that the Universal Poison Demon Sect was about to hold. Naturally, they knew the name of the Peerless Genius of the Universal Poison Demon Sect.","Not only the black-robed man and the black-robed man, but they also thought that the peerless genius of the Universal Poison Demon Sect was absolutely stunning.","Jian Wushuang, who was in a corner of the tavern, had a strange look on his face when he heard their conversation.","“Peerless genius?” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and said, “It seems that Leng Ruxue has made great progress. But it’s true. After all, she has the body of woeful poison.”","Leng Rushuang looked indifferent. When she heard Leng Ruxue’s name, her expression did not change at all.","“Shuang ‘er, you have also made great progress over the years. Now you have reached the top of the second level. If you fight Leng Ruxue one-on-one, are you confident?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“I don’t know.” Leng Rushuang shook her head, but then she said seriously, “But I won’t lose.”","“If you won’t lose, then you’ve won?” Jian Wushuang smiled. “Don’t worry. When we get to the Universal Poison Demon Sect, I’ll let Leng Ruxue fight you face-to-face. You’ll settle the grudge between the two of you. As for the people of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, I won’t let them interfere.”","“Not only the people of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, I hope you won’t interfere, husband,” Leng Rushuang suddenly said.","“What?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Leng Rushuang said seriously, “We are sisters, and now we have our own paths. I came to find her this time to completely cut off my previous relationship with her. This time, we will settle it ourselves. I will fight her fair and square!”","“Okay, but if your life is threatened, I will help you,” Jian Wushuang said directly.","“Okay.” Leng Rushuang nodded slightly.","At this moment...whoosh!","In the void not far away, several figures rushed over at the same time and arrived at the entrance of the tavern in the blink of an eye.","“In front of us is the Universal Poison Demon Sect. Let’s rest in this tavern for a while, then we can go to the Universal Poison Demon Sect,” the leading elder with a childlike face said.","Behind the elder with a childlike face were several young men and women, all of whom emitted different auras.","“They are from the Ice Emperor Island. The leader is the second elder of the Ice Emperor Island. As for those who are following him, they should be the genius disciples of the Ice Emperor Island who are participating in this grand gathering.”","“Tsk tsk, the Ice Emperor Island is only second to the three top forces in the Thunder star area. I heard that the genius disciples of this year are also very outstanding.”","“They are indeed not bad. Do you see that golden-robed man? He is the number one genius of the Ice Emperor Island, Qin Feng. He also has a second-tier cultivation base. Moreover, he had once fought a third-tier overlord head-on, but he was only at a slight disadvantage.”","Whispers broke out in the tavern. Many guests looked at the new arrival.","Most of their eyes were fixed on the golden-robed man.","The people of the Ice Emperor Island took their seats in the tavern. As soon as they sat down —","“Senior Brother Qin, look over there.” A voice rang out.","The golden-robed man, Qin Feng, immediately looked over. He was looking at where Jian Wushuang and the other two were.","“Huh?” Qin Feng’s eyes instantly froze on Leng Rushuang.","“Phew!”","Qin Feng stood up and his eyes became extremely sharp.","“Witch, I didn’t expect to meet you here in advance.” Qin Feng’s voice also became low.","“Witch?”","“Is the witch that Qin Feng mentioned the peerless genius of the Universal Poison Demon Sect?”","The entire tavern was in an uproar, and everyone looked at Qin Feng and Leng Rushuang.","Leng Rushuang and Liu Mei slightly frowned.","Jian Wushuang also frowned.","“You have mistaken me for someone else,” Leng Rushuang said.","“Mistaken me for someone else? What a joke. I’ve seen you before. I’ve long remembered your appearance and your soul aura. How could I have mistaken you?” Qin Feng sneered, and he slowly walked over.","Jian Wushuang touched his nose and felt helpless.","Leng Rushuang and Leng Ruxue were two souls derived from the same body. Not only did they look the same, but their soul aura was also more than 80% similar because they had been together for a long time, if they were not familiar with each other, they could be wrong even if they relied on their soul aura.","Now, it was obvious that Qin Feng had mistaken Leng Rushuang for Leng Ruxue.","“Hey, stop,” Jian Wushuang shouted, he said in a low voice, “boy, your name is Qin Feng, right? If you say you have mistaken me for someone else, then you have mistaken me for someone else. The person beside me is my wife, not the witch from the Universal Poison Demon Sect that you mentioned.”","“Your wife?” Qin Feng was stunned.","As far as he knew, the witch from the Universal Poison Demon Sect had a terrifyingly high standard. Although there were many people who were infatuated with her, the witch had never taken a fancy to anyone, let alone become someone else’s wife.","But the woman in front of him, whether it was her appearance or her soul aura, she was very similar to the witch?","“Impossible. Even if you can change your appearance, your soul aura can’t be changed. Your soul aura is almost the same as the witch’s. How can you not be the witch?” Qin Feng shouted in a low voice, obviously, he did not believe what Jian Wushuang said.","“Whether you believe it or not, I don’t want to waste my time with you. Shuang ‘er, let’s go.” Jian Wushuang obviously did not want to waste his time with Qin Feng. He stood up and prepared to leave.","“Wait.” Qin Feng shouted in a low voice. His figure flashed and blocked Jian Wushuang’s way. He stared at Leng Rushuang with burning eyes. “Witch, I was humiliated by you 10,000 years ago. During these 10,000 years, I bitterly cultivated to fight you. Now that I finally meet you, how can I let you leave like this?”","“How noisy!” Jian Wushuang was obviously a little angry. He did not want to lower himself to Qin Feng’s level, but he did not expect that Qin Feng would not stop.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang made his move.","He did not take out his divine sword. Instead, he just slashed with one hand. In an instant, under the watchful eyes of the many cultivators in the tavern, an extremely terrifying sword essence suddenly erupted.","The strength of this sword essence shocked everyone in the tavern, including the Rulers and the second elder from the Ice Emperor Island.","“Oh no!” The second elder was shocked. He wanted to help, but he found that he was too late.","Endless sword essence enveloped Qin Feng.","Qin Feng was known as the number one genius of Ice Emperor Island, but in front of Jian Wushuang, he was no different from an ant.","Under the sword light, Qin Feng’s divine body instantly collapsed.","Of course, Jian Wushuang did not kill him directly. Instead, he left Qin Feng with a breath, but it was also extremely miserable."]},{"number":4033,"title":"Chapter 4033 - Had Been Successfully Refined","paragraphs":["“How is this possible?” Qin Feng’s divine body had recovered, and his aura was extremely weak. However, he still stared at Jian Wushuang with disbelief in his eyes.","He had been defeated in an instant with just a casual swipe of his hand. If his opponent had not held back, he would have died in that instant.","How could this man be so powerful?","But his aura was obviously at the level of a second-level Ruler?","“I was just giving you a warning. If you continue to nag and block our way, I will kill you directly,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","Qin Feng could not help trembling.","“Your Excellency.” The second elder of the Ice Emperor Island came up quickly and said, “Thank you for your mercy. Qin Feng was indeed too reckless. I will take him to apologize to you.”","The second elder knew very well that the universe was dangerous. Even if Qin Feng killed him, it would not be a problem.","“Humph, let’s go.” Jian Wushuang snorted and left the tavern with his wife and Devil Flame.","Qin Feng was now well-behaved and did not dare to walk in the path of Jian Wushuang and the other two.","After Jian Wushuang and the other two left the tavern, the tavern immediately exploded.","“Wow, Qin Feng, the No. 1 genius of the Ice Emperor Island, was defeated with just one hand?”","“Not only defeated, but he would have died if he didn’t hold back.”","“That man is so powerful. But why does he seem to be at the level of a second-level Ruler?”","“He is a second-level Ruler. I don’t know if he deliberately concealed his aura or if he is only at this level. If he is really a second-level Ruler, then he is very powerful. After all, even the witch of the Universal Poison Demon Sect can’t defeat Qin Feng so easily.”","Discussions rang out in the tavern.","Qin Feng’s face was as red as a pig’s liver. The people of the Ice Emperor Island did not have the face to stay in the tavern any longer. Instead, they immediately set off for the Universal Poison Demon Sect.","After leaving the tavern, Jian Wushuang and the other two did not immediately go to the Universal Poison Demon Sect. After all, the grand meeting in the Universal Poison Demon Sect would not be held for a while, and Leng Ruxue did not seem to be back yet.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang decided to find an inn in a nearby city and stay there for the time being.","For the rest of the time, Jian Wushuang and the other two stayed in the inn while Jian Wushuang focused all his energy on refining the venom.","Buzz!","The soul in Jian Wushuang’s sea of consciousness shook, and then it was directly destroyed.","A moment later, the destroyed soul recovered.","“I failed again.” Jian Wushuang shrugged, not surprised at all.","After learning that the venom could be refined by the soul, he had tried many times and failed every time. His soul had been destroyed countless times, but he was not anxious at all, instead, he continued to try again and again.","In a flash, five years passed.","“Haha, I finally succeeded.”","In a room in the inn, Jian Wushuang’s laughter rang out. Of course, the room was surrounded by restrictions, so his laughter did not spread out.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was sitting on the bed alone with a surprised smile on his face. In front of him was a drop of scarlet venom floating in the air.","The scarlet venom had been floating there. Previously, Jian Wushuang did not dare to touch it with his hands. But now, even if he swallowed the drop of venom, he would not be affected by it, let alone touch it with his hands.","After all, the drop of venom had been completely refined and controlled by him.","“After spending so much time, my soul has been destroyed more than 10,000 times. Now, I finally succeeded in refining this drop. Tsk, tsk, it’s really difficult.” Jian Wushuang could not help sighing.","Fortunately, he was a perfect life. Even if his soul was destroyed, he could rely on divine power to instantly restore it.","If it were anyone else, even the most extreme Ruler of the fifth level, it would be almost impossible for them to refine this poison. However, if an ordinary Ruler of the fifth level or a Ruler of the fourth level tried to refine this poison...it would be simply courting death.","Refining the venom would also be of great use to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and the Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand. Under his guidance, the floating scarlet venom slowly flew toward the Wuqi Divine Sword and directly merged into it, after the Venom entered the Wuqi Divine Sword, it disappeared. However, Jian Wushuang was the Ruler of the Wuqi Divine Sword. After refining the venom, he could clearly sense the existence of the venom.","The venom was inside the sword, but without his guidance, it would not display its power. However, as long as he willed it, the venom would immediately be activated along with the sword, while attacking the enemy with swordsmanship, the venom would also enter the enemy’s body along the sword, causing unprecedented damage.","“From now on, I will have another trump card in my hand.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","He had cultivated many trump cards, and many of them were very powerful.","For example, the dragon-killing secret skill, the primordial universe, and the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation formed by the three Heaven Suppression Tablets were all his trump cards, and they were all extremely powerful.","However, if measured by the degree of Terror, the trump card he had now was undoubtedly the most terrifying.","This was because the venom he had refined could kill even an ultimate level Ruler if he was not careful.","A Ruler below the ultimate level could not survive the corrosion of a drop of venom.","After refining a drop of venom, Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to refine the second drop. After all, there were only three months left before the grand meeting of the Universal Poison Demon Sect.","During this month, Jian Wushuang and his wife had a good tour of the Thunder Star World. Three months later, they set off for the Universal Poison Demon Sect together.","At this moment, the Universal Poison Demon Sect had become especially lively because of the grand meeting.","This grand meeting was actually a genius banquet that was held every ten million years. Every time, the geniuses of the top forces of the Thunder Star World would compete to choose the strongest genius, this strongest genius had the chance to receive personal guidance from the star lord of the Thunder Star World. Of course, he would also receive some other rewards.","This genius banquet was held every ten million years. This was already common in the Thunder Star World. However, the reason why it was so special this time was that it attracted so much attention, in the end, it was all because of that peerless genius that appeared in the Universal Poison Demon Sect."]},{"number":4034,"title":"Chapter 4034 - The Genius Banquet","paragraphs":["On the day of the banquet, the Universal Poison Demon Sect opened its doors. Countless cultivators swarmed over, and it was extremely lively.","Most of these cultivators were there to watch the show. However, as long as they came, the Universal Poison Demon Sect would receive them well. They weren’t worried at all that someone would come and cause trouble.","After all, this grand banquet was not just held within the Universal Poison Demon Sect. It was mainly because the Thunder Star World’s once-in-a-million-year genius banquet had been personally ordered by the star lord.","Anyone who dared to cause trouble during the banquet would be disrespectful to the star Lord. However, the star lord of the Thunder Star World was a fifth level Ruler. In the Thunder Star World, his words were absolute, no one dared to disobey him.","The vast martial arts practice field could accommodate millions of people at the same time. In the center of the martial arts practice field, there was a huge void, which was used as a battlefield.","!!","Many geniuses who participated in the genius feast would head to the battlefield to compete and determine the strongest.","At this moment, there were tens of thousands of people gathered in the martial arts practice field.","These tens of thousands of people were not ordinary people. The weakest among them was the Principles Master, and there were many Rulers.","This was the difference between a level two astral world in a medium-sized starfield and a level two astral world in a barren region at the edge of the universe.","For example, on Devil Cloud Planet, the strongest Ruler, Devil Cloud Planet Ruler, had just broken through to level four Ruler, while Devil Cloud Planet only had over a hundred Rulers under it.","However, the most powerful Ruler in the Thunder Star World was a fifth-level Ruler, and he had many fourth-level Rulers under his command. There were at least thousands of ordinary Rulers in the Thunder Star World!","“So many people have come to attend this banquet.”","Jian Wushuang stood in a corner with his arms crossed. Leng Rushuang, who was beside him, was wearing a light veil bamboo hat and had restrained her aura.","After the incident in the restaurant, Leng Rushuang realized that she was too similar to Leng Ruxue. If she did not disguise herself, it would be easy for people to mistake her and cause unnecessary trouble.","Therefore, before she came to the feast, Leng Rushuang deliberately covered her face with the bamboo hat.","Devil Flame was still standing respectfully behind Jian Wushuang.","Soon, the genius feast was held.","Although the genius feast said that geniuses from all forces in the Thunder Star World could participate, in fact, only geniuses from the three top forces could make a name for themselves in the genius feast.","Without a doubt, the witch from the Universal Poison Demon Sect was the most dazzling.","“Leng Ruxue.”","Jian Wushuang stood there with a cold gaze, staring at a peerless beauty who was fighting on the battlefield.","The peerless beauty was very similar to Leng Rushuang, not only in appearance, but also in temperament and soul aura.","Naturally, this peerless beauty was Leng Ruxue.","After many years, Jian Wushuang met Leng Ruxue again. She was the number one genius of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, and even the most dazzling existence among the younger generation in the Thunder Star World. and at this genius feast...her performance was indeed dazzling.","She held a cyan-colored long spear in her hand. With a casual thrust of the long spear, she easily defeated the top geniuses from various forces.","Even the genius disciples from the other two top forces, who had battle strength comparable to a third-level Ruler, could not last long in Leng Ruxue’s hands and were easily defeated by her.","The spectators could see that Leng Ruxue had not used her full strength.","“That’s right. After more than 200,000 years, Leng Ruxue has made great progress. Her comprehension of the origin of the spear principle universe is very high, and she is even comparable to a fourth-level Ruler. With her ability to steal food and her divine power, which is obviously much stronger than that of a second-level Ruler, she can easily defeat all the geniuses at the Genius Feast. However, she hasn’t used her most powerful body of woeful poison. I heard that she has Rulered the first secret skill of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, the universal poison scripture, but she hasn’t used it yet.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","Beside Jian Wushuang, although Leng Rushuang’s face was hidden under the bamboo hat, her eyes were fixed on Leng Ruxue in the middle of the battlefield. She looked calm.","Time passed slowly.","The genius feast lasted for three days and three nights in the drill ground.","On the fourth day, the genius feast came to an end.","Now, there was only one battle left in the genius feast. One of them was Leng Ruxue, and the other was the number one genius from a top force.","In terms of combat strength, that genius was stronger than an ordinary third-level Ruler, but it was obvious that he was much weaker than Leng Ruxue.","When the battle began, this genius did not intend to defeat Leng Ruxue. Instead, he wanted to force Leng Ruxue to use her special constitution or use the Ten Thousand Poison Scripture, unfortunately, he did not succeed in the end.","In this battle, Leng Ruxue displayed her extremely terrifying spear technique. This spear technique was far stronger than those third-level Rulers who were proficient in the spear path. In the end, she easily defeated that genius.","From then on, the competition of this genius feast had truly come to an end.","“Haha, as expected of the number one super genius in the history of the Universal Poison Demon Sect. Her strength is indeed impressive.”","“Unfortunately, I had specially rushed over this time. I had wanted to take a good look at her woeful poison body, but I didn’t expect that she didn’t use her constitution at all.”","“She is clearly a second-level Ruler, but in terms of battle strength, she is probably comparable to a peak third-level Ruler. If she were to use her constitution to use the Ten Thousand Poison Scripture, there would probably be very few third-level Rulers who could defeat her.”","“This witch’s talent is definitely the best in our thunder star sector for billions of years. Even in the entire Purple Micro Galaxy, she can probably rank in the top three.”","After the final competition ended, the experts from various sects and factions who stood in the void at the very top began to discuss. Naturally, this included the people from the three top factions.","On the martial arts practice field, the tens of thousands of cultivators watching the battle were also discussing.","Most of them were praising how powerful Leng Ruxue was.","In the corner of the martial arts practice field, Jian Wushuang glanced at Leng Rushuang and said, “The battle of the genius feast is over. Now, Shuang ‘er, it’s your turn.”","“Well, I’m ready,” Leng Rushuang said softly.","“I’ll open the way for you.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and then moved."]},{"number":4035,"title":"Chapter 4035 - Old Friend","paragraphs":["On the vast battlefield, because she had already defeated the last genius, Leng Ruxue was preparing to leave the battlefield in front of everyone’s eyes.","But at this moment...whoosh!","A figure appeared directly in the middle of the battlefield as if it had teleported. Moreover, as soon as this figure appeared, a tyrannical aura immediately locked onto her.","Leng Ruxue stopped in her tracks and raised her head in surprise. She felt that the other party’s aura was very familiar to her.","As the figure of the other party appeared, a familiar face appeared in front of her, causing Leng Ruxue’s pupils to shrink.","The many cultivators on the martial arts practice field also noticed the changes in the battlefield and saw Jian Wushuang’s appearance.","All of them were puzzled.","“Sir, what’s the matter?”","An elder of the Universal Poison Demon Sect who supported the fight for this grand meeting immediately appeared in the center of the battlefield and stood in front of Leng Ruxue, staring at Jian Wushuang vigilantly.","Although Jian Wushuang was only a second-level Ruler, the elder of the Universal Poison Demon Sect faintly sensed an extremely dangerous aura from Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang did not even look at the elder. Instead, he stared at Leng Ruxue who was behind him with interest.","“What’s the matter? Aren’t you going to greet your old friend?” Jian Wushuang asked with a smile.","“Old friend?” The elder of the Universal Poison Demon Sect looked puzzled.","“It’s you?” Leng Ruxue stared at Jian Wushuang with a sharp gaze. “I didn’t expect you to come here.”","Leng Ruxue was indeed surprised.","She knew very well how far away the Divine Beginning Realm was from her star field.","Her Ruler, Ruler Star Luo, had spent a lot of effort to send her here. The Universal Poison Demon Sect had even sent a fourth-level Ruler to welcome her personally, she had even taken some universe passages at all costs.","Even so, it still took her 30,000 years to get here.","But the Jian Wushuang in front of her...not long ago, she had received a message from her Ruler, Ruler Star Luo. She knew about the changes in the Divine Beginning Realm and that Jian Wushuang had now become the master of the Divine Beginning Realm, but that was only tens of thousands of years ago.","Even her Ruler, Ruler Star Luo, had not yet returned to the Thunder Star World, but Jian Wushuang had actually rushed here from the Divine Beginning Realm.","“I’m not alone this time.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Behind him, a beautiful figure slowly walked over and arrived beside Jian Wushuang in a moment.","Although the beautiful figure was wearing a bamboo hat, it was still difficult to conceal her breathtaking figure. The moment Leng Ruxue saw the beautiful figure, she could not help being startled.","“Is that you?” Leng Ruxue asked softly.","“Sister, it’s been a long time.” An indifferent voice came from under the veil. Leng Rushuang stretched out her jade-like hand and took off her bamboo hat, revealing a peerless face. Her aura was no longer concealed and directly spread out.","The moment Leng Rushuang revealed her appearance and aura, countless cultivators in the entire martial arts practice field instantly burst into an uproar.","“Who is this?”","“It seems that she is too similar to the witch. Are they sisters?”","“No, I’m afraid it’s not that simple. After all, even if they are sisters, they can only imagine their appearance. However, their souls and auras are almost the same. There must be other factors involved.”","Exclamations sounded from every corner of the martial arts practice field.","Around the battlefield, Qin Feng, who came from the gathering place of the genius disciples of the Ice Emperor Island, stared at Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang with wide eyes.","“They are really two people. Did I really mistake them for the wrong people in the tavern?” Qin Feng still found it hard to believe.","In the void above, the top experts from various forces also had strange expressions.","Only the high-level experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect had ugly expressions on their faces.","“What’s going on?”","Among the high-level experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, the first elder with the highest strength and status opened his mouth to ask. As for the sect leader of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, he didn’t show his face during this banquet.","“First Elder, have you forgotten? When Star Luo first found Leng Ruxue, he said that she was somewhat special...” An elder of the Universal Poison Demon Sect beside him said in a low voice.","The first elder’s expression changed, and he immediately remembered Leng Ruxue’s background.","Perhaps others did not know, but the top experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect knew that Leng Ruxue’s woeful poison body was born from a great sin. At the same time, Leng Ruxue was a soul born from a great sin, besides her, his divine body originally had another soul.","“Is she the soul that shared a body with Ruxue? What is she doing here?” The first elder frowned.","“The two of you, although I don’t know the purpose of your trip, today is the once-in-a-million-years genius banquet of our Thunder Star World. This banquet was personally ordered by our Thunder Star World Star Lord. No one is allowed to interfere with the genius banquet. Therefore, I advise the two of you to leave,”said the elder who supported the banquet.","“I didn’t want to affect the opening of the genius feast. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have waited until the convention was over to decide on the strongest genius. However, the genius feast is to decide on the strongest genius. Now, my wife is cultivating at the same time as the peerless genius of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, and both of them are second-level Rulers. Now, my wife wants to fight with her face-to-face. It shouldn’t be a problem, right?” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“What a joke. We don’t even know your wife’s background. She didn’t really participate in the genius feast. She fought step by step from the beginning to the end. How could she be qualified to fight with Ruxue? If anyone in the astral world wanted to challenge Ruxue, then Ruxue would be very busy,” the elder said in a deep voice.","“So? That’s a bit of a pity.” Jian Wushuang sighed lightly.","The elder thought that Jian Wushuang was going to give in. Just as he smiled, a terrifying sword essence suddenly rose and covered the elder, it even covered the entire battlefield.","“What are you doing?” The experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect were shocked and angry.","The elder in front of Jian Wushuang, who was at the peak of the third level, was swept away by the sword essence like a leaf. He was hung out of the battlefield and finally regained his balance.","“This battle must go on. No one can stop it!”","“If you, the Universal Poison Demon Sect, are honest, it would be fine. But if you are not, I don’t mind playing with you first.”","Jian Wushuang’s cold voice suddenly resounded throughout the entire martial arts practice field.","..."]},{"number":4036,"title":"Chapter 4036 - Tyrannical Strength","paragraphs":["“Arrogant!”","The experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect were all furious.","In any case, the genius feast was held in their Universal Poison Demon Sect, so the Universal Poison Demon Sect naturally had the final say in all the principles.","The Universal Poison Demon Sect naturally would not agree to Jian Wushuang’s direct challenge to Leng Ruxue and attack their elder without any explanation.","At this moment, the experts from the upper echelon of the Universal Poison Demon Sect all moved at the same time.","However, before they could make a move, Jian Wushuang had already slashed down with his sword.","He slashed directly toward the experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect.","Whoosh!","It was as if the entire world was about to be cut open. A huge sword shadow cut through the space and appeared in front of the experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect.","The sword shadow was magnified in the eyes of the experts, and the earth-shaking power was unscrupulously pressing down on them at this moment.","“This...”","The senior experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, including the first elder, all changed their expressions.","They had thought that the person who came to cause trouble was just an ordinary second-level Ruler. However, after Jian Wushuang showed his strength, this terrifying sword attack alone made them...they were shocked.","The power of this sword was so strong that they felt they could not resist it.","“Quick, attack together!” The first elder shouted. A giant axe appeared in his hand, and a strong aura rose from his body.","The other elders were not slow either. They all attacked at this moment, trying to block Jian Wushuang’s sword.","After all, the Universal Poison Demon Sect was one of the three top forces in the Thunder Star World, and its overall power was very powerful.","In terms of the highest level of battle strength, besides the Sect Master who had reached the peak of the fourth-level, there were also three fourth-level Rulers. At this moment, including the first elder, there were two fourth-level Rulers who attacked, in addition, there were more than a dozen third-level Rulers.","However, the Poison Demon Sect was best at using poison instead of attacking head-on.","Moreover, even if they were good at fighting head-on, they might not be able to do anything against Jian Wushuang’s extremely powerful sword attack.","Boom!","A violent explosion resounded throughout the heaven and earth, and the entire void fell into a huge energy storm. The energy storm lasted for a long time and finally dissipated.","After the divine power storm dissipated, the cultivators on the martial arts practice field found that the experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect were standing there listlessly. Many of them had blood on their mouths, including the first elder, they were all the same.","Obviously, although they had blocked Jian Wushuang’s sword, they were all seriously injured.","However, Jian Wushuang’s unscrupulous attack and the terrifying power finally alerted the Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect.","Buzz!","An extremely cold aura suddenly rose from the depths of the Universal Poison Demon Sect. Then, an old figure covered in a black robe appeared in the world.","The black-robed old figure looked down at Jian Wushuang with a pair of strange cold eyes.","“Ruler!”","“Ruler!”","The numerous strong persons of ten thousand poisons devil’s doctrine, see the appearance of this black robe old figure, all in succession big joy.","They have absolute faith in their Ruler.","In the entire Thunder Star World, apart from the Supreme Star Lord, no one was a match for their Sect Master. Even the Rulers of the other two top forces, in terms of strength, were comparable to their Sect Master, and a little bit worse.","That is to say, as long as the star lord does not act, their suzerain is the strongest, at least they all think so.","What they did not know was that Jian Wushuang, who was standing in front of them, was not from the Thunder Star World at all, but from other star worlds and even other star fields.","“Here, how to return a responsibility?” Black robe old figure below, transmit low and hoarse voice.","“You’re the Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, right?” Jian Wushuang glanced coldly at the black-robed old man. “I came to your Universal Poison Demon Sect just to let my wife fight with Leng Ruxue. After the fight, I’ll leave and won’t affect your Universal Poison Demon Sect too much. But if your Universal Poison Demon Sect wants to stop me, you can’t blame me.”","“Your wife?” The Sect Master looked down at Leng Rushuang and Leng Ruxue and frowned.","“Sect Master, it’s like this.” The grand elder appeared beside the Sect Master and told him the story.","After hearing it, the Sect Master’s face turned gloomy.","“Your wife is a second-level Ruler and has a great relationship with Ruxue. If she wants to fight with Ruxue, our sect won’t stop her. However, this is our sect. You are acting so arrogantly. Aren’t you disrespecting our sect?” The Sect Master said coldly.","“I don’t care about you. What can you do about it?” Jian Wushuang said disdainfully.","When he came here, he had already obtained complete information about the Universal Poison Demon Sect and the entire Thunder Star World from the Nine Emperor Pavilion. He even knew the strength of the Thunder Star Lord.","He dared to do this because he knew everything. He knew that no one in the Thunder Star World could stop him from doing anything.","In that case, he did not need to be too careful.","“What an arrogant boy. In that case, I would like to ask you for advice. I don’t know what you are capable of to be so arrogant in the Universal Poison Demon Sect.” The Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect was already emitting a terrifying evil aura.","“Ask me for advice? Let’s talk about it after you can take one of my strikes.” Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold, but the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand slashed down again.","The same sword move was performed by Jian Wushuang’s heaven-splitting move.","The experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect had barely withstood Jian Wushuang’s sword move, even though they were seriously injured.","However, Jian Wushuang had only relied on his comprehension of the universe origin of sword principle to perform his swordsmanship.","But now, while performing his swordsmanship, this sword move was accompanied by an extremely dense power of the universe’s principles!","With the addition of this power of universal principles, the already powerful sword instantly reached a whole new level.","Whoosh!","The shocking sword shadow suddenly slashed down.","The Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, who was covered in a black robe, panicked the moment he saw Jian Wushuang’s sword shadow."]},{"number":4037,"title":"Chapter 4037 - Battle of Predestination","paragraphs":["“How can he be so strong?”","The Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect was confused.","After all, although he was in the deep underground of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, he could still sense the strong energy fluctuation.","For example, he could sense the general power of Jian Wushuang’s sword. Although that sword had crushed many experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, the power of that sword was still at the peak of the fourth level.","He was confident that he could withstand this level of swordsmanship. That was why he said he wanted to ask Jian Wushuang for advice.","However, he never expected that the power of Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship was so much stronger than the previous sword. It was on a completely different level.","Even he could not withstand this sword.","There was no other way. The Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect could only try his best to resist this sword, but in the end, he was swept away by the Sword Shadow. He was severely injured on the spot, and even his aura was greatly weakened.","“He’s too strong. This is definitely a fifth-level battle strength.” The Sect Master looked at Jian Wushuang in horror.","Beside him, the senior experts from the Universal Poison Demon Sect were also trembling in fear.","They did not expect that their Sect Master was still not a match for Jian Wushuang’s sword.","“I’ve already said that you should stay on the side and wait for the result of my wife’s battle with Leng Rushuang. I’ll naturally leave. But if any of you are disobedient or interfere on the way, don’t blame me for being rude.” Jian Wushuang looked coldly at the experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect.","The experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, including the Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, did not speak.","They did not dare to speak. Although they were very unconvinced, Jian Wushuang’s strength was there, so they had no choice but to bow their heads.","This scene was witnessed by countless cultivators on the martial arts practice field, and they could not help but sigh.","Even the experts of the other two top forces were secretly amazed. But no matter what they thought, at this moment, no one dared to step forward to stop Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang alone was enough to suppress the Universal Poison Demon Sect.","On the battlefield, Leng Ruxue also saw everything.","“I didn’t expect that his strength has become so strong.” Leng Ruxue’s eyes were cold, and she clenched her right hand.","“How strong he is has nothing to do with you, because your opponent in this battle is me.” Leng Rushuang said coldly.","“Are you my opponent?” Leng Ruxue smiled disdainfully.","She had shared a body with Leng Rushuang before, and they were very familiar with each other. However, in her heart, Leng Ruxue did not think much of Leng Rushuang.","She did not think much of her before, not to mention now that she had completely awakened the woeful poison body and refined the Ten Thousand Poison Scripture. She had become the acknowledged number one genius of the Thunder Star World.","As for Leng Rushuang?","As far as she knew, Leng Rushuang’s soul had been in a deep sleep. She had just woken up not too long ago.","In other words, not to mention her innate advantage, she had already cultivated for a very long time before Leng Rushuang, not to mention that her innate advantage was much greater than Leng Rushuang’s.","“It’s useless to just talk. We’ll only know who’s stronger and who’s weaker after a real battle.” Leng Rushuang’s expression was still cold. She could not be bothered to argue with Leng Rushuang. Everything depended on strength.","Leng Rushuang flipped her hand and a pale purple whip appeared in her hand.","This pale purple whip was the magic array treasure that Jian Wushuang had chosen for her in the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","“Oh? A principle treasure? It seems that guy treats you quite well.” Leng Ruxue smiled indifferently, then, she took out her cyan long spear and an equally strong aura emanated from it.","“You’re not the only one who has a Principle-based supreme treasure,” Leng Ruxue said.","Leng Rushuang was rich because of Jian Wushuang, so he could easily get her an attack Principle-based supreme treasure.","Leng Ruxue was the number one genius in the history of the Universal Poison Demon Sect. It was not hard to imagine how much the sect valued her. In addition, she had also gotten an opportunity, so it was normal for her to have an attack Principle-based supreme treasure.","As the two of them took out their respective divine weapons, this battle, which had been destined since the moment they were born many years ago, finally began.","“Die!”","Leng Ruxue’s killing intent erupted. She took the initiative to attack. Her figure moved, and countless figures appeared on the battlefield at the same time. These figures maintained the same movements, and both of them held long spears in their hands, the long spears suddenly stabbed out explosively.","Bang!","The space was directly penetrated and a huge hole appeared. A terrifying green light strangely appeared in front of Leng Rushuang.","Leng Rushuang’s expression did not change at all. The moment the green light appeared, her body had already retreated. At the same time, the light purple long whip extended out.","It was like a towering waterfall that came from the nine heavens. With a crash, it contained a terrifying might and destroyed the green light at the first possible moment. Meanwhile, the waterfall that filled the sky continued to fall, it continued to rush toward the densely packed figures of Leng Ruxue.","Countless phantoms were directly destroyed by this waterfall. Even Leng Ruxue’s original body had suffered the impact of this waterfall.","“You do have some ability.”","Leng Ruxue’s original body was revealed. However, there was still a strange smile on the corner of her mouth. In the next moment, that green long spear transformed into a violent green lightning that directly penetrated the waterfall...in the blink of an eye, it shot toward Leng Ruxue.","Leng Rushuang raised her head, and the longwhip in her hand also followed suit. Like a giant dragon turning its body, the longwhip lashed out against the green lightning, causing it to immediately dim.","“Eh?” Leng Ruxue frowned slightly. “This slut’s divine power is actually not any weaker than mine. In addition, her whip arts are quite impressive. Her comprehension of the Dao is actually this high?”","Leng Ruxue had thought that Leng Rushuang’s soul had just awoken not long ago, and that it was already very impressive for her to be able to reach the second level of power as a Ruler. However, she had not expected that Leng Rushuang’s combat power was much stronger than she had expected.","In terms of divine power, because of her poison woeful body and some secret techniques, Leng Ruxue had already reached the peak of the second level, almost reaching the third level of power as a Ruler. However, Leng Rushuang’s divine power was no weaker than hers.","Her comprehension of the universe origin of the spear path was already comparable to a fourth level Ruler, but Leng Rushuang’s comprehension of the whip path was also no weaker than hers.","When the two fought, Leng Ruxue realized that she couldn’t do anything to the other in a short period of time.","Moreover, after the two fought for a while, Leng Rushuang took the initiative to attack."]},{"number":4038,"title":"Chapter 4038 - The Body of Woe Poison","paragraphs":["Leng Rushuang looked down from above. Her jade-like hand waved the light purple long whip, and she swept out like a swimming dragon.","In an instant, a violent power filled the air.","Standing below, Leng Rushuang felt that she had instantly fallen into an extremely violent ocean.","The waves in the sky rolled up crazily, forming a series of tsunamis that rushed toward Leng Rushuang.","“This move...”","Jian Wushuang, who had already appeared at the edge of the battlefield, could not help smiling when he saw Leng Rushuang’s whip skill.","This whip skill was taught to Leng Rushuang by supreme fog. The whip skill was created by supreme fog, so Leng Rushuang was only using the first move.","However, even the first move was extremely powerful, especially the violent and endless essence realm. It was not inferior to Jian Wushuang’s wave light sword formation and was even stronger in some aspects.","When Leng Rushuang first used this whip skill, Jian Wushuang was already amazed. At that time, Leng Rushuang had only Rulered less than 10% of this whip skill, but now, after so many years...the power of this skill could be perfectly displayed by Leng Rushuang.","The extremely violent waves crazily attacked Leng Ruxue. Leng Ruxue also continuously used her spear skills in an attempt to break free from the violent waves. However, the waves used the force to deflect the force, leaving Leng Ruxue helpless.","“What the hell is this skill?” Leng Ruxue’s face was a bit unsightly. In this vast ocean, she was really too passive.","“Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!”","The violent waves continued to attack. It was fine for a while, but after a short while, Leng Ruxue could not hold on any longer.","“Humph, I won’t waste any more time with you.” Leng Ruxue snorted. In an instant, her pair of pitch-black eyes turned grayish-white.","Her grayish-white eyes were extremely strange.","Seeing these eyes, Jian Wushuang, who was outside the battlefield, instantly understood that Leng Ruxue was going to use her special physique.","He had fought with Leng Ruxue in the Eternal Chaotic World, and her eyes were grayish-white.","Buzz!","Suddenly, a dazzling golden light lit up in her grayish-white eyes. Then, a large amount of scarlet-golden flames spread crazily in the surroundings at a terrifying speed. In the blink of an eye, the entire battlefield fell into a sea of golden flames.","Not only that, there was also a large amount of hazy golden fog rising from the golden sea of flames.","“The golden fog and the golden sea of flames are not real flames, but...poisonous fog!” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","He could tell at a glance that the overwhelming golden sea of flames was actually formed by poisonous fog. Now, Leng Rushuang had completely fallen into the golden sea of flames.","The endless golden mist, including the sea of golden flames, completely covered Leng Rushuang.","“Is this the woeful poison body?” Leng Rushuang could see the real situation of the surrounding sea of flames.","The golden flames in the sky seemed to want to vaporize her entire divine body. and the rising golden mist was everywhere, trying to invade her divine body.","She could only urge her divine power and set up a simple defense to resist the erosion of the mist. However, the erosion of the mist was far beyond her expectation. Although she could resist it...the consumption of her divine power was huge and fast.","After the golden sea of flames swept over, Leng Rushuang could clearly sense that the aura from Leng Ruxue’s body had soared to a whole new level. After she urged her special constitution...her strength had already far surpassed what she had just experienced.","Other than that, behind Leng Ruxue, an enormous phantom of a strange beast had unexpectedly condensed. The body of that strange beast was not very big, but the key point was that the two pairs of enormous wings around its body...occupied a large amount of space, making it seem like a flying butterfly.","“The Ten Thousand Poison Scripture!”","“It’s the Ten Thousand Poison Scripture of the Universal Poison Demon Sect. This witch has indeed refined it. Moreover, her life-bound phantom beast is actually this kind of multicolored poisonous butterfly?”","A wave of exclamations sounded from the surrounding martial arts practice grounds.","The Ten Thousand Poison Scripture was not only extremely famous in the Thunder Star World, but also in the entire Purple Micro Galaxy. This secret technique was also extremely powerful.","At the same time, Leng Ruxue, who had activated her body of woeful poison and used the Ten Thousand Poison Scripture, had already reached a new level of strength at this moment.","“The golden sea of fire around me is too strong. I don’t have a perfect life-form like the soldiers. My divine power is boundless. With my divine power, I can only last for a few dozen breaths before my divine power is completely exhausted. If that’s the case, I’ll go all out and defeat her within these dozens of breaths.” Leng Rushuang instantly made up her mind.","Boom!","A terrifying aura suddenly rose from Leng Rushuang’s body, and a large amount of white light suddenly appeared behind her. The white light shone like the surrounding sky, making her look extremely holy at this moment, she was like a goddess from the nine heavens.","Her hair and robes were all blown up at this moment, and even her eyes were suffused with a faint white light.","“Shuang ‘er must have used her trump card.” Jian Wushuang looked at the scene with a solemn expression.","She had even received the true inheritance from supreme fog, who had not only taught her the whip skill, but also taught her some powerful secret skills and life-saving methods.","However, usually, Leng Rushuang would not use those methods, and this was the first time Jian Wushuang had seen Leng Rushuang use them.","The white light behind Leng Rushuang became more and more dazzling, and her aura became more and more powerful. When her aura reached a peak, whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Leng Rushuang’s figure was strangely divided into three!","Yes, she went from one person to three people. It was not an illusion or an illusion, but a real body.","The three Leng Rushuang each held a long whip in their hands. Except for Leng Rushuang, who was in the middle, who was holding a principle treasure, the other two were only holding supreme true treasures.","Sou!","The three Leng Rushuang attacked at the same time, and their speed reached its peak.","Three powerful whip shadows descended at the same time. Each whip shadow was much stronger than Leng Rushuang’s previous one, but there were three of them.","“What secret technique is this?”","“One person turned into three?”","“I can see that they are not phantoms, but real divine bodies. Is it a clone secret technique?”","“But even if it’s a clone secret technique, there must be a difference in strength. But these three human shadows, except for the supreme treasures in their hands, are all the same?”","The martial arts practice field was full of exclamations.","..."]},{"number":4039,"title":"Chapter 4039 - Victory or Defeat","paragraphs":["Even Jian Wushuang was shocked when he saw Leng Rushuang turn into three.","“It’s indeed a secret skill taught by supreme fog. It’s really amazing.” Jian Wushuang exclaimed.","On the battlefield, three Leng Rushuang unleashed their monstrous strength at the same time and attacked Leng Rushuang crazily.","Leng Ruxue was also continuously fighting back, and the fierce battle between the two became even more intense.","However, the longer it dragged on, the more disadvantageous it was for Leng Rushuang. In just a few breaths’ time, Leng Rushuang’s divine power had already been depleted by nearly half, and the golden flames that filled the sky were burning more and more vigorously, Leng Ruxue’s strength within the golden flames was also becoming stronger and stronger.","“Haha, bitch, although I don’t know how your strength improved so much in such a short time, you’re still far from me.” Leng Rushuang’s proud voice resounded in the void, her already extremely powerful aura had actually increased by another level at this moment.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. “After Leng Rushuang activated her body of woe poison, her strength has been continuously increasing. As the battle drags on, her strength will become stronger. I’m afraid Shuang ‘er will be in trouble.”","Leng Rushuang also noticed this.","“Half of her divine power has been consumed. We can’t continue fighting like this. Let’s decide the winner with one move.” Leng Rushuang’s eyes turned cold.","In the center of the battlefield, three figures of Leng Rushuang retreated at the same time. However, as they retreated, the white light behind her became more dazzling and holy.","A superior aura suddenly burst out from the three figures of Leng Rushuang. At the same time, it also spread out with the power of a vast magic formation.","“Magic Formation? A combined attack Magic Formation?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","Sure enough, the three Leng Rushuang formed a combined attack magic formation. Vast light rose from the three figures. The three lights converged and finally formed a huge, hazy shadow.","This shadow also looked like a holy woman, but it had eight arms. Each of these eight arms held a long whip.","As the three figures of Leng Rushuang opened their eyes at the same time, a cold and fierce light flashed explosively.","This enormous holy woman’s illusory figure swung out eight arms at the same time.","Rumble...the world began to tremble wildly.","Endless might gathered crazily in the void. In the blink of an eye, it actually formed a huge green dragon that was over a hundred thousand feet long. This huge green dragon opened its large mouth and carried an incomparable might, it directly swallowed Leng Ruxue, who was in the middle of the golden ocean below.","“What a joke!”","Leng Ruxue let out a sharp whistle. The colorful poison butterfly behind her also let out an ear-piercing screech. Endless golden flames rose fiercely.","The long spear in Leng Ruxue’s hand also suddenly pierced explosively. In an instant, the power of the entire golden sea of fire completely merged into the long spear. A terrifying might completely erupted at this instant.","The two shocking powers represented the fates of the two of them. At this moment, they finally collided head-on.","Chi chi chi!","There were no terrifying booming sounds that one had imagined. Instead, there was only the sound of large amounts of energy and divine power crazily squeezing against each other.","The entire large battlefield was completely covered by the powerful divine power of the two of them, forming a huge energy storm.","The storm swept in all directions, causing many experts to be terrified.","Although there were only two second-level Rulers fighting on the battlefield, it was clear that their strength could not be measured by the second-level Rulers. Their battle strength was definitely at the third-level, even among the third-level Rulers, they should be extremely powerful.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold as he stared at the battlefield in front of him. His soul power had been focused on Leng Rushuang. If she was in danger, he would immediately attack her.","However, it was obvious that the collision had not reached that stage yet.","Moreover, he could sense that Leng Rushuang’s aura had not been significantly weakened.","“Did she win?” Jian Wushuang smiled.","As expected, as the energy storm in the center of the battlefield dissipated, the experts on the martial arts practice field fell silent after seeing the scene clearly.","The experts from the Universal Poison Demon Sect, in particular, looked extremely gloomy at this moment.","In the center of the battlefield, two figures were still standing face to face. Although Leng Rushuang was the only one left among the three figures, she was still standing there intact. Although her aura was much weaker than before, however, that was also because she had consumed a large amount of divine power.","On the other hand, Leng Ruxue’s standing figure was clearly trembling slightly. Her hair was also in a mess, and there was blood at the corner of her mouth. The aura on her body was much weaker than before, and she looked extremely miserable.","Just from the looks of the two of them, one could already tell the victor of this battle.","“That witch actually lost?”","“She used all of her strength to activate the woeful poison body and even used the Ten Thousand Poison Scripture. But in the end, she was still defeated and lost to an expert of the same level.”","“The witch actually lost. This is really unexpected.”","Many of the experts watching the battle secretly sighed.","Because they had long regarded Leng Ruxue as the number one genius of the Thunder Star World in recent years. She was even one of the top super geniuses in the entire Purple Micro Galaxy. Such a super genius, within the same level...it was almost impossible to find someone who could defeat her.","But now, he had indeed been defeated by an expert of the same level.","There was no room for trickery. The other party’s strength was indeed stronger than this witch’s.","“Impossible, this is impossible!”","A crazy hissing sound suddenly rang out on the training field. At this moment, Leng Ruxue’s beautiful face had been completely distorted, “You b*tch, you cultivated so many years later than me, and you don’t have my special physique, how can you be stronger than me!”","“Impossible, impossible!”","Leng Ruxue was in a state of madness. She simply could not accept the reality before her eyes.","One had to know that she had never thought much of Leng Rushuang. She had even called Leng Rushuang a b*tch all this time, but in the end, she was actually defeated by this ‘b*tch’.","How could she accept such a result?","“You’re already in such a state, are you still not willing to admit defeat?” Leng Rushuang stared coldly at Leng Ruxue.","“Admit defeat? What a joke. Unless I die, I will never lose to you.” Leng Ruxue growled, “Come on, if you have the ability, kill me now!”","“Kill you?” Leng Rushuang shook her head. “Perhaps in your eyes, I don’t even exist as an elder sister, but to me, you are still my younger sister.”","“From today onwards, the grudge between you and me will be settled. You should take care of yourself.”","..."]},{"number":4040,"title":"Chapter 4040 - Thunder Star Lord","paragraphs":["“From today onwards, the grudge between us will be resolved. You better take care of yourself.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Leng Rushuang turned around and left without any hesitation.","“B*tch, do you think that by doing this, I will be grateful to you? This is such a huge joke. You will regret it. You will definitely regret it!”","“If I don’t die today, I will definitely kill you in the future!” Leng Ruxue had already screamed. Unfortunately, Leng Rushuang could not be bothered with her anymore.","After this battle, Leng Rushuang did not want to have any more entanglements with Leng Ruxue. As for what Leng Ruxue said about coming to kill her in the future, she did not care about it at all.","Let’s not talk about whether they would meet again in the future. Even if they did meet again, so what?","Leng Ruxue was a genius. She had the body of woe poison and had cultivated the universal poison scripture, which was one of the best in the entire Purple Micro Galaxy.","However, her potential was definitely stronger than Leng Ruxue’s. After all, she had absorbed the heart of the astral world, which meant that her potential was limitless and that she had a high chance of becoming a supreme-being in the future.","Moreover, she was a personal disciple of a supreme-being. With Jian Wushuang, her advantage was greater than Leng Ruxue’s. Even if they met again in the future, the gap between them would only be greater.","Naturally, she would not care about Leng Ruxue’s threat.","“Husband.” Leng Rushuang returned to Jian Wushuang’s side.","“Have you decided not to kill her?” Jian Wushuang asked calmly.","“Yes.” Leng Rushuang nodded.","In fact, from the beginning, Leng Rushuang had never thought of killing Leng Ruxue. No matter what the latter had done, she had no intention of killing Leng Ruxue.","The reason she came to the Purple Micro Galaxy was to settle the grudge between her and Leng Ruxue, but she did not want to kill her.","“Okay, I respect your choice.” Jian Wushuang did not interfere too much.","As for the experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, although their faces were extremely ugly, they were relieved when they saw that Leng Rushuang did not kill her.","However, just as Jian Wushuang was about to leave —","“What happened here?” A long voice suddenly sounded.","Above the nine heavens, a ray of lightning suddenly condensed.","This ray of lightning was extremely dazzling and contained explosive power. As the ray of lightning slowly dispersed, a burly barefoot man appeared in front of everyone.","Seeing the burly barefoot man appear, the many experts present, especially the experts from the Universal Poison Demon Sect, immediately revealed a pleasantly surprised expression.","“Star Lord!”","The Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect was the first to bow toward this burly man.","Following closely behind, the experts from the Universal Poison Demon Sect, including the top experts from the surrounding factions, as well as the people on the martial arts practice field, all bowed toward the person who came.","Star Lord was referring to the Supreme Star Lord of the Thunder Star World.","The absolute number one expert of the Thunder Star World had reached the fifth-level many years ago.","“Star Lord of the Thunder Star World?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. “It seems that it won’t be easy for us to leave this time.”","“Ruler, I can tell that this person is very strong. Even among the fifth-level Rulers, he is at least at the advanced level, not far from the peak.” Devil Flame’s voice sounded in Jian Wushuang’s ear.","“The fifth-level advanced level Ruler.” Jian Wushuang nodded secretly.","A Ruler at this level was indeed very strong, even stronger than Nine Whiskers, who fought with him.","Even so, it only made him a little more serious, but it did not make him frightened.","“Star Lord, please make a decision on behalf of the Universal Poison Demon Sect!” The Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect bowed to the burly barefoot man and did not get up for a long time.","“Make a decision?” The burly barefoot man, who was Thunder Star Lord, looked grim and looked around. “When exactly? Tell me clearly.”","“Star Lord, it’s these three.” The Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect pointed at Jian Wushuang and the other two, with a hint of resentment, he said, “The genius feast was going smoothly and the strongest genius, Leng Ruxue of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, was chosen. Logically speaking, the genius feast should have ended by now. But who would have thought that these three would suddenly appear and barge into the battlefield without any explanation to fight with Ruxue? The Universal Poison Demon Sect did not agree, so this man attacked recklessly and defeated many experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect. Even I was defeated by him.”","“There’s nothing we can do. Due to his methods, our Universal Poison Demon Sect had no choice but to give in and let his wife fight with Leng Ruxue. Ruxue was also pressured by this person and was unable to display her true strength. In the end, she was also defeated by that woman!”","“Star Lord, it was originally just a victory or defeat. It wasn’t important. However, the key point was that this person acted too recklessly and didn’t take our Universal Poison Demon Sect seriously at all. Moreover, he clearly knew that this genius banquet was personally ordered by you, Star Lord. You, Star Lord, had also ordered that no one was allowed to cause trouble at the genius banquet. Yet, he still acted in such a manner. Clearly, he didn’t even take you, Star Lord, to heart.”","“Now, he and his wife are going to leave. If we let them go, not only our sect, but also Star Lord, will lose a lot of face. I’m afraid this genius banquet will become a joke.”","Many experts on the martial arts practice field were stunned by the angry words of the Sect Master, and a trace of disdain rose in their hearts.","Although the Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect said it nicely, the people present were not fools. Although Jian Wushuang was a bit unreasonable, he came up to challenge them openly, moreover, he relied on his own strength to crush the numerous experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect and did not use any other means.","As for the battle between Leng Rushuang and Leng Ruxue, the Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect also said that the latter did not use her strongest strength because of Jian Wushuang’s pressure? How could this be?","Everyone present could see that Leng Ruxue’s strength was not affected. She had already used her full strength, but her strength was indeed inferior to others.","In the end, she had fought openly and relied on her absolute strength. No one present felt indignant about Jian Wushuang’s actions.","On the contrary, the words of the Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect were disgraceful.","However, the words of the Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect did provoke the anger of Thunder.","“It was you who caused trouble at the genius feast?” Thunder glanced at Jian Wushuang coldly, and there was a flash of violent thunder in the depths of his eyes.","“Caused trouble? I waited for the genius feast to end before I made my move,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","“Is that so?” Thunder Ruler’s eyes were still as cold as ever.","“Star Lord, the battle for the genius feast has indeed ended, but you haven’t come to bestow treasures yet. How can you say that it has ended?” The Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect said.","“Yes, that’s true.” Thunder Ruler nodded slightly."]},{"number":4041,"title":"Chapter 4041 - Thunder Star War God","paragraphs":["“No matter who you are or what reason you have, you should be punished for ruining the genius feast.” Thunder Star Lord stared at Jian Wushuang coldly.","“Thunder Star Lord, I don’t want to cause any trouble. Besides, I’m done with my business, and I don’t intend to stay in your Thunder Star World. If you let me leave now, nothing will happen. But if you continue to pester me, I can’t guarantee what will happen later.” Jian Wushuang was very calm.","“A mere second-level Ruler is really arrogant.” Thunder Star Lord laughed, “Forget it, I won’t kill you. I’ve built a thunder prison in the Thunder Star World to punish those who disrespect me. I’ll lock you up in the Thunder Prison and keep you there for 100 million years.”","As soon as he finished his words, Thunder Star Lord attacked.","Green thunderbolts flashed crazily on his body. As he stretched out his hand, a huge palm made entirely of thunderbolts grabbed toward Jian Wushuang.","The thunder palm contained a violent and suffocating power. In front of this thunder palm, an ordinary fourth-level Ruler would probably lose the ability to resist.","The many experts on the training field were all terrified the moment they saw the Thunder Star Lord make his move.","One had to know that this was the Thunder Star Lord, the publicly acknowledged number one expert of the entire Thunder Star Lord. Over the long years, he had always been a man of his word in the Thunder Star World. No one dared to disobey his orders, but it was precisely because he was too aloof...that was why very few people in the Thunder Star World had actually seen him make his move.","But now, Thunder Star Lord had directly attacked in front of everyone, and he was only dealing with a second-level Ruler.","“As expected of a fifth-level Ruler. His casual attack is so powerful.” Jian Wushuang just smiled faintly, and then he directly slashed with one hand.","In an instant, an invisible sword shadow rushed out and directly cut through the Thunder Hand. The huge thunder hand was directly cut into two by the sword shadow, and a large amount of thunder power crazily spread out in the surrounding void, crackling sounds were heard in the void.","“Huh?” Thunder Star Lord was surprised.","Although he had just casually attacked, an ordinary fourth-level Ruler could not withstand it. However, this second-level Ruler had actually blocked it, and he had also easily blocked it.","“Star Lord, although this person is only a second-level Ruler, his real strength is very impressive. Even I am not his match,” the Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, who was beside Thunder Star Lord, said.","Thunder Lord narrowed his eyes. He had heard the Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect say that Jian Wushuang was powerful, but he did not take it seriously. But now, it seemed that this second-level Ruler was indeed extraordinary.","“Thunder Lord, I have already said that it’s better for you to let me go. Otherwise, you, the Ruler of the astral world, will probably fall today and lose face in front of the experts of the Thunder Star World,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","“You’re boasting shamelessly.” Thunder Star Lord sneered. He flipped his palm and a cyan spear appeared in his hand. As the spear appeared, a large amount of cyan thunder power surged out from Thunder Star Lord’s body, the green thunder power was completely connected to the spear. At that moment, Thunder Star Lord also transformed into a Thunder War God with a green aura.","“You can say that again after you receive three moves from me.” Thunder Star Lord shouted in a low voice, but his body moved instantly.","“Three moves? Let’s try it first.” Jian Wushuang also smiled, and the Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand. His divine power surged and directly faced Thunder Star Lord.","“The first move!”","Thunder Star Lord held the spear with one hand. Endless green thunderbolt power gathered on the spear, and in the blink of an eye, it turned into a huge green thunderbolt snake.","As Thunder Star Lord’s long spear stabbed out, the green thunderbolt snake tore at Jian Wushuang at a rapid speed.","The space was shattered by the endless thunderbolt power on the thunderbolt snake.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. He held the Wuqi Divine Sword with both hands and activated the mysterious universe origin of sword principle. The moment the Wuqi Divine Sword slashed down, the power of the universe principle instantly merged into his swordsmanship.","Without using the universe principle, Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship could only be considered the most powerful in the fourth level. However, once he used the universe principle, the power of his swordsmanship could instantly rise to the fifth level.","Bang!","With a crisp explosion, the shining green thunder snake came into contact with the sword light. It was immediately dimmed by the power contained in the sword light. The entire thunder snake became weak and flew backward.","“Hmm, fifth-level battle strength?” Thunder Star Lord stared at Jian Wushuang in surprise, but then his eyes turned cold. “Even if you are really a fifth-level Ruler, you can’t be presumptuous in the Thunder Star World!”","Chi!","The green thunder power surged crazily. The entire void was completely covered by the cyan thunder power, forming a huge thunder sea.","In the sea of thunderbolts, the green Thunder War God, which was formed by Thunder Star Lord, was even more powerful. The power of the spear in his hand increased dramatically","One after another, the thundersnakes with terrifying power burst out at the same time.","At this moment, at least more than a hundred thundersnakes surged out.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand, and a terrifying sword essence condensed in front of him. In the blink of an eye, many sword rays condensed, each of which contained a rich power of the universe’s principles.","Under Jian Wushuang’s guidance, the sword rays rushed out at the same time and collided with the incoming thunder snakes.","A dense explosion sound was heard, and the hundreds of thunder snakes were all defeated by the sword rays.","“Haha, Thunder Ruler, you can use such a method to deal with an ordinary fourth-level Ruler, but it’s far from enough to deal with me.” Jian Wushuang’s laughter resounded throughout the entire martial arts practice field.","“Boy, don’t be so arrogant. Take my third move first.” Thunder Star Lord shouted, his eyes flashing with terrifying thunder.","A large number of thunder snakes surged out from the endless thunder sea. In the blink of an eye, nearly 1,000 thunder snakes appeared.","However, this time, the 1,000 thunder snakes did not scatter and attack Jian Wushuang. Instead, they gathered together at a terrifying speed in the shortest time.","The power of a single lightning snake was powerful enough. The 1,000 lightning snakes gathered together and turned into a huge lightning dragon in the blink of an eye.","This lightning dragon emitted a destructive power."]},{"number":4042,"title":"Chapter 4042 - Could No Longer Be Resolved","paragraphs":["Previously, it was Thunder Dragon. Now, it was a Thunder Dragon that was hundreds or thousands of times bigger than before. In terms of power, they were not on the same level.","Even Jian Wushuang’s pupils could not help shrinking when he saw the huge Thunder Dragon coming at him.","Jian Wushuang drew his sword and did not hold back his strength anymore.","One sword move, split the heaven!","Boom!","!!","The heaven and earth were completely split apart.","This sword move seemed to come from beyond the nine heavens and wanted to split the entire firmament universe.","The first move of splitting the heaven was the strongest sword move in terms of attack, apart from the three sword formations that Jian Wushuang had created.","The shocking sword shadow directly struck the Thunder Dragon.","“Roar!”","The Thunder Dragon’s roar faintly sounded in the world. In fact, the roar was a burst of thunder. The Thunder Dragon rolled and exploded with terrifying power. Even Jian Wushuang’s first move of splitting heaven could not completely cut the Thunder Dragon, however, it still sharply reduced the Thunder Dragon’s power.","After being hit by the sword light, the Thunder Dragon’s volume was much larger than before. However, it still rushed toward Jian Wushuang like a madman.","Rumble! The Thunder Dragon hit Jian Wushuang’s divine body. Jian Wushuang felt as if he was hit by a huge star. At the same time, a large amount of thunder power crazily entered his body, trying to destroy his divine body.","However, he had cultivated the third level of supreme indestructibility. The strength of his divine body was comparable to the strongest universe supreme treasure, so the impact of the thunder power did not affect him much.","In the void, Jian Wushuang regained his balance after being defeated by the Thunder Dragon for a distance. Then, he raised his head and smiled. “Thunder Star Lord, your moves are quite fancy, but the power is a little weak. Your Thunder Dragon only scratched my divine body.”","Thunder Star Lord’s expression finally darkened.","The countless experts watching the battle were all extremely shocked.","“This person actually received the Star Lord’s attack?”","“If it was the previous two attacks, it would have been fine. But that last move, the Star Lord clearly used all of his strength, and in the end, he still wasn’t able to injure him?”","“This man is only a second-level Ruler, but his battle strength has reached the fifth level?”","“Where did this monster come from? It’s so terrifying.”","The experts of Thunder Star Lord were secretly amazed.","The experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect did not dare to make a sound at this moment.","The Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect had wanted Thunder Star Lord to kill Jian Wushuang, but now he was shocked by Jian Wushuang’s strength.","Obviously, Jian Wushuang’s battle strength was at the fifth level. He could not afford to offend such an expert. Even the Star Lord would not want to offend such an expert?","“Humph, no wonder you’re so arrogant. You’re quite capable.” Thunder Star Lord snorted, his eyes still fixed on Jian Wushuang. “Since you are not weak, take out 500 universe origin stones as an apology and let this matter go.”","“500 universe origin stones?” Jian Wushuang sneered, “Thunder Ruler, you are really asking for too much.”","Indeed, it was asking for too much because the price of an attack Principle treasure was only about 200 universe origin stones.","500 universe origin stones. Many fifth-level Rulers did not have that much.","Thunder Star Lord must have seen the extraordinary Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand, and he was only a second-level Ruler, yet he could unleash the power of a fifth-level Ruler. He must have been a fifth-level Ruler during the great era, so he dared to say this.","“You don’t want to hand it over? Then you’ll die!” Thunder Star Lord’s eyes suddenly turned cold, at this moment, the power of the Thunder Star Lord, which was originally filled with a large amount of green thunder, began to surge crazily. Then, under the watchful eyes of countless experts, the green thunder began to undergo a qualitative change, the thick green thunder began to undergo a qualitative change.","In the blink of an eye, the power of the green thunder had completely turned into a faint purple thunder.","The Thunder Star Lord had also turned back into a purple thunderbolt war god.","“Purple thunderbolt?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. He carefully felt the power of the purple thunderbolt. Without a doubt, after the power of the Thunderbolt turned from green to purple, its power was obviously a level higher than before.","“This kid is indeed not weak. If it was before, I wouldn’t have been able to do anything to him. But now that I have refined the purple thunderbolt scroll, my strength has greatly increased, so I can make an example of him.” A trace of killing intent flashed in the eyes of the Thunder Star Lord.","Originally, he did not want to kill Jian Wushuang. He just wanted to send Jian Wushuang to thunder hell to be suppressed as a punishment.","But after the fight, he realized that Jian Wushuang was so strong, so he changed his mind.","It was normal for a second-level Ruler to have such great battle strength. He must have gotten a great opportunity, so he might have a treasure on him.","It was for this reason that Thunder Ruler wanted to kill Jian Wushuang.","“Crash!”","Endless purple thunderbolts flashed crazily, followed by purple lightning pillars descending from the sky above.","“Blood thunder sea, destroy!”","Thunder Ruler shouted, and the purple lightning pillars instantly gathered together and rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and moved quickly, leaving afterimages in the void. However, the purple lightning pillars seemed to have locked onto him. Where did he go, the purple lightning pillars rushed toward him.","In the end, he had no choice but to meet them.","“Earth Guardian Sword Formation!”","Jian Wushuang finally used the sword formation. Earth sword domains rose up, carrying the power of the formation. In the blink of an eye, they formed a huge guardian sword formation.","The protective sword formation covered Jian Wushuang’s entire body. The vast purple lightning pillars rushed at the Earth Sword Formation, but they only partially destroyed it, but they could not completely destroy the sword formation.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang retreated quickly. At the same time, a cold voice suddenly sounded, “Thunder Ruler, are you really not going to be kind today?”","“Nice? What a joke!” Thunder Ruler smiled coldly, but the purple thunderbolts around him became even more intense.","“Very good. In that case, let’s see who will kill who!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes also emitted a shocking killing intent.","He did not want to tangle with Thunder Ruler. After all, there was no conflict of interest between the two parties. However, he did not expect that the other party would not stop. Moreover, that move just now was clearly intended to kill him.","Did this Thunder Star Lord really think that he had a good temper?"]},{"number":4043,"title":"Chapter 4043 - Death","paragraphs":["Buzz!","The hazy fog swept away, and Jian Wushuang finally displayed his killer move.","“What is this? A sword formation?” Thunder Ruler frowned as he looked at the fog in front of him. He could feel the power of the formation contained in the fog, but then he snorted coldly and said, “It’s just a small trick.”","The purple thunderbolt power surrounding Thunder Ruler, which was already extremely majestic, suddenly surged once again.","The mighty purple thunderbolt sea swept toward the fog in all directions, intending to disperse the fog directly.","!!","However, the fog that was swept out by the obscure sword formation was not solid at all. Although the purple thunderbolt power attacked, the fog did not have much of an impact on the battlefield.","The fog still filled the entire battlefield, and Jian Wushuang had already disappeared in front of Thunder Ruler.","Thunder Ruler looked around coldly, trying to find Jian Wushuang. However, he could not see Jian Wushuang because of the layers of gray fog, he could only sense Jian Wushuang’s approximate position with his soul perception.","Whoosh!","Without any warning, an ice-cold sword light cut through the void from the side.","“So fast, and so sudden!” Thunder Star Lord was shocked, but he did not panic. He saw a large amount of purple thunderbolt power surge and instantly gathered to form a complete purple thunderbolt armor on his body.","The thunderbolt armor covered Thunder Star Lord’s entire body. The sword light cut down on the purple thunderbolt armor, but it only scattered a part of the purple thunderbolt. In the next moment, the purple thunderbolt armor returned to normal.","“Humph, this is the Thunder God battle armor that I formed after refining the Purple Thunder Scroll. This battle armor can not only increase my offensive power, but also my defensive ability to the extreme. With both offense and defense, my overall strength can be doubled.” The Thunder Star Lord sneered.","The secret technique that he cultivated was extremely powerful. The first scroll of the green thunder scroll had already increased his strength by a lot. Not long ago, he had refined the purple thunder scroll, and his overall strength had increased again.","The purple Thunder God armor was especially powerful, which was the reason why he was so confident.","Jian Wushuang used the sword skill of the obscure sword formation to strike the Purple Thunder God armor, but it did not cause much damage.","However, Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry. In the hazy fog, sword lights lit up again.","Thunder Star Lord was prepared for these sword lights. He easily attacked. Purple lightning pillars descended out of thin air. Most of the sword lights were directly scattered by the lightning pillars. Even if some of them were not destroyed...they could not cause any damage to his purple Thunder God armor.","“Haha, kid, this is your trump card. You’re just scratching my itch.” Thunder Star Lord laughed loudly.","“Really?” Jian Wushuang’s cold voice suddenly sounded behind Thunder Ruler.","“What?” Thunder Ruler was stunned. His soul power had been sensing Jian Wushuang’s approximate position, but he did not sense when Jian Wushuang had appeared behind him.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang had already stabbed out with the Wuqi Divine Sword.","The sword was so fast that Thunder Star Lord did not have time to defend himself.","“Humph, so what if I am stabbed by you? With your level of attack, you can’t break my Thunder God armor.” Thunder Star Lord snorted in his heart. He had absolute confidence in the purple thunder armor on his body.","In fact, unless Jian Wushuang used the dragon-killing secret skill, which could increase his strength in a short period of time, he could not break the Thunder God armor with normal sword skills.","However, Thunder Star Lord did not know that Jian Wushuang had activated the drop of scarlet venom hidden in the Wuqi Divine Sword the moment he stabbed out!","This drop of venom was personally refined by an ultimate level Ruler Poison Ruler!","Just one drop was worth 1,000 universe origin stones!","Chi!","The cold sword light stabbed into the purple thunder armor on Thunder Star Lord’s body, and a sound of divine power melting was heard.","The smile on Thunder Star Lord’s face froze and turned into shock.","Wherever the sword light touched, the purple thunder that formed the Purple Thunder armor started to melt rapidly.","It was like a bowl of hot water sprinkled on the snow in winter.","The purple thunder melted too quickly.","There was nothing they could do. Once the drop of venom contained in the Wuqi Divine Sword exploded, the terrifying corrosive power might not even be able to resist the divine body of an Ultimate Ruler, and this purple thunder was only formed by Thunder Star Lord’s own divine power, how could he withstand the corrosion of the venom.","In an instant, a hole the size of a bowl appeared in the center of the Purple Thunderbolt armor. The Wuqi Divine Sword continued to extend and stab at the divine body of Thunder Star Lord.","There was a protective armor on the surface of the main body of thunder star. Although it was not a Principle Supreme Treasure, it was still the most powerful supreme treasure. Logically, it should be able to withstand all attacks, although Jian Wushuang’s Wuqi Divine Sword was an upper-grade Principle-based supreme treasure, he could not fully pierce through it because he could not unleash its true power.","However, Jian Wushuang did not need to pierce through it. He just needed to let the tip of the sword touch the Supreme Treasure armor. The moment the tip of the sword touched the supreme treasure armor...the drop of Venom from the Wuqi Divine Sword instantly rushed toward the supreme true treasure armor.","The supreme true treasure armor at the supreme grade was corroded and collapsed at this moment. The venom continued to corrode, and in the next moment, it finally entered Thunder Star Lord’s divine body.","Thunder Star Lord’s eyes were wide open.","“No!”","With a hysterical roar, Thunder Star Lord did not even have time to struggle before his divine body collapsed. His divine power was completely corroded, and the sound was completely cut off.","The purple thunderbolts in the sky dissipated, and Thunder Star Lord died!","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang appeared in the void where Thunder Star Lord died. He looked down at the treasure left behind by Thunder Star Lord and was shocked.","“It’s too terrifying. Although I had guessed that the poison was very terrifying, I didn’t expect it to be so terrifying. Thunder Star Lord is a fifth-level Ruler, and he is very powerful. However, in just a moment, he died. Even the supreme treasure armor on his body was corroded.” Jian Wushuang sighed.","Even he was like this, and the experts watching the battle around the drill ground were even more shocked beyond words."]},{"number":4044,"title":"Chapter 4044 - Thunder Star Lord’s Wealth","paragraphs":["“The Star Lord is dead?”","“How is that possible? The Star Lord is a fifth-level Ruler. How could he die at the hands of a second-level Ruler?”","“Impossible, this is impossible!”","The experts of Thunder Star Lord felt like they were going crazy.","Over the long years, the Thunder Star Lord had always been an invincible existence in the Thunder Star Lord’s place. Even in the entire Purple Micro Galaxy, he was still an expert who stood at the top of the pyramid.","!!","Such an expert was already invincible in a medium-sized Star Field.","Even the Thunder Star Lord himself had once said that he was fearless in the Purple Micro Galaxy. From this, one could see his strength.","And that was indeed the case. Over the long years, the Thunder Star Lord had always given people the feeling of invincibility. Whether it was in the Thunder Star Field or in the battles with the other experts of the Star Field, the Thunder Star Lord had always been incomparably powerful.","It was precisely because of this that in the hearts of these experts of the Thunder Star Field, they had long been almost blindly worshipping the Thunder Star Lord. But today, they had never imagined that the Thunder Star Lord would actually die.","He was killed by a second-level Ruler in front of everyone.","Shock, fear, and disbelief appeared in everyone’s minds,","Jian Wushuang had already waved his hand and put the treasures left by the Thunder Star Lord into his interspatial ring. Then, he looked at the Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect with interest.","“Not good.” The Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect was like a frightened bird. As soon as he sensed Jian Wushuang’s gaze, he immediately retreated without hesitation, desperately trying to distance himself from Jian Wushuang.","He knew very well that it was Thunder Lord who had begged him to deal with Jian Wushuang. He wanted to use Thunder Lord to kill Jian Wushuang. Even if he could not kill Jian Wushuang, he had to punish him properly.","Who would have thought that not only did Thunder Star Lord fail to kill Jian Wushuang, but he was killed instead.","So now, could Jian Wushuang spare him?","“Shuang ‘er, let’s go.”","Unexpectedly, Jian Wushuang did not attack the Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect. Instead, he called his wife and Devil Flame and left the Universal Poison Demon Sect.","To Jian Wushuang, the Sect Master of the Universal Poison Demon Sect was nothing in his eyes. It did not matter whether he killed him or not. However, because Leng Rushuang had already said that the enmity between him and Leng Ruxue was over...Jian Wushuang did not intend to have any contact with Leng Ruxue in the future, and Leng Ruxue was from the Universal Poison Demon Sect. Therefore, Jian Wushuang spared her life.","Under the gaze of countless experts, Jian Wushuang and the other two left the Universal Poison Demon Sect and soon disappeared into the horizon.","The martial arts practice field was already in an uproar.","In the camp of the Universal Poison Demon Sect, the experts of the Universal Poison Demon Sect were all shocked. Among the crowd, Leng Ruxue gritted her teeth and looked in the direction where Jian Wushuang and the other two had left.","“Jian Wushuang, I didn’t expect you to be so strong after so many years. You even killed Star Lord!”","“And that bitch, she has been sleeping for so many years, but her strength is even stronger than mine!”","Leng Ruxue clenched her hands and her eyes were cold.","“Just you wait. You are stronger than me now, but it won’t be long before I surpass you. I will!”","Leng Ruxue had already regarded Leng Rushuang and Jian Wushuang as her targets.","However, what Leng Ruxue did not know was that both Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang had a much greater innate advantage than him.","Needless to say, Jian Wushuang was not only at the perfect life level, but also possessed an astral world. He had unlimited potential.","Leng Rushuang had also fused with the heart of the astral world. Her innate advantage was definitely greater than her body of woe poison.","Just now, Leng Ruxue was already inferior to the two of them. In the future, the gap would only be greater.","Moreover, they probably would not have the chance to meet again in the future.","...","After leaving the Universal Poison Demon Sect, Jian Wushuang and the others had finished their business in the Purple Micro Galaxy. Naturally, they did not stay any longer and quickly left the Thunder Star World.","In the universe void of the Purple Micro Star Road, the ancient universe boat slowly moved forward.","In the universe boat, Jian Wushuang was examining the treasures and interspatial rings left behind by the Thunder Star Lord after his death.","“He is indeed a second-class astral world Ruler of a medium-sized Star Field. His wealth is much more than that of the Devil Cloud Star Lord. Even compared to Nine Whiskers, the Ascetic Cultivator we met in the Purple Micro Star River, Nine Whiskers’s wealth is far inferior to that of the Thunder Star Lord if it were not for the venom,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Nine Whiskers was an Ascetic Cultivator, and he had been to many territories and killed many great beings. He had even killed a fifth-level Ruler, so he had an extraordinary family background. Of course, the most precious thing was the venom that he had gotten back then.","Putting aside the venom, Nine Whiskers’s total was probably less than 4,000 universe primitives.","However, Thunder Star Lord had almost 4,000 origin stones in his universe ring.","In addition to all kinds of valuable resources and the green spear used by Thunder Star Lord himself, the Green Spear should be a mid-grade Principle True Treasure, and its value was also very high.","All of these added up, Thunder Star Lord’s total wealth should be close to 8,000 universe origin stones.","His wealth was already close to that of an ultimate level Ruler.","“It’s already impressive for an ordinary fifth-level Ruler to be worth 1,000 to 2,000 universe origin stones. However, Thunder Star Lord is a Ruler of a second-level astral world and has been staying in the Purple Micro Galaxy for a long time. He’s at the top, so it’s easy for him to plunder treasures. It’s normal for him to be so rich,” Devil Flame said with a sigh.","Jian Wushuang also nodded slightly. As a fifth-level Ruler and a second-level star world Ruler in a medium-sized Star Field, if he was good at collecting money, he could indeed accumulate a lot of universe origin stones over a long period of time.","If it were other fifth-level Rulers, they definitely would not have such wealth.","Of course, no matter how good he was at collecting money, he could not be compared with an ultimate level Ruler.","Jian Wushuang had heard from Devil Flame that an Ultimate Ruler, even if he was relatively poor, would have tens of thousands of universe origin stones, and the stronger ones would have hundreds of thousands of universe origin stones, as for the Ultimate Ruler, he could easily get more than one million universe origin stones.","Compared to those Ultimate Rulers, the amount of universe origin stones Jian Wushuang got was just a drop in the bucket.","“I got a lot of source stones when I killed Nine Whiskers. Now that I killed Thunder Star Lord, I got more. I don’t need these source stones for now, but I can buy you a suitable nomological true treasure armor,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile."]},{"number":4045,"title":"Chapter 4045 - The Price","paragraphs":["“The Principle True Treasure armor?” Leng Rushuang was shocked, but then she shook her head. “Husband, you still don’t have the Principle True Treasure armor...”","Before Leng Rushuang could finish her words,.","“I’m different from you,” Jian Wushuang interrupted her. “I’m a perfect life-level cultivator with boundless divine power. I’ve also cultivated the supreme eternal celestial body. Although it’s only the third level, my divine body is still comparable to the supreme true treasure armor. Once I cultivate to the fourth level, my divine body will be comparable to an ordinary low-grade Principle True Treasure armor. Therefore, ordinary Principle True Treasure armor is useless to me.”","“But you are different. Although your current battle strength is not bad, your life-saving ability is not very strong. The universe is too dangerous. Although I will always be by your side, if there is a sudden danger, I may not be able to protect you in time. Therefore, you must find a way to improve your life-saving ability.”","Jian Wushuang said solemnly.","!!","It was true. He and his wife were adventuring in the universe. He was not worried if they encountered danger, but he was only worried about his wife.","After all, Leng Rushuang’s life-saving ability was not as heaven-defying as his.","“I understand.” Leng Rushuang nodded and stopped insisting. “In fact, Ruler taught me a life-saving secret skill. It’s just that it’s very difficult to cultivate it. I’m only barely at the beginning. As for my body-protection ability, I’m indeed a little lacking.”","“That’s good. I’ll go to the Nine Emperor Pavilion again and choose a suitable principle-type supreme treasure armor for you.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Immediately, the three went to the Nine Emperor Pavilion again, and Chief Ballmer received them.","“Chief Ballmer, I need a low-grade principle-type supreme treasure armor,” Jian Wushuang said.","“No problem. This is the principle-type supreme treasure armor that the Nine Emperor Pavilion can take out immediately. They’re all low-grade. You can take a look.” Ballmer immediately took out a list.","Although it was a list, in fact, there were only four Principle True Treasure armors on it.","This was normal. The Purple Micro Galaxy was only a medium-sized Star Field, and the strongest person in it was only a fifth-level Ruler. An ordinary fifth-level Ruler could hardly afford a Principle True Treasure armor.","“The price is really expensive.” Jian Wushuang looked at the price of the four Principle True Treasure armors on the list.","Even the cheapest of the four principle-type supreme treasure armors was worth more than 1,200 universe origin stones, and the most expensive sword was worth 1,800 origin stones.","After all, Jian Wushuang estimated that the soul-defense type supreme treasure he obtained after killing Nine Whiskers would not be worth more than 2,000 origin stones.","In terms of type, this principle-type supreme treasure armor was slightly inferior to a soul-defense type supreme treasure.","“The price of a Principle Supreme Treasure armor is much more valuable than an attack supreme treasure. Under normal circumstances, it’s usually ten times more expensive. Some lower-grade Principle Supreme Treasure armors with stronger protective effects are even as valuable as an ordinary middle-grade attack supreme treasure,” Ballmer said.","“If you want to buy it, then buy the best one. I’ll take this Heart Jade Emperor Blood Armor,” Jian Wushuang said directly.","“Husband.” Leng Rushuang glanced at Jian Wushuang.","The Heart Jade Emperor Blood Armor was the most expensive one on the list of supreme treasures. It was worth 1,800 origin stones.","“This is an origin stone.” Jian Wushuang took out an interspatial ring. There were exactly 1,800 origin stones in it.","After taking it, Ballmer briefly scanned it with his consciousness. He nodded and said, “Wait a moment, I’ll send someone to deliver this armor right away.”","Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry and just waited. Halfway through, Jian Wushuang suddenly asked, “Chief Ballmer, there’s something I want to ask you.”","“Blood Sword, please go ahead.” Ballmer was still as enthusiastic as ever.","“I know that the Nine Emperor Pavilion has influence in every corner of the universe. The universe passage in the Nine Emperor Pavilion should be very comprehensive, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Universe passage?” Ballmer raised his eyebrows and then smiled. “Yes, it’s very comprehensive. If the Nine Emperor Pavilion wants to, we can easily reach the core territory of the universe from the edge of the universe. However, it will cost a lot of money to travel such a long distance. For an ordinary Ruler, it’s definitely an astronomical figure.”","“I don’t want to go directly to the core of the universe from here. I just want to go to the Nine Luminaries Galaxy. I wonder if the Nine Emperor Pavilion has a direct access to the universe?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Nine Luminaries Galaxy?” The star map of the Nine Luminaries Galaxy immediately appeared in Ballmer’s mind, but then he smiled. “The Nine Luminaries Galaxy is indeed not the core of the universe. It’s not too far from the Purple Micro Galaxy where we are now. Of course, the Nine Emperor Pavilion has a direct access to the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, but I’m afraid you can’t use it, Blood Sword.”","“Why?” Jian Wushuang looked at him with a frown.","“Blood Sword, there’s something you may not know. Although the universe passage of the Nine Emperor Pavilion covers every corner of the universe, it’s not open to the public.”","“Not open to the public?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Yes, even I, a subordinate of the Nine Emperor Pavilion and a supervisor of the Purple Micro Galaxy, have some authority, let alone you. In fact, even the lords with one or two levels higher authority than me in the Nine Emperor Pavilion are not qualified to use the long-distance universe passages of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. Only some of the core experts in the Nine Emperor Pavilion are qualified to use these universe passages, and almost all of them are supreme experts,” Ballmer said.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang immediately understood.","Even Ballmer and the experts from the Nine Emperor Pavilion, who were one or two levels higher than him, were not qualified to use those long-distance universe passageways, so what right did he have?","“Blood Sword, you are a genius expert on the Nine Emperor List and a friend of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. If you really need it, you can use those universe passageways, but the price to pay is very high,” Ballmer said.","“How much do I have to pay to go directly from the Purple Micro Galaxy to the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field?” Jian Wushuang asked immediately.","“I don’t know the exact number, but I estimate it to be at least millions of universe origin stones,” Ballmer said.","Hearing this number, Jian Wushuang rolled his eyes, but he no longer had the idea of using the universe passage.","Millions of universe origin stones?","What a joke!","All of his assets added up, he could only break 10,000 universe origin stones, which was only a few hundredths.","“It seems that it’s impossible to go directly to the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field. I can only take the universe boat and travel slowly.” Jian Wushuang was also full of helplessness."]},{"number":4046,"title":"Chapter 4046 - 18,000 Years","paragraphs":["In a short while, someone from the Nine Emperor Pavilion brought the Heart Jade Emperor Blood armor over.","The blood-red armor was crystal clear and looked like a layer of glass.","“Shuang ‘er, try refining it,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Leng Rushuang nodded and immediately began refining the Heart Jade Emperor Blood Armor.","The requirements for refining a low-grade principle treasure were also quite harsh. Leng Rushuang was not weak at the moment. Although she had spent some time, she had successfully refined the armor.","!!","After refining it, the Heart Jade Emperor’s blood armor turned into a layer of blood-red green robe and draped over Leng Rushuang’s body. It made the already cold and arrogant Leng Rushuang look even more gorgeous.","“How do you feel?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Very good. The armor’s protective ability is very good. It’s much stronger than ordinary supreme treasures. However, the most powerful thing is the four levels of power contained in the armor. The first level of power alone is enough to greatly increase my strength. Moreover, with my current strength, I can activate the first level of power,” Leng Rushuang said.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","Generally, the Supreme Treasure armor did have its own power, but it was not easy to activate it.","In Jian Wushuang’s opinion, the power of the principle Supreme Treasure Armor could only be activated by comprehending a trace of the universe principle, but now it seemed that it was not so.","“The four levels of power in the armor require a high level of comprehension of the universe principle. However, the first level only requires a certain level of contact with the universe principle and a relatively simple use of the power of the principles contained in it. Although I have not comprehended the universe principle, I have been following you around all the time. I often see you comprehending the universe principle, so I naturally have some contact with it. Therefore, I just happened to reach the threshold of activating the first level of power,” Leng Rushuang said with a smile.","“That’s good.” A smile appeared on Jian Wushuang’s face.","Soon, the three of them continued their journey.","They left the Purple Micro Galaxy in the universe boat and entered the vast universe void.","Time flowed like water. In the blink of an eye, 18,000 years had passed.","During these 18,000 years, Jian Wushuang spent most of his time in the vast universe void. Occasionally, when he passed by some Star Fields, he would stay in those Star Fields for a while, he would taste the delicacies and specialties of these Star Fields.","It had to be said that Jian Wushuang’s knowledge had improved a lot after passing through these Star Fields.","In the universe boat, Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang casually sat there. On the table, there were some brightly colored fruits.","These fruits were all obtained from the small Star Field that they had just passed by.","“Husband, the people from the Thunder Dragon Star Field were really enthusiastic. They gave us so many fruits before they left. These fruits are enough for us to eat for tens of thousands of years,” Leng Rushuang said with a smile.","“Enthusiastic?” Jian Wushuang touched his nose. He knew very well that apart from their enthusiasm, it was mainly because their strength was so strong that they were in awe of them. That was why they would try their best to please them.","After all, the strongest Ruler in a small Star Field was only a fourth-level Ruler. When Jian Wushuang arrived in that area, he had a dispute with a fourth-level Ruler and defeated him with one move, after that, the fourth-level Ruler was in awe of them.","The fourth-level Ruler ordered people to prepare the fruits.","“Although the universe is vast, strength is always the most important thing. As long as you are strong enough, you can easily suppress many Star Fields. The cultivators in those Star Fields are naturally terrified and can only try to curry favor with you.” Jian Wushuang shook his head and smiled.","Although his current strength was nothing in the vast universe, he was definitely a top expert in small or medium-sized Star Fields. He was definitely worthy of respect.","“Unfortunately, in the past 18,000 years, I have made great progress in the universal principle and the sword principle. However, I still haven’t integrated the sixth principle in the principle of heaven and earth.” Jian Wushuang sighed, feeling helpless.","Back when he was in the Divine Beginning Realm, the sixth principle he had comprehended, the dark principle, was already just one step away from fusing with the other five principles. However, all these years, up until now, so much time had passed, there were still no signs of complete fusion.","After all, he had not abandoned his cultivation in these years. Moreover, because he had grasped the Divine Beginning Realm’s will of Heavenly Dao, he was able to comprehend and fuse the Principles very quickly.","For example, in these 18,000 years, he had completely comprehended the seventh Principle, but he still could not completely fuse the sixth Principle.","“I can’t help it. It’s easy to comprehend the universe Principle, but it becomes more and more difficult to fuse it. It’s because I have mastered the Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm that I can comprehend the Principle so quickly, but it still takes a long time to fuse it,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","For example, Devil Cloud Ruler’s strength increased dramatically after he took over the Divine Beginning Realm, but his progress stopped for a long time after he reached the third-level Ruler, in the end, he finally broke through to the fourth-level Ruler.","In terms of talent and comprehension, Jian Wushuang was definitely stronger than Devil Cloud Star Lord. However, he had only cultivated for a short period of time.","“Husband, don’t worry. Although your realm hasn’t improved, your strength has been improving. If you go all out now, you’ll be close to the peak of the fifth-level Ruler, right?” Leng Rushuang looked at him.","Seeing Leng Rushuang, Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly.","In the past 18,000 years, he had not integrated the sixth Principle, but Leng Rushuang was one step ahead of him. Now that she had integrated the six Principles and become a third-level Ruler, she was completely ahead of him in terms of realm.","“The integration of Principles, especially at my current level, can only wait and rely on opportunities.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “But you’re right. Although I can’t fuse Principles, my strength has been improving, especially in the universe Principles. I’ve been improving all these years, and now I don’t even know what level my comprehension of the universe Principles has reached.”","“Devil Flame, you’re very knowledgeable. Can you tell me if there’s a way to let me know the specific level of my comprehension of the universe Principles? At the very least, I need something to refer to,” Jian Wushuang said.","He really did not know what level his understanding of the universal principles had reached. All he knew was that he was much stronger than before.","..."]},{"number":4047,"title":"Chapter 4047 - The Principle Sea","paragraphs":["18,000 years later, Devil Flame had already refined and absorbed all the special crystals he had obtained, and his divine body had recovered to about 40%.","With about 40% of his divine body, Devil Flame’s realm had recovered to the peak of the fourth-level Ruler, which was infinitely close to the fifth-level. His battle strength was undoubtedly at the fifth-level, even among the fifth-level Rulers, he was extremely strong.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s question, Devil Flame hurriedly said, “Ruler, there are many ways to judge the comprehension of universal principles in the vast universe, but the most convincing one is the Principle Sea.”","“Principle Sea? What is that, the universal Principle Sea?” Jian Wushuang asked in puzzlement.","“No.” Devil Flame shook his head. “Principle Sea is actually a test for the comprehension of universe principles. There are 33 levels of Principle Sea, corresponding to 33 different levels of the comprehension of universe principles.”","!!","“The Principle Sea was created by an Ruler force at the core of the universe. It was later widely used in the universe. Most of the top experts in the universe, like those supreme experts, use the Principle Sea as a standard to judge their comprehension of the universe’s principles. The first level of the Principle Sea requires one to Ruler a trace of the universe’s principles to pass it. As for the highest level, the 33rd level, it is said to be the limit of the universe’s principles. It means that one has completely mastered the entire universe’s principles. However, there are only a handful of such supreme experts in the entire universe.”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang was noncommittal.","The universe principle was the supreme principle of the vast universe. Even supreme experts could barely enter it. The 33rd level of the Principle Sea represented the complete Rulery of the universe principle, naturally, it was not something that an ordinary person could pass.","Perhaps even a top-tier supreme expert, or even an invincible supreme expert like Planet Ruler Lingyun, would not be able to pass it.","“My comprehension of the universe’s principles is no longer the same as before. If I go to the Principle Sea, I should be able to pass more than the first level. However, I still have to try how many levels I can pass,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself, then he raised his head and said, “Devil Flame, you just said that the Principle Sea has been widely used in the vast universe. There should be many places where I can pass the Principle Sea, right?”","“Not many places have it.” Devil Flame said seriously, “After all, the universe principle is too high-end. Only supreme experts are qualified to comprehend it. Only a few talented Rulers are qualified to comprehend it. However, because the level is too high, ordinary small and medium-sized Star Fields don’t need the Principle Sea. Therefore, this Principle Sea can only be found in large Star Fields.”","“A large-scale Star Field?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","A large-scale Star Field had a first-class Star Field, and it definitely had an ultimate level Ruler. Some of the stronger large-scale Star Fields even had supreme-beings.","However, the vast universe mostly had small-scale Star Fields and medium-scale Star Fields. As for large-scale Star Fields, they were only common in the depths of the universe. As for the edge of the universe, although there were some, there were very few.","Jian Wushuang and the others had passed by many Star Fields along the way, but none of them had passed by large Star Fields.","“Husband, if I remember correctly, let’s continue forward. After passing through two small Star Fields, we will arrive at a large Star Field, the Bone Pupil Star Field,” Leng Rushuang said.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand, and a huge star map immediately appeared in the void in front of him.","On the star map, Jian Wushuang soon saw the location of the Bone Pupil Star Field.","“Yes, the Bone Pupil Star Field is the only path we have to take, and it’s not far from where we are now. If we take the universe boat without any delay, we can arrive there in a few hundred years.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","The star map had an introduction about the Bone Pupil Star Field.","The Bone Pupil Star Field was indeed a large Star Field. There were not only level one Star Fields, but also two. There were even more level two and level three Star Fields.","“There are even two level one Star Fields in the Bone Pupil Star Field. There must be a Principle Sea in there. Let’s go to the Bone Pupil Star Field first,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","The universe boat flew through the universe void at the fastest speed. After only 300 years, they arrived in the Bone Pupil Star Field.","In the core area of the Bone Pupil Star Field, an island was floating in the void space. The island was quiet.","Normally, since this island was in the core area of the Bone Pupil Star Field, there should be many great beings passing by. However, in fact, this island was almost uninhabited in the Bone Pupil Star Field.","Although the great beings of the Bone Pupil Star Field knew about the existence of this island, they almost did not come here.","On the island, there was an endless sea. At the edge of the sea, a brown-haired old man sat there with his eyes closed. He did not move at all.","The brown-haired old man had been sitting on the island in the same position for hundreds of thousands of years.","He had not moved for hundreds of thousands of years. If people did not know that, they would think that he had died a long time ago.","But suddenly...","“Eh?” The brown-haired elder suddenly opened his eyes, revealing his slightly turbid pupils. “Someone is coming?”","Sure enough, three figures rushed over from not far away and soon arrived at the edge of the ocean.","“Halt,” the brown-haired elder said slowly.","Jian Wushuang and the other two stopped.","“Ruler, the Principle Sea is ahead. Although it looks like an ordinary ocean, in fact, you will find this Principle Sea after you walk along it. It has a different world,” Devil Flame said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and looked at the brown-haired elder who was sitting casually below.","“Whoosh!”","Jian Wushuang and the other two flew down and arrived in front of the brown-haired elder.","“I’m Xue Jian. My wife and one of my guards are beside me. We passed by and heard that there is a Principle Sea here that can determine the level of comprehension of the universe’s principles. We came here to have a look,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“The Principle Sea is not something that just anyone can see. It requires a certain level of comprehension of the universe’s principles. However, among the three of you, the strongest one is only a fourth-level Ruler. I wonder which one of you has comprehended a trace of the universe’s principles?” The brown-haired elder looked over with a light gaze.","“It’s me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Oh?” The brown-haired elder looked at Jian Wushuang with a hint of surprise in his heart.","He could tell at a glance that Jian Wushuang was only a second-level Ruler.","It was rare for a second-level Ruler to be able to comprehend a trace of the principles of the universe.","..."]},{"number":4048,"title":"Chapter 4048 - Challenge!","paragraphs":["“I am Gui Yun, the guardian of the Principle Sea,” the brown-haired elder said.","“Guardian?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“Ruler, every Principle Sea in the universe has a guardian. As for the purpose of this Guardian’s existence, I don’t know. However, it should be related to the top force behind the creation of the Principle Sea,” Devil Flame said softly.","Jian Wushuang understood that the top force in the depths of the universe created the Principle Sea and spread it throughout the universe. It was impossible for the geniuses of the universe to enter it without a purpose.","“If you want to enter the Principle Sea, you must first show whether you have really comprehended a trace of the universe’s principles. After all...seeing is believing,” said the Guardian, Gui Yun.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded and then waved his hand. A trace of the power of the universe principle instantly condensed in his palm.","Gui Yun’s eyes immediately lit up. “It really is the universe principle. It’s amazing that a second-level Ruler can comprehend a trace of the universe principle. Although the Bone Pupil Star Field is a large starfield and there are many Rulers, only one has really comprehended a trace of the universe principle. Moreover, that one has only comprehended a trace of the universe principle at the fourth-level Ruler level.”","Jian Wushuang listened calmly, but he found it funny.","After all, he had comprehended a trace of universe principle at the level of Principle Ruler, not the second-level Ruler.","“Well, it proves that you have comprehended a trace of universe principle, so you can go to the Principle Sea.” Gui Yun smiled and waved at the endless sea in front of him.","“Splash!” The endless sea rolled crazily, and the power of the formation rose in the sea.","“Go,” Gui Yun said.","Jian Wushuang nodded and rushed to the Principle Sea without hesitation.","As soon as he entered the Principle Sea, Jian Wushuang disappeared in front of Leng Rushuang and the others. Apparently, Jian Wushuang had begun the test of the first level of the Principle Sea.","“Devil Flame, you know more about the Principle Sea. How many levels do you think you can pass with your husband’s comprehension of the universe principles?” Leng Rushuang asked.","“Madam, although I used to be an Ultimate Ruler, I haven’t comprehended any of the universe principles. I haven’t really tried the Principle Sea, but I’ve heard that there are 33 levels in the Principle Sea, and each level has a step. Ruler’s comprehension of the universe principles has improved greatly over the years, so it shouldn’t be difficult to pass the first three levels. As for whether I can pass the fourth level, I don’t know,” Devil Flame said.","“Passing the first three levels isn’t difficult?”","When Gui Yun Heard Devil Flame’s words, he started laughing, “You’re underestimating this Principle Sea a little too much. Although the Principle Sea has 33 levels, and indeed every three levels has a step, the gap between each level is still very big. Under normal circumstances, as long as one grasps a trace of the universe principles, they can pass the first level. However, the second level requires a certain level of comprehension toward the universe principles, and the third level requires one to truly step into the threshold of the universe principles.”","“Your Ruler is only a second-level Ruler, so he must have just been exposed to the universe principles. It’s no problem for him to pass the first level, but I’m afraid the second level will be difficult. I think he can only pass the second level.”","“Not necessarily.” Devil Flame glanced at Gui Yun.","Leng Rushuang just smiled faintly.","Gui Yun did not know Jian Wushuang very well.","Moreover, when Jian Wushuang displayed the universal principle, he did only show a trace of the universal principle. This made Gui Yun think that Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the universal principle was not high, so he said so.","However, Leng Rushuang and Devil Flame had a certain understanding of Jian Wushuang. They knew that Jian Wushuang had already grasped a trace of the universal principle at the level of Principle Ruler, and because he had mastered the divine will of the Divine Beginning Realm over the years, his progress in the universe principle was even more rapid.","They all knew that Jian Wushuang had entered the threshold of the universe principle a long time ago.","“Eh?” Gui Yun’s expression changed. “He has passed the first level and is heading to the second level.”","Gui Yun was not surprised that Jian Wushuang had passed the first level.","However, not long after Jian Wushuang passed the first level, Gui Yun sensed that Jian Wushuang had passed the second level again.","“He passed the second level?” Gui Yun was surprised.","“My Ruler is much more powerful than I thought.” Devil Flame glanced at Gui Yun and said with a faint smile.","“Maybe, but he shouldn’t be able to pass the third level.” Gui Yun still insisted on his judgment.","The power of the magic formation surged crazily in the Principle Sea. Unfortunately, they could not see Jian Wushuang pass the Principle Sea.","After Jian Wushuang passed the second level, Gui Yun knew that Jian Wushuang had passed the third level.","“He really passed the third level?” Gui Yun was really shocked.","One had to know that the third level required the comprehension of the universe principles to truly cross the threshold. It was extremely difficult to reach this step.","Many Rulers who had just broken through would take an extremely long period of time to truly reach the threshold of the principles of the universe.","For a second-tier Ruler to be able to pass the third level of the Principle Sea meant that he had to be one of the most supreme geniuses in the entire universe.","“Tsk, tsk. This is going to be interesting. A second-tier Ruler who is able to pass the first three levels of the Principle Sea...those two should be very interested, right?” A strange smile appeared on Gui Yun’s face, following that, he took out two command talismans and sent two messages over.","The Bone Pupil Star Field had two first level starfields, the Golden Feather Starfield and the Blue Flame Starfield. The Star Lords of these two first level Starfields were both final level Rulers, and they were both extremely powerful.","As the saying goes, one mountain can not contain two tigers. There were two first level Starfields in a starfield, and they were the only two final Rulers. Naturally, the battles between these two starfields were very intense.","But today, both Golden Feather Star Lord and Green Flame Star Lord received a message from Gui Yun, the protector of the Principle Sea.","“A second-class Ruler is challenging the Principle Sea, and he has already passed the first three levels.”","Upon receiving this message, the two Star Lords were immediately alarmed.","“The third level of the Principle Sea?”","“That is the threshold of the principles of the universe. Many Rulers who have just broken through are only at this level of comprehension of the principles of the universe, right?”","“If such a super genius can become a disciple of my Golden Feather star sector, then why should I be afraid of that disciple of Green Flame?”","Golden Feather Star Lord’s eyes shone with an unprecedented brilliance. The next moment, he rode the universe passageway within Golden Feather star sector and rushed toward the island where Principle Sea was located at the fastest speed possible.","..."]},{"number":4049,"title":"Chapter 4049 - The Fifth Level of the Principle Sea","paragraphs":["Azure Flame Astral World.","Under the jade blue sky, it was a purgatory.","The entire boundless land was being crazily burned by a blazing fire. This blazing fire had a strange purplish-black color. It had been burning on this land for countless years, yet it had never been extinguished.","The cultivators of the Green Flame Star World, not to mention the Rulers of principles, even some extremely powerful Rulers did not dare to easily set foot on this land. After all, if a Ruler stayed on this land for a slightly longer period of time...it was possible for them to be burned to ashes by the blazing flames of this land.","However, under this vile illusion, a devilish purple-clothed youth was located at the very center of the blazing flames of this land. Endless purplish-black flames were wildly burning. To this devilish purple-clothed youth...it was like nourishment for him.","He was training on this land, just like a fish in water, incomparably comfortable.","Right at this moment...","Sou!","A human figure suddenly descended.","“Disciple.” The Green Flame Star Lord appeared in front of the violet-robed devilish youth.","“Ruler, why are you here?” The violet-robed devilish youth raised his head in surprise.","“Something has happened. Disciple, come with me.” The Green Flame Star Lord spoke.","“Oh?” The violet-robed devilish youth could not help but stand up, asking in puzzlement, “What is it?”","“Gui Yun, who is guarding the Principle Sea, just sent me a message saying that a second level Ruler is currently challenging the Principle Sea, and has already passed the first three levels.” The Green Flame Star Lord said.","“What?” The violet-robed, devilish-looking youth was shocked, but then his expression turned extremely grave.","He now knew why his Ruler, the Green Flame Star Lord, had come looking for him.","This was because he was the only person in the entire Bone Pupil Star Field who had comprehended the principles of the universe. He was also known as the publicly acknowledged number one genius of this starfield, however, he had only comprehended a sliver of the principles of the universe at the fourth-level Ruler level. Up until now, he was still only at the fourth-level Ruler level. However, in terms of the principles of the universe, he had been able to pass the second level of the Principle Sea not long ago.","However, the difference between the second and third levels of the Principle Sea was already enormous. Furthermore, the other party was only a second-level Ruler.","“Let’s go to the Principle Sea.”","Green Flame Star Lord waved his hand and immediately rushed toward the Principle Sea with his disciple, the evil purple-clothed youth.","At the edge of the Principle Sea, the look of shock on the Watchman Gui Yun’s face had disappeared and was replaced by a faint smile.","He was also quite happy.","It was known that the reason why he, the watchman, existed was to dig out some super geniuses hidden in the universe.","Jian Wushuang, who could pass the third level of the Principle Sea as a second-level Ruler, must be one of the top geniuses.","“A second-level Ruler can pass the third level of the Principle Sea. He is qualified for me to report it. Well, don’t worry, let’s wait for him to finish,” Gui Yun said with a smile.","Suddenly...Gui Yun opened his eyes wide.","“The, the fourth level?”","He was completely stunned.","It was already incredible for a second-level Ruler to pass the third level of the Principle Sea. However, he had just learned that Jian Wushuang had passed the fourth level of the Principle Sea!","After all, there were three steps in the Principle Sea, from the third level to the fourth level. It was a huge leap, but Jian Wushuang had also passed it?","“He has already entered the fifth level. Could it be that he can still pass the fifth level?” Gui Yun gulped, his eyes shining brightly. He was already looking forward to it.","The fifth level of the Principle Sea!","Jian Wushuang was still standing on the vast ocean, and in front of him was a cyan-robed elder.","Jian Wushuang was no stranger to this cyan-robed elder, because he had met him on the previous four levels. However, the strength he displayed was different on different levels.","“You have a bright future as a second-level Ruler.” The cyan-robed elder looked at Jian Wushuang with a hint of admiration in his eyes.","“Please give me some guidance, senior.” Jian Wushuang was quite humble.","“Just like the first four levels, if you defeat me, you will be able to enter the sixth level.” The cyan-robed elder smiled slightly and then directly attacked.","Boom!","The ocean below suddenly surged up. The cyan-robed elder held a pitch-black long staff in his hand. The long staff was like the waves in the ocean, crushing toward Jian Wushuang in a mighty manner.","It was not very powerful, and the universe origin of the staff principle was not very strong. However, the long staff contained an extremely rich power of the universe principles.","Jian Wushuang immediately moved. He held the Wuqi Divine Sword in one hand, and a large amount of the power of the universe principles swept up and met it directly.","Clang! Clang! Clang! Clang!","The two crazily collided on the surface of the ocean. They constantly competed in speed and power. In the blink of an eye, they had met hundreds of times.","Suddenly, the cyan-robed elder twisted his wrist casually, and the black longstaff suddenly split into two in the void. The two black longstaff smashed toward Jian Wushuang almost at the same time.","“What?” Jian Wushuang was shocked. “It’s the same attack. I can’t tell which one is real and which one is fake. What’s going on?”","Jian Wushuang was confused.","The cyan-robed elder did not use a special movement technique or secret skill. Instead, he relied on his comprehension of the power of principles to change his attack from one to two, and they were exactly the same, Jian Wushuang could not see any flaws at all.","Boom!","Jian Wushuang urged his comprehension of the principles of the universe and tried his best to use his swordsmanship to block the two stick shadows.","However, in the Principle Sea, with the same divine power, the same comprehension of the dao, and even the same speed, he could not block the two stick shadows at the same time.","Jian Wushuang tried his best to block one of the stick shadows, but the stick shadow turned into an illusion, and the other stick shadow hit Jian Wushuang’s divine body without any resistance.","Jian Wushuang immediately retreated. It took him a while to regain his balance on the surface of the sea, and the crazy sea finally calmed down.","“Little guy, you lost.” The cyan-robed elder looked at Jian Wushuang calmly.","“How could this be?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He did not expect that he would lose like this?","Most importantly, when he fought with the cyan-robed old man, he clearly sensed that the cyan-robed old man’s comprehension of the universe principles was worse than his.","Yes, he did not know how high the cyan-robed old man’s comprehension of the universe principles was. However, in the fifth level of the Principle Sea, his comprehension of the universe principles was indeed inferior to his.","However, when the two of them fought, he lost."]},{"number":4050,"title":"Chapter 4050 - Guidance","paragraphs":["“Little guy, do you find it incredible?” The green-robed elder looked over at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “I can feel that your comprehension of the universal principles is slightly worse than mine, but you easily defeated me on the premise that everything else is the same.”","“Haha! This is actually very easy to understand. The same comprehension of the power of the universal principles, but in the hands of different people, the strength displayed is not much. In the end, it is in the grasp and application of the universal principles.” The green-clothed elder laughed.","“Grasp and application of the universal principles?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Just like the principles of heaven and earth, the universal principles are an extremely transcendental and powerful force. It is naturally important to grasp this kind of power. Just like a peerless sword, in the hands of an ordinary person and in the hands of a peerless swordsman, the power displayed is completely different.” The green-clothed elder laughed.","“Your comprehension of the principles of the universe is already considered quite high. At least, it’s higher than the comprehension of the principles of the universe that I can display at the fifth level of the Principle Sea. Unfortunately, your grasp and application of the principles of the universe are too crude. You only know how to fuse the power of the principles into your sword techniques and into your own attacks. Naturally, the effect of the power of the principles that you can display isn’t much stronger.”","“Although my power of principles is lower than yours, I can Ruler and use them well, but my battle strength is stronger than yours.”","After saying that, the green-robed elder looked at Jian Wushuang again, “Little guy, you are good at sword principle. If you have a Ruler behind you, you can ask your Ruler to find a secret manual for the use of the universe principles that is compatible with your swordsmanship. Learn more about the basic application and control of the universe principles. This will greatly increase your strength.”","“I understand. Thank you for your guidance, senior,” Jian Wushuang quickly thanked him.","“Okay, go.” The green-clothed elder waved his hand. Jian Wushuang immediately found that he could not control his body and flew backward. Soon, he flew out of the Principle Sea and came to the outside of the Principle Sea.","Leng Rushuang and Devil Flame immediately came up to him.","“Husband, how do you feel?” Leng Rushuang asked.","“I’ve gained a lot,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","He had gained a lot from this trip to the Principle Sea.","First of all, he knew that his current comprehension of the universe principles was at the fourth level of the Principle Sea, which was still far from the fifth level.","Of course, this matter was secondary to Jian Wushuang. The real gain was that in the fifth level of the Principle Sea, the cyan-robed elder’s guidance made him realize that his application and grasp of the universe principles were too rough, it was too crude.","As the cyan-robed old man had said, although his understanding of the universal principles was not low, he only knew how to apply the universal principles to his swordsmanship and attack power.","But in fact, the magical use of the universal principles was far more than that.","It was just that no one had taught him, and there were no secret manuals for him to control and cultivate the use of the universal principles. He himself did not realize this.","But now, he finally realized it.","“Haha, my young friend Blood Sword, you are very capable.” A hearty laughter rang out. The watchman, Gui Yun, looked at Jian Wushuang with a strange glint in his eyes.","At the same time, Gui Yun finally revealed his divine power aura. He was a fifth-level Ruler, and his aura was obviously much stronger than the one Jian Wushuang had met in the Purple Micro Galaxy, Thunder.","“The peak of the fifth-level?” Jian Wushuang was secretly surprised.","He was only a guardian of the Principle Sea, but he was also so strong. No Wonder Gui Yun called him little friend now.","“Little friend Blood Sword, if I’m not wrong, you’re not a native cultivator of the Bone Pupil Star Field, right?” Gui Yun asked.","“Yes, we’re from another Star Field. We just happened to pass by this place and knew there was a Principle Sea here, so we came here to explore. We’ll leave soon,” Jian Wushuang replied.","“No wonder. If you are a cultivator from the Bone Pupil Star Field, you must be very famous in the Bone Pupil Star Field.” Gui Yun smiled and said, “You will leave soon?”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Well, it’s a pity. If the Golden Feather Star Lord knew about this, he would be very disappointed.” Gui Yun sighed.","“Golden Feather Star Lord?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. He naturally knew that Golden Feather Star Lord was an Ultimate Ruler of the two first-class star worlds in the Bone Pupil Star Field.","“Blood Sword, to tell you the truth, when you passed the third level of the Principle Sea, I sent a message to Golden Feather Star Lord and Green Flame Star Lord respectively. If nothing unexpected happens, they should be here soon,” Gui Yun said.","“Mr. Gui Yun.” Jian Wushuang frowned, feeling a bit dissatisfied.","He came to the Principle Sea just to have a try and know his comprehension of the universe principles. He did not want to interact with people from the Bone Pupil Star Field, not to mention the two Ultimate Rulers in the Bone Pupil Star Field.","However, Gui Yun’s message immediately attracted the attention of the two Ultimate Rulers.","“Haha, Blood Sword, don’t worry. Golden Feather Star Lord and Green Flame Star Lord have arrived, but they won’t harm you. After all, you don’t have any grudges with them. They might even be good for you,” Gui Yun said with a smile.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Gui Yun and relaxed his eyebrows.","Indeed, he had just arrived in the Bone Pupil Galaxy and had no contact with the two Ultimate Rulers. It was impossible for them to find trouble with him for no reason.","As for the benefits, Jian Wushuang did not think about it.","“Oh, the Golden Feather Star Lord has arrived,” Gui Yun suddenly said.","Jian Wushuang also looked up at the direction outside the island. Sure enough, a figure bathed in golden light was rushing over and soon appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and the others.","“Gui Yun.”","Golden Feather Star Lord spoke in a clear voice. He first greeted Gui Yun, then looked at Jian Wushuang and the other two.","With his strength, he could naturally see the realm of Jian Wushuang and the other two at a glance. Then, his eyes immediately fixed on Jian Wushuang.","After all, Jian Wushuang was the second-level Ruler among the three of them. Naturally, he was the one who had passed the third level of the Principle Sea.","“This should be the Blood Sword young friend who passed the third level of the Principle Sea, right?” Golden Feather Star Lord came to Jian Wushuang with a smile.","“Golden Feather Star Lord, it’s true that he is Blood Sword young friend, but you’re wrong about one thing. Not only did he pass the third level of the Principle Sea, but he also passed the fourth level just now,” Gui Yun said with a smile."]},{"number":4051,"title":"Chapter 4051 - Golden Feather Star Lord","paragraphs":["“The fourth level?” Golden Feather Star Lord stared.","Originally, in his opinion, it was already incredible that this Blood Sword could pass the third level, and the fourth level was even more shocking.","Such a super genius, if...","At the thought of this, Golden Feather Star Lord shook his hand fiercely, making a decision in his heart.","“You have passed the fourth level of the Principle Sea at the second level. You are really amazing, Blood Sword. Even I admire you.” Golden Feather Star Lord said with a smile. His words were obviously full of flattery.","!!","Jian Wushuang was slightly surprised.","Golden Feather Star Lord had nothing to do with him. Even if his talent was great, he would only praise him a little. How could he praise Him?","Jian Wushuang wondered if the Star Lord had other motives?","“Blood Sword, if you don’t mind, can you come to my Golden Feather star world and have a cup of tea?” The Star Lord said with a smile.","“Tea?” Jian Wushuang looked strange, but he still nodded and said, “Golden Feather Star Lord invited me, so how could I refuse? But forget it. After all, I’m in a hurry, so I’ll stay here.”","“Okay.” Golden Feather Star Lord waved his hand, and a tea table appeared in front of him. There was a pot of tea and several cups on the table.","Golden Feather Star Lord, Jian Wushuang, and the others sat down beside the tea table one after another.","Golden Feather Star Lord poured a cup of tea for Jian Wushuang, and he also poured a cup for Leng Rushuang and Gui Yun. As for Devil Flame, he did not sit down at all.","“Blood Sword, please,” Golden Feather Star Lord said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang picked up the teacup in his hand and put it on the tip of his nose to sniff it. Instantly, he felt his whole soul relaxed.","“This tea is not ordinary.” Jian Wushuang immediately understood.","Without hesitation, he drank a cup of tea with his wife. After drinking the tea, a refreshing feeling entered his stomach, and the effect of the tea immediately came into play.","Jian Wushuang only felt that his soul power was wrapped by an extremely warm power. His entire soul was greatly nourished, and his divine body was also strengthened at this moment, even his body and mind felt relaxed, as if the pressure of hundreds of millions of years had suddenly dissipated.","“What a strange effect.” Jian Wushuang opened his eyes with a hint of surprise.","“Haha, this is ice spirit tea, a rare treasure of the universe boat. This pot is probably worth 50 origin stones. Even if you have origin stones, you might not be able to buy it. I heard that Golden Feather Star Lord spent a lot of effort to get three pots of ice heart tea. Even I can’t bear to drink it. Today, thanks to Blood Sword, I can also drink it.” Gui Yun smiled.","Hearing Gui Yun’s words, Jian Wushuang was shocked.","Such a pot of tea was worth 50 origin stones? Moreover, it was priceless?","However, Jian Wushuang was immediately on guard.","Golden Feather Star Lord first praised him and then brought out such a precious and rare tea. Jian Wushuang would not believe that Golden Feather Star Lord did not have other motives.","“It’s just a pot of tea. To be able to produce a super genius like Blood Sword, what’s the big deal even if you bring out all three pots of iced heart tea?” Golden Feather Star Lord said with a smile.","“Golden Feather Star Lord is really generous.” Gui Yun smiled bitterly but did not say anything more.","“Blood Sword, you said you were in a hurry? What’s going on?” Golden Feather Star Lord asked.","“To tell you the truth, we are not cultivators from the Bone Pupil Star Field, but from other Star Fields. We just happened to pass by this place and knew there was a Principle Sea here, so we came here to try. We planned to leave after we finished the Principle Sea,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Blood Sword, are you in such a hurry to leave?” Golden Feather Star Lord frowned.","“Why? Do you need my help?” Jian Wushuang tried to ask.","“Well...” Golden Feather Star Lord did not know what to say.","At this moment, Gui Yun laughed and said, “Haha, let me be the middleman.”","“Blood Sword, you may not know this, but the situation in the Bone Pupil Galaxy is very delicate. After all, there are two grade one star worlds in this Galaxy. As the saying goes, one mountain can not contain two tigers. Two grade one star worlds are in the same Galaxy, so there will naturally be many fights. Over the years, these two grade one star worlds have been fighting each other, and both sides are like fire and water.","“However, although both sides are in the first-class astral world and their overall strength is about the same, in terms of the strongest experts, the battle strength of the Golden Feather Star Lord is slightly weaker than that of the Green Flame Star Lord.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang could not help looking at the Golden Feather Star Lord.","“I’m ashamed. Although they are both Ultimate Rulers, the Green Flame Star Lord is indeed much stronger than me. However, my life-saving ability is not weak. Although I can’t defeat him alone, it’s very difficult for him to predict me,” the Golden Feather Star Lord said.","“In that case, you don’t have to be afraid of Green Flame Star Lord, do you?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“He’s not afraid,” Gui Yun said with a smile. “Over the years, the Golden Feather World and Green Flame Star World have never been at a disadvantage. However, something happened not long ago.”","“It’s Green Flame Star Lord. He took in a disciple with great talent. He has cultivated for less than two million years. Not only has he reached the fourth-level Ruler level, but he has also comprehended a trace of the universe principle. Not long ago, Green Flame Star Lord’s disciple also came to challenge the Principle Sea and passed the second level in one go.”","Gui Yun paused at this point.","As for what happened next, although he did not say it, Jian Wushuang could roughly guess it.","Golden Feather Star Lord had always been on par with Green Flame Star Lord, and neither side had an obvious advantage, but now Green Flame Star Lord had an additional disciple who had comprehended a trace of universe principle...this made Golden Feather Star Lord feel threatened.","After all, that disciple of Green Flame Star Lord had only cultivated for less than two million years, and he was able to comprehend a trace of universe principle at the Ruler level. This already showed his talent, and he was definitely the number one genius in the entire Bone Pupil Great Star Field.","Moreover, that disciple was already at the fourth level. As long as he was given enough time, he would definitely be able to reach the fifth level and even the Ultimate Ruler level in time.","One had to know that Golden Feather Star Lord was not as powerful as Green Flame Star Lord. He could only protect himself when facing Green Flame Star Lord one-on-one. However, if Green Flame Star Lord had another Ultimate Ruler who had comprehended a trace of the universe principles by his side...that would definitely not be something Golden Feather Star Lord could contend against."]},{"number":4052,"title":"Chapter 4052 - Rejection","paragraphs":["“The disciple of Green Flame Star Lord has caused great danger to Golden Feather Star Lord. Thus, from hundreds of thousands of years ago, Golden Feather Star Lord began to think of ways to excavate the geniuses within the Golden Feather star sector, including the geniuses within the entire Bone Pupil major starfield. He longed to nurture a genius who could similarly comprehend a trace of the universe principles at the Ruler level. In the future, he would be able to contend against the disciple of Green Flame Star Lord.”","“It’s a pity that in the past hundreds of thousands of years, there have been some geniuses born in the Bone Pupil Star Field, but none of them have been able to comprehend a trace of the universe principle at the Ruler level,” Gui Yun said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","He knew very well that it was extremely difficult for a Ruler to comprehend a trace of the universe principle.","For example, Golden Feather Star Lord and Green Flame Star Lord were both Ultimate Rulers. Neither of them had been able to comprehend a trace of the universe principle, let alone others.","!!","Under normal circumstances, it would be extremely difficult for even a major starfield to give birth to a Ruler who had comprehended a single strand of the principles of the universe. Usually, it would take tens or even hundreds of chaos cycles for one to be born.","The Golden Feather Star Lord had already given birth to one of the Azure Flame Star Lord’s disciples. Naturally, it would be even more difficult for the Golden Feather Star Lord to find a second one.","Of course, this was only limited to the bone eye Great Star Field. However, his appearance now clearly gave Golden Feather Star Lord hope.","“Blood Sword, my young friend, since Gui Yun has said so, I won’t hide it from you. I do desire you to stay in the bone eye Great Star Field and help me fight against Green Flame Star Field. Of course, I’m also willing to pay a price for this. A low-grade Principle True Treasure armor, a low-grade soul defense Principle True Treasure, and a middle-grade Principle True Treasure weapon!”","“In addition, if you want to cultivate in the Golden Feather Star World in the future, feel free to ask. As long as I can afford it, I won’t refuse,” Golden Feather Star Lord said solemnly.","Jian Wushuang glanced at Golden Feather Star Lord.","He had to admit that Golden Feather Star Lord was very sincere.","Not to mention the ice spirit tea, just the price that Golden Feather Star Lord was willing to pay now was a low-grade Principle True Treasure armor, a low-grade soul defense Principle True Treasure, and a middle-grade Principle True Treasure magic weapon, these three Principle True Treasures alone were worth more than 5,000 universe origin stones.","It should be known that the most ordinary final-level Rulers were all worth around 10,000 universe origin stones. Although Golden Feather Star Lord was a first-grade astral world Ruler, his wealth was naturally more than that of an ordinary final-level Ruler, however, paying 5,000 universe origin stones at one time was indeed a big deal.","“Golden Feather Star Lord.” Jian Wushuang looked at Golden Feather Star Lord and said, “I’m sorry, but I can’t agree to your request.”","“Blood Sword, my friend.” Golden Feather Star Lord was obviously anxious. “If you think I’m paying too little, feel free to ask for more. If you can agree to it, I’ll agree to it.”","“It’s not a matter of whether you have paid enough or not.”Jian Wushuang shook his head, “You just said that I’m not a cultivator of the Bone Pupil Galaxy. I just happened to pass by here. To tell you the truth, I left my hometown to explore the universe largely because I wanted to go to the Nine Luminaries Galaxy in a short time.”","“I can’t stay in a Galaxy for too long, let alone stay in the Bone Pupil Galaxy and join hands with you to fight against the Green Flame Star World.”","“So, I can only apologize.”","Hearing this, Golden Feather Star Lord could only smile bitterly, although he was still unwilling to accept it, “I also guessed it. You’re just a genius Ruler from another Star Field who just passed by. It’s really impossible for you to stay.”","Golden Feather Star Lord was already mentally prepared when he learned that Jian Wushuang came from another Star Field’s sea of consciousness.","It was normal. If Jian Wushuang was a local cultivator from the Bone Pupil Star Field, he was confident that he could make Jian Wushuang stay. But since he came from another Star Field, he was obviously an expert who was adventuring in the universe. It would be unrealistic for him to make Jian Wushuang stay, it was not realistic.","Knowing that it was not realistic, Golden Feather Star Lord tried his best to try, but he was naturally rejected by Jian Wushuang.","“Golden Feather Star Lord, Blood Sword passed the fourth level of the Principle Sea as a second-level Ruler. Such a genius must be the best in the entire vast universe. It’s impossible for you to keep him in an ordinary large Star Field,” Gui Yun said, pursing his lips, “I know.”","“I know.” The Golden Feather Star Lord’s expression became even more bitter. However, he was still an Ultimate Ruler, after all. Soon, a smile appeared on his face once more. “Forget it. We’ll think of another way in the future. However, for us to be able to gain the support of a genius like little friend Blood Sword today, our trip wasn’t a wasted one.”","“That’s more like it.” Gui Yun nodded as well.","Right at this moment...two more figures charged over from the void outside the island.","“The Green Flame Star Lord and his disciple are here,” Gui Yun said.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his head.","“Humph.” Golden Feather Star Lord snorted.","“Haha, it’s quite lively here.”","The two figures appeared in front of the Principle Sea as they laughed indifferently.","The one who laughed indifferently was the Green Flame Star Lord.","As for his disciple, the purple-robed evil-looking young man, his sharp, blade-like eyes locked onto Jian Wushuang as soon as he appeared.","“It’s him. He has comprehended the universe principle and is only a second-level Ruler, but he has passed the fourth level of the Principle Sea!” The purple-robed evil-looking young man’s eyes narrowed.","On the way here, Gui Yun sent another message to Green Flame Star Lord and told him that Jian Wushuang had passed the fourth level. Naturally, Green Flame Star Lord also told him.","“Green Flame Star Lord, you came much later than Golden Feather Star Lord,” Gui Yun said with a smile.","“Golden Feather came here alone as soon as he received your message, but I have to bring my disciple with me. Of course, I came a little slower, but fortunately, I made it in time,” Green Flame Star Lord said with a smile, his eyes swept over Golden Feather Star Lord, and at the same time, he saw the pot of tea on the coffee table.","“Oh, he even took out the ice spirit tea. It seems that Golden Feather has invested a lot. But if I’m not wrong, Blood Sword didn’t agree with him, did he?” Green Flame Star Lord said with a smile.","“Humph, this has nothing to do with you, right?” Golden Feather Star Lord snorted.","“Yes, it doesn’t.” Green Flame Star Lord smiled, but he already had the answer in his heart.","At this time, the purple-robed evil youth had already come to Jian Wushuang and said in a low voice, “My name is Emperor Fire!”","..."]},{"number":4053,"title":"Chapter 4053 - Di Huo’s Challenge","paragraphs":["“Di Huo?” Jian Wushuang looked at the purple-robed young man calmly.","“I heard that you have passed the fourth level of the Principle Sea. I would like to fight with you. Do you dare to accept my challenge?” Di Huo asked directly.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. When he saw Di Huo’s gaze, he had guessed what Di Huo was trying to do. However, he did not expect Di Huo to challenge him so directly.","Jian Wushuang did not respond immediately, but Golden Feather Star Lord snorted and said, “Di Huo, you are already a fourth-level Ruler, but Blood Sword is only a second-level Ruler. How dare you challenge him?”","“Of course I won’t bully him. When we fight, I will deliberately control the power of my divine power. I will only use the power of the fusion of the five Principles. I will only rely on my comprehension of the universe Principles and the Dao to fight.” Green Flame continued to stare at Jian Wushuang. “Why? Don’t you dare?”","!!","Jian Wushuang had a strange look on his face.","“My young friend Blood Sword.”","Someone spoke again, but at this moment, it was Emperor Flame’s Ruler, Green Flame Star Lord.","“My young friend, can you speak from the side?” Green Flame Star Lord said with a smile.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Immediately, Green Flame Star Lord and Jian Wushuang came to the side. Moreover, Green Flame Star Lord directly blocked the surrounding space and time, obviously not wanting their conversation to be heard by others.","“Blood Sword, I’m sorry. Although my disciple is talented, he is too arrogant. In addition, he has been recognized as the number one genius in the Bone Pupil Star Field all these years. No one can compare with him, which makes him more arrogant. That’s why he came to challenge you today,” Green Flame Star Lord said.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","It was obvious that Di Huo had always been the number one genius in the Bone Pupil Galaxy. Now that someone with a higher talent and comprehension than him had suddenly appeared, Di Huo was not convinced and wanted to fight.","“Do you want to accept the challenge?” Asked Green Flame Star Lord.","“Green Flame Star Lord, do you want me to accept the challenge or not?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“If you are confident that you can defeat my disciple, I hope you can accept the challenge,” Green Flame Star Lord said.","“Oh, why?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“I just said that my disciple is good at everything, but he is too arrogant and arrogant. This is not a good thing for him. So if possible, I hope you can teach him a lesson and let him know that there is always someone better than him. Of course, I won’t let you do it for nothing. I can give you a Principle Supreme Treasure as a reward,” Green Flame Star Lord said.","After hearing what the Star Lord said, Jian Wushuang’s expression became even more strange.","He did not expect that the Star Lord wanted to ask him to teach his disciple a lesson.","However, it was also true that Di Huo’s arrogant personality was fine in the Bone Pupil Galaxy. However, if he went to the vast universe in the future, he might cause trouble because of his personality.","Teaching him a lesson earlier would be very helpful to Di Huo.","“Green Flame Star Lord, I will agree to fight with him. I will also teach him a lesson according to what you said. As for the reward, there’s no need for it,” Jian Wushuang said.","It was a piece of cake. Jian Wushuang really did not want any reward.","“Thank you, Blood Sword.” A smile appeared on Green Flame Star Lord’s face.","Soon, they returned to Di Huo.","Di Huo looked at his Ruler, Green Flame Star Lord, in confusion, but he found that the latter looked unfathomable. He was also confused and did not know what his Ruler had said to Jian Wushuang.","“Di Huo, I agree to fight with you,” Jian Wushuang said directly.","“Very good, where shall we fight?” Di Huo’s eyes were shining.","“I’m in a hurry, so I don’t need to pick a place to fight. Let’s fight here,” Jian Wushuang said casually.","“Humph, arrogant.” Di Huo was enraged by Jian Wushuang’s attitude.","In the void of the island, Jian Wushuang and Di Huo stood face to face at a certain distance, while Green Flame Star Lord and Golden Feather Star Lord had long retreated to the side.","Leng Rushuang, Devil Flame, and Gui Yun stood together.","“Humph, Emperor Fire just passed the second level of the Principle Sea. Does he think he’s so great? Not to mention that he’s deliberately suppressing the power of his divine power, even if he goes all out, he probably won’t be a match for Ruler.” Devil Flame secretly curled his lips.","In the void, Emperor Fire’s eyes were cold, and a cyan saber appeared in his hand.","The cyan saber was burning with a raging Green Flame, which was enough to make an ordinary Ruler’s heart palpitate.","“Blood Sword, you’re the first person in hundreds of thousands of years that I really want to fight. I hope you won’t disappoint me in this battle.” Di Huo held the Green Flame saber with one hand and stared at Jian Wushuang with a burning gaze.","“I’m in a hurry. Don’t be so long-winded. Hurry up and fight so that I can get rid of you so that I can continue my journey.” Jian Wushuang looked impatient.","“You’re too arrogant.” Di Huo was completely enraged by Jian Wushuang. He did not waste any more words and directly attacked.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Numerous phantoms burst out at the same time.","Di Huo actually conjured nine figures at the same time. Whether it was their appearance, aura, or the movements of their hands, they were all exactly the same, even the soul power of a Ruler could not tell which of the nine figures was his real body.","The nine figures rushed over at the same time. The cyan-colored flame saber in their hands was raised high and ready to cut down.","“Emperor Fire’s comprehension of the universe principles is far inferior to mine. Like me, he also doesn’t know how to better Ruler these universe principles.” Jian Wushuang smiled slightly, but suddenly he moved.","“Swish!”","Jian Wushuang’s entire body turned into a cold sword light and flashed out in an instant.","His speed was too fast.","Before Di Huo could even slash out his saber, the cold sword light that Jian Wushuang transformed into had already struck his many figures.","In that instant, Di Huo’s eight figures were directly crushed into pieces. As for his original body, it was also struck by the terrifying sword light, and his entire body was forced back in an extremely sorry state, it was not easy for him to regain his balance.","“You lost.”","Jian Wushuang reappeared in the void and looked at Di Huo indifferently.","Di Huo, on the other hand, was completely stunned.","In just a moment —","He was the one who attacked first, but he was defeated before he could swing his saber.","There was no room for struggle.","The gap between the two was just too big!","..."]},{"number":4054,"title":"Chapter 4054 - Meaning","paragraphs":["“How is this possible?” Di Huo’s head was buzzing.","He knew that Jian Wushuang had passed the fourth level of the Principle Sea, so his comprehension of the universal principles must be much higher than his.","However, when they fought, even if they had the same divine power and the same degree of fusion of the principles, the outcome could not be decided just by the comprehension of the universal principles.","In Di Huo’s opinion, although his comprehension of the universe principles was not as good as Jian Wushuang’s, he was very confident in his comprehension of the saber principle, the universe origin, his saber skills, and the secret skills he cultivated.","Under such circumstances, even if his comprehension of the universe principles was weaker, he should be able to defeat Blood Sword.","However, the real fight was not what he had imagined.","He did not even have the chance to show his saber skills and was defeated in an instant.","“What a powerful sword!”","The surrounding spectators, including Green Flame Star Lord, Golden Feather Star Lord, and Gui Yun, were all shocked.","Two of them were Ultimate Rulers, and the other one was also a Ruler at the peak of the fifth level. They all had very high standards, so they could naturally see how powerful Jian Wushuang’s sword was.","“It’s too fast,” Golden Feather Star Lord praised.","“It is very fast. In terms of speed, he is probably the top among the fifth level Rulers. There is no doubt that Blood Sword has a very high comprehension of the universe principles, and his comprehension of the sword principle universe is also ridiculously high. I think he has already surpassed most of the fifth level Rulers,” Green Flame Star Lord said.","“In the Principle Sea, we can only see the comprehension of the universal principles, but we can’t judge other aspects. But now, it seems that Blood Sword is much stronger than we thought.” Gui Yun sighed.","Before, they thought that Jian Wushuang only had a high comprehension of the universal principles. But now, they knew that Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the universe origin of Sword Principle was also ridiculously high, and his swordsmanship.., he was probably stronger than many fifth-level Rulers who were good at sword principle.","Gui Yun and the others did not feel wronged that Di Huo was defeated by him.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang had already flown down from the void, and Di Huo followed behind Jian Wushuang and flew down.","“My young friend Blood Sword, thank you very much.” Green Flame Star Lord said with a smile.","“You’re welcome.” Jian Wushuang just nodded slightly.","“Disciple, are you convinced of this battle?” Green Flame Star Lord looked at Di Huo.","Di Huo moved his lips and wanted to say something, but he held it back in the end. He just lowered his head and looked extremely ugly.","“Humph.” Green Flame Star Lord suddenly snorted. “A defeat is a defeat. If you don’t even have the courage to face defeat, then you’ll disappoint me.”","“Ruler.” Di Huo raised his head and said in a low voice, “I’m convinced by this battle. Thank you for your guidance, Mr. Blood Sword.”","Di Huo had even addressed Jian Wushuang as Mr. Blood Sword. It was obvious that Jian Wushuang’s strength had convinced him.","Seeing this, Green Flame Star Lord nodded with satisfaction, he said, “A defeat is not terrible. Moreover, the little friend Blood Sword who defeated you now must be the best and most heaven-defying genius in the entire vast universe. It’s not shameful to be defeated by such a genius. What’s important is that you must recognize yourself through this battle.”","“Although you are a genius and you are number one in terms of talent in the entire Bone Pupil Star Field, you might not be able to rank at the top in the entire vast universe. At the very least, you are still far from the most heaven-defying geniuses.”","“What you need to do is to maintain your reverence toward the universe. Keep your temper and slowly grow step by step. Sooner or later, you will have a chance to stabilize your peak. You might even surpass Blood Sword in the future.”","“I understand.” Di Huo nodded heavily, and his eyes became hot again.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang also nodded secretly. He could see that the Star Lord of Green Flame was very devoted to his disciple, and he also knew how to teach his disciple.","After teaching Di Huo a lesson with his own hands, Di Huo’s temper would definitely be erased, and his achievements in the future would be even greater.","As for whether Di Huo would have a chance to surpass him in the future, Jian Wushuang did not dare to say it.","“Alright, it’s time to fight. Disciple, let’s go back.” Green Flame Star Lord said directly.","“Yes.” Di Huo nodded respectfully.","Green Flame Star Lord smiled at Jian Wushuang and then left with Di Huo.","“What a pity.” Golden Feather Star Lord looked at Jian Wushuang with emotion.","It was obvious that Jian Wushuang was much more talented than Di Huo and had greater potential. It was a pity that Jian Wushuang did not agree to his invitation.","“Well, Blood Sword, Gui Yun, I’m leaving too.” Golden Feather Star Lord left directly.","After the two Star Lords left —","“Blood Sword, I just heard you say that you’re going to the Nine Luminaries Galaxy?” Gui Yun looked at him.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Since you’re going to the Nine Luminaries Star Field, then after you leave the Bone Pupil Star Field, your next stop should be the Pillheart Star Field,” Gui Yun said.","“That’s right.” Jian Wushuang looked at Gui Yun with some confusion, not knowing why Gui Yun asked this question.","“That’s right. After you passed the fourth level of the Principle Sea, I reported this news to the higher-ups. You should know that the creator of the Principle Sea is a top force in the depths of the universe. This top force created the Principle Sea and spread it across all the major Star Fields in the universe. Moreover, there is a watcher beside the Principle Sea in each major Star Field. Naturally, it has some special purpose.”","“The special intention is to find some geniuses. A genius like you, Blood Sword, will certainly attract the attention of the high-level experts of this force. They might even arrange someone to contact you. So I hope you can leave a message token so that I can contact you,” Gui Yun said.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Haha, don’t worry, my friend. It’s not a bad thing for you,” Gui Yun said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment and nodded slightly.","Indeed, the forces behind the Nine Emperor Pavilion and the Principle Sea were all Supreme Rulers in the universe. In front of such a Supreme Ruler, even a supreme was nothing, not to mention a genius who had yet to grow up.","If there was no absolute reason, these super forces would certainly not lower themselves to attack a genius. At most, they would try to recruit these geniuses with various conditions or at a price.","For example, the Nine Emperor Pavilion established the special list of the Nine Emperor List.","Even if the super forces behind the Principle Sea really wanted to contact him, they would probably come to recruit him. This was indeed not a bad thing for Jian Wushuang.","..."]},{"number":4055,"title":"Chapter 4055 - Expensive","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang left his message token and then left.","After leaving the Principle Sea, Jian Wushuang continued to fly toward the Nine Luminaries Star Field. The next Star Field he was going to pass by was the core Star Field.","The Divine Beginning Realm...Jian Wushuang’s original body and his wife had been in the universe for more than 20,000 years, but the Divine Beginning Realm was still very peaceful.","Although Jian Wushuang’s original body had left, the Divine Beginning Realm had long since stabilized. Xuan God Daoist, Temporal Temple Master, and the others were still there. In addition, Jian Wushuang had control over the divine realm’s will of the Heavenly Dao, naturally, no one could act recklessly.","Buzz! In the Star Palace, Jian Wushuang’s consciousness avatar appeared in front of Xuan God Daoist.","“Xuan God, find Ruler Chenyun for me. I have something to ask him,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay, wait a moment.” Xuan God Daoist immediately went to make the arrangements.","Jian Wushuang was just a consciousness clone. If he wanted to find Ruler Chenyun, Xuan God Daoist would have to do it.","Soon, Ruler Chenyun appeared in front of Jian Wushuang. Of course, Ruler Chenyun was just a consciousness clone.","“Blood Sword Master, do you still find it interesting to travel in the universe?” Ruler Chenyun looked at Jian Wushuang with a smile.","“Of course, the vast universe is much larger than the Star Field where the Divine Beginning Realm is located.” Jian Wushuang also smiled. “Ruler Chenyun, I have something to ask you.”","“What is it?” Ruler Chenyun looked over.","“You know that I have comprehended a bit of the universe principles. After all these years, my comprehension of the universe principles has improved a lot. But not long ago, I met an expert who told me that although my comprehension of the universe principles is good, I don’t know how to Ruler them and use them. He also suggested that I buy some secret manuals that combine the universe principles and sword principle.”","“I’m also very curious about this secret manual. There must be one in the Nine Emperor Pavilion, but I wonder how much it’s worth?” Jian Wushuang asked.","He wanted to know how much the secret manual, which could help him better Ruler and use the universe principles and perfectly cooperate with his sword principle, was worth, and whether he could afford it with his own wealth.","“A secret manual that can help me Ruler and use the universe principles, and it has to perfectly coordinate with my swordsmanship?” Ruler Chenyun revealed a strange expression.","After pondering for a moment, Ruler Chenyun spoke again, “Blood Sword Master, the secret manual you mentioned is naturally available in the Nine Emperor Pavilion. However, its value is beyond your imagination.”","“Oh? How much?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. He was more or less ready.","However, Ruler Chenyun stretched out a finger, “Even if it’s an ordinary technique or secret manual to grasp and use the universe principles, it’s worth 100,000 universe origin stones in the Nine Emperor Pavilion. As for the secret manual that perfectly matches the universe principles and sword principle, it’s even more valuable. It costs hundreds of thousands of universe origin stones.”","“What?”","Even though Jian Wushuang was mentally prepared, he was still shocked when he heard the number.","100,000 universe origin stones, and it was just the most ordinary secret manual for grasping and using the universe principles?","“Why is it so expensive?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“It’s normal for it to be expensive,” Ruler Chenyun said with a smile. “Blood Sword Master, you should know that only supreme experts are qualified to comprehend the universe principles, and those who comprehend the universe principles at the Ruler level are very few.”","“However, even if a Ruler has comprehended universe principles, most of them can only comprehend a little of them. They don’t need to use them at all. Therefore, under normal circumstances, only Supreme-level experts and Supreme-level experts can afford to buy secret manuals on the use of universe principles.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood.","It was true that 100,000 universe origin stones was an astronomical figure for a Ruler, but it was probably nothing for a supreme expert.","The secret manual on the use of universe principles was prepared for supreme experts.","As for Rulers, most of them could not comprehend it at all. Even if they did, they could only comprehend a little of it. There was no need for such a secret manual.","However, Jian Wushuang was different. He had comprehended a trace of universe principle at the level of a Principle Ruler, and he had made great progress over the years. Now, he could pass the fourth level of the Principle Sea and even comprehend the universe principle, he was stronger than the gatekeeper of the fifth level of the Principle Sea, but his ability to use and control the universe principle was much stronger than his.","His comprehension of the principles of the universe was already stronger than that of some of the lowest-level supreme-beings. That was why he needed to use the secret manual of the use of the principles of the universe.","However, the value of the secret manual was so expensive that Jian Wushuang could not accept it.","“I thought I was rich now, but I didn’t expect that I could not afford even the most common method of using the principles of the universe.” Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly.","“I understand, Ruler Chenyun. Thank you.” Jian Wushuang thanked him.","“You’re welcome, Blood Sword Master.” Ruler Chenyun smiled and then disappeared.","...","In the vast dark void of the universe, the ancient universe boat was still rushing forward.","In the universe boat, Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly.","“Even the most ordinary universe principle application secret manual costs 100,000 universe origin stones. It’s really expensive.” Jian Wushuang praised.","Hearing this, Leng Rushuang only smiled faintly.","Devil Flame said in a deep voice, “Ruler, I didn’t even Ruler a trace of universal principle when I was alive. This secret manual is far away. However, I’ve heard that anything that involves the comprehension or usage of universal principle is very expensive. After all, only supreme experts are qualified to be involved in those things.”","“Well, I’ve learned something today.” Jian Wushuang shrugged.","However, he was not in a hurry. After all, his strength was still too weak. He was only at the second level. There were many ways for him to improve his strength. He could improve his ability to use and control the principles of the universe, it was just one of them.","Even if he could not get such a secret manual now, when his strength improved in the future, he would naturally have other ways to get it.","“Let’s continue on our way. It won’t be long before we reach the core Star Field. I wonder if the super force behind the Principle Sea will send experts to contact me there,” Jian Wushuang muttered."]},{"number":4056,"title":"Chapter 4056 - Lord Xiao","paragraphs":["While Jian Wushuang was riding on the universe boat, in the depths of the universe, there were four figures gathered in a towering temple.","Although they were just consciousness incarnations, their every move was enough to suffocate an ordinary Ruler.","There was no doubt that these four were all Ruler-level experts.","“This is news from the Bone Pupil Star Field at the edge of the universe not too long ago. Everyone, take a look.” A white-robed man waved his hand, sending out a message.","“A second-stage Ruler actually managed to pass the fourth level of the Principle Sea? Very impressive.” Someone immediately sighed in praise.","“He isn’t bad at all. In addition, his comprehension of the prime essences of the Dao of the sword is extremely high, even surpassing that of most fifth-tier Rulers. A genius of this level is quite rare,” a bald, old man said.","“Comprehending the prime essences of the Dao of the sword isn’t a big deal. The most important thing is the principles of the universe. After all, comprehending the principles of the universe has a lot to do with one’s level of insight. Some Rulers spend countless years trying to come up with countless methods, but they are still unable to comprehend even a sliver of the principles of the universe. However, as long as one reaches the Ruler level, comprehending the principles of the universe will be much easier. In other words, the lower one’s level of insight is, the more difficult it will be to comprehend the principles of the universe.”","“He’s only a second-tier Ruler, yet his comprehension of the universe principles is already so high. If I’m not wrong, he’s most likely already comprehended a strand of the universe principles at the level of a principle Ruler. He’s one of those supreme geniuses that are rarely seen in trillions of starworlds.” The only purple-robed woman amongst the four said solemnly.","“A principle Ruler is able to comprehend a strand of the universe principles? This Blood Sword is so heaven-defying?” The bald old man revealed a look of shock.","“It’s very possible,” the purple-clothed woman said in a low voice.","“Alright.” The white-clothed man who had spoken at the beginning finally spoke, “There is no doubt about the talent of this Blood Sword, but what we need to decide now is whether or not we should make contact with him. If we do, what conditions must we set?”","Hearing this, the supreme beings present were all silent.","Their force was indeed one of the top super forces in the vast universe. It was not inferior to the Nine Emperor Pavilion at all.","Such a super force also attached great importance to some genius experts with great potential.","A genius like Jian Wushuang had clearly reached the qualification that this super force attached importance to.","However, no matter how much they valued him, they would not throw caution to the wind for a genius.","After all, a genius was just a genius, not a super expert who had fully grown up and had great influence in the universe.","“This Blood Sword is so heaven-defying at the level of a second-level Ruler. Most importantly, he comes from the edge of the universe. Not only is his talent and potential terrifying, but he must have also obtained some great opportunities. Maybe he has obtained some ancient inheritances.”","“And many of these ancient legacies involve some of the major powers in the universe. There might even be enemies of our side. Thus, I suggest that we continue to pay attention to him first, and then think of a way to find out more about him. Once we truly find out more about him, it won’t be too late to make a decision.” The bald old man said.","“Mm, that makes sense.” The violet-robed woman nodded.","“I think we can make appropriate contact first, or we can give him some benefits. We can form a good relationship with him first, and we can talk about the rest later.” The last person said.","The four of them were talking.","But at this time...","Weng! A hazy figure suddenly appeared in the center of the Divine Hall.","The four people in the Divine Hall immediately looked at the person. When they saw the person’s appearance clearly, they were all shocked.","“Lord Xiao!”","“Greetings, Lord Xiao!”","The four supreme-being experts, including the white-robed man with a higher status, all bowed respectfully at the same time.","“I heard that you are discussing the Blood Sword?” The azure-robed old man looked at the four people in front of him.","“Yes.” The white-robed man nodded respectfully.","“I know about the Blood Sword.” The azure-robed old man said, “That Principle Sea in the Bone Pupil Great Star Field happens to be guarded by one of my incarnations.”","The four were immediately stunned.","They had just been curious as to why this Lord Xiao would suddenly come here.","One had to know that although this Lord Xiao was also a supreme-being like them, they were both supreme-beings, and the difference in strength between them was abnormally huge.","If the four of them could only be considered to have a firm foothold amongst the supreme-beings, then this Lord Xiao was without a doubt a supreme expert standing at the pinnacle of the supreme-beings.","Such an expert, in the depths of the universe, was able to open up a large god country by himself. That was the true supreme-being expert of the super force they were in.","Under normal circumstances, the so-called geniuses, no matter how heaven-defying, didn’t have the qualifications to startle such a supreme being.","But now, this Lord Xiao had come personally.","“So, the Principle Sea that the Blood Sword charged through was guarded by Lord Xiao’s incarnation.” The four people were secretly surprised.","“You plan to make contact with that little guy?” The green-clothed old man Lord Xiao looked at the four people in front of him.","“No, the result of our discussion just now is that we won’t make contact with him for the time being. It’s not too late to make contact after we have investigated his background,” the white-clothed man said.","“Is that so?” The carefree man narrowed his eyes slightly, he said, “I don’t care if you guys come into contact with him or not. But this little guy, I think he’s pretty good. He didn’t just pass the fourth level of the Principle Sea. In fact, if it wasn’t for my incarnation personally overseeing the Principle Sea, he might have already passed the fifth level.”","“What?” The white-robed man and the others were all startled.","Pass the fifth level?","The difference between the fourth level and the fifth level of the Principle Sea was enormous.","“If that little fellow only had a simple comprehension of the principles of the universe, he already had the qualifications to pass the fifth level. However, his ability to control the principles of the universe was a bit too crude.”","“In the Principle Sea, I once gave him some guidance, but then I remembered that the secret manual of the principles of the universe was a bit too valuable to a Ruler. If this little fellow had a Ruler behind him, that would be fine, but if it was useless, he would have to wait until he broke through to become an great Ruler before he would have a chance to acquire such a manual.”","“That’s why I came to look for you.” Lord Xiao said indifferently.","The white clothed man and the other three looked at each other. They still did not understand why Lord Xiao had come.","“I’ve chosen a secret manual for this little fellow that is extremely suitable for his universe principles and Sword Dao. When you want to come into contact with him, come look for me and bring that manual to him. Tell him that I gave it to him.”","After saying that, Lord Xiao left.","..."]},{"number":4057,"title":"Chapter 4057 - A Big Favor","paragraphs":["Two hundred years after leaving the Bone Pupil Galaxy, Jian Wushuang arrived at the Pillheart Galaxy.","Not long after arriving at the Pillheart Galaxy, Gui Yun contacted him.","In a dark and boundless void, the universe boat was floating there quietly. In the distance, three figures were rushing over.","The leader of the three was a golden-robed man, and the two people beside him were also wearing long robes.","“My Friend Blood Sword is in the universe boat,” the golden-robed man came to the front of the universe boat and said.","!!","Jian Wushuang immediately walked out of the universe boat.","“It’s me. May I know who you are?” Jian Wushuang asked.","The golden-robed man looked at Jian Wushuang carefully, nodded slightly and said, “My name is three wings. I’m here on behalf of the Divine King Palace.”","“Divine King Palace?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","He immediately understood that the super force behind the Principle Sea should be the Divine King Palace.","He just did not know who was stronger in the Divine King Palace compared to the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","“My friend Blood Sword, you are very talented. You can pass the fourth level of the Principle Sea at the second level. Some of the higher-ups of the Divine King Palace have already noticed you. They sent me here on behalf of the Divine King Palace to have an official contact with you. Secondly, I also brought you a gift.”","With that, the golden-robed man waved his hand and a big silver box appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","The Three Winged Ruler opened the box and Jian Wushuang immediately saw the square-shaped crystal jades inside.","These crystal jades were neatly arranged. At a glance, there must be dozens of them.","“Three Winged Ruler, these crystal jades are?” Jian Wushuang looked puzzled.","“These crystal jades are used to store secret skills and secret manuals in the depths of the universe. There are a total of 36 pieces of crystal jades in this box. All of them add up to a secret manual that combines the use of universe Principles with sword principle, called the Purple Blood Secret Manual.”","“Of course, there are three volumes of the complete Purple Blood Secret Manual. Each volume is divided into three levels. Now, it only gives you the first three levels of the first volume of the Purple Blood Secret Manual,” the Three Winged Ruler said with a smile.","“Purple-blood manual? A manual that combines the universal principle and sword principle?” Jian Wushuang stared at him.","Not long ago, he had asked the Devil Cloud Master and learned that the most common manual for the use of the universal principle was worth 100,000 origin stones.","But now, in the blink of an eye, someone from the Divine King Palace had given him the first volume of a manual that combined the universal principle and sword principle.","“Three Winged Ruler, as far as I know, the Secret Manual of the universal principle is usually very expensive. The first volume of the Purple Blood Secret Manual you brought me should be very valuable, right?” Jian Wushuang asked directly.","“Of course.” Three Winged Ruler nodded with a smile. “To tell you the truth, although I am a Ruler of the ultimate level and come from the Divine King Palace, and I have accumulated some wealth over the years, all of my wealth added up is probably only worth a little bit of the first volume of the Purple Blood Secret Manual.”","“Blood Sword, my young friend, you might not know this, but in the universe, even the most ordinary methods of using the universe principles are extremely valuable. It is simply not something an ordinary Ruler can afford. Furthermore, combining the Sword Dao with the secret manual of using the universe principles is even more valuable. And now, I have brought you the violet-blood manual. It is one of the publicly acknowledged three most powerful manuals of the Sword Dao and the use of the universe principles in the vast universe.”","“The creator of the violet-blood manual was a supreme expert who stood at the very top of the universe. His understanding of the Dao of the sword and his understanding of the principles of the universe were both at the peak of perfection. The combination of the two allowed him to rise to the top of the universe. If he had left behind a complete copy of the violet-blood manual, even a Supreme Ruler would have valued it. Now, however, he has only brought you the first volume, which is better.”","“However, even if it’s just the first volume of the Purple Blood Secret Manual, it’s still worth a million universe origin stones.”","Hearing the words of the Three Winged Ruler, Jian Wushuang was a little stunned.","It was worth a million universe origin stones?","A million universe origin stones should be a considerable amount of wealth even for an expert at the supreme-being level.","Some weaker or poorer supreme-beings were only worth about a million universe origin stones.","In other words, the first volume of the Purple Blood Secret Manual was worth more than the wealth of the poorer supreme-beings.","“Three Winged Ruler, the first volume of the Purple Blood Secret Manual is too valuable. I’m afraid I can’t accept it.” Jian Wushuang said seriously.","Although the first volume of the Purple Blood Secret Manual was very useful to him, he did not deny that he was not eager to get it.","However, he also knew that there was no such thing as a free lunch in this world. He had not given anything. He had only shown some talent, so how could he accept such a precious gift?","“Young friend, you don’t accept it, but are you worried that the Divine King Palace will make some requests to you?” The Three Winged Ruler looked at Jian Wushuang with a smile.","Jian Wushuang did not answer, but he tacitly agreed.","“Haha, don’t worry, my friend. To be honest, although your talent is incredible and you have attracted the attention of some high-level experts of my palace, it’s not enough to ask my palace to directly take out a million origin stones worth of the Purple Blood Secret Manual to recruit you. The gift I brought today is actually not directly given by my palace, but a personal gift from a Lord in my palace,” the Three Winged Ruler said with a smile.","“A personal gift? May I know who it is?” Jian Wushuang asked with a frown.","“It’s Lord Xiao. He’s one of the highest-ranking members of the Divine King Palace. His strength is among the top experts in the palace, and his status is much higher than most supreme-beings,” the Three Winged Ruler said.","“Lord Xiao? I’ve never met him, and I don’t think he has any connection with me. Why would he give me the first volume of the Purple Blood Secret Manual?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“My friend, it’s not like you don’t have any connection with him. Have you forgotten that he was the guardian of the Principle Sea in the Bone Pupil Galaxy? That Principle Sea is the guardian of Xiao Yao’s consciousness avatar. I’ve also heard that he has given you some guidance in the Principle Sea,” the Three Winged Ruler said.","“It’s him?” Jian Wushuang was stunned, then he understood.","In the Principle Sea, the cyan-robed elder told him that he was too rough in the use of the universal principles, so he did give him some pointers.","But before, Lord Xiao only gave him some casual pointers, but now, he gave him such a precious gift.","This is a huge favor."]},{"number":4058,"title":"Chapter 4058 - The Purple-Blood Secret Manual","paragraphs":["“My friend Blood Sword, Lord Xiao asked us to bring the first volume of the Purple Blood Secret Manual to you. He also asked me to tell you that he looks forward to your growth,” the Three Winged Ruler said with a smile.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang looked strange, but he began to hesitate in his heart.","If the first volume of the Purple Blood Secret Manual was given to him by the Divine King Palace, Jian Wushuang would not accept it.","But now it was a personal gift from Lord Xiao...","It would be fine if he did not have any relationship with Lord Xiao, but in fact, he had already received guidance from Lord Xiao when he was in the Principle Sea. It could be said that he had already received a favor from Lord Xiao.","!!","Now, Lord Xiao had only done him a great favor, and it was obvious that Lord Xiao had given him a gift on a whim. He had not expected Lord Xiao to repay him in the future.","After all, the Three Winged Ruler had said that Lord Xiao was one of the most powerful figures in the divine imperial palace. He was extremely powerful even amongst Rulers, and was very likely a supreme-being.","Although he was talented, he was still very weak. How could a supreme-being like Lord Xiao seek his reward?","“In that case, please thank Lord Xiao for me,” Jian Wushuang said.","It was obvious that he had accepted the gift.","“That’s more like it,” the Three Winged Ruler said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang also smiled faintly, in his heart, he thought, “Anyway, I’ve already owed Lord Xiao a favor in the Principle Sea. Now, I just owe him an even bigger favor. If I can break through to the supreme-being level and reach the top of the vast universe, I’ll find a way to repay it. But if I can’t reach that level, then I have no other choice.”","“Blood Sword, the first volume of the Purple Blood Secret Manual has been given to you. The three of us will take our leave now,” the Three Winged Ruler said.","“Thank you,” Jian Wushuang thanked him.","Soon, the Three Winged Ruler left, and Jian Wushuang returned to the universe boat.","As soon as he returned to the universe boat, Leng Rushuang and Devil Flame immediately came up to him.","“Husband, what did the Ruler just say to you?” Leng Rushuang asked.","Jian Wushuang briefly recounted what he had just said to the Three Winged Ruler.","After hearing it, both Leng Rushuang and Devil Flame were a little dumbfounded.","“The Purple Blood Secret Manual, a secret manual calculated by millions of origin stones?” Leng Rushuang was extremely shocked.","“A million universe origin stones, the wealth of an expert at the supreme level, is nothing more than that,” Devil Flame added.","“The value is amazing, and it’s a personal gift from Lord Xiao. I have no reason to refuse it,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Ruler, you don’t have to refuse. There are countless experts in the vast universe, but how many of them haven’t received favors from others during their rise to power? Who Hasn’t received help from others? There are some who have grown up on their own and have no friends, but how many of them have?”","“Besides, Lord Xiao is just looking forward to your growth and helping you. It’s a favor, but if you grow up in the future, you can return it to him,” Devil Flame said.","“I think so too.” Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Let’s not talk about it. I’ll study the Purple Blood Secret Manual first.”","...","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in a secret chamber in the universe boat. In front of him was the big box, in which 36 square crystal jades were placed neatly.","Jian Wushuang picked up the first crystal jade.","As his consciousness sank in, a vast message was transmitted to Jian Wushuang in an instant.","The message of the first crystal jade was not the combination of the universe principle and the sword principle origin, but just some basic use of the universe principle. Even so, Jian Wushuang’s head buzzed, it was as if he had entered a brand new world in an instant.","Indeed, as he received the information of the first crystal jade, a brand new door was placed in front of him.","It should be known that he did not know anything about the use of the universal principle before. He only knew how to integrate the universal principle into his attacks and increase the power of his attacks.","But now, even the most superficial and simple use of the universe principles was enough for Jian Wushuang to gain enlightenment.","Time passed. After a full hour, Jian Wushuang finally received all the information in the first crystal jade.","But after receiving it, his mind became confused.","“This is only the first crystal jade, but I can only understand the information at the beginning. I can’t immediately use the principles after that.” Jian Wushuang shook his head, then he began to receive the second crystal jade’s information.","The second crystal jade contained even more information. It was only at this point that he began to talk about the combination of universal principles and sword principle.","“It’s actually a cover-up?” Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes.","“I always thought that the combination of universal principles and sword principle should have a primary and secondary distinction. If it’s not dominated by the universal principles or sword principle, in fact, the universal principles and sword principle are controlled by one’s own consciousness. The universal principles are profound and unfathomable, and the level of comprehension is like the number of an army. The same is true for sword principle, but one’s own consciousness is definitely the absolute soul and the existence of a general.”","“Consciousness dominates the universal principle, and comprehension of sword principle is a perfect combination.”","With a smile on his face, Jian Wushuang continued to accept and comprehend.","There were three volumes of the Purple Blood Secret Manual. Each volume had a total of 36 crystal jades, and 12 of them were in the first realm. In other words, the creator of the Purple Blood Secret Manual...the combination of sword principle and universal principle was divided into nine realms. Jian Wushuang needed to completely comprehend the information in the first 12 crystal jades in order to reach the first realm.","But in fact, Jian Wushuang was so confused that he could not comprehend the first piece of crystal jades, let alone the other ones.","However, what surprised Jian Wushuang was that the use of universal principle and sword principle were divided in detail by the pieces of crystal jades in the Purple Blood Secret Manual. It could be said that the whole process of using universal principle and sword principle were combined, it was a complete analysis.","This made it much easier for Jian Wushuang to understand and comprehend.","It was also much easier to get started.","For example, it only took Jian Wushuang 30 years to completely comprehend the first crystal jade.","Then he continued to comprehend the second crystal jade. The second crystal jade took much longer than the first one, but it took less than 200 years.","The third crystal jade took Jian Wushuang 600 years —","In a flash, another 30,000 years passed.","..."]},{"number":4059,"title":"Chapter 4059 - Slaughter","paragraphs":["Long Chenxing River, a Galaxy that was wider than the Purple Micro Galaxy, had more intersecting Star Fields, and was more chaotic.","There were also a large number of space pirates in long Chenxing River, and they were more powerful. There were many fourth-level and fifth-level space pirates. There were even rumors that there were even ultimate level space pirates in long Chenxing River.","In the Galaxy.","“Kill him!”","“It’s already good enough that we don’t kill a second-level space Ruler. How dare he provoke us?”","!!","“He’s courting death!”","Hundreds of space pirates charged at a black-clothed man in front of the Galaxy like wasps.","The black-clothed man held a sword in one hand, and his figure directly materialized.","He appeared among the space pirates like a ghost.","Chi! Chi! Chi! Chi!","Sword shadows seemed to fly out casually. These sword shadows weren’t very powerful, but they were very mysterious.","The sword shadows easily slashed onto the bodies of the space pirates. The weaker first-level or second-level Rulers could not withstand one sword attack, and they were killed, even the protective armor on the surface of their bodies was torn apart easily.","Even the third-level Ruler’s true treasure armor was torn apart with a single sword attack, and his godly power was instantly annihilated.","Although this black-clothed man was only a second-level Ruler, and the power of his godly power was only at the peak of the second-level, the third-level Rulers could not withstand the sword techniques he displayed.","The slaughter was completely one-sided.","More than a hundred space pirates had been slaughtered in just a few breaths, and only a few of them had fled back when they saw that the situation was not good.","And at this time...","Buzz! Buzz! Buzz! Buzz!","Four strong auras suddenly swept over from the distant void. These four people were three men and one woman, and the auras on their bodies were all at the fourth-level Ruler level.","“Leader!”","“Leader!”","Seeing the appearance of the four people, the space pirates who were lucky enough to survive screamed miserably as if they had seen their savior.","These four people were the leaders of this group of space pirates.","In Chenxing River, even a small space pirate gang had a fourth-level dominator overseeing them. Now, there were four fourth-level Dominators in this space pirate gang.","“A second-level Ruler killed so many of us?”","“He is only a second-level Ruler, and his divine power is only at the second level, but his swordsmanship can’t even stop a third-level Ruler?”","“His divine sword in the water should be a medium-grade principle treasure, and it can even tear the supreme true treasure armor.”","The four leaders stared at Jian Wushuang with cold eyes. Their eyes were filled with killing intent.","“Four fourth-level Rulers? That’s going to take some effort.” Jian Wushuang looked up at the four leaders with a smile on his face.","It was a clear smile.","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang moved and easily appeared in front of the four leaders as if he had teleported.","“Be careful!”","The four leaders were shocked because Jian Wushuang’s speed was very fast.","However, before they could react, Jian Wushuang had already struck.","Whoosh!","It was a very ordinary and casual strike.","In the eyes of the four fourth-level Rulers, this strike was very slow and soft, as if it contained no power at all,","even an ordinary Principle Ruler might be able to dodge such a slow sword move, let alone a Ruler.","However, when the four leaders saw Jian Wushuang’s sword move and were ready to counterattack, they were horrified to find that they could not move.","It was not that they could not move, but that they were too slow,","they were as slow as snails, so slow that they could not dodge or block Jian Wushuang’s sword light.","“It’s not that we are too slow, but his swordsmanship is too fast!” This thought immediately appeared in the minds of the four leaders.","They widened their eyes and watched as the slow and soft sword light slashed at their necks at the same time, the power of the true treasure armor on their bodies had been fully activated, protecting their entire bodies.","However, when the sword light slashed toward them, the supreme-tier true treasure armor on their bodies was torn apart like a piece of paper by the sword light.","The power of the sword light did not decrease, and it continued to slash toward their godly bodies.","Chi! Chi! Chi! Chi!","The sound of the sword cutting into their bodies could be heard, and four huge heads were sent flying at the same time.","The four leaders’ eyes were still filled with fear and disbelief, they did not believe that a second-level Ruler could kill them with only one sword attack. Even their true treasures, armor, and undying bodies were useless against this sword attack.","“The leader is dead?”","“He killed four leaders with one sword strike?”","“Run!”","Those space pirates who were lucky enough to survive were even more terrified. They were scared out of their wits and began to flee frantically.","Jian Wushuang did not chase after them anymore, buzz! The ancient universe boat stopped in the void around Jian Wushuang. Leng Rushuang and Devil Flame walked out of the universe boat.","“Husband, your strength has improved a lot compared to 30,000 years ago,” Leng Rushuang said with a smile.","“You only used the divine power of a second-level Ruler and killed four fourth-level Rulers with one sword attack. Ruler, your strength...” Devil Flame was also amazed.","Jian Wushuang just smiled faintly.","It was not a big deal to kill four fourth-level Rulers with the combat strength of a second-level Ruler. After all, Jian Wushuang already had the combat strength of a fifth-level Ruler since a long time ago in the Purple Micro Galaxy, he had even killed a fifth-level Ruler, Thunder Star Lord.","However, the reason why Jian Wushuang had such battle strength was that his divine power was very strong. It was comparable to the divine power of a third-level Ruler, plus the power of the will given by the universal principles, he also had two secret skills, life divine power and heaven-cleaving skill. This made him as powerful as any fourth-level Ruler.","But this time, whether it was killing the space pirates or killing the four fourth-level Rulers, his divine power was controlled at the second-level, he did not use the power of the will given by the universe principles.","In other words, he killed the four fourth-level Rulers with the power of an ordinary second-level Ruler, relying solely on his swordsmanship and his comprehension and application of the universe principles.","If it had been 30,000 years ago, Jian Wushuang would not have been able to do this. However, over the years, as he comprehended the Purple Blood Secret Manual, his application of the universe principles continued to improve. Combined with his swordsmanship, he was able to display his own swordsmanship, it was several times more exquisite and terrifying than before, or even nearly ten times more.","That was how he was able to do this."]},{"number":4060,"title":"Chapter 4060 - Darkness","paragraphs":["“Husband, have you completely mastered the first level of the Purple Blood Secret Manual?” Leng Rushuang asked.","“How could it be so easy?” Jian Wushuang shook his head and smiled.","The first level of the first three levels of the first volume of the Purple Blood Secret Manual required him to completely comprehend the first 12 pieces of crystal jade. In the past 30,000 years, Jian Wushuang had already comprehended the first 10 pieces of crystal jade.","He was very close to completely comprehending the 11th piece of crystal jade, but he was still far from comprehending the 12th piece of crystal jade.","“However, this Purple Blood Secret Manual is indeed amazing. I have only comprehended the first 10 pieces of crystal jade, and my application of the universe principles is still at the basic stage. However, the combination of the use of the universe principles and swordsmanship has made my swordsmanship several times or even nearly 10 times more exquisite than before, and the power is much stronger.","!!","“In addition, my application of the universal principles has improved, and my Rulery of the Wuqi Divine Sword has reached a whole new level.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were shining with a bright light.","The Wuqi Divine Sword was an upper-grade Principle Supreme Treasure, and even a supreme-being would attach great importance to such a Principle Supreme Treasure.","Previously, although Jian Wushuang had comprehended the universal principles, he could only exert a little of the power of the Wuqi Divine Sword. But now, with the improvement of his comprehension of the universal principles...the most important thing was that he could use the universe principles more deeply, so he could exert the power of the Wuqi Divine Sword even more.","Because of this, when he fought with the space pirates, the Wuqi Divine Sword slashed at his opponent’s divine body. The armor on his opponent’s body could not withstand it at all. It either collapsed or was torn apart.","The armor was only at the supreme treasure level, so it could not withstand the attack of an upper-grade principle treasure.","“My use of the universe principle is still very low. When I completely comprehend the first 12 pieces of crystal jade and reach the first stage of the Purple Blood Secret Manual, my strength will probably increase greatly,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","Of course, he also knew that he was still a distance away from that step.","“Let’s continue to explore. There are countless space pirates and experts in the Chenxing River. It’s a good opportunity for me to use it as a training ground,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","The universe boat continued to fly toward the end of the Galaxy.","There were countless space pirates in long Chenxing River, and Jian Wushuang completely regarded them as his opponents to gain experience.","Every time he encountered a group of space pirates, he would directly kill them and defeat them head-on.","Moreover, when those space pirates fought, Jian Wushuang would not directly reveal his strongest strength. Instead, he would deliberately maintain the power of his divine power and use the strength of a second-level Ruler, he would rely on his swordsmanship and the use of universal principles to fight the pirates.","Even so, ordinary pirate gangs could not stop Jian Wushuang. He could easily kill a fourth-level Ruler.","Soon, another 200 years passed.","In the Chenxing River, a bald elder stood in front of Jian Wushuang. Around them were a large number of pirate corpses.","These space pirates had just been mercilessly slaughtered by Jian Wushuang.","But because of the slaughter, the bald elder was lured out.","“You are Blood Sword?” The bald elder stared at Jian Wushuang with a cold gaze.","Blood Sword was Jian Wushuang’s name.","In the past few hundred years, Blood Sword’s name had been very well-known in the Chenxing River.","The reason was that Jian Wushuang had killed countless pirates in the last few hundred years, and many pirate forces had also been wiped out by him, moreover, he took the universe boat and took the initiative to kill the pirates time and time again.","The pirates in the Star River were not stupid. Under normal circumstances, they did not dare to provoke the universe boat. As long as the pirates did not take the initiative to provoke them, the experts in the universe boat could not be bothered with these space pirates.","However, this Blood Sword was different. Even if the space pirates did not take the initiative to provoke them, he would still go directly to their door and slaughter them without any reason. This kind of behavior...was obviously treating those space pirates as trial stones.","Most importantly, he himself was only a second-tier Ruler.","It was difficult for him not to attract attention in long Chenxing River.","“Who are you?” Jian Wushuang also looked at the bald elder.","“Elder Mo Hong,” the bald elder said.","“Sorry, I’ve never heard of him,” Jian Wushuang said.","“It’s okay if you’ve never heard of him. You just need to remember this name, because you’ll die at his hands soon,” Elder Mo Hong said.","“Oh? You’re very confident?” Jian Wushuang gave a strange smile.","“Humph.” The bald elder snorted and waved his hand. Hum Hum Hum. Streams of black light rapidly condensed in front of him, and in the blink of an eye, they formed a three-meter-long black magic sword.","As soon as the black magic sword was formed, a vast black power burst out. The entire Galaxy was covered by the dark power, and it became completely dark.","“Sword formation?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","“A fifth-level Ruler, seeing me use the sword formation without saying anything, you really think highly of me.”Jian Wushuang smiled lightly, and the Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand, there was also a strong aura rising from his body.","After all, his opponent was a genuine fifth-level Ruler. It was impossible for Jian Wushuang to deliberately hide his strength and preserve the power of his divine power like before. At the beginning, Jian Wushuang planned to attack with all his strength.","However, the moment the black divine sword took shape and shot toward him.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils suddenly constricted.","He stared at the black divine sword that was rushing toward him. The black divine sword contained the most concentrated power of the dark principles. The entire sword formation was dominated by the dark Principles and supplemented by the other principles, they complemented each other.","However, Jian Wushuang saw some very subtle things in the black magic sword.","These things were not eye-catching, but Jian Wushuang noticed them.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang gained some understanding in his mind.","“Is that so?”","“Darkness, essence, details...”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with ecstasy.","However, even though he was ecstatic, the black divine sword did not show any mercy. The endless darkness brought with it an extremely sharp power that enveloped Jian Wushuang in the blink of an eye.","Boom!","With a violent roar, a large amount of dark air and sword essence scattered crazily.","In the endless darkness, whoosh! A figure rushed out.","This figure was Jian Wushuang, who had been pushed back by the black divine sword. At this moment, although he was in a sorry state, his aura did not weaken at all.","The ecstasy in his eyes did not weaken at all. Instead, it was even more intense!","..."]},{"number":4061,"title":"Chapter 4061 - The Third Level","paragraphs":["“I see. What I was missing was just a trace of the essence of the principle of darkness.” Jian Wushuang was very excited.","“Principle of darkness, merge!”","A large amount of principle power rose from Jian Wushuang’s body, which contained a strong principle of darkness. In the blink of an eye, the Principle power merged perfectly.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s body trembled, and his divine body and divine power began to transform.","“Huh?”","!!","Elder Mo Hong stood in the void in front of Jian Wushuang. The black divine sword was still hovering in front of him with a shocking aura. However, Elder Mo Hong frowned at this moment.","“My attack just now didn’t hurt him, and his aura...” Elder Mo Hong was a fifth-level Ruler, so his perception was very sharp, he could tell at a glance that Jian Wushuang was different from before.","The divine power aura he emitted was much stronger than before.","“Has he made a breakthrough?” Elder Mo Hong asked in a low voice.","Indeed, Jian Wushuang’s aura had reached the third-level Ruler level.","After comprehending the divine will of the Divine Beginning Realm for tens of thousands of years, Jian Wushuang had finally fused the sixth Principle of darkness perfectly, and his realm had also risen to the third-level smoothly.","“Husband!”","“Ruler!”","In the universe boat not far away in the void, Leng Rushuang and Devil Flame, who had been watching the scene, also noticed the changes in Jian Wushuang and could not help but be overjoyed.","“Elder Mo Hong, I have to thank you. If it weren’t for the Dark Sword Formation you just displayed, it would have taken me a lot of time to fuse the sixth principle.” Jian Wushuang looked at Elder Mo Hong with a smile.","“Humph, so what if you’ve made a breakthrough? You’ll still die!” Elder Mo Hong snorted. The black magic sword that was floating quietly in front of him once again appeared in front of Jian Wushuang like a phantom.","An extremely powerful and sharp aura was transmitted over. The power of the black magic sword was obviously stronger than before.","Jian Wushuang smiled. He had already made a breakthrough, so he did not want to waste any more time with Elder Mo Hong.","He raised the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand and poured a vast amount of divine power into the divine sword.","Although he was a third-level Ruler, his divine power was already at the fourth-level because of his perfect life level. In addition to the power of his will, which was given by the universal principle, as well as his life divine power and heaven-cleaving skill, Jian Wushuang’s sword was no weaker than any fifth-level Ruler in terms of divine power.","In other words, Jian Wushuang was also using the divine power of a fifth-level Ruler to perform this sword.","However, Jian Wushuang had comprehended the universal principle and could even combine it with his own swordsmanship, which was unimaginable for a fifth-level Ruler.","Therefore, a funny scene appeared.","Jian Wushuang raised the longsword in his hand and simply swung it. He did not display any extraordinary swordsmanship, but just casually swung the sword and hacked.","It felt like an adult was teaching his child a lesson. It was very simple.","“Arrogant!” Even Elder Mo Hong could not help but feel shocked and angry.","However, when the Wuqi Divine Sword struck the black divine sword, a terrifying power burst out.","The Black Divine Sword Formation, which was controlled by Elder Mo Hong, the fifth-level Ruler, collapsed immediately and turned into a black light.","Jian Wushuang’s sword continued to strike Elder Mo Hong.","“How is this possible?” Elder Mo Hong stared at Jian Wushuang, but the sword light had already struck him.","Elder Mo Hong’s body was also protected by the Supreme Treasure armor. However, after the sword light struck him, his supreme treasure armor shook slightly and did not show any damage, however, most of the power of the sword light passed through the armor and directly reached Elder Mo Hong’s divine body.","The power was ridiculously strong, and Elder Mo Hong’s own divine body was not very strong, which caused his divine body to be smashed into a bloody mist at this moment.","Buzz!","In just a moment, Elder Mo Hong’s divine body was reassembled again.","However, after reassembling, he did not even look at Jian Wushuang. Instead, a large amount of black light immediately emerged from his body. He turned into a black graceful and fled frantically toward the void behind him at an astonishing speed.","Elder Mo Hong had escaped!","He had no choice but to flee.","The terrifying strength Jian Wushuang displayed with just one strike had completely frightened him.","“70%!”","“70% of my divine power has been destroyed in an instant!”","Elder Mo Hong’s body and mind were trembling as he fled.","Jian Wushuang’s simple and crude strike, which looked like an adult bullying a child, not only destroyed his sword formation in an instant, but also hit his divine body, causing it to explode, it also destroyed 70% of his divine power.","How powerful was this sword attack? Mo Hong did not know, but he knew that if he used that sword attack again, he would definitely die.","Therefore, he could only flee frantically.","Seeing him flee, Jian Wushuang did not chase after him.","“Since you helped me break through, I’ll spare your life.” Jian Wushuang’s voice sounded in Mo Hong’s ear.","Elder Mo Hong heaved a sigh of relief, but he still fled the void as fast as he could and soon disappeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Buzz!” The ancient universe boat arrived in front of Jian Wushuang. Jian Wushuang rushed into the universe boat.","“Husband, congratulations,” Leng Rushuang said with a smile.","“Master, congratulations,” Devil Flame said.","“Haha!” Jian Wushuang laughed heartily. He was also very happy.","It was a huge leap for him to become a third-level Ruler after integrating the sixth principle.","His strength would naturally undergo an earth-shaking change.","His divine power alone had improved a lot. As his realm became higher and higher, his speed of comprehending sword principle and universe principles would be much faster.","“Ruler, you were able to kill a fifth-level Ruler at the second level. Now that you have not only obtained the first volume of the Purple Blood Secret Manual, but also reached the third level, you should be invincible among the fifth-level Rulers, right?” Devil Flame looked at him.","“I don’t know if there are any invincible among the fifth-level Rulers. But I dare say that in the entire universe, only a few fifth-level Rulers are stronger than me, except for those who have a huge innate advantage like me or have heaven-defying opportunities,” Jian Wushuang said confidently."]},{"number":4062,"title":"Chapter 4062 - Arrived in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy","paragraphs":["“In the entire vast universe, except for those who have a huge innate advantage like me or have heaven-defying opportunities, there should be very few fifth-level Rulers who are stronger than me.”","Under normal circumstances, this sentence from a third-level Ruler was enough to cause countless cultivators to despise and snort in disdain.","However, Jian Wushuang was indeed confident.","Now that he had broken through to the third-level Ruler, his divine power was no weaker than an ordinary fifth-level Ruler because of the power of his will.","In other words, he was on par with a fifth-level Ruler in terms of basic level. The only difference was that he did not fuse so many principles of heaven and earth.","!!","However, Jian Wushuang’s advantage in the universe principles was too great!","The universe principles were unattainable among the countless Rulers in the vast universe.","There were countless Rulers in the vast universe, but those who could truly comprehend the universe principles at the Ruler level were as rare as Phoenix feathers and unicorn horns. “...”","Once a Ruler comprehended the universe principles, he would have a much greater advantage compared to other Rulers.","However, Jian Wushuang had not only comprehended a trace of the universe principles, but his comprehension of the universe principles had also reached a certain level. When he was in the Bone Pupil Star Field, he was already able to pass the first four levels of the Principle Sea, later, he obtained the Purple Blood Secret Manual, which greatly improved his use of the universe principles and combined it with sword principle. He definitely had the strength to pass the fifth level of the Principle Sea.","His comprehension of the universe principles at this level was no less than that of an ordinary supreme-being.","Under such circumstances, he could naturally crush many fifth-level Rulers with the help of the universe principles.","For example, the Star Lord Devil Cloud who controlled the dark divine sword formation was very powerful. He was not the weakest among the fifth-level Rulers, but was extremely powerful. However, against such a Ruler...Jian Wushuang had indeed destroyed him with a casual sword attack. He did not even use his swordsmanship.","His strength had far surpassed that of a fifth-level Ruler. In addition, he had many trump cards. If he used all his strength, he was confident that he could fight against even an ultimate level Ruler.","Because of this, Jian Wushuang dared to say that there were not many fifth-level Rulers in the vast universe who were stronger than him.","Of course, those who had great innate advantages or had great backgrounds and had obtained heaven-defying opportunities were exceptions.","“After reaching the third-level Ruler level, whether I’m comprehending the Purple Blood Secret Manual, the principles of the universe, or the sword principle, I’ve improved a lot compared to before. I’m confident that I can reach the first level of the Purple Blood Secret Manual within 20,000 years. By then, my strength will improve a lot. I don’t need to continue killing in the Chenxing River anymore. I’d better hurry to the Nine Luminaries Galaxy,” Jian Wushuang said.","He passed by the Chenxing River. The reason why he took the initiative to find trouble with the space pirates and kill them in the Chenxing River was to hone his swordsmanship and use of the universal principles, he wanted to comprehend the first 12 crystals of the Purple Blood Secret Manual and reach the first realm of the Purple Blood Secret Manual before he arrived in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy.","After all, his Ruler, Xuan Yi, was put on a bounty in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy by a big force with an Ultimate Ruler behind him.","If Jian Wushuang wanted to help his Ruler, he naturally needed enough strength. He did not have enough strength, so he did not hesitate to spend more time on the way to find ways to improve his strength. But now that he had made a breakthrough in his realm...and he was confident that he could reach the first stage of the Purple Blood Secret Manual before reaching the Nine Luminaries Star Field, there was no need to waste time on the way.","In the long Chenxing River, the universe boat began to travel at a faster speed.","Traveling in the dark void of the universe was extremely long and boring.","But experts had to endure loneliness.","Jian Wushuang had his wife accompanying him, so he was in a better mood.","In a flash, another 74,000 years had passed!","Including the time that Jian Wushuang had traveled, he had traveled for nearly 100,000 years!","During this time, Jian Wushuang had passed through countless Star Fields, including four galaxies in the universe. Now, he had finally arrived at the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field!","On the way here, Jian Wushuang had already understood a lot of information about the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field.","Although the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field was also a Great Star Field, it was much more powerful than the Bone Pupil Great Star Field that he had stayed in before.","The Bone Pupil Grand Starfield only had two grade one starfields, and the strongest were only two ultimate level Rulers. As for the Nine Luminaries Grand Starfield, because it was closer to the depths of the universe, it had a total of eight grade one starfields!","In addition, the Nine Luminaries Grand Starfield had existed for an extremely long time, at least much older than the Bone Pupil Grand Starfield.","For example, the Bone Pupil Great Star Field had two level one star worlds that were born from the universe. Before these two level one star worlds were born, no other level one star worlds had appeared in the Bone Pupil Great Star Field, although the true experts were the Golden Feather Star Lord and the Green Flame Star Lord.","However, although the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field only had eight level one star worlds, before these eight level one star worlds, there were already quite a number of level one star worlds that had reached the end of their lifespans and had collapsed on their own. Moreover, there were quite a number of them.","Although the astral worlds had been destroyed, the experts who stood at the peak of the astral worlds were able to survive. Some of those experts had gone into the depths of the universe to explore, while others had continued to stay, this had resulted in an extremely large number of experts in the Nine Luminaries Great Starfield.","For example, there were more than twenty ultimate level Rulers in the entire Nine Luminaries Great Starfield. There were even rumors that there were supreme experts hidden within the Nine Luminaries Great Starfield.","Of course, very few people knew whether or not there were supreme-beings hidden within the Nine Luminaries Great Starfield. After all, it had been many years since a supreme-being had appeared in the Nine Luminaries Great Starfield.","And the Nine Luminaries Great Starfield was publicly acknowledged to be the strongest not because of the eight first-class starfields, but because of the four most powerful forces.","For example, the Thunder God Palace, which had placed a bounty on his Ruler, Xuan Yi, was one of the four most powerful forces. It had a deep foundation, and its overall strength was extremely tyrannical. For example, there were three known Supreme-level Rulers in the Thunder God Palace!","One of them, the current Palace Ruler of the palace, was said to be at the top even among ultimate level Rulers.","In such a large Star Field with many experts, even though Jian Wushuang’s strength had improved a lot, he had completely comprehended the first 12 pieces of the Purple Blood Secret Manual and reached the first stage of the Purple Blood Secret Manual, however, Jian Wushuang still felt tremendous pressure in the face of the Thunder God Palace.","..."]},{"number":4063,"title":"Chapter 4063 - The Bounty Was Gone","paragraphs":["In the Nine Emperor Pavilion in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy.","“Hello, Blood Sword. I’m Feixue, one of the supervisors of the Nine Emperor Pavilion in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy.” A graceful and beautiful woman stood in front of Jian Wushuang with a gentle smile.","Although Jian Wushuang was only a third-level Ruler, he was ranked on the Nine Emperor List. No matter which Galaxy he went to, the supervisor would receive him personally.","“Supervisor Feixue, I need the treasures on this list.” Jian Wushuang took out the list of treasures he had prepared a long time ago.","This list of treasures was naturally the list of treasures needed to cultivate the fourth level of the Supreme-level undying celestial body.","!!","The beautiful woman Feixue took the list and glanced at it briefly, she nodded slightly. “Blood Sword, my friend, the treasures you want are all available in the Nine Luminaries Star Field. If you need them now, I can try my best to send them all to you within ten days. However, the treasures on this list are extraordinary. I estimated that they are about 8,300 universe origin stones. But you are a friend of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, so you only need 8,000 universe origin stones.”","“Within ten days?” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","In the past, the Purple Micro Galaxy was only a medium-sized Star Field. It would take the manager of the Purple Micro Galaxy, Ballmer, thousands of years to collect all these treasures. However, in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field, it only took ten days to collect them.","From this, it could be seen that there was a huge gap between a large Star Field and a medium-sized Star Field.","“This is 8,000 universe origin stones.” Jian Wushuang took out an interspatial ring.","There were indeed 8,000 universe origin stones in the interspatial ring. They were accumulated by Jian Wushuang after killing Thunder Star Lord in the Purple Micro Galaxy and countless star pirate experts in the past 100,000 years.","In terms of wealth, Jian Wushuang’s current wealth was not inferior to those of ordinary Ultimate Rulers. Even if he took out 8,000 universe origin stones now, he still had all kinds of treasures worth thousands of universe origin stones, this did not include the 1,000 universe origin stones and a drop of special venom that he got from Nine Whiskers.","“Don’t worry, Blood Sword. I will personally deliver the treasures on this list to you within ten days,” Feixue said with a smile.","“Supervisor Feixue, apart from these treasures, I also want to ask you about something,” Jian Wushuang said.","“You are on the Nine Emperor List, so you are qualified to receive the information in the Nine Emperor Pavilion. As long as it’s within my jurisdiction, I can answer whatever you ask,” Feixue said with a smile.","“I want to ask about the bounty issued by the Thunder God Palace more than 100,000 years ago,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Bounty?” Feixue was stunned, but she immediately reacted. “You mean the Thunder God Palace paid a great price to reward Xuan Yi?”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded, “I want to know what’s going on with this bounty.”","“Blood Sword, I know about this bounty. After all, when the Thunder God Palace issued this bounty, because the price was very high, just by providing the information and location of the other party, you could get a reward of 100 origin stones. If you captured or killed the other party, you could get a middle-grade principle treasure and 500 universe origin stones. Such a high bounty caused a great sensation in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field. Many fourth-level and fifth-level Rulers were moved by it.”","“But as far as I know, although this bounty has caused a lot of commotion and many experts have paid attention to it, I haven’t heard of anyone who has received the bounty on this bounty,” Feixue said.","“No one has received the bounty?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","No one had received the bounty, which meant that no one had found the location of his Ruler.","“In other words, the person on the bounty should still be alive,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Not necessarily.” Feixue shook her head and said, “Blood Sword, I’m afraid you don’t know that more than 3,000 years ago, the Thunder God Palace suddenly revoked the bounty.”","“Revoked?” Jian Wushuang was stunned. “Why did they revoke it?”","“Well...” Feixue paused for a moment, then she continued, “Under normal circumstances, an Ruler force like Thunder God Palace in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy would not give up so easily since they had decided to reward the other party. But now, they suddenly revoked the bounty. There are only two possibilities.”","“One is that they knew that the other party had long fled outside the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, or even fled to a territory far away from it. Thunder God Palace is the absolute Ruler in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, but its force can not touch some distant territories. Naturally, they could not do anything to the other party, so they withdrew the bounty.”","“The other possibility is that the person has been found by the people of the Thunder God Palace and killed. Since he is dead, there is no need for the bounty to exist.”","Jian Wushuang’s face turned ugly when he heard Feixue’s words.","He knew that Feixue was telling the truth. There were only two possibilities for the Thunder God Palace to suddenly revoke the bounty.","It would have been fine if it was the first, but if it was the second...Jian Wushuang clenched his hands tightly, his eyes turning extremely cold.","“The intelligence ability of the Nine Emperor Pavilion is amazing. Is there any way to confirm which one it is for me?” Jian Wushuang looked at Feixue and asked.","“I’m afraid it won’t be easy.” Feixue shook her head. “Blood Sword, as far as I know, the conflict between Xuan Yi and the Thunder God Palace is very intense. It can be said that the entire Thunder God Palace is furious. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have made such a big fuss. At first, it was very big, but later, when the Thunder God Palace withdrew the bounty, they kept a very low profile. It didn’t even cause much of a stir in the Nine Luminaries Star Field. The Thunder God Palace never mentioned the bounty to the outside world again.”","“The Nine Emperor Pavilion knows that you take this bounty very seriously. We’ve asked around, but we haven’t received any reply. If I’m not wrong, the highest level of the Thunder God Palace must have issued a gag order.”","“Gag order?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","Even the Nine Emperor Pavilion, which was so influential, could not get any information from the Thunder God Palace. It seemed that only the experts at the highest level of the Thunder God Palace knew the final result of the bounty, even many experts at the highest level might not know about it.","“Little friend Blood Sword, if you really want to understand the result of this matter, you can only personally look for those experts at the highest level of the Thunder God Palace. My Nine Emperor Pavilion can provide you with a list of the experts at the highest level of the Thunder God Palace. As for who little friend will look for, it will be up to you to decide.” Feixue smiled."]},{"number":4064,"title":"Chapter 4064 - Intelligence","paragraphs":["“In addition to the list of the top experts of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, I also need to know all the information about Xuan Yi, who is on the bounty of the Thunder God Palace, as well as the specific conflicts between him and the Thunder God Palace, and what he did,” Jian Wushuang said.","“No problem.” Feixue nodded with a smile.","Soon, Feixue handed two complete pieces of information to Jian Wushuang.","One was about the top experts of the Thunder God Palace, and the other was about Xuan Yi.","Jian Wushuang first looked at the information about Xuan Yi.","!!","However, after reading the information, Jian Wushuang frowned even more.","It was mentioned that Xuan Yi was an expert born in the Demonic Luo Star World, a second-class star world in the Nine Luminaries superstarfield.","His birth, his gradual growth, and his rise were all mentioned in great detail. Every step of his growth could be witnessed with certainty.","Although this process was not very exciting, it was still a bumpy process. When Xuan Yi rose in the Demonic Luo Star World, he was not a dazzling super genius. He was relatively mediocre, it felt like he was a very ordinary one.","From the beginning, he did not have much fame on his path of cultivation to the Principles Master. It was only until he reached the Ruler level that he gradually gained a certain level of fame. Moreover, his fame was not because of his strength, it was because he had all kinds of endless methods.","He had studied various fields, such as alchemy, weapon refining, array formation, and soul. He had dabbled in some of them, and he had a certain level of achievements.","Some of his methods were even more troublesome for those who were obviously stronger than him.","Although his methods were impressive, they were limited to the Demonic Luo Star World. However, the one that truly made his name in the entire Nine Luminaries Great Star area was the collision with the Thunder God Palace more than 100,000 years ago.","That collision was Xuan Yi’s battle to become famous.","He had gone from an ordinary Ruler who only had a certain level of fame in the Demonic Luo Star World to a famous figure in the entire Nine Luminaries Great Star area. He had become well-known.","During that battle, Xuan Yi had used his third-level Ruler combat strength to not only kill several fourth-level Rulers of the Thunder God Palace, but most importantly, he had also killed a super genius of the Thunder God Palace, Lei Yi!","At that time, Lei Yi was publicly acknowledged as the number one genius of the Thunder God Palace and the entire Nine Luminaries Great Star area. Although he was only a third-level Ruler, he had already comprehended a trace of the universe principles, in addition, he was one of the personal disciples of the Thunder God Palace Ruler. With a large amount of resources to nurture him, his potential was limitless.","However, in that battle 100,000 years ago, Lei Yi was killed by Xuan Yi.","Perhaps Lei Yi himself did not expect that he, who was also a third-level Ruler and was publicly acknowledged as the number one genius of the entire star area, would actually die in the hands of Xuan Yi.","It was because of Lei Yi’s death that the Thunder God Palace was completely enraged. That was why there was a reward that caused a sensation in the entire Nine Luminaries Great Star Field.","“He killed the number one genius of the Thunder God Palace and was also the personal disciple of the palace Ruler of the Thunder God Palace. No wonder the Thunder God Palace was enraged.” Jian Wushuang nodded secretly.","After all, Lei Yi had comprehended a trace of the universe principle.","Even in the Great Star Field, it was extremely difficult for a Ruler to comprehend a trace of universe principle.","For example, in the Bone Pupil Great Star Field, it was not easy for an emperor fire to comprehend a trace of universe principle and was immediately accepted as a personal disciple by the Green Flame Star Lord. The rival Golden Feather Star Lord was willing to pay a great price, however, there was still no second Ruler who had comprehended a trace of universe principle.","Although Lei Yi came from the Thunder God Palace and had been nurtured by the palace with many resources, it was already amazing that he could comprehend a trace of universe principle at the third-level Ruler level.","Such a genius would definitely be regarded as a treasure by the Thunder God Palace, but it was a pity that this treasure was killed by Xuan Yi.","As for the reason why Xuan Yi killed him..","“It was for a woman?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","Because in his impression, his Ruler was basically a man who had no desires. He had been in contact with his Ruler for so many years, but he had never heard of any relationship between his Ruler and a woman.","But now, his Ruler, Xuan Yi, actually killed someone for a woman, and it was a super genius of the Thunder God Palace.","“This woman named eight must have an unusual relationship with my Ruler.” Jian Wushuang looked at the woman named eight mentioned in the report.","After his Ruler Xuan Yi killed Lei Yi, he disappeared with the woman. Even the Nine Emperor Pavilion could not find their location.","This was all the information about his Ruler Xuan Yi in the Nine Luminaries Star Field and the conflict between him and the Thunder God Palace.","However, what puzzled Jian Wushuang was that his Ruler’s rise in the Nine Luminaries Star Field was so clear. The whole process was verified, and he had lived for a very long time, it was as if he was indeed born in the Nine Luminaries Star Field and had lived in the Nine Luminaries Star Field.","But if he was really born in the Nine Luminaries Star Field and had stayed in the Nine Luminaries Star Field, then what was Xuan Yi in the Divine Beginning Realm?","“Xuan Yi, who was put on the bounty by the Thunder God Palace in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, has the same appearance and temperament as Ruler. There is no doubt that he is Ruler, but he has been staying in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy. It is obvious that he has never left. What is going on?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Could it be a clone?” Jian Wushuang could not help thinking.","But he soon shook his head.","His Ruler, Xuan Yi, had always been enigmatic and mysterious. All kinds of methods made Jian Wushuang feel incredible.","Even though he now had the battle strength of an Ultimate Ruler, his Ruler was still a huge mystery in his heart.","The more he came into contact with this mystery, the more confused he became. To really solve this mystery, perhaps he had to see Xuan Yi again in person.","However, he did not know if his Ruler was still in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy. As for whether he had been found and killed by the people of the Thunder God Palace, Jian Wushuang did not believe it.","He believed that his Ruler was very powerful. Although the Thunder God Palace was very powerful, it was not enough to kill his Ruler.","However, even if his Ruler was still alive, he did not know where he was. The only people who might know his Ruler’s whereabouts were the top officials of the Thunder God Palace.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang immediately looked at the second report in front of him, which was about the top experts of the Thunder God Palace.","Immediately, Jian Wushuang began to browse through the information of the top experts of the Thunder God Palace."]},{"number":4065,"title":"Chapter 4065 - Target, Emperor Rain!","paragraphs":["As one of the four most powerful forces in the Nine Luminaries Star Field, the Thunder God Palace had many experts under its command. There were hundreds of experts at the fourth level and above.","However, among these experts, there were probably only a dozen or so who were qualified to be called the highest level.","Jian Wushuang was now looking at the information of these ten or so people.","Among these ten or so people, the strongest ones were the three ultimate level Rulers of the Thunder God Palace. Jian Wushuang directly ignored them.","After all, although his battle strength was very strong and he could fight the ultimate level Rulers head-on, he could only fight them head-on. He could not take them down or kill them, naturally, he could not get the information he wanted from the other party.","!!","Therefore, Jian Wushuang could only choose the remaining experts who were at the peak of the fifth level.","“Eh?” Jian Wushuang quickly found a suitable target.","“The first principle enforcement elder of Thunder God Palace, Emperor Rain!”","Jian Wushuang looked at the information in front of him.","Thunder God Palace was one of the most powerful forces in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field. Not only did it have many experts, but it also controlled many territories.","For example, Thunder God Palace occupied two of the eight level one star worlds in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field that were still in operation, in addition, Thunder God Palace also controlled a large number of level two and level three star worlds in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field.","Since the Thunder God Palace controlled such a huge territory, it was natural that they had to deal with the emergencies in those territories. Therefore, there was a principle enforcement temple in the Thunder God Palace.","There were many deacons and a few principle enforcement elders in the principle enforcement temple. All of them were powerful experts.","If anything happened in the territory under the Thunder God Palace, if it couldn’t be solved, the experts of the principle enforcement temple would appear. And if something important happened, the principle enforcement elders would personally take action.","It should be known that the principle enforcement elders in the principle enforcement temple were all level five Rulers.","As the first principle enforcement elder of the principle enforcement temple and the temple Ruler of the entire principle enforcement temple, Emperor Rain was naturally one of the highest-ranking members of the Thunder God Palace. Moreover, his battle strength had reached the pinnacle of level five, in terms of battle strength, he was ranked fifth in the Thunder God Palace.","“With Emperor Rain’s status in the Thunder God Palace, he is only second to the three ultimate level Rulers. He must be the one who knows the result of the bounty.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a strange light.","In fact, among the experts on the list given to him by Feixue, there were a few who were qualified to know the result of the bounty. The reason why Jian Wushuang chose Emperor Rain was mainly because of his position, he was the first principle enforcement elder of Thunder God Palace.","Since he was the principle enforcement elder, he must be out on a mission.","Like the other top experts on the list, most of them were in the lair of Thunder God Palace or in some important places. It was not so easy for Jian Wushuang to kill them.","Only Emperor Rain was easier to kill. As long as Jian Wushuang used some means, he could lure him out and bring him to him.","“Although Emperor Rain has the battle strength at the peak of the fifth level, it shouldn’t be difficult for me to take him down with my current strength.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and made his decision.","However, Jian Wushuang did not move directly. Instead, he waited in the Nine Emperor Pavilion for ten days.","Ten days later, Feixue personally delivered the many treasures needed to cultivate the fourth level of the supreme eternal celestial body to Jian Wushuang. In addition, she also brought Jian Wushuang a low-grade Principle Supreme Treasure armor.","Jian Wushuang had spent nearly 2,000 universe origin stones to buy this principle Supreme Treasure Armor. Previously, he had also bought one for his wife, Leng Rushuang.","Although he had already obtained a treasure to cultivate the supreme eternal celestial body, he only needed to spend some time and energy to cultivate the fourth level of the supreme eternal celestial body, by then, his divine body would be comparable to an ordinary low-grade principle supreme treasure. However, having a protective armor at the level of a principle supreme treasure would still greatly improve his protective ability, most importantly, he could activate the power of the armor, which would also help his strength to a certain extent.","After getting what he wanted, Jian Wushuang left the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","“Husband, should we directly deal with Emperor Rain or find a place for you to cultivate the fourth level of the supreme eternal celestial body?” Leng Rushuang asked.","“Let’s deal with Emperor Rain first. As for the fourth level of the supreme eternal celestial body, although I have obtained a treasure to help me cultivate it, it will take me at least one to two thousand years to Ruler it. I can’t wait that long,” Jian Wushuang said.","“One to two thousand?” Leng Rushuang was stunned.","In his opinion, with his husband’s talent and perception, and with the help of a cultivation treasure, it should be easy for him to Ruler the secret skill. He didn’t expect it to take so long.","“It’s normal. I’ve been cultivating the second and third levels for more than 10,000 years in the space-time tower, which is 1,000 times faster than time. The fourth level is more difficult than the first three levels. Although it’s easier for me to comprehend it now that I’ve made a breakthrough, it still takes time,” Jian Wushuang said.","“In that case, let’s deal with Emperor Rain first. Husband, how do you plan to lure him out?” Leng Rushuang asked.","“That’s easy. I’ve read the intelligence on Emperor Rain and know that he has a disciple guarding a second-class astral world under the command of Thunder God Palace. Although he has many disciples, this one is definitely one of the more outstanding ones among his disciples. If we kill his disciple directly, he will come out and kill us in anger. Then, we will take him down,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Good idea.” Leng Rushuang nodded with a smile.","Immediately, the three of them set off.","There were countless star worlds in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field, including many second-class Star Worlds.","In one of the ordinary second-class star worlds, there was a group of towering buildings at the top of a high mountain. The buildings were extremely magnificent, especially one of the ancient purple towers, which directly pierced into the clouds above, it was like a heavenly palace, guarding everything in this astral world.","In the void outside the mountain, Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang stood side by side, while Devil Flame stood behind Jian Wushuang.","“Devil Flame, when we were on our way, I swallowed many special crystals for you. Your cultivation has recovered to the fifth-level, and your battle strength should be among the top of the fifth-level. It’s most suitable for you to deal with the disciple of Emperor Rain. Go,” Jian Wushuang instructed.","“Yes.” Devil Flame nodded, and then immediately moved toward the towering buildings on the mountain."]},{"number":4066,"title":"Chapter 4066 - The Furious Emperor Rain Ruler","paragraphs":["After a short moment.","Boom!","A terrifying boom, accompanied by the shaking of heaven and earth, resounded through the void.","The towering buildings on the peak of the mountain turned into ruins in the blink of an eye. Countless figures rushed out from the ruins in a sorry state.","“Blood Thunder Cliff, you didn’t think that my Devil Flame could come back alive, did you?”","“A billion years ago, you destroyed my sect and killed my parents. Today, I will make you pay with blood!”","“All of you must die!”","A cold voice filled with endless killing intent spread out from the black-clothed tall man in the void above.","This tall black-robed man’s aura towered into the sky. He was like a black demonic god, suppressing everything below.","The countless cultivators who had come out of the buildings in a sorry state saw this tall black-robed man and their expressions changed drastically.","“He’s too powerful. He destroyed my Blood Thunder Cliff’s defensive formation with just one move. This strength must be that of a fifth-level Ruler. Moreover, he’s probably one of the extremely powerful ones among fifth-level Rulers!”","“This expert is obviously here for revenge. We’re finished!”","“Run, run quickly!”","Terrified voices rang out one after another, and countless cultivators of the Blood Thunder Cliff began to flee frantically.","The Blood Thunder Cliff was actually a branch of the Thunder God Palace in this second-level astral world. It was in charge of everything in this second-level astral world for the Thunder God Palace.","However, if such a force wanted to completely Principle the entire second-level astral world, it was inevitable that it would destroy many rival forces and sects. Over the long years, the Blood Thunder Cliff had destroyed countless forces and sects, their enemies were even more numerous.","However, because the Blood Thunder Cliff was already extremely powerful, it had two grade-4 Rulers. The Thunder God Palace had even sent one over, a total of three grade-4 Rulers, in a grade-2 astral world, they could absolutely be the king and the Ruler.","Thus, over the course of many years, none of the enemies of the Blood Thunder Cliff dared to come knocking on their doors.","It was precisely because of this that the Devil Flame, as the enemy of the Blood Thunder Cliff, came knocking on their doors. This also lowered the defenses of the Thunder God Palace.","Boom!","The black-robed demonic god, who was located at the highest point of the void, attacked directly. He moved like lightning and easily killed all the escaping experts one by one.","At the same time he killed these experts, his gaze had long been fixed on a person.","It was a cold-looking man in silver armor. This cold-looking man was also running away. Moreover, he had deliberately concealed his aura. His method of concealing his aura was quite brilliant.","If it was not for Devil Flame knowing his appearance and the fact that he had already set his eyes on him, he might have taken the opportunity to escape.","Hu!","Devil Flame appeared directly in front of the cold-looking man in silver armor as if he had teleported. His ice-cold killing intent instantly covered the cold-looking man.","“Not good!” The cold-looking man’s expression changed drastically. Seeing Devil Flame in front of him, he was ready to attack. He immediately shouted, “Stop, I’m from the Thunder God Palace. My Ruler is the number one principle enforcement elder of the Thunder God Palace, Emperor Rain Ruler!”","“If you dare to kill me, my Ruler will definitely not let you off!”","“Thunder God Palace? Emperor Rain Ruler?” Devil Flame frowned, but he was secretly laughing in his heart.","This cold-looking man actually brought out the Thunder God Palace and Emperor Rain Ruler to threaten him at the critical moment. This was what Devil Flame wanted.","“Humph, what Thunder God Palace, What Emperor Rain Ruler? I’ve never heard of it. You’d better die.” Devil Flame attacked without hesitation.","“No!”","The cold-looking man let out a miserable cry. Under the absolute suppression of his strength, he couldn’t even last two moves before he was killed by Devil Flame on the spot.","After killing the cold-looking man in front of him, the Devil Flame pretended to continue chasing after the fleeing experts from the Blood Thunder Cliff. It only stopped after all the cultivators from the Blood Thunder Cliff had fled.","“Ruler, I’ve killed Emperor Rain’s disciple according to your instructions. What should I do next?” The Devil Flame sent a message to Jian Wushuang.","“Don’t worry. Just stay in the Blood Thunder Cliff and pretend that you’re looting the treasures accumulated in the Blood Thunder Cliff. If everything goes well, Emperor Rain will get the news soon and come here as soon as possible. Then I’ll take him down,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Devil Flame nodded.","He immediately began looting the Blood Thunder Cliff according to Jian Wushuang’s instructions.","As Jian Wushuang had expected, Emperor Rain, who was far away in the Thunder God Palace’s lair, immediately received the news shortly after the cold-faced man’s death.","In the principle enforcement temple of Thunder God Palace.","“Bastard!”","A low shout suddenly exploded in the void, and then an extremely violent aura suddenly rose.","“Third Elder, Eighth Elder, follow me!” The voice ordered.","Soon, three figures rushed out from the principle enforcement temple. The other two were fine, but the leader had a shocking killing intent.","Wherever he passed, the surrounding experts of Thunder God Palace could feel his unconcealable killing intent.","“What’s going on?”","“Emperor Rain Ruler, What’s going on?”","“Who knows, something might have happened.”","Many cultivators in Thunder God Palace were discussing.","And at this moment...","“Emperor Rain!” An aged voice suddenly sounded.","The three figures immediately stopped. The eyes of the golden-haired burly man in the lead were filled with an unconcealable fierceness, but when he saw the aged figure in front of him...the ferocity in his eyes also slightly receded.","“Grand Elder.” The two principle enforcement elders behind the Emperor Rain Ruler immediately bowed respectfully.","“Emperor Rain, what happened?” The old figure asked.","“It’s Zhenfu. He was killed.” The Emperor Rain Ruler said in a low voice.","“Zhenfu? That little fellow died?” The old figure frowned slightly. He could understand why the Emperor Rain Ruler was so furious.","Emperor Rain Ruler did have many disciples, but those who had made some achievements could be counted on one hand. Zhenfu was undoubtedly the most outstanding disciple under Emperor Rain Ruler. He was now a fourth-level Ruler, in the future, he had a chance to reach the fifth-level. He could even take his place and become the new first principle-enforcing elder of the principle-enforcing temple.","Emperor Rain Ruler placed great importance on this disciple of his.","“Who killed that little fellow?” The old figure asked.","“It was a fifth-tier Ruler who appeared out of nowhere. He seems to have a deep grudge with a branch faction under the Thunder God Palace. Previously, he had been escaping. Now that his strength has broken through, he ran back to take revenge. As for Zhenfu, he happened to be stationed there all these years, so he met with misfortune.” Emperor Rain Ruler gnashed his teeth.","“Is that so?” The old figure understood.","“First Elder, I won’t talk to you anymore. If we delay any longer, that fellow will escape.”","Emperor Rain Ruler was extremely anxious. He brought the two principle enforcement elders under his command and immediately headed toward the second-grade astral world.","After Emperor Rain Ruler left, that old figure frowned and seemed to be deep in thought.","..."]},{"number":4067,"title":"Chapter 4067 - The Ruler Behind Them","paragraphs":["On the top of the mountain, the Blood Thunder Cliff had completely turned into ruins. Only the Devil Flame was still plundering treasures in the ruins.","However, not long after the Devil Flame destroyed the Blood Thunder Cliff, three figures with powerful auras arrived.","“They arrived so quickly?” Devil Flame raised his head and looked at the three people who had just arrived.","These three people were all fifth-level Rulers, and the person in the lead had reached the peak of the fifth-level. After this person arrived, an extremely violent aura immediately rose into the air, the gaze he used to look at Devil Flame was filled with hatred and anger.","“Who are you?” Although Devil Flame already knew in his heart, he still asked despite knowing the answer.","“You killed so many people under the command of my Thunder God Palace, and most importantly, you killed my disciple. You actually don’t know who I am?” Emperor Rain Ruler stared at Devil Flame, and his eyes seemed like they were about to spurt out sparks.","“You are Emperor Rain Ruler?” Devil Flame revealed a shocked expression.","“Since you know, then hurry up and take your life. Let’s attack together and kill him.”","As the number one principle enforcement elder of Thunder God Palace, Emperor Rain was always swift and decisive. He did not waste any time with Devil Flame and directly attacked.","Not only Emperor Rain, but the other two principle enforcement elders also attacked Devil Flame at the same time.","The three fifth-level Rulers were all peak existences among the fifth-level Rulers, especially Emperor Rain Ruler, who had reached the pinnacle of the fifth-level Rulers. The three of them making their moves at the same time was simply too powerful.","Devil Flame’s gaze was cold, and he wasn’t afraid at all. He directly went up and fought with the three Rulers.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","A series of earth-shaking explosions sounded one after another. The Blood Thunder Cliff, which had been turned into ruins, suffered unprecedented destruction and became even more miserable.","In the void not far away from the Blood Thunder Cliff, Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang stood side by side. They could directly see the battlefield in front of them.","“They are at least three Rulers at the peak of the fifth level, and Emperor Rain is only second to the Ultimate Ruler. He won’t be able to resist the Devil Flame if they join hands,” Leng Rushuang said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. “After all, Devil Flame’s divine body has just recovered to 50%, and his cultivation has barely reached the fifth level. Although he has the memory and skills of an Ultimate Ruler and has the combat strength at the peak of the fifth level, he is at best on par with Emperor Rain. Now, he is at a disadvantage against three Rulers.”","“Shuang ‘er, wait here. I’ll go help Devil Flame,” Jian Wushuang ordered.","“Okay.” Leng Rushuang nodded.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang dashed forward.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang appeared on the battlefield. As soon as he appeared, Devil Flame, who had been fighting with the three principle enforcement elders, immediately stopped and came behind him.","“Master,” Devil Flame called out respectfully.","“Thank you for your hard work,” Jian Wushuang said.","The simple exchange was heard by Emperor Rain and the other two.","“Master?”","Emperor Rain could not help being stunned.","“This mysterious expert who single-handedly destroyed Blood Thunder Cliff and killed my disciple, whose battle strength is no less than mine, actually called this third-level Ruler as his master?” Emperor Rain felt a little incredulous.","The two principle enforcement elders beside him also felt the same way.","“Emperor Rain, I’ve been waiting for you here for a long time,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Waiting for me for a long time?” Emperor Rain’s expression changed, but his pupils immediately shrank. “The person who really has a grudge against Blood Thunder Cliff is you? Did you ask your servant to kill my disciple?”","“I did ask him to kill your disciple. As for me and Blood Thunder Cliff, we don’t have any grudges. The reason I asked him to do this was to lure you here,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Emperor Rain’s expression suddenly changed.","He was not a fool. He immediately reacted after hearing Jian Wushuang’s words.","The mysterious cultivator in front of him, who was unknown but had a superior Ruler of the fifth level as his servant, did not really want Blood Thunder Cliff, but for him!","He had destroyed the Blood Thunder Cliff and killed his disciple just to lure him here from the Thunder God Palace.","“You dare to scheme against me after killing my disciples? Brat, you are really courting death!”","Emperor Rain Ruler was completely enraged.","He was originally a violent person, which was why he was the number one principle-enforcing elder of the Thunder God Palace and was responsible for enforcing the principle.","Now that he knew that he had been tricked by a third-level Ruler, he was naturally very angry.","Boom!","Emperor Rain attacked again, and the other two principle enforcement elders beside him also attacked at the same time.","Their eyes were filled with killing intent as they focused on Jian Wushuang. However, although they were eager to kill Jian Wushuang, they focused most of their energy on the Devil Flame behind Jian Wushuang.","They did not care about Jian Wushuang because he was only a third-level Ruler. On the contrary, they knew that his servant Devil Flame was also very powerful.","However, at this moment, the third-level Ruler, Jian Wushuang, who they did not care about, moved.","He took out the Wuqi Divine Sword and suddenly moved.","Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish!","The vast void was filled with thousands of afterimages of Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang crossed the distance directly, and the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand also flew out.","Emperor Rain and the two principle enforcement elders’eyes instantly fixed on the sword that Jian Wushuang swung out.","The sword attack gave them a very strange feeling.","It was slow and soft, as if it felt a bit of power. However, this sword attack made the three of them shiver.","Chi! Chi! Chi!","The cold sword edge directly cut through their divine bodies.","In an instant, the Supreme Treasure armor on two of their bodies was torn apart. The terrifying power of the sword shadow destroyed their divine bodies on the spot and madly destroyed their divine power.","Under the impact of the Sword Shadow, more than 70% of the divine power of the two principle enforcement elders was destroyed.","As for Emperor Rain, as a member of the highest level of the Thunder God Palace, not only was his strength much stronger, but he also had an inferior-grade principle supreme treasure armor protecting his body, although Jian Wushuang could now use part of the power of the Wuqi Divine Sword and easily tear apart ordinary supreme treasure armor, he could not directly tear apart the principle supreme treasure armor, therefore, although this sword attack had severely injured Emperor Rain, it did not cause him to lose more than 70% of his divine body.","However, this sword attack had completely stunned the three of them!"]},{"number":4068,"title":"Chapter 4068 - Suppression","paragraphs":["“How is this possible?”","“A third-level Ruler can destroy 70% of our divine power with one strike? This is impossible!”","The two principle enforcement elders were terrified and stared at Jian Wushuang with wide eyes.","“How can he be so strong? and his swordsmanship is so fast that even I am not qualified to resist it. How can a third-level Ruler be so terrifying?” Emperor Rain looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief.","He did not know that Jian Wushuang had killed a fifth-level Ruler when he was a second-level Ruler.","After he broke through to the third-level Ruler, his divine power was no weaker than that of a fifth-level Ruler. With his great advantage in the principles, he could easily kill a fifth-level Ruler like an adult bullying a child, he could easily kill a fifth-level Ruler.","Apart from that, he also obtained the violet-blood secret manual, which gave him a certain level of control over the principles of the universe. He was even able to perfectly combine the principles of the universe with his own Sword Dao, reaching the first realm mentioned in the violet-blood secret manual.","Once he reached this first realm, his overall strength once again soared. Right now, in terms of combat power, he had long surpassed a fifth-level Ruler. Even compared to an Ultimate Ruler, he was still infinitely inferior.","Moreover, because of the perfect combination of the universe principle and his sword principle, his swordsmanship was extremely exquisite. Perhaps even the Ultimate Rulers who were good at sword principle were far inferior to him in swordsmanship.","Naturally, he could easily kill these fifth-level Rulers.","Even the top-level Rulers of the fifth-level could only take one or two sword strikes from Jian Wushuang.","“The three of you are already very powerful among the Rulers of the fifth-level, but one strike is not enough. What about another one?” Jian Wushuang smiled, he raised the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand again.","“Oh no!” The faces of Emperor Rain and the other two changed drastically.","“Run, run!” Emperor Rain shouted in a low voice.","At this moment, Emperor Rain Ruler no longer wanted to take revenge for his disciple.","He was very clear that the other party’s strength was so tyrannical, and it was obvious that they were here for him. Naturally, he was prepared.","If he was not careful in today’s matter, he, Emperor Rain Ruler, would very likely die here, not to mention the two principle enforcement elders beside him who were not even as strong as him.","Following Emperor Rain’s shout, the three figures fled at the same time.","But just as Emperor Rain had said, since Jian Wushuang had lured him here on purpose, he was prepared. How could he give them a chance to escape?","With a thought, the three towering golden stone tablets immediately rose up.","The three Heaven Suppression Tablets appeared from three different voids around the Blood Thunder Cliff. Obviously, Jian Wushuang had placed the three stone tablets there and activated them as soon as Emperor Rain and the others fell into the trap.","As expected, as soon as Jian Wushuang activated the three Heaven Suppression Tablets, the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation was activated and covered the vast void. Naturally, it also completely covered Emperor Rain and the others.","The terrifying suppressive force directly affected Emperor Rain and the others.","As soon as the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation was formed, it completely blocked the escape route of the three people.","“Oh no, it’s a suppression formation. I was prepared for it.” Emperor Rain’s expression was extremely ugly.","He immediately recognized that the three golden stone tablets were suppression-type supreme treasures.","The suppression formation activated by the three suppression-type supreme treasures was so powerful that the three fifth-level Rulers could not break it?","The terrifying suppression force that came directly at them made Emperor Rain and the others feel despair.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang had caught up with them.","Without the suppression of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, the three of them could not resist Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship at all.","However, under the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, their strength was greatly suppressed, and Jian Wushuang’s strength had increased again. Now, he was displaying his swordsmanship.","Chi! Chi! Chi!","Before the two ordinary principle enforcement elders could even let out a scream, their divine bodies collapsed again. This time, they had no chance to regenerate their divine bodies and were directly killed.","As for Emperor Rain, his endurance was indeed much stronger than the two principle enforcement elders. However, after two consecutive strikes, his divine power had been reduced by nearly 50%. If Jian Wushuang continued to attack, he would definitely die!","Emperor Rain could no longer see any hope of escaping, but his eyes were still cold and filled with violence as he stared at Jian Wushuang, he said sternly, “Boy, what is the grudge between you and me? Why are you scheming against me? Even if I die, you have to let me die with closure.”","“Grudge?","“No, there was no grudge between us before. The reason why I came to deal with you this time is because you are the first principle enforcement elder of the Thunder God Palace and one of the highest-ranking officials of the palace.” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“What?” Emperor Rain narrowed his eyes. “You have enmity with the Thunder God Palace?”","“No, I just want to know something from you. I’ll ask you now. If your answer satisfies me, maybe I’ll let you live,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Emperor Rain stared at Jian Wushuang. He wanted to see if Jian Wushuang was lying, but it was obvious that Jian Wushuang was not lying.","“What do you want to know?” Emperor Rain asked in a deep voice.","“More than 100,000 years ago, Lei Yi, the number one genius of your Thunder God Palace, was killed. After that, your Thunder God Palace issued a bounty, causing a great sensation in the entire Nine Luminaries Galaxy. However, not long ago, your Thunder God Palace kept a low profile and removed the reward. Why?","“And the person on the bounty, how is he now?” Jian Wushuang looked at Emperor Rain.","“Bounty?” Emperor Rain looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise. “You’re here for the person on the Bounty?”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang did not deny it.","“Haha, I see. I’m surprised that the Thunder God Palace has an enemy that is an absolute Ruler in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy. Although we have enemies, there are only a few who can really threaten us. However, your strength must be the strongest among the many potential enemies of the Thunder God Palace. However, the Thunder God Palace did not receive any information before, which is obviously illogical. Now it seems that you’re not a cultivator from the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, but from another Galaxy. Moreover, your relationship with Xuan Yi must be extraordinary.” Emperor Rain laughed.","“I’m asking you, what’s the whereabouts of the person on the bounty?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold.","..."]},{"number":4069,"title":"Chapter 4069 - First Elder of the Thunder God Palace","paragraphs":["“Boy, do you think I will answer your question honestly? Who do you think you are, a Supreme Elder?” Emperor Rain mocked.","“It’s okay if you don’t say it now. After I suppress you, I will have time to ask you slowly.” Jian Wushuang did not waste time with Emperor Rain. He waved his hand, instantly, the three Heaven Suppression Tablets in the surrounding void burst out with dazzling golden light.","On the Heaven Suppression Tablet, the three enormous golden divine devil phantoms condensed, and the already powerful suppressive force rose again.","“A suppression-type principle treasure?” Emperor Rain’s pupils constricted.","The suppressive force of a suppression-type Principle treasure was already very powerful. He still had more than half of it left and could barely resist the suppressive force. However, once he was seriously injured and fell into a weakened state...Jian Wushuang could control the principle-type supreme treasure and completely suppress him. His life and death would be controlled by his opponent.","“You want to suppress me? In your dreams!” Emperor Rain roared and struggled desperately in the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation.","However, the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation was a powerful Suppressive Formation performed by three Heaven Suppression Tablets at the same time. If Jian Wushuang were to perform it personally, Emperor Rain would not be able to escape the Suppressive Power of the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang also made a decisive move.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","One after another, mysterious sword lights slashed toward Emperor Rain.","These sword lights were imbued with a rich universal principle. They were unfathomable and incredibly fast. Emperor Rain could barely withstand one or two of them, but the remaining ones were still standing on his divine body.","One sword, two swords. After just a few swords, more than 80% of Emperor Rain’s divine power had been destroyed. His aura had become extremely weak.","At this point, it would be extremely difficult for him to block the suppressive force of the Heaven Suppression Array.","But at this moment, a change occurred!","Boom!","A pale palm appeared out of thin air. This palm expanded infinitely in the air and in an instant, it forcefully tore open a hole in the heaven suppression array. It then grabbed Emperor Rain.","The entire Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation shook violently. The three Golden Divine Devil Phantoms on the Heaven Suppression Tablet dimmed slightly, and the entire formation almost collapsed.","“Eh?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","With his current strength, the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation cast by the three Heaven Suppression Tablets was forcefully torn apart and almost collapsed?","His opponent’s strength was extraordinary.","Buzz! An old figure appeared in the magic formation and stood beside Emperor Rain.","“First Elder!”","Seeing the arrival, Emperor Rain, who was already extremely weak and almost despaired, was overjoyed. His eyes shone with a dazzling light again.","“First Elder?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","He knew all the information about the top officials of the Thunder God Palace. Among them, the three ultimate level Rulers were the strongest and most respected.","The First Elder of the Thunder God Palace was one of the three ultimate level Rulers.","“Ultimate level Rulers?” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, but he was very surprised, “When I attacked, I had already completely sealed off the surrounding space and time. Although Emperor Rain was in a desperate situation, he shouldn’t have been able to send a message for help. Even if he could, the senior experts of the Thunder God Palace shouldn’t have been able to arrive so quickly. But this great elder...","“How did he know that Emperor Rain was in danger and how did he arrive here in time?” Jian Wushuang was very confused.","But in fact, not only him, but also Emperor Rain was very surprised.","“First Elder, why are you here?” Emperor Rain asked immediately.","“When I saw you in the palace, I already knew something was wrong,” the old figure said, “our Thunder God Palace has stood in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy for a long time, and we have many enemies. However, only a handful of them can reach the fifth level. Moreover, under the strong influence of our Thunder God Palace, these enemies usually hide. It’s already good enough that our Thunder God Palace doesn’t actively pursue them. Who has the courage to directly take revenge on our Thunder God Palace?”","“And this time, it was an unknown powerhouse who suddenly destroyed the Blood Thunder Cliff. Your disciple Zhenhuang happened to be there as well. This is too much of a coincidence.","“So, when you rushed out to avenge your disciple, I followed you secretly just in case. Unfortunately, I was a little slow and could only save you in time. I couldn’t save the two principle-enforcing elders as well.” The First Elder of Thunder God Palace sighed.","Whether it was Emperor Rain and the other two or the First Elder of Thunder God Palace, they all arrived at the second-grade astral world through the universe passage.","However, after the same universe passage was activated once, it would take a while for it to be activated a second time. It was during this time that the First Elder of Thunder God Palace was delayed a little.","In addition, Jian Wushuang was too strong and too fast. When the First Elder of Thunder God Palace arrived, the two principle enforcement elders were already dead, but Emperor Rain was still alive and had not been completely suppressed.","“First Elder, this is the person who killed Zhenhuang and the third and eighth principle enforcement elders. If you hadn’t arrived in time, I’m afraid I would have died in his hands and at the very least, I would have been suppressed.” Emperor Rain stared at Jian Wushuang, he gnashed his teeth and said.","The First Elder of Thunder God Palace also fixed his eyes on Jian Wushuang.","“A third-level Ruler?” The First Elder of Thunder God Palace narrowed his turbid eyes slightly.","“First Elder, although he is only a third-level Ruler, his strength is very terrifying. He killed the third and eighth enforcement elders with only two strikes. His battle strength is definitely at the pinnacle of the fifth-level. He is even stronger than me,” Emperor Rain said immediately.","“I can see that if he doesn’t have enough strength, he won’t dare to plot against the first principle enforcement elder of the Thunder God Palace.” The voice of the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace became cold, “I don’t know who you are, but since you dare to plot against the Thunder God Palace, you shall die today.”","“Oh, you are very confident?” Jian Wushuang’s lips curled up.","Boom!","The First Elder of Thunder God Palace made a move directly. He did not move much and simply flipped his hand.","In an instant, a large amount of divine power, accompanied by endless power of Principles, rapidly gathered in the void. In the blink of an eye, it formed a giant jade-like hand.","The giant hand occupied more than half of the sky, and Jian Wushuang was under the cover of the giant hand. He looked up and could clearly sense the destructive aura contained in the giant hand."]},{"number":4070,"title":"Chapter 4070 - Ultimate Ruler","paragraphs":["“This is the strength of an Ultimate Ruler?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","He had come into contact with an Ultimate Ruler before.","Like Devil Flame, he had been an Ultimate Ruler at his peak.","In the Bone Pupil Galaxy, the Golden Feather Star Lord and Green Flame Star Lord he had met were also Ultimate Rulers.","However, even though he had come into contact with them, he had never really fought with a final realm Ruler. It could even be said that he had never seen a final realm Ruler fight up close.","This caused his judgment of the final realm Ruler’s strength to be slightly off.","He had originally thought that the final realm Ruler and the fifth realm Ruler only had a difference in the power of their divine power and that they had fused an additional principle.","The difference between the two was almost the same as the difference between a fourth-level Ruler and a fifth-level Ruler.","However, now that Jian Wushuang saw an Ultimate Ruler making a move, he instantly understood that it was not the case.","An Ultimate Ruler was much more powerful than a fifth-level Ruler.","Not to mention the power of divine power, just the principles of heaven and earth alone...","A fifth level Ruler needed to fuse eight principles, and an Ultimate Ruler needed to fuse nine principles.","But one had to know that nine was the heaven and earth level.","Fusing nine principles was the pinnacle of all cultivators in the universe.","Once nine principles were fused, it meant that he had reached the highest level in the principles of heaven and earth and had no chance of further improvement. After reaching this level in the same principles, a cultivator’s strength would undergo a qualitative transformation.","This change included all kinds of aspects, but the power of the fusion of the nine Principles alone was ridiculously strong.","For example, the seemingly casual palm of the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace had brought Jian Wushuang endless pressure.","“Humph!”","Jian Wushuang snorted coldly, and the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand burst out with majestic power.","An extremely violent aura condensed in his hand. It seemed to be able to cut through the sky and cut open the vast universe.","Whoosh!","The huge sword light directly slashed out, carrying Jian Wushuang’s highest understanding of the universe origin of sword principle, his comprehension of the universe principles, and most importantly, the two were perfectly combined.","Jian Wushuang had used the universe principles in the past years and combined them with sword principle to the extreme.","His strength had also reached the extreme and he had just displayed his strongest sword move.","This sword move was the first move of splitting heaven!","The same sword skill had been perfected over tens of thousands of years and was no longer the same as before.","Boom!","The world suddenly shook and the surrounding void seemed unable to withstand the impact of the two terrifying forces and began to shake.","In the blink of an eye, more than half of the mountain where the Blood Thunder Cliff was located disappeared. Previously, when the Blood Thunder Cliff was destroyed by the Devil Flame, there was at least a piece of debris left, but now there was no debris, only the bare mountain wall was left.","Under the impact of the two supreme forces, the giant crystal hand that covered more than half of the Void was broken in the middle. The entire palm was split in half, obviously forcefully split in half by someone.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang appeared beside Devil Flame.","“Let’s go,” Jian Wushuang said and then rushed toward the surrounding void with Devil Flame.","After a long while, the void slowly calmed down and the overwhelming power dissipated. The old figure, the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace, was still standing in the highest void with a calm expression, as for Emperor Rain King, who was beside him, he was extremely anxious.","“First Elder, that brat has escaped. Aren’t you going to chase after him?” Emperor Rain King asked in a low voice.","“Do you think that this old man doesn’t want to kill him?” The First Elder of the Thunder God Palace coldly glanced at Emperor Rain King.","Emperor Rain King was startled. When he sensed the cold eyes of the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace, his heart could not help but shudder.","Only then did he remember that although he was also one of the highest-ranking members of the Thunder God Palace and held an important position in the palace, compared to the First Elder in front of him, the difference was still like heaven and earth.","The First Elder of the Thunder God Palace, the Ultimate Ruler, was one of the most powerful forces of the Thunder God Palace.","After all, the Ultimate Ruler was the most powerful force in the entire Nine Luminaries Great Star area. There were only about twenty of them in the entire Nine Luminaries Great Star area, while the Thunder God Palace only had three.","Any one of these three ultimate Dominators was the true pillar of the Thunder God Palace, and they could not fall.","But like Emperor Rain, although he was the temple Ruler of the principle enforcement temple and the number one principle enforcement elder, if he died, the Thunder God Palace could easily find someone to replace him.","But the First Elder could not be replaced.","And how could he teach the First Elder how to do things?","“Grand Elder, could it be that even you can’t kill him?” Emperor Rain Ruler became extremely obedient this time and even addressed him as ‘you’ in a humble tone.","“Hmph, although I don’t know where this kid came from, his strength is indeed very strong. Although he is only a third-level Ruler, his divine power isn’t any weaker than a fifth-level Ruler. Most importantly, he has comprehended the principles of the universe, and his comprehension of the principles of the universe has reached an extremely high level, far exceeding our imaginations. Just by relying on his comprehension of the principles of the universe, he can already be considered invincible among fifth-level Rulers. Even compared to an Ultimate Ruler, he isn’t much weaker.”","“Didn’t you see that my palm was cut in half by his sword?","“Although I didn’t use my full strength, I’m sure that I can’t kill him even if I use my full strength. If I want to kill him, I need two or even three Ultimate Rulers to do it at the same time,” the First Elder said in a deep voice.","“That kid is so powerful?” Emperor Rain was shocked.","He did not expect that the First Elder would have such a high opinion of Jian Wushuang.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang was able to cut the First Elder’s giant crystal hand in half with a single strike. His strength was really impressive.","“Let’s go back first. When we get back, you can tell me what happened. I want to know why this person set you up,” the First Elder said.","“Yes.” Emperor Rain nodded respectfully.","Soon, the First Elder and Emperor Rain returned to the Thunder God Palace.","In the vast void, a universe boat stopped quietly. Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang sat together in the universe boat, while Devil Flame stood beside them.","“It failed.”","“I didn’t expect that Emperor Rain would be trapped in a well-designed trap. We were able to completely suppress him, but in the end, he still escaped.”","Jian Wushuang clenched his hands, a trace of unwillingness in his eyes."]},{"number":4071,"title":"Chapter 4071 - The Fourth Level of the Supreme","paragraphs":["“I miscalculated,” Jian Wushuang thought. “I thought I could only attract Emperor Rain by letting the Devil Flame attack the Blood Thunder Cliff. I didn’t expect Emperor Rain to come, but the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace is following me?”","The appearance of the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace was indeed unexpected to Jian Wushuang.","However, it was not his miscalculation. After all, the reason why the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace came was just an accident.","If the First Elder had not happened to meet Emperor Rain in the Thunder God Palace and sensed that something was wrong, there would not have been an ultimate level Ruler rushing here.","This was an accident for Jian Wushuang, not a miscalculation.","The real miscalculation was his judgment of the Ultimate Ruler’s strength.","“I thought that as long as I combined the use of universal principles with sword principle and reached the first realm of the Purple Blood Secret Manual, I would be able to fight an Ultimate Ruler head-on. But now it seems that’s not the case,” Jian Wushuang said.","He had just fought with the First Elder of Thunder God Palace.","Although it was only a one-time fight, Jian Wushuang could already feel the huge difference in strength between him and his opponent.","The ultimate level Ruler was much more powerful than the fifth level Ruler, much more powerful than Jian Wushuang had expected.","Although it seemed that he had directly cut the giant palm of the First Elder of Thunder God Palace into two, in fact, Jian Wushuang knew very well that he had used all his strength in that sword attack, he had displayed his strongest swordsmanship, and the power of all his techniques had reached its peak.","The First Elder of the Thunder God Palace had just casually attacked.","“If the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace attacked with all his strength in a head-on confrontation, I would definitely not be his match. Perhaps I can only truly fight against him if I use all my trump cards,” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice.","In terms of trump cards, the sword formation, the dragon-killing secret skill, and the original universe, which were his innate divine abilities granted by the universal principles, were all his trump cards.","However, Jian Wushuang would not use these trump cards easily, but once he used them, his strength would increase dramatically in a short period of time.","“In the previous situation, with the great elder of the Thunder God Palace around, I’m afraid I won’t be able to do anything to Emperor Rain even if I use all my strength. After this battle, Emperor Rain will definitely be very careful in his actions. I’m afraid it’s impossible for me to attack him again,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","It was likely that Emperor Rain was not the only one. After this battle, Emperor Rain would definitely tell all the high-level experts of the Thunder God Palace about his purpose of coming here. The top-level experts of the Thunder God Palace would definitely be extremely vigilant, they would be on guard against him at all times. It would be ten times more difficult for him to attack the top-level experts of the Thunder God Palace.","“Husband.” Leng Rushuang looked at Jian Wushuang. She knew that Jian Wushuang was unwilling to accept this.","“It’s okay.” Jian Wushuang shook his head, “After this battle, I won’t be able to attack the top experts of the Thunder God Palace for a while. Well, I’ll wait for a while and cultivate the fourth level of the Supreme-level undying celestial body first. Then I’ll have a way to deal with the Thunder God Palace,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Leng Rushuang nodded slightly.","Then, Jian Wushuang found a hidden place in the Nine Luminaries Star Field and stayed there for the time being.","Jian Wushuang directly began to cultivate in seclusion.","What he cultivated was naturally the fourth level of the supreme eternal celestial body.","Previously, many treasures needed to cultivate the fourth level of the supreme eternal celestial body had already been in his hands. What he needed to do now was to carefully comprehend them and with the help of these treasures, he could truly cultivate the fourth level of the supreme eternal celestial body.","This process was not difficult, but it would take some time.","In the blink of an eye, 3,000 years had passed.","In the secret chamber, Jian Wushuang’s divine body had reached the final stage of transformation.","Finally, with the explosion of Jian Wushuang’s divine body, Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes, and a ray of hot light burst out.","“Haha, it worked!” Jian Wushuang laughed in surprise.","After meditating in the secret chamber for 3,000 years and with the help of many treasures, he finally cultivated the fourth level of the supreme eternal celestial body.","In fact, it took Jian Wushuang more than 10,000 years to cultivate the second and third levels of the supreme eternal celestial body. The fourth level was even more difficult than the first three levels, however, it only took Jian Wushuang 3,000 years to cultivate it, mainly because after he broke through to the Ruler realm, his vision and comprehension speed were much faster than before, whether it was comprehension or cultivation, naturally, the speed was also faster.","“As expected, once I cultivate the fourth level of the supreme eternal celestial body, my divine body will undergo a huge transformation. After the transformation, the strength of my divine body should be comparable to an ordinary low-grade Principle Supreme Treasure.” Jian Wushuang looked around his divine body, feeling the strength of his divine body and the enormous power hidden in it, he was extremely excited.","Previously, when he had completed the third level, his body was comparable to a universe supreme true treasure, which was still powerful enough.","However, a universe supreme true treasure and a Principle True Treasure were completely different.","Now that he had completed the fourth level of the supreme undying body, his divine body was comparable to an ordinary low-grade Principle True Treasure. In terms of the strength of his divine body, it was more than a hundred times stronger?","The stronger his divine body was, the more powerful his body defense and defense would be. Even the power contained in his divine body would be more astonishing.","Jian Wushuang could clearly sense that the power released by his divine body alone was close to the power of a fifth-level Ruler.","Under the amplification of the power of the will given by the universal principle, the power of his divine body could be directly magnified by ten times. In other words, the power of Jian Wushuang’s divine power had also been greatly enhanced. His overall strength...had increased by another level.","“Now I am qualified to compete with an ultimate level Ruler,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","In the past 3,000 years, he had only fought with the First Elder of Thunder God Palace once, and then he immediately left. At that time, he could see that there was a big gap between his strength and his opponent’s.","However, now that he had cultivated the fourth level of the supreme immortal celestial body, his divine body’s strength had soared, and his overall strength had increased by another level. If he met the First Elder of Thunder God Palace again, perhaps there would still be a gap in strength, but at least Jian Wushuang now had the confidence to face him.","Moreover, the most terrifying thing about the increase in the strength of his divine body was its protective ability.","The protective ability of his divine body, which was comparable to an inferior-grade principle supreme treasure, was so heaven-defying that even the attack of an ultimate level Ruler would not cause much damage to Jian Wushuang’s divine body, moreover, Jian Wushuang was also protected by the armor of an inferior-grade principle supreme treasure."]},{"number":4072,"title":"Chapter 4072 - Stand By","paragraphs":["The protective ability of the low-grade Principle True Treasure armor alone was already powerful enough. The attack of a Ruler at the ultimate level was enough to strike the low-grade Principle True Treasure armor, 10% of its power can pass through the treasure armor into the body of God is good enough.","The remaining 10% of its power could barely shake Jian Wushuang’s divine body, which was comparable to a lower-grade principle supreme treasure armor.","Jian Wushuang was a perfect life. His divine power was as vast as the sea, and his endurance was much stronger than that of ordinary cultivators.","“The armor of a low-grade principle-type true treasure is combined with a divine body that is comparable to a low-grade principle-type true treasure. If I’m not mistaken, ordinary final-level Rulers can’t hurt me at all. Only some experts among final-level Rulers or some top-notch existences can really hurt me. As for killing me, among final-level Rulers, perhaps only those who are more heaven-defying and have already comprehended a part of the universe’s principles are able to do so,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Ultimate Rulers were already experts in the universe, and there were not many of them. In total, there were only about 20 Ultimate Rulers in the ancient and well-established Great Star Field like the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field.","Ultimate Rulers who had comprehended the universe principles were even rarer. Even in the deepest part of the universe, there were not many such Rulers. However, the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field was only close to the depths, after all, it was not in the depths of the universe, Jian Wushuang had read about the Ultimate Rulers in the Nine Luminaries Star Field. He knew that there was not even one Ultimate Ruler who had comprehended the universe principles in the entire Nine Luminaries Star Field.","Even the strongest palace Ruler of the Thunder God Palace, who was considered to be at the top level among the Ultimate Rulers, was still far from the Ultimate Ruler who had comprehended the universe principles.","This meant that no one could kill him in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy unless there was a hidden Ultimate Ruler or a hidden supreme expert.","With such a powerful body-protection ability, Jian Wushuang was naturally confident.","“If I want to get what I want from the Thunder God Palace, I have to find a way to make the palace compromise. However, my body-protection ability is strong, but my offensive ability is only close to that of an Ultimate Ruler. This strength alone is not enough to make the palace compromise. It seems that I have to prepare well.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","Soon, he walked out of the secret chamber, stayed with Leng Rushuang and Devil Flame, and soon arrived at the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","“Blood Sword, my friend.” Feixue, one of the supervisors of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, continued to receive Jian Wushuang and the other two.","“Supervisor Feixue, I have some venom in my hand. Take a look.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand and took out jade bottles.","Each of these jade bottles contained a drop of venom, a total of nine drops.","In fact, there were twelve drops in total. Jian Wushuang had used one drop to kill Thunder Star Lord, and the other two drops had been refined during his journey. They were hidden in his Wuqi Divine Sword.","Since they were already refined, Jian Wushuang naturally did not take them out.","“Venom?”","Feixue took the jade bottles, opened the stopper, and carefully observed them for a while, then she smiled and said, “Blood Sword, your poison is of high quality. It should be produced by a Poison Ruler who is an Ultimate Ruler. The value of this poison is not bad. I can give you one drop of it for 1,000 universe origin stones.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","Back in the Purple Micro Galaxy, Ballmer had given him the same price.","“Buy all nine drops of Venom for me. In addition, I need a few drops of higher-level venom,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Huh?” Feixue could not help looking at Jian Wushuang in surprise. “Higher-level venom? My friend Blood Sword, what are you...”","“It’s none of your business what I want to do. Just give me the venom,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Of course,” Feixue said with a smile again, “but the nine drops of venom are of high quality and extremely valuable. Under normal circumstances, one drop of venom can easily kill a Ruler at the pinnacle of the fifth level. Even an ultimate level Ruler will be severely injured if he is not killed by this drop of venom. A higher level venom is the kind of venom that will kill even an ultimate level Ruler!”","“Yes, that’s what I want,” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice.","He was determined to make a move against Thunder God Palace, and he had to make it compromise.","Since he wanted to make it compromise, he had to make it fear him. However, he was not strong enough, so he could only rely on this terrifying venom.","Once he had two or three drops of this venom and refined them into the Wuqi Divine Sword, it would be equivalent to Rulering several killing weapons. He could kill the ultimate level Ruler of Thunder God Palace if he was not careful!","This was what truly terrified the Thunder God Palace.","“Blood Sword, although I don’t know why you want this venom, I have to tell you in advance that this venom, which can kill an ultimate level Ruler in one drop, is mostly refined by a Poison Ruler at the Supreme-level. It’s also extremely difficult to use this venom. If you are not careful, you will die first, not to mention killing your enemies,” Feixue said solemnly.","“I know that.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","He knew that, but it was not a problem for him. After all, his soul was invincible. He would not really die during the process of refining the poison. At most, his soul would be destroyed a few more times.","“Well, since you already know, I won’t say anymore. There are three types of venom that can easily kill an Ultimate Ruler that I can find for you in the Nine Emperor Pavilion. Two of the three types of venom are personally refined by a Supreme-level Poison Ruler, and the other one is refined by a Supreme-level Poison Ruler. Although he is only a Ruler, his ability to refine venom is no worse than those Supreme-level Poison Rulers,” Feixue said.","“What’s the price of these three poisons?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“The first two poisons refined by Supreme-level Poison Rulers cost 8,000 universe origin stones each. As for the poison refined by the Ultimate Ruler Poison Ruler, it’s much cheaper. It only costs 5,000 universe origin stones,” Feixue said.","“So expensive!” Jian Wushuang gasped.","“Expensive?","“Actually, it’s already considered cheap.” Feixue smiled and said, “Blood Sword, you should know that the venom is personally refined by a Supreme-level Poison Ruler. Each drop contains the blood and sweat of a Supreme-level expert. If used well, this drop of venom can easily kill those Ultimate Rulers who stand at the top. If it’s not because the venom itself is too corrosive and difficult to use, the value of this venom is much more than that.”"]},{"number":4073,"title":"Chapter 4073 - Everything Was Ready","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang could understand.","After all, it was a poison concocted by a Supreme-level Poison Ruler. One drop was enough to easily destroy an ultimate level Ruler, so it was normal for it to be a little more expensive.","If it was not because the way the poison was used was too harsh and difficult, the price would probably be even more expensive.","“8,000 universe origin stones for one drop. I just bought nine drops of Venom and only got 9,000 universe origin stones. Even with all the resources I have left, I can’t buy two drops of such venom. It seems that I can only settle for the second best,” Jian Wushuang thought.","“Supervisor Feixue, give me two drops of venom for each drop of 5,000 origin stones,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Sure. Two drops of poison, 10,000 origin stones in total,” Feixue said.","Jian Wushuang immediately gave Feixue the origin stones he had obtained after selling the nine drops of poison. Then, he took out 1,000 origin stones from his accumulation.","“My friend Blood Sword, there is one more thing I have to remind you. Even if you manage to refine the poison, you can only use it in a simple way. For example, you can merge it into your magic weapon and then let the poison corrode the opponent’s divine body during the attack. However, there is a prerequisite for this method. Your magic weapon must come into contact with the opponent’s divine body. In other words, you must really attack the opponent’s divine body,” Feixue said.","“Of course, I know that,” Jian Wushuang said.","Feixue did not say anything more and immediately went down to prepare the two drops of venom.","Soon, Feixue brought the two drops of brand-new venom to Jian Wushuang.","The two drops of venom were completely black and ink-like. Although they were in a jade bottle, when Jian Wushuang’s soul power came into contact with them, his body and mind became completely cold and his soul almost froze.","“As expected, these two drops of venom are much more powerful than the one I got from Nine Whiskers.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were shining.","Without a doubt, any one of these two drops of venom could be fatal to an Ultimate Ruler.","Jian Wushuang left the Nine Emperor Pavilion with the two drops of venom. Then he found a new place and began to refine the two drops of venom.","It was even more difficult to refine such a high-level venom.","It took Jian Wushuang a long time to barely refine one drop of the inferior venom he got from Nine Whiskers, and he also spent a lot of energy.","Of course, the current Jian Wushuang was definitely different from before.","Not only had he made great progress in strength, but he also had sufficient experience in refining the venom. Therefore, it did not take him too long to refine it again, although the level was higher.","After 2,000 years, Jian Wushuang had completely refined the two drops of Venom into his Wuqi Divine Sword. On average, he had refined one drop every 1,000 years.","“I’ve already refined the fourth level of the supreme imperishable celestial body, and I’ve completely mastered the two drops of venom, which are worth 10,000 universe origin stones. They have become my trump card. Now, everything is ready. Even if I have more time, my strength and skills won’t be able to improve any further!”","“It’s time to find the Thunder God Palace.”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, which were filled with a fierce light.","He was definitely going to attack the Thunder God Palace. There was no doubt about that.","It was just that when he attacked 5,000 years ago, his strength was obviously not enough. But now, it was almost enough.","“Husband, what are you going to do this time? Do you have a plan?” Leng Rushuang looked at him.","“I’ve already thought of a plan. To be exact, I don’t have a plan. I’ll just kill them,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Kill them? Husband, are you going to...” Leng Rushuang looked surprised and worried.","“Don’t worry. After I’ve cultivated the fourth level of the Supreme-level undying celestial body, almost no one can kill me except for the Supreme-level. As for the Thunder God Palace, although there are three final-level Rulers, I’m confident that I can deal with them,” Jian Wushuang said with a confident smile.","“Shuang ‘er, you and Devil Flame stay in the universe boat and wait for my news,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Leng Rushuang nodded.","Jian Wushuang immediately set off for the Thunder God Palace.","The Thunder God Palace was one of the four most powerful forces in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy. It had a deep foundation and many experts. There were three ultimate level Rulers.","5,000 years ago, although Jian Wushuang had attacked the Thunder God Palace once, he only wanted to attack one of the highest levels of the palace. That was why he lured Emperor Rain out, but he did not expect to fail in the end.","But now, Jian Wushuang did not plan to hide his attack for the second time.","He wanted to directly attack the Thunder God Palace and use his absolute strength to make the palace compromise and bow down to him.","“Before I really go to the nest of the Thunder God Palace, I should first get some chips.” Jian Wushuang smiled. He did not go to the nest of the Thunder God Palace, but went to the Purple Thunder Star World under the command of the Thunder God Palace.","There were eight level one star worlds in the nine Great Star Fields, which were still in the evolution stage. These eight level one star worlds were controlled by the four strongest forces in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field.","The Purple Thunder Star World was a level one star world under the control of the Thunder God Palace.","It must be known that the Thunder God Palace was very powerful in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field and had countless star worlds under its command. For example, there were dozens of level two star worlds under the command of the Thunder God Palace.","Because it had so many second-class star worlds under its command, the Thunder God Palace did not pay much attention to Jian Wushuang when he destroyed the Blood Thunder Cliff.","But the first-class Star Worlds were different.","There were only eight first-class star worlds in the Nine Luminaries Star Field, and the Thunder God Palace only had two.","These two first-class star worlds were very important to the Thunder God Palace.","But today, Jian Wushuang arrived in the first-class astral world, the Purple Thunder Star World.","The Purple Thunder Star World had a Supreme Holy Land, the Purple Thunder Region, which was occupied by the experts of the Thunder God Palace. The palace had also sent many experts to guard this place all year round, moreover, there was a powerful magic array around the Purple Thunder Region. This magic array was extremely strong, and unless one was an ultimate level Ruler, it would be difficult for anyone to break it.","In addition, the Purple Thunder Star World and the Thunder God Palace were connected by a cosmic tunnel. If something big happened in the Purple Thunder Star World, the experts of the Thunder God Palace could come here as soon as possible to rescue them, this made the status of the Thunder God Palace in the Purple Thunder Star World Unshakable.","In the void above the Purple Thunder Region, a figure stood there coldly.","This figure was naturally Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":4074,"title":"Chapter 4074 - Chips","paragraphs":["“The Thunder God Palace really values the first-class astral world. The array in the Purple Thunder Star World is much more powerful than the one in the Blood Thunder Cliff. I’m afraid that without the strength of an Ultimate Ruler, it’s impossible to break the array.”","Jian Wushuang looked down at the boundless land in front of him. This land was completely covered by the array. Through the array, he could see the densely packed buildings and a large number of cultivators.","This land was the foundation of the Thunder God Palace in the Purple Thunder Star World.","“Fortunately, this magic array is not difficult for me.”","Jian Wushuang smiled, but the Wuqi Divine Sword had already appeared in his hand.","Without any hesitation, Jian Wushuang slashed down with his sword in anger.","Jian Wushuang instantly burst out his strongest power, along with the strength of his divine body. The swordsmanship he displayed was the most powerful heaven-opening move.","Boom!","The majestic sword light directly cut into the ancient magic formation. Instantly, the entire magic formation began to shake violently, as if a huge rock had fallen into the water.","In the magic formation, many of the cultivators under the command of the Thunder God Palace raised their heads.","“What’s going on?”","“Someone is attacking the magic formation!”","“This magic formation was personally set up by the Thunder God Palace. Without the strength of an Ultimate Ruler, it’s impossible to move it. But now, it’s shaking so much after just one attack, as if it can’t withstand it. Could it be that an Ultimate Ruler is attacking?”","The experts under the Thunder God Palace were all in an uproar.","Especially those who were at the peak of the Violet Thunder Star World.","“Quick, send a message to the palace. Tell them that an Ultimate Ruler is coming. Ask them to send reinforcements immediately!”","“Quick, ask the First Elder or the palace Ruler to come as soon as possible. Otherwise, it will be too late!”","The fifth-level Rulers from the Thunder God Palace had already gathered together in the array.","These fifth-level Rulers were all extremely powerful. There were even some who stood at the peak of the fifth-level. However, none of them could catch up to Emperor Rain Ruler.","At this moment, these fifth-level Rulers were all filled with panic.","The Thunder God Palace was one of the strongest forces in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field. Almost no one dared to provoke them. Moreover, the Purple Thunder Star Field was one of the two first-level Star Fields under the Thunder God Palace. It could be said that the Thunder God Palace valued the resources the most.","It was precisely because the Thunder God Palace valued the purple thunder star area so much that almost no force or expert in the Nine Luminaries Great Star area dared to come to the Purple Thunder star area to cause trouble.","The Rulers who guarded the Purple Thunder star area had always been living an extremely comfortable life. However, who would have thought that someone would actually come to kill them today? Moreover, judging from the movements of the array formation, the person who came to kill them was most likely an Ultimate Ruler.","The fifth-level Rulers were naturally terrified.","Buzz, buzz, buzz!","The entire magic array was shaking crazily, and it was on the verge of collapsing.","However, in the end, the magic array still withstood Jian Wushuang’s sword.","“It didn’t collapse?” Jian Wushuang looked at the magic array in surprise, but then he smiled and slashed down with the Wuqi Divine Sword again.","If one sword was not enough, he would do it again.","Boom!","The sword light, which was also extremely powerful, mercilessly slashed at the magic formation again.","The magic formation, which had been on the verge of collapse because of the first sword light, could no longer withstand the same attack. It was mercilessly torn apart by the sword light on the spot.","The entire magic formation collapsed completely, turning into a vast amount of energy and dissipating in the void.","The cultivators of the Thunder God Palace who had been hiding under the formation were now completely exposed to Jian Wushuang.","The cultivators who were looking down at the Thunder God Palace were in a mess. Jian Wushuang did not draw his sword again. Instead, he waved his hand and three towering golden stone tablets rose up.","The three Heaven Suppression Tablets appeared at the same time and almost instantly covered the huge buildings below.","As the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation was activated, the boundless suppressive force instantly pressed down on the cultivators of Thunder God Palace.","The suppressive force was so strong that even a fifth-level Ruler would find it difficult to resist it. As for the fourth-level Rulers, the third-level Rulers, and even the weaker ones, under the suppressive force, they even lost their ability to resist.","Some people even knelt down on the spot.","“Haha, come in.”","Jian Wushuang smiled. There was a hidden independent space in the three Heaven Suppression Tablets. This independent space was actually a prison used to suppress people.","Now, Jian Wushuang directly attacked. Ancient Golden Palms extended out from the three Heaven Suppression Tablets. The speed of these golden palms was incredible, they dragged the cultivators of the Thunder God Palace into the independent space and suppressed them.","The cultivators of the Thunder God Palace could not resist the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation.","In just a moment, a large number of cultivators were suppressed by Jian Wushuang into the independent space in the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","The only ones who were not suppressed were the fifth-level Rulers.","“My divine power is only at the fifth-level. Even if I control the three Heaven Suppression Tablets and use the Divine Devil Heaven Suppressing Formation, I won’t be able to suppress the fifth-level Rulers directly. But it doesn’t matter. I just need to spend a little more effort,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile, he had already rushed toward the crowd in front of him.","At this moment, more than a dozen fifth-level Rulers of the Thunder God Palace in the Purple Thunder Star World had gathered together, but their eyes were filled with fear.","It must be known that they had just watched as their subordinates had been suppressed by someone. None of them had been able to resist at all.","But now, everyone else had been suppressed, leaving only them behind.","“Eh?”","These fifth-level Rulers suddenly raised their heads. They all noticed a figure speeding toward them.","“Is that a third-level Ruler?”","“The one attacking us is not an Ultimate Ruler, but a third-level Ruler?”","“That’s impossible!”","The Rulers were stunned.","Jian Wushuang did not bother with them. As soon as he got close, he attacked.","Sword Shadows appeared in his hands. 5,000 years ago, he could easily kill an expert at the peak of the fifth level before he had reached the fourth level of the Supreme-level undying celestial body, although there were more than a dozen fifth-level Rulers here, only two or three of them had reached the peak. Although there were more of them, Jian Wushuang could still deal with them easily.","In just a short while, the dozen or so fifth-level Rulers were killed by Jian Wushuang until they were at their weakest. Then, they were suppressed by Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":4075,"title":"Chapter 4075 - Thunder God Palace Was Furious","paragraphs":["“There are more than a dozen fifth-level Rulers, fourth-level Rulers, and third-level Rulers. As for the first-level Rulers, second-level Rulers, and Principle Rulers, there are countless of them. Although I have captured many people, I’m afraid that only a dozen fifth-level Rulers and a few fourth-level Rulers are worthy of Thunder God Palace’s attention.”","“But it shouldn’t be a big deal for a big force like the Thunder God Palace to lose so many experts. It seems that I don’t have enough chips. I have to catch more experts from the palace,” Jian Wushuang thought.","After making up his mind, Jian Wushuang immediately left the Purple Thunder Star World and rushed to the other star worlds under the command of the Thunder God Palace.","Not long after Jian Wushuang left, a dazzling light lit up on the ground below, followed by a powerful aura appearing in the area.","These people were all experts from the Thunder God Palace who had received the message and rushed to the rescue at the fastest speed. The leader of them was the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace.","!!","“Where is everyone? Why is there no one here?” The First Elder frowned and looked around.","His soul power had already spread out, but he did not sense any aura in the vast void around him, including the many cultivators under the command of the Thunder God Palace who should have been here, there was not a single one.","“Is he late?” The First Elder immediately understood.","Although he had rushed here as soon as he received the message.","It had only taken him a short time to get here from the Thunder God Palace, but there was nothing he could do. Jian Wushuang’s speed was too fast.","With just two strikes, he had broken the formation of the Earth. Then, he used a suppression-type principle treasure to directly suppress the many cultivators under him.","It had only been a short time from Jian Wushuang’s attack to the time when he suppressed all the experts and left. The First Elder had indeed failed to catch up.","“According to the previous news, the person who attacked was a third-level Ruler. However, the strength of this third-level Ruler is very likely to be able to suppress all the experts of our Thunder God Palace in the Purple Thunder Star World in an extremely short period of time. This third-level Ruler...” The First Elder’s eyes were cold. “If I’m not mistaken, it should be the person who attacked Emperor Rain previously.”","The First Elder had guessed that it was Jian Wushuang, but he could not do anything about it. After all, he did not know where Jian Wushuang was, and he did not have Jian Wushuang’s communication token, so he could not find Jian Wushuang at all.","In desperation, the First Elder of Thunder God Palace had to take his people back to Thunder God Palace.","However, not long after he returned to Thunder God Palace, there was news that a second-level astral world under the command of Thunder God Palace had been attacked by a third-level Ruler in a very short period of time, almost all the experts in the second-level astral world had been suppressed by the other party.","Then, another second-level astral world was attacked again..","In order to increase his bargaining chip with the Thunder God Palace, Jian Wushuang did not hesitate to go to one astral world after another under the control of the palace and attack the experts of the palace.","He did not kill any of the experts of the palace. Instead, he used a thunderous method to suppress all the experts of the palace and locked them in the independent space of the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","One astral world after another was suppressed. Although the Thunder God Palace had responded and issued various orders to deal with Jian Wushuang’s attack, they were all useless.","However, the result was useless.","Jian Wushuang definitely had the strength of an Ultimate Ruler, and the Thunder God Palace only had three Ultimate Rulers, all of whom were still in the nest of the Thunder God Palace.","In other words, as long as Jian Wushuang did not go to the nest of the palace, the palace would not be able to do anything to him.","As for the Star Worlds under the palace, although they had a certain amount of power, it was a joke in front of Jian Wushuang. He could easily sweep through the second-grade star worlds by himself, he could suppress the experts of the Thunder God Palace.","Just like that, Jian Wushuang swept through one first-level star world, fifteen second-level star worlds, and suppressed countless experts of the Thunder God Palace.","Although the Thunder God Palace was thinking of various countermeasures, so far, they had not threatened Jian Wushuang.","After sweeping through fifteen second-level star worlds, Jian Wushuang finally stopped.","“15 second-level astral worlds, including the Purple Thunder Star World, all the experts left by the Thunder God Palace in these astral worlds have been suppressed by me. So far, I have suppressed more than 40 fifth-level Rulers, hundreds of fourth-level Rulers and third-level Rulers, not to mention the number of other Rulers and Principle Rulers. There are also some talented geniuses among them. Even the Thunder God Palace should care about such a force, right?” Jian Wushuang smiled.","These experts that he had suppressed would all become his bargaining chips.","And in his opinion, the bargaining chips he had now might not be enough to make the Thunder God Palace nervous or furious, but it was definitely enough to make the Thunder God Palace pay attention.","At the very least, the Thunder God Palace didn’t dare to ignore this power. Once he went all out and killed all these experts that had been suppressed, he believed that the Thunder God Palace would also be anxious.","To be able to reach this point was already enough.","“With these chips, it should be more than enough. Even if I continue to sweep through an astral world and an astral world like this, although I can capture even more experts from the Thunder God Palace, it would only be icing on the cake. In addition, the Thunder God Palace isn’t stupid. Previously, it was me who acted too quickly. But now, they should have already reacted and ordered those astral world experts to hide. They won’t give me the chance to continue suppressing them.”","“It’s about time. Next, I should go to the Thunder God Palace and have a face-to-face talk with the Ultimate Ruler of the Thunder God Palace.”","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and immediately set off toward the headquarters of the Thunder God Palace.","At this moment, the Thunder God Palace was already in a state of fury.","The Thunder God Palace had been dominating the Nine Luminaries Star Field for too long. Over the long period of time, the Thunder God Palace had been high and mighty in the Nine Luminaries Star Field.","Other than the three strongest forces that were on par with him, no one in the Nine Luminaries Great Star area dared to provoke the Thunder God Palace.","Even final realm Rulers generally would not dare to provoke the Thunder God Palace. This was because the Thunder God Palace not only had three final realm Rulers, but also had a deep foundation. They had all kinds of trump cards and had the ability to kill the final realm Rulers.","It was because of this that the Thunder God Palace was able to occupy such a vast territory and control so many astral worlds.","But today, the Thunder God Palace was truly provoked.","Not only was it provoked, it was even humiliated. It was pressed to the ground and rubbed against each other.","The entire Thunder God Palace was naturally furious."]},{"number":4076,"title":"Chapter 4076 - The Negotiations Had Come to an End","paragraphs":["Within the Thunder God Palace, the three Ultimate Rulers of the Thunder God Palace, the Thunder God Palace Master, the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace, and the Blood Thunder General, had gathered together.","“Have you found out who that person is?” The Thunder God Palace Master asked coldly.","“No.” The First Elder of the Thunder God Palace shook his head. “If I’m not wrong, this person should be from another Star Field. He is an outsider. The reason why he attacked my Thunder God Palace this time is related to the person we put a bounty on. Right now, he is sweeping through many Star Worlds under my Thunder God Palace and suppressing our experts. I guess he is using these suppressed experts as bargaining chips to negotiate with my Thunder God Palace.”","“Negotiate? Humph!” Thunder God Palace Master snorted and looked around. “Has the order been given?”","“It has been given. The experts of Thunder God Palace have hidden in the Star Worlds that are important to us. Even if that person rushed over now, he would only be able to find nothing. As for the ordinary Star Worlds, such as a large number of level three Star Worlds, I have also ordered some important people to hide,” said the First Elder of Thunder God Palace.","!!","“That’s good.” Thunder God Palace Master nodded slightly.","There were too many Star Worlds under the control of Thunder God Palace. If they allowed Jian Wushuang to sweep through them one by one, Thunder God Palace would not be able to withstand it.","“Since he wants to get enough bargaining chips to negotiate with us, he should come to us if he can’t use them,” Thunder God Palace Master said.","“That should be the case.” The First Elder of Thunder God Palace nodded.","At this moment...","“Thunder God Palace Master, come out and talk.”","A magnificent voice was suddenly transmitted from the void outside of Thunder God Palace, resounding in the entire Thunder God Palace.","The Thunder God Palace Master, the First Elder of Thunder God Palace, and the Blood Thunder General immediately raised their heads.","“He came to our door so soon?” The Thunder God Palace Master narrowed his eyes.","“How dare he come directly to my Thunder God Palace’s Lair? He’s really courting death.” The First Elder of Thunder God Palace smiled coldly.","“Let’s go and meet him together.”","The Three Palace Masters left at the same time.","Jian Wushuang stood alone in the void outside of Thunder God Palace with his hands behind his back. He looked down at the ancient sect below.","It was worthy of being one of the strongest forces in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy. The Thunder God Palace’s nest was majestic and beautiful. The sect-protecting formation alone was terrifying. Jian Wushuang’s eyesight was not bad. He could tell at a glance that the sect-protecting formation of the Thunder God Palace’s nest...it was probably impossible to break in forcefully without the strength of a supreme-level expert.","“The Thunder God Palace’s heritage is extraordinary.” Jian Wushuang could not help but exclaim in admiration.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Three figures suddenly burst out of Thunder God Palace and arrived in front of Jian Wushuang. Behind them were experts from Thunder God Palace, including the first principle enforcement elder, Emperor Rain.","“The three Ultimate Rulers of Thunder God Palace are all here.” Jian Wushuang looked at the three people in front of him with a smile.","Among them, he had fought with the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace. However, the First Elder was clearly standing on the side. The leader was the burly man in purple armor.","The burly man in purple armor should be the Thunder God Palace Master, a top-notch Ultimate Ruler. Jian Wushuang could not help but feel a sense of fear when he glanced at the burly man.","He was also an Ultimate Ruler, but the Thunder God Palace Master was much stronger than all the other Ultimate Rulers he had met before.","“Thunder God Palace Master, I’ve heard a lot about you.” Jian Wushuang smiled and greeted him as if he was an old friend.","“Humph!” Thunder God Palace Master snorted, “Are you the one who swept through more than ten Star Worlds under Thunder God Palace and suppressed many cultivators of Thunder God Palace?”","“Yes, I am.” Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile.","“A third-level Ruler can easily defeat a fifth-level Ruler. A top-notch genius like you shouldn’t hide it. Tell me your name.” Thunder God Palace Master said.","“Blood Sword,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Where are the cultivators under the command of Thunder God Palace?” Thunder God Palace Master asked.","“They are in a suppression-type principle treasure that I carry with me. Don’t worry, they are all alive and well. I didn’t kill anyone from your palace.” Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Thunder God Palace Master, let’s talk.”","“Talk? What a joke.” Thunder God Palace Master sneered, “If you had lowered yourself from the beginning and come to my palace to visit me politely, perhaps we would have had a chance to talk. But now, you have attacked my palace without saying anything. You have suppressed many of my palace’s cultivators and used them as bargaining chips to threaten my palace to talk to you...I’m sorry, my palace has stood in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy for so many years and has never been threatened by anyone!”","“Thunder God Palace Master, do you mean that you don’t care about the lives of the experts of your palace?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold.","“Haha, they are just dozens of fifth-level Rulers. My palace can afford to lose them. Even if they all die, they will die for my palace.” Thunder God Palace Master laughed coldly, there was no hesitation in his words.","“Dozens of fifth-level Rulers, and a large number of third-level and fourth-level Rulers. How could the Thunder God Palace not care about so many experts? Thunder God Palace Master is really bold.” Jian Wushuang could not help praising.","“Blood Sword, you have underestimated the Thunder God Palace. The Thunder God Palace has no intention to talk to you. Since you dare to come to the Thunder God Palace today, you should leave your life behind.” Thunder God Palace Master’s voice was cold, “Go, kill him!”","With the order of the Palace Master, the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace and the Blood Thunder General behind him immediately attacked.","The two ultimate realm Rulers did not care about their status at this moment. They attacked Jian Wushuang at the same time.","As for the strongest Palace Master, he was not in a hurry to attack.","“I wanted to use this little bargaining chip to make the palace give in, but now it seems...” Jian Wushuang shook his head. He had thought that the negotiation would fail, but he did not expect the palace to be so decisive. They did not even talk about it, they wanted to kill him directly.","“I have no choice. I can only use the second plan to kill the palace and make them compromise.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. The Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand, and an extremely powerful aura suddenly rose from his body.","“Boy, die!”","A low shout suddenly sounded in the sky. It was the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace.","The First Elder of the Thunder God Palace had fought with Jian Wushuang before. He knew that although Jian Wushuang was only a third-level Ruler, his real strength was not weak. Therefore, he did not hold back at the beginning."]},{"number":4077,"title":"Chapter 4077 - The Battle Against the Ultimate Ruler","paragraphs":["Buzz! A large amount of green divine power rapidly gathered in the void.","In the blink of an eye, it actually formed a huge green jade palm that towered into the sky. This jade palm contained nine different principles at the same time, perfectly fusing together, causing one’s heart to tremble.","As the cyan jade palm slowly covered down, the void below seemed to be unable to withstand the power, and cracks appeared faintly, as if it would collapse at any time.","Looking at the cyan jade palm slowly covered down, Jian Wushuang smiled coldly and instantly slashed out with his Wuqi Divine Sword.","The strongest power instantly exploded!","!!","First move of splitting heaven!","Whoosh!","The result was the same as before. The green jade palm was cut in half by the majestic sword light, and a large amount of green divine power spread out in all directions.","“Huh?”","The First Elder of Thunder God Palace could not help frowning. “This kid seems to be much stronger than last time?”","The First Elder of Thunder God Palace indeed felt that Jian Wushuang’s strength had increased.","After all, when he fought with Jian Wushuang last time, his giant hand was also cut in half by Jian Wushuang’s sword.","But at that time, he did not use his full strength. It was just a casual attack, and Jian Wushuang had used his full strength.","But now, he had used all his strength. His cyan jade giant hand was much stronger than the palm that had attacked Jian Wushuang. In the end, it was still cut in half by Jian Wushuang’s sword.","There was no doubt that Jian Wushuang was stronger than before.","Whoosh!","A ghost-like figure suddenly appeared beside Jian Wushuang.","It was none other than the Blood Thunder General, who controlled a special troop of the Thunder God Palace, which was an assassination troop.","The Blood Thunder General was also good at assassination. His speed was incredible.","When he appeared beside Jian Wushuang, the Blood Thunder General drew a line in his palm and a long black sword burst out.","Jian Wushuang had already reacted. He slightly stepped back while Wuqi Divine Sword instantly cut across him.","Clang!","When the two come into contact, there was a flash of light.","“Humph!”","The Blood Thunder General snorted coldly. The dark long sword in his hand, however, was like a poisonous snake! Psst! Psst! Psst!","A sword followed a sword, with the fastest speed burst forward.","Just in a blink of an eye, the Blood Thunder General directly stabbed hundreds of swords, each sword was extremely fast, and the power is extremely terrifying.","However, to his surprise, Jian Wushuang’s speed was not slow at all. In the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang also stabbed hundreds of times, completely blocking his attack.","Clang!","With another sound of metal colliding, Blood Thunder General’s figure floated backward like a ghost.","“This kid...” Blood Thunder General looked at Jian Wushuang in horror.","He was an Ultimate Ruler and an assassin. Speed was his specialty. In the blink of an eye, he had stabbed out hundreds of times. This was definitely one of his killing moves, but his killing move...had actually been completely blocked by this third-level Ruler.","“Blood Thunder, be careful. This kid isn’t weak at all.” The First Elder of Thunder God Palace appeared next to Blood Thunder General and said.","“I can tell.” Blood Thunder General nodded slightly. “He has already comprehended the principles of the universe, and judging from the fact that he was able to keep up with my sword-arts, his comprehension of the principles of the universe is quite high. He should be able to at least pass the fourth level of the Principle Sea, or even the fifth level.”","“The fifth level of the Principle Sea?” The First Elder of Thunder God Palace was also shocked.","They were all Ultimate Rulers, so they knew clearly what it meant for a third-level Ruler to pass the fifth level of the Principle Sea.","“Don’t hold back. Kill him with all your strength,” the First Elder of Thunder God Palace shouted. A violent aura rose from his body, and his aura instantly soared.","Boom!","The First Elder of Thunder God Palace turned into a huge dark cloud and charged toward Jian Wushuang.","As for General Xue Lei, he also disappeared into the void.","In the next moment, bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","A series of terrifying explosions could be heard. Jian Wushuang had already fought with the First Elder of Thunder God Palace in the dark cloud.","Unlike before, the First Elder of Thunder God Palace was defeated by Jian Wushuang in a head-on attack, but now the First Elder of Thunder God Palace was fighting Jian Wushuang in close combat.","The Blood Thunder General hid in the surrounding void with his body, occasionally giving Jian Wushuang a fatal blow.","The combination of two Ultimate Rulers was extremely terrifying, especially the attack of the Blood Thunder General. It was too strange and fast, making it impossible to guard against.","If it were an ordinary Ultimate Ruler, he would probably be in an extremely difficult situation when facing the combined attack of the two. He might even be able to set up a formation very quickly.","However, Jian Wushuang was different.","Although Jian Wushuang was not an Ultimate Ruler, and his strength was not even comparable to an Ultimate Ruler to a certain extent, his advantage was something that most Ultimate Rulers did not have.","That was because his comprehension of the universe principles was too high. His comprehension of the universe principles was extremely high, and it was perfectly combined with sword principle. This made his swordsmanship extremely mysterious, not only could he easily withstand the head-on attack of the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace, but he could also react in time to the repeated attacks of the Blood Thunder General and easily withstand them.","Even if it was one against two, he would not be at a disadvantage.","“Although both of them are very strong, they can indeed defeat an ordinary Ultimate Ruler. Unfortunately, they are facing me.” Jian Wushuang also smiled.","In fact, for an expert like him who had a high comprehension of the universe principles and could combine sword principle, the best way to defeat him was to break the principle with force and crush him with his powerful strength.","It would be a joke if the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace and the Blood Thunder General came to fight him in close combat.","The swordsmanship that he displayed was far more exquisite than the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace and the Blood Thunder General. If it were not for the fact that he was weaker than the Ultimate Ruler and the Blood Thunder General’s assassination techniques were indeed powerful...he had long repelled these two people.","The First Elder of the Thunder God Palace and the Blood Thunder General had also realized this.","“No, his swordsmanship is too profound. It’s much more exquisite than our attacks. If we fight him in close combat, we’re just asking for it.” The First Elder of the Thunder God Palace said in a low voice.","“This kid is indeed very strong. We can’t take him down with just the two of us.” The Blood Thunder General said.","While they were talking, they all looked behind them at the same time. The Thunder God Palace Master was there."]},{"number":4078,"title":"Chapter 4078 - Thunder God Palace Master Made His Move","paragraphs":["Thunder God Palace Master stood in the surrounding void and did not make his move.","After all, he was the strongest person in Thunder God Palace. Even among the Ultimate Rulers, he was extremely strong and could even be called a peak existence.","He was Thunder God Palace’s greatest reliance.","But it was precisely because of this that he would not act rashly. Because once he personally acted, it meant that the Thunder God Palace had been pushed to the limit by the other party.","Moreover, the person who was currently charging in front of them was only a third-tier Ruler. The Thunder God Palace Master had to maintain his identity first. Secondly, he also believed that the Thunder God Palace’s First Elder and the Blood Thunder General Ruler working together...it would be enough to take him down.","!!","However, the reality was completely beyond his expectations.","The First Elder of Thunder God Palace and the Blood Thunder General, two Ultimate Rulers, had joined hands and unleashed their full strength, but they could not do anything to this third-level Ruler!","Seeing the pleading eyes of the First Elder of Thunder God Palace and the Blood Thunder General, Thunder God Palace Master’s face turned ashen. After a long while, he finally sighed.","“You two, leave,” Thunder God Palace Master said.","The First Elder of Thunder God Palace and Blood Thunder General immediately retreated. After leaving Jian Wushuang, they still looked at Jian Wushuang with a trace of horror.","Perhaps the onlookers could not see it, but they knew very well that since the two of them fought with Jian Wushuang in close combat, not only did the opponent not feel much pressure, but he also became much more relaxed, he easily blocked their attacks as if he was strolling in the garden.","From the beginning to the end, their attacks did not cause any pressure to the other party.","On the contrary, it was the other party’s exquisite swordsmanship that made the two of them feel great pressure at all times.","“Palace Master, this kid’s comprehension of the universe principles is too high, and his swordsmanship is also very mysterious. If his strength is not much different from his, he can completely rely on his comprehension of the universe principles to easily play us,” the First Elder of Thunder God Palace said softly.","“I see.” Thunder God Palace Master nodded slightly, but his eyes were unusually cold.","“A third-level Ruler can make two Ultimate Rulers of Thunder God Palace helpless. Blood Sword, you are very powerful!” Thunder God Palace Master stared at Jian Wushuang. “Ever since I became the Thunder God Palace Master, there is almost no one in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy that I admire. But today, I can’t admire you. Without a doubt, you are the most terrifying genius that I have seen in my many years of life!”","The First Elder of the Thunder God Palace and the Blood Thunder General looked extremely solemn.","They both agreed with the words of the Thunder God Palace Master.","A third-level Ruler was able to fight head-on with their Ultimate Ruler, and they could not do anything to him even if they joined hands. How difficult was that?","Even in the entire universe, it would be difficult to find such a formidable third-level Ruler?","“Thunder God Palace Master, there’s no need to compliment me. You can either do it yourself or tell me everything I want to know,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“In that case, it seems that I’ll have to do it myself,” Thunder God Palace Master said calmly.","Although Thunder God Palace Master’s words were very calm, Jian Wushuang immediately became vigilant.","After all, Thunder God Palace Master was not the same as the previous two.","Whether it was the First Elder of Thunder God Palace or the Blood Thunder General Ruler, although they were both Ultimate Rulers, they were only ordinary Ultimate Rulers.","But Thunder God Palace Master was considered to be at the top level among the Ultimate Rulers!","Before Jian Wushuang decided to kill his way to Thunder God Palace, he had carefully inquired about the strength gap between the Ultimate Rulers of Devil Flame. Devil Flame told him that the strength gap between each level of the Ultimate Rulers was very huge.","Generally speaking, those who could reach the top level among the Ultimate Rulers could be more than ten times stronger than ordinary Ultimate Rulers!","“Thunder God Palace Master, let me see how strong you are, the strongest expert of the Thunder God Palace.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, but there was a hint of excitement in them.","Thunder God Palace Master did not say anything else. He just looked at Jian Wushuang coldly.","The next moment, a huge axe appeared in his hand.","It was a red-gold huge axe. It was five meters long and was surrounded by layers of golden thunderbolts. These golden thunderbolts danced wildly in the void, an extremely violent aura was transmitted from the huge axe.","“It’s a medium-grade principle treasure. It’s almost close to an upper-grade principle treasure.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","He could tell that the huge axe that Thunder God Palace Master took out was not much weaker than his Wuqi Divine Sword.","“Die!”","Thunder God Palace Master said lightly.","As soon as he finished his words, he chopped down with the light golden axe in his hand.","There were no fancy moves, and Thunder God Palace Master did not want to fight Jian Wushuang in close combat. After all, he knew that Jian Wushuang had a very high comprehension of the universe principles, his swordsmanship was much more exquisite than his axe skills.","However, Thunder God Palace’s advantage was also very obvious. It was pure power.","He could easily kill the Ultimate Ruler of the fifth level with a casual attack.","And now, he was using his full strength...as the earth-shaking and terrifying power swept out, countless experts watching the battle showed fear and awe.","Even the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace and the Blood Thunder General, the two Ultimate Rulers, could not help but feel frightened.","The power of the axe of the Thunder God Palace Master was too strong.","It was more than ten times stronger than the most powerful attack of the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace and the Blood Thunder General!","The Mighty Axe Shadow slashed directly at Jian Wushuang. When the axe shadow arrived, it had completely sealed off the void around Jian Wushuang, giving him no room to escape or dodge.","It was purely using force to suppress others!","“Humph!”","Jian Wushuang also appeared as fast as lightning and unleashed his strongest power at this moment.","The mighty power continued to merge into his Wuqi Divine Sword. In the next moment, he directly slashed out with his strongest move, the first move of splitting heaven.","This sword attack was previously able to cut off the cyan crystal jade palm condensed by the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace.","At this moment, this majestic sword light collided with the Mighty Axe Shadow.","Bang!","A low sound of collision rang out, and the surrounding void seemed to tremble at this moment.","Jian Wushuang only felt a terrifying power that was completely superior to his own. His heaven-cleaving first move sword skill instantly collapsed, but the Mighty Golden Axe Shadow did not lose its momentum, in an instant, it completely submerged his body.","Bang!","The axe shadow directly hacked Jian Wushuang’s body, directly cutting him into the ground below. A huge hole appeared out of nowhere.","..."]},{"number":4079,"title":"Chapter 4079 - No Injuries?","paragraphs":["“So powerful!”","The hearts of many experts from Thunder God Palace, including the First Elder of Thunder God Palace and Blood Thunder General, twitched when they saw that Jian Wushuang was instantly cut into the ground below.","He was indeed terrifyingly powerful.","After all, the First Elder of Thunder God Palace and Blood Thunder General could not do anything to Jian Wushuang when they joined hands just now.","However, the Thunder God Palace Master had completely crushed Jian Wushuang with only one blow.","!!","At the same time, the supreme Ruler, the Thunder God Palace Master, was more powerful than the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace and the Blood Thunder General.","“Is the Ruler called Blood Sword dead?”","“Such a terrible blow directly hit his divine body. He is only a third-level Ruler. Even if he doesn’t die, I’m afraid he won’t have a good ending.”","“Tell him to come to my Thunder God Palace to provoke us. In my opinion, he’s dead for sure.”","Many cultivators of the Thunder God Palace began to discuss among themselves. They all looked down at the pit in the ground.","Suddenly...whoosh!","A bolt of lightning shot out from the pit and appeared in the void in the blink of an eye.","“Haha, as expected of Thunder God Palace Master. His strength is much stronger than that of other Ultimate Rulers.” A hearty laughter echoed in the world.","Seeing Jian Wushuang reappear in the void, and sensing that his aura was not weakened at all, the experts of Thunder God Palace were stunned.","“How could it be?”","“It’s fine that he’s not dead, but why is he still alive and kicking?”","“His aura is not weakened at all? Could it be that the axe just now did not hurt him?”","The experts of Thunder God Palace widened their eyes in disbelief.","“This is impossible!” The First Elder of Thunder God Palace and the Blood Thunder General shouted at the same time.","They were both Ultimate Rulers with the protection of lower-grade principle true treasure armors. However, even they would be injured by the axe of Thunder God Palace Master.","As for Jian Wushuang, although his battle strength was not much weaker than theirs, he was only a third-level Ruler?","A third-level Ruler should not be able to protect his body as well as theirs, right?","How could he take the blow and still be unharmed?","“This kid...” Palace Master Thor narrowed his eyes slightly.","In fact, he was as shocked as the First Elder of Thunder God Palace and the Chief of Blood Thunder Army. However, Jian Wushuang did not seem to be injured when he reappeared in front of him.","“Could it be that this kid has some special treasures, such as some powerful and heaven-defying elixirs, that can heal his injuries in an instant?” Thunder God Palace Master could not help but think, but his expression soon recovered, “I’d like to see if you really have such a great ability.”","Thunder God Palace Master attacked again and raised the giant axe in his hand. However, the moment he raised the giant axe this time, the momentum was even greater.","The destructive aura condensed in the giant axe was even stronger.","“Humph!”","As Thunder God Palace Master snorted, the giant axe in his hand hacked down again.","The same axe, which used force to suppress people, was not fancy, but more powerful and powerful.","The mighty shadow of the axe once again arrived in front of Jian Wushuang.","However, this time, Jian Wushuang did not intend to use the sword skill of the first move of heaven to fight head-on. Instead, he directly activated the sword formation.","Buzz! A special energy fluctuation spread out.","Streams of special sword essence surged crazily, forming layers of tough sword domains.","In a short while, Jian Wushuang had condensed nearly 100 earth sword domains in front of him. Moreover, these earth sword domains were perfectly combined in a special way, forming a huge and complete sword formation of earth protection!","It was Jian Wushuang’s most powerful protective move, the Earth Guardian Sword Formation!","As Jian Wushuang’s use of the universal principles continued to improve, and with the perfect combination of sword principle, the power of this sword formation was much stronger than before.","This sword formation was definitely Jian Wushuang’s most powerful protective move.","Boom!","The Axe Shadow with astonishing power finally arrived in front of Jian Wushuang and directly hit the Earth Guardian Sword Formation.","The entire Earth Guardian Sword Formation began to tremble crazily at this moment. Layer after layer of the Emperor Sword realm was destroyed one after another.","In the blink of an eye, more than half of the Earth Guardian Sword Formation was destroyed, but the giant axe was still extremely powerful and continued to attack.","Finally, all the Earth Sword Realms in the Earth Guardian Sword Formation were destroyed. The Earth Guardian Sword Formation was split open by the Axe Shadow.","“My Earth Guardian Sword Formation was defeated?” Jian Wushuang secretly clicked his tongue, but he was not surprised.","After all, he was an ultimate dominator at the top level, and he had used his ultimate move. It was normal for him to break through the Earth Guardian Sword Formation.","However, after the axe shadow destroyed the Earth Guardian Sword Formation, more than half of its power had been consumed. Although the remaining power continued to pass through, it was weakened by the armor of the principle-type supreme treasure on Jian Wushuang’s body, not much of it had actually passed through Jian Wushuang’s divine body.","Jian Wushuang’s divine body was also comparable to an inferior-grade principle supreme treasure, so it was not a big deal for him to take the attack head-on.","On the surface, after taking the attack, Jian Wushuang was only knocked back a relatively long distance before he regained his balance.","Jian Wushuang still had a smile on his face, “Thunder God Palace Master, was that your strongest attack?","“If that’s all you’ve got, I’m afraid you’ll be disappointed today. With such little strength, you won’t even be able to hurt me, let alone kill me.”","Although Jian Wushuang’s words sounded arrogant, he was telling the truth.","Thunder God Palace Master’s attack could not hurt him.","The experts of Thunder God Palace were completely stunned.","“He, he is really not injured?”","“He took Palace Master’s axe head-on like nothing happened? His aura did not weaken at all!”","“Where did this Blood Sword come from?!”","Not only the experts of Thunder God Palace, but also the three Ultimate Rulers of Thunder God Palace.","Thunder God Palace Master, the First Elder of Thunder God Palace, and Blood Thunder General Ruler all looked extremely gloomy.","Especially Thunder God Palace Master.","If it was the first axe, Thunder God Palace Master suspected that Jian Wushuang was just putting on an act, or that he had been seriously injured and only recovered the instant elixir or special treasure.","However, he had clearly seen the whole process of the second axe. There was no such thing as putting on an act or swallowing a treasure to recover divine power.","Jian Wushuang took his axe head-on, but he was not injured at all!"]},{"number":4080,"title":"Chapter 4080 - Jian Wushuang’s Killer Move!","paragraphs":["“How is this possible? How is he not injured?” The First Elder of Thunder God Palace roared.","“The sword array he just displayed should be a protective sword array. It is extremely powerful, but Palace Master’s axe is even more powerful. Although the most powerful axe of Palace Master was weakened by the sword array by more than half, the remaining power still hit him. He has a principle true treasure armor, but the power of that axe can not be completely blocked by the principle true treasure armor. Even if only 10 percent of the power of that axe was transmitted to his divine body, it should be enough to kill a third-level Ruler easily. At the very least, it should be enough to severely injure him, right?","“But the result...” the Blood Thunder General frowned.","It was only now that they realized what a terrifying monster this Ruler called Blood Sword was.","He was only a third-tier Ruler, but his combat power was comparable to an Ultimate Ruler. His comprehension of the principles of the universe was incredible.","!!","At the same time, his protective means were extremely heaven-defying. Even the most powerful axe of Thunder God Palace Master could not hurt him at all.","“Where did this monster come from?” The First Elder of Thunder God Palace could not help but ask. He looked at Jian Wushuang with a hint of fear in his eyes.","Indeed, it was fear.","Although Jian Wushuang did not seem to be very strong at the moment, he was still only a third-level Ruler.","If he could not defeat a third-level Ruler, what would happen when he made a breakthrough and reached the fourth, fifth, or Ultimate Ruler level?","By then, the Thunder God Palace would be no different from an ant in front of the Blood Sword Ruler?","“Thunder God Palace Master.”","Jian Wushuang’s voice rang out again. “Is that really your strongest move?”","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Thunder God Palace Master frowned and fell silent.","“It seems so.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly, he continued, “Your Thunder God Palace has been an overlord in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy for so many years. With such a deep foundation, you must have many trump cards. Why don’t you try them out and see if they can kill me?”","Thunder God Palace Master fell silent again.","It was true that Thunder God Palace had some trump cards.","However, even if he used his strongest trump card, he was not confident that he could kill the Blood Sword Ruler in front of him. Instead, he had wasted his strongest trump card.","Although he did not want to admit it, Thunder God Palace Master knew very well that with the strength of Thunder God Palace, he could not kill the Blood Sword Ruler in front of him. Even if Thunder God Palace was desperate, they could not do it.","“I have given you a chance. It seems that your Thunder God Palace can’t Seize It. In that case, I will show you my skills next.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly turned cold.","“What do you want to do?” Thunder God Palace Master stared at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang smiled coldly, but his body suddenly moved.","Like a ghost, he directly slashed toward the Void to the side. In that direction was the Blood Thunder General.","“Blood Thunder, be careful!” Thunder God Palace Master warned him.","The Blood Thunder General was already alert, but he was not afraid when he saw Jian Wushuang coming toward him.","Although Jian Wushuang’s battle strength was not weaker than his, he was not much stronger than him. Logically, Jian Wushuang should not be a threat to him in a one-on-one fight.","However, soon, Blood Thunder General’s expression changed.","“So fast!” Blood Thunder General’s eyes turned red.","He was ready to attack when he saw Jian Wushuang appear in front of him, but he did not expect Jian Wushuang’s sword move to be so fast.","It was unbelievably fast. It was so fast that he, the Ultimate Ruler, had no time to block it.","It was a swordsmanship that was performed right under his nose. He had seen Jian Wushuang’s sword, but he could not block it at all.","He could not keep up with Jian Wushuang’s speed at all.","“How can it be so fast?” Blood Thunder General Ruler was in disbelief. He could only watch as Jian Wushuang’s cold sword light passed through his divine body.","“Huh?” Blood Thunder General Ruler was stunned. “The power of this sword seems to be very ordinary.”","It was indeed very ordinary. The moment the sword light flashed past, Blood Thunder General Ruler did not feel much. The power of that sword was very ordinary. It had probably only reached the threshold of an Ultimate Ruler. Although it had struck his body...however, he had the protection of his principle true treasure armor, so this sword attack could not hurt him at all.","“Is it just fast?” Blood Thunder General Ruler could not help but think.","But in the next moment, his eyes widened.","“Oh no!”","Blood Thunder General Ruler’s eyes were red, as if he was about to spit blood.","At this moment, he was enduring an extremely terrifying attack.","This terrifying attack came from the venom attack carried by the Wuqi Divine Sword!","Yes, Jian Wushuang’s sword was indeed fast, but its power was very ordinary. Under normal circumstances, it could not hurt Blood Thunder General Ruler, but if the Wuqi Divine Sword was infused with venom, it would be completely different.","The moment the venom touched the Blood Thunder General’s body along the Wuqi Divine Sword, it immediately passed through the principle true treasure armor and entered the Blood Thunder General’s divine body.","The Blood Thunder General’s true treasure armor could resist material damage, but it could not resist the corrosion of the pervasive venom.","In an instant, the terrifying power of the drop of venom completely exploded in the Blood Thunder General’s divine body.","“Pu!”","A large mouthful of fresh blood violently spurted out from the Blood Thunder General’s mouth. This Blood Thunder General was an Ultimate Ruler, and at this moment, he was so frightened that his face turned pale. His divine power was being consumed at an inconceivable speed.","In just an instant, his divine power had actually been consumed by more than 70%.","Fortunately, after consuming more than 70% of his divine power, he was able to temporarily suppress the erosive power within his body.","“Blood Thunder!”","“Blood Thunder!”","Thunder God Palace Master and the First Elder of Thunder Palace had already arrived beside the Blood Thunder General. Both of them looked anxious.","The Blood Thunder General slowly opened his eyes, “That was close. I almost died!”","The Blood Thunder General knew very well that he had indeed walked on the edge of life and death just now. He almost died.","“Blood Sword!”","Seeing the miserable look on Blood Thunder General’s face, Thunder God Palace Master could not help gnashing his teeth.","Jian Wushuang also looked over, “Thunder God Palace Master, you may not know this, but I have two different kinds of poison. The one I just used on Blood Thunder General was only a drop worth 1,000 origin stones, but I have a drop worth 5,000 origin stones, and a stronger one. Do you want to try it?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and a drop of pitch-black poison, which emitted a terrifying aura, appeared in front of him.","..."]},{"number":4081,"title":"Chapter 4081 - Blackmail","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang did have two kinds of venom in his hand.","One was the 12 drops he had gotten from Nine Whiskers. Although he had used one drop and sold another nine drops, he had already refined the remaining two drops and fused them into the Wuqi Divine Sword.","This was the poison he had used to deal with the Blood Thunder General. Although this poison was personally refined by a poison Ruler of an Ultimate Ruler, it was extremely powerful and could easily kill a fifth-level Ruler, however, if it was used to deal with an Ultimate Ruler, some of the weaker Ultimate Rulers might fall. However, as long as they were slightly stronger, they could still forcefully block it.","The Blood Thunder General survived the attack of the venom.","However, this was also because Jian Wushuang did not kill him directly. If he wanted to kill him, he would use the second venom, which was the pitch-black venom in his hand.","This venom was worth 5,000 universe origin stones per drop. Among the Ultimate Rulers, unless they had comprehended the universe principles and were extremely powerful, they would be killed by the corrosion of this venom, they would almost certainly die.","If Jian Wushuang had used this poison just now, it was absolutely impossible for the Blood Thunder General Ruler to survive.","Not to mention the Blood Thunder General Ruler, even the Thunder God Palace Master might die if he was accidentally corroded by this poison.","Therefore, the moment Jian Wushuang took out this pitch-black poison, the Thunder God Palace Master, the First Elder of the Thunder God Palace, and the heavily injured Blood Thunder General Ruler were all shocked.","“That, that is...” Thunder God Palace Master looked at Jian Wushuang’s venom in horror, his heart still surging.","The First Elder of Thunder God Palace and the Blood Thunder General were even more terrified.","“This venom is definitely several times or even nearly ten times stronger than the one that just corroded me. That drop of venom almost killed me. If he attacks me with this venom, I will definitely die!” Blood Thunder General said in shock.","“This kid is only a third-level Ruler. How could he control such a terrifying venom?” The voice of the First Elder of Thunder God Palace also trembled.","At this moment, the three Ultimate Rulers of Thunder God Palace stood together and faced only Jian Wushuang.","However, the three of them looked at Jian Wushuang with fear, even the powerful Thunder God Palace Master.","They were not afraid of Jian Wushuang himself, but the drop of venom in his hand.","Even the Thunder God Palace Master was terrified by the venom.","“Thunder God Palace Master, do you want me to continue?” Jian Wushuang asked with a smile.","The drop of pitch-black venom was in his palm, and she looked at the three Palace Masters of Thunder God Palace with a playful look.","Blackmail!","This was a blatant blackmail!","But even though they knew that this was a blackmail, the three Omega Rulers of the Thunder God Palace had no choice but to take it seriously.","“Blood Thunder, what exactly happened to that sword just now? If that sword came at you again, would you be able to block it?” The Thunder God Palace Lord said softly.","“I wouldn’t be able to block it. I have no confidence at all.” The Blood Thunder general shook his head. “His sword just now was not very powerful, but the key point is that it was too fast. It was so fast that it was beyond my ability to withstand. Such a sword combined with the terrifying venom was definitely the most terrifying attack. Not to mention me, even ordinary Ultimate Rulers would not be able to block his sword.”","Blood Thunder General knew very well how incredible the speed of Jian Wushuang’s sword was.","“If Blood Thunder can’t block it, then I’m afraid I can’t block it either,” the First Elder of Thunder God Palace said.","They had to admit that Jian Wushuang’s sword and the special venom posed a great threat to them.","In fact, Jian Wushuang’s performance in the actual battle was originally developed by him after he had obtained the special venom and was able to completely control it.","“The sword technique is called ‘Netherworld Mo Wen’!”","The power of his swordsmanship was very ordinary, but the speed of his swordsmanship was definitely the fastest sword technique that Jian Wushuang could perform.","It was the fastest sword technique that he could perform by perfectly combining his comprehension of the principles of the universe with his sword principle.","He did not create this sword technique to heavily injure his opponent by relying on the power of his swordsmanship. He just wanted to make it too late for his Wuqi Divine Sword to touch his opponent’s divine body.","As long as the Wuqi Divine Sword could touch his opponent’s divine body, the venom contained in the divine sword could be immediately activated, just like how it was used against the Blood Thunder General.","Neither the Blood Thunder General nor the Thunder God Palace grand elder could withstand Jian Wushuang’s sword. Naturally, as long as Jian Wushuang used the pitch-black venom, he could easily kill them both.","This made the Palace Master nervous.","After all, although the Thunder God Palace had been established in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy for many years and had a deep foundation, there were only three Ultimate Rulers.","These three Ultimate Rulers were not like the ordinary Rulers who were suppressed by Jian Wushuang. Even if all the suppressed Rulers died, they were nothing to the Thunder God Palace.","However, if any of the Ultimate Rulers died, it would be a huge loss to the Thunder God Palace.","If two of them died at the same time, it would definitely be a heavy blow to the Thunder God Palace. It would even affect the Thunder God Palace’s position as the overlord of the Nine Luminaries Galaxy.","“Blood Thunder, First Elder, you two, quickly retreat back to the palace. There is a magic array in the palace. He can’t attack you,” the Thunder God Palace Master whispered.","“Yes.”","Both First Elder and General Ruler Blood Thunder nodded slightly, and then they retreated to the back of the palace.","Jian Wushuang naturally noticed their actions and immediately smiled. “Thunder God Palace Master, you want them to hide in the palace, so I can’t do anything to them, right?”","Thunder God Palace Master did not speak, but just looked at Jian Wushuang coldly.","“Haha, do you think this will work? “Even if I can’t kill them, you can’t kill me either. You can’t even do anything to me. From today onwards, I will be guarding outside the nest of your Thunder God Palace. If any of your experts dare to come out, I will kill them. I will make sure that none of your experts dare to leave the nest for a long time,” Jian Wushuang said with a cold smile.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, the face of the Palace of thunder god finally turned completely"]},{"number":4082,"title":"Chapter 4082 - Begging for Death","paragraphs":["That was right, Thunder God Palace Master was not afraid of Jian Wushuang at all.","Even if Jian Wushuang’s ‘Underworld Mo Wen’ was incredibly fast, Thunder God Palace Master could still withstand it in time with his strength. No matter how terrifying the poison in Jian Wushuang’s hand was, it was still very difficult for it to pose a big threat to Thunder God Palace Master.","And because of the protection of the palace formation, Jian Wushuang could not fight his way in.","However —","If Jian Wushuang did not fight his way in, the experts of Thunder God Palace could not stay in Thunder God Palace and not leave, right?","Although there were some space passages in Thunder God Palace that allowed them to leave secretly, it was a great humiliation for Thunder God Palace to be blocked in front of the nest and not be able to do anything about it.","If word got out, the palace would definitely become a joke in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy.","The position of the palace as the absolute overlord in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy would definitely be shaken. The other three overlords would also take the opportunity to attack the palace.","This was something that the Palace Master did not want to see.","Taking a deep breath, the Palace Master looked at Jian Wushuang again and waved his hand. A strange power spread out and covered the surrounding void, blocking the surrounding space-time.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang smiled.","Since Thunder God Palace Master blocked the surrounding space and time, he naturally intended to talk to him.","“Thunder God Palace Master, are you finally not so overbearing that you want to kill me directly?” Jian Wushuang looked at Thunder God Palace Master with interest.","“Humph!” Thunder God Palace Master just snorted and did not speak.","Because of the time-space barrier, the experts in the palace could not hear their conversation.","“Tell me, what do you want?” Thunder God Palace Master stared at Jian Wushuang.","“The First Elder should have told you my purpose. I want to know where Xuan Yi, who was put on the bounty by your palace more than 100,000 years ago, is.” Jian Wushuang asked.","“He’s dead,” Thunder God Palace Master said directly.","“Dead?” Jian Wushuang frowned, but his eyes turned cold. “How did he die?”","“Of course he was killed by my Thunder God Palace. He killed the number one genius of my Thunder God Palace. Naturally, he will die,” Thunder God Palace Master said in a low voice.","“Killed by your Thunder God Palace?” Jian Wushuang smiled with a hint of mockery. “Thunder God Palace Master, you’d better not deceive yourself. Although I don’t know if he’s really dead, I’m sure that your Thunder God Palace doesn’t have the ability to kill him.”","Jian Wushuang was very confident that the Thunder God Palace could not kill Xuan Yi.","To be exact, he was confident in Xuan Yi.","His Ruler Xuan Yi was too mysterious and his methods were too incredible. If it were not for some special reasons, even if he was just an ordinary Ruler, he could not be killed by an ordinary person.","Although the Thunder God Palace was the overlord force of the Nine Luminaries Galaxy and had many experts under its command, including three Ultimate Rulers, Jian Wushuang really did not think that the Thunder God Palace could kill Xuan Yi.","Even in the Divine Beginning Realm, his Ruler Xuan Yi was only a principle Ruler. But if he was not burdened by the Divine Beginning Realm and was restricted everywhere, he would not have been able to completely let go, even Devil Cloud Ruler would not have been able to do anything to him.","Jian Wushuang’s words made Thunder God Palace Master silent for a while, but he soon raised his head again, he said, “Yes, Xuan Yi is very good. No matter if it’s his life-saving ability or his concealing ability, it seems that ordinary Rulers are not able to have them. Our Thunder God Palace had paid a great price before, but we were unable to kill him. It was very difficult to even find his tracks. Even after offering such a big reward, we were still unable to kill him.”","“If he keeps hiding like this, I’m afraid that in millions or tens of millions of years, the Thunder God Palace won’t be able to do anything to him. However, if he chooses to hide and instead comes to the Thunder God Palace to beg for death, then it will be very easy for the Thunder God Palace to kill him.”","“Beg for death?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Would his Ruler Xuan Yi come to the Thunder God Palace to beg for death?","“Thunder God Palace Master, how dare you lie to me?” Jian Wushuang stared at Thunder God Palace Master.","“Humph, do you think I would lie to you in this situation? If you don’t believe me, I can swear an oath to the universe origin.” Thunder God Palace Master snorted.","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","Thunder God Palace Master dared to swear an oath to the universe origin, so he was not lying to him.","Did his Ruler Xuan Yi really come to Thunder God Palace to beg for death?","“Why did he do that?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","“I don’t know the details, but when he came to beg for death, he made a condition,” Thunder God Palace Master said.","“What condition?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“There was a woman by his side, named Eighth. She was born as a slave and her hometown was in a second-class Star World under the command of Thunder God Palace. He asked us to send her back to her hometown. As long as she is in the second-class Star World, we have to do our best to take care of her and not let her get hurt,” Thunder God Palace Master said.","“That’s it?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“That’s it. As for the rest, my Thunder God Palace knows nothing about it,” Thunder God Palace Master said.","Jian Wushuang’s frown deepened.","He had read the information before and knew that his Ruler, Xuan Yi, had killed the number one genius of the Thunder God Palace, Lei Yi, because of a woman named Eighth.","But now, his Ruler Xuan Yi had come to the Thunder God Palace to seek death for Eighth?","What was going on?","Jian Wushuang could not figure it out.","“Who killed him in the Thunder God Palace?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Xuan Yi killed my personal disciple. Naturally, I killed him myself.” Thunder God Palace Master’s voice was cold, “But when I killed him, I felt a little strange. He was too calm and composed, as if his life and death were of no importance. This made me wonder if he was just a doppelganger, but his original body was somewhere else.”","“But when I killed him, I also checked carefully, but I couldn’t find any traces of his doppelganger.”","When Thunder God Palace Master said this, there was a trace of doubt in his eyes.","But when he heard this, Jian Wushuang smiled.","Doppelganger?","Undoubtedly, the one killed by Thunder God Palace Master was not Xuan Yi’s original body.","Or it could be said that Xuan Yi, who had been living in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, was not his original body.","Even Xuan Yi in the Divine Beginning Realm was not his original body.","Xuan Yi from the Divine Beginning Realm was also dead, and so many people had seen it. Xuan Yi from the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field was also dead, and he died calmly."]},{"number":4083,"title":"Chapter 4083 - Ah Ba","paragraphs":["According to Jian Wushuang’s guess, his Ruler Xuan Yi in the Divine Beginning Realm was probably an avatar of a mighty expert in the universe.","Xuan Yi in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy was probably also an avatar. Otherwise, he would not have come to his death so calmly.","“Thunder God Palace Master, since Xuan Yi died in your hands, the treasures he left behind should also be in your hands, right?”Jian Wushuang asked.","“His interspatial ring is here. I checked it before and found that he has an extraordinary family background and some special treasures, but that’s all.” Thunder God Palace Master waved his hand and directly threw an interspatial ring to Jian Wushuang.","After taking it, Jian Wushuang briefly scanned it with his consciousness. The many treasures in the interspatial ring were comparable to that of a fifth-level Ruler. It even had a principle supreme treasure, but there were no real treasures.","Jian Wushuang glanced at Thunder God Palace Master and did not doubt it.","“There’s one more thing. Since your Thunder God Palace has already killed Xuan Yi, why didn’t you announce it to the public? Instead, you quietly withdrew the reward. Moreover, the entire Thunder God Palace kept this matter a secret. Only a few people at the highest level know about it?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","In Jian Wushuang’s opinion, the sky-high bounty offered by the Thunder God Palace was to kill his Ruler Xuan Yi. Now that the Thunder God Palace had killed Xuan Yi, it was only natural that it should announce it to the public.","However, the performance of the Thunder God Palace was obviously not like this.","“Humph, Blood Sword Ruler, what do you think my Thunder God Palace is? Do you think my Thunder God Palace doesn’t have any face?” The Palace Master snorted coldly.","“Shameless?” Jian Wushuang was confused.","“Xuan Yi is only a third-level Ruler. It’s embarrassing that my palace failed to find him and kill him after 100,000 years. If the outside world knows that my palace failed to find Xuan Yi and that Xuan Yi came to my palace to seek his death, my palace will become a joke.” Thunder God Palace Master’s voice was cold.","“Is that why the Thunder God Palace quietly withdrew the bounty? Do you want to let this matter rest?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes, that’s right.” Thunder God Palace Master nodded. “Of course, there’s another reason. Although Xuan Yi is only a third-level Ruler, I can’t see through him at all. I once doubted whether he had a great background or background, and Xuan Yi died by my hand in the end. Naturally, I was worried that the person behind Xuan Yi would come looking for me, so I tried my best to cover it up. I didn’t expect that you would come looking for me so soon.”","There was obviously a hint of helplessness in Thunder God Palace Master’s words.","After hearing what Thunder God Palace Master said, Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","He had already understood.","When Xuan Yi killed Lei Yi, the number one genius of Thunder God Palace, Thunder God Palace was extremely furious. At that time, they did not think much about it. They just issued a reward and caused such a big commotion","However, after the Thunder God Palace came into contact with Xuan Yi, the Thunder God Palace felt that Xuan Yi was extraordinary.","Especially after Xuan Yi went to the sect and begged for death. When the Thunder God Palace Master came into contact with Xuan Yi, the Thunder God Palace Master could not see through Xuan Yi at all. This made the Thunder God Palace Master wary. He felt that Xuan Yi had a huge background and status.","At that time, the Thunder God Palace Master already regretted making such a huge commotion and putting a bounty on Xuan Yi. However, he had no choice but to shoot the arrow at the bowstring. The Thunder God Palace Master still killed Xuan Yi, however, the next step was to cover up the matter. Firstly, it was for his own face. Secondly, he did not want the news to spread and alert the forces or backgrounds behind Xuan Yi.","Jian Wushuang could accept Thunder God Palace Master’s explanation.","“Thunder God Palace Master.” Jian Wushuang looked at Thunder God Palace Master again. “I can tell you now that Xuan Yi was my Ruler. To be exact, he was a clone of my Ruler.”","“Ruler?” Thunder God Palace Master was stunned, but his heart was twitching, “This Blood Sword is only a third-level Ruler, but his battle strength is comparable to that of an Ultimate Ruler. Moreover, his comprehension of the universe principles is terrifyingly high. He is definitely one of the top and most terrifying super monsters in the vast universe. Such a monster is already shocking enough. How terrifying would it be to be able to teach such a monster?”","At this moment, Thunder God Palace Master was truly terrified.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang also noticed his fear.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, he said, “Thunder God Palace Master, what kind of person is my Ruler? Although the avatar you killed is not important to him, his identity and strength are obvious. Tell me, how should I end this matter?”","“What do you want?” Thunder God Palace Master took a deep breath.","“It’s simple. Take out 30,000 universe origin stones to apologize, and this matter will end here,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay, sure.” Thunder God Palace Master nodded without hesitation.","“So straightforward?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","In fact, Xuan Yi was his Ruler, but Jian Wushuang did not know whether it was really a avatar or some special reason. Moreover, whether Xuan Yi really had a great background and background was a mystery.","However, Jian Wushuang could see that Thunder God Palace Master was terrified of his Ruler’s identity, so he naturally wanted to avenge his Ruler and extort him. Therefore, he directly offered 30,000 universe origin stones as an apology, he thought that this price was high enough and that Thunder God Palace Master should at least haggle over it, but in the end, Thunder God Palace Master agreed so readily.","He agreed to 30,000 universe origin stones immediately.","“As expected of the Overlord who has been standing in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy for so many years. The Thunder God Palace is really rich. It seems that my price of 30,000 universe origin stones is still a little low,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Hearing this, the corner of the Palace Master’s mouth twitched.","30,000 universe origin stones —","It must be known that the total wealth of an ordinary Ultimate Ruler was only around 10,000 universe origin stones. 30,000 universe origin stones was equivalent to the total wealth of the three Ultimate Rulers.","But Thunder God Palace Master was, after all, a top-tier existence among the Ultimate Rulers, and his wealth was much richer than that of an ordinary Ultimate Ruler. In addition, Thunder God Palace had been standing in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy for so many years, and it had a deep foundation. So, 30,000 universe origin stones...he was still able to afford it.","Of course, even if he could afford it, it was still an incomparably large sum of money to Thunder God Palace.","Thunder God Palace Master had no other choice. He really thought that Xuan Yi’s background was very huge and had a great background. After all, just a third level Ruler level disciple was already enough to make Thunder God Palace helpless, if someone else appeared behind Xuan Yi, the Thunder God Palace would not be able to resist.","Therefore, he could only compromise."]},{"number":4084,"title":"Chapter 4084 - Snatching People","paragraphs":["“I’m a man of my word. 30,000 universe origin stones and this matter will be settled,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Wait here for a moment.” Thunder God Palace Master immediately returned to Thunder God Palace and began to prepare the 30,000 universe origin stones.","30,000 universe origin stones was not a small amount. Although Thunder God Palace could afford it, it was still a great loss.","After a while, Thunder God Palace Master returned to Jian Wushuang. At the same time, he brought an interspatial ring and gave it to Jian Wushuang.","“30,000 universe origin stones are all here,” Thunder God Palace Master said.","!!","Jian Wushuang glanced at it briefly and nodded slightly.","“Thunder God Palace Master, where is the woman named Eighth now?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“She has opened a small tavern in the Dusty Rain Star World. Over the years, our Thunder God Palace has sent experts to protect her in secret. After all, I promised Xuan Yi that I would protect her, so I won’t go back on my words,” Thunder God Palace Master said.","“You’re smart.” Jian Wushuang smiled and left immediately.","Seeing that Jian Wushuang had finally left, Thunder God Palace Master and many experts in Thunder God Palace heaved a sigh of relief.","“This terrifying guy has finally left.” Blood Thunder General said with lingering fear.","Although Jian Wushuang had left, it had to be said that Thunder God Palace had indeed suffered a setback this time.","...","After leaving Thunder God Palace, Jian Wushuang headed directly to the Dusty Rain Star World. Leng Rushuang naturally followed him.","The Dusty Rain Star World was an ordinary second-class Star World under the control of the Thunder God Palace. There was a tavern in a city in this Star World.","The tavern was small and very simple, but there were many customers in the tavern.","In fact, many of these customers came for the lady boss of the tavern.","“Look, the lady boss is really beautiful!”","“She’s more than beautiful. Her face and figure are simply perfect.”","“Unfortunately, she was born a slave. She always has a special mark on her hand that represents her status as a slave. She will never be able to remove it. If she doesn’t have this mark, she would be even more perfect.”","Whispers could be heard in the tavern.","Many heated gazes would occasionally look at the plain-robed lady in front of the tavern counter.","That lady had a slender figure. Although she was only wearing a simple plain robe, it was unable to conceal her almost perfect figure. Coupled with her devastatingly beautiful face, it felt as if a goddess had fallen into the mortal world.","In terms of appearance, this lady’s appearance was undoubtedly enough to shock the world. It was likely that in the entire Dusty Rain heavenly world, it would be difficult to find a second person whose appearance was comparable to hers.","It was precisely because of this that the business of this tavern was so good. Those customers had come to this tavern in order to meet this lady boss.","Right at this moment...","“You are the lady boss of this tavern?” A voice that carried a hint of arrogance suddenly rang out.","Within the tavern, the whispers immediately stopped. Those customers’ gazes immediately turned toward the source of the voice. When they clearly saw the appearance of that person, most of these customers revealed playful smiles.","The person who had spoken was a young man dressed in luxurious clothes. Behind him were two guards. The two guards had extremely powerful auras, and they were actually two Rulers.","Being able to have two Rulers act as guards was enough to prove that this young man had an extraordinary background.","The beautiful woman who had been busy at the counter all this time raised her head slightly and glanced at the young man. Then, she lowered her head again and continued to do her own thing.","“Tsk tsk, I’ve long heard that there is an extremely beautiful lady boss in this tavern. Seeing her today, she really didn’t disappoint me.” The young man smiled. “Miss, my name is He Yun. My father is Ruler Wan Yan, and he controls countless territories under his command. A beauty like you shouldn’t be a lady boss in a small tavern in this city. Why don’t you come back with me? I guarantee that you can do whatever you want in this Dusty Rain heavenly world. Won’t that be a great pleasure?”","This young man, He Yun, spoke with absolute confidence.","He did indeed have such confidence. His father, Ruler Wan Yan, could indeed be considered an overlord in this Dusty Rain heavenly world.","However, after He Yun finished speaking, that absolute beauty still lowered her head and busied herself with the matters in her hands, completely ignoring him.","This caused He Yun’s expression to stiffen slightly. His expression was also rather awkward. However, after the awkwardness, it was replaced by anger.","“Miss, don’t refuse a toast only to drink a forfeit. I, He Yun, have never been unable to obtain a woman that I want.” He Yun’s voice was ice-cold. The two guards behind him also stared coldly at the absolute beauty.","Clearly, as long as the absolute beauty did not agree, they would directly attack.","However, they did not notice that the customers in the inn were all looking at them with pity, especially He Yun.","Boom!","A powerful aura suddenly erupted. This aura had reached the fourth level Ruler level, instantly suppressing He Yun and his two guards.","The two guards, who were only at the first level Ruler level, immediately revealed terrified expressions. Their bodies trembled as they trembled.","As for He Yun, he was only a Ruler of principles. At this moment, the crystal was suppressed to the ground.","“Get lost, or die!” A cold voice sounded in the ears of He Yun and the other two.","He Yun’s two guards were scared out of their wits. They immediately dragged He Yun and left in a sorry state.","After the three of them left, that aura slowly disappeared.","When the guest in the tavern saw this scene, he was no longer surprised.","“Tsk tsk, that He Yun just now was really in a sorry state.”","“Haha, he’s also stupid. Before snatching her away, he didn’t even inquire about the identity of this lady boss. She had the experts of the Thunder God Palace personally guard her. Not to mention that his father is only a fourth-tier Ruler of the Dusty Rain heavenly world, even if the number one expert of the Dusty Rain Heavenly World came, he probably wouldn’t dare to lay his eyes on her.”","“If I remember correctly, this He Yun should be the twenty-first person to be scared out of his wits in all these years.”","The guests in the tavern chatted and laughed casually.","They all lived in this city, so naturally, they knew a bit about the identity of this tavern’s lady boss.","They knew that the background and background of this tavern’s lady boss was not something that the people in the Dusty Rain Star World could afford to provoke.","Just as He Yun was scared off, three figures slowly walked in from the entrance of the tavern. After the three of them arrived, they went directly to the tavern counter, which was in front of the absolute beauty.","..."]},{"number":4085,"title":"Chapter 4085 - Handmaiden","paragraphs":["“Are you Eighth?”","Jian Wushuang looked at the woman in front of him carefully.","He had to admit that this woman was very beautiful. In terms of looks, she was no less cold than his aura.","However, this woman was born a slave. Although she had become a principle Ruler, she had obviously relied on treasures to build up her temperament. Her temperament was very ordinary, and she even gave people a very humble feeling, naturally, she lost some of her charm.","“You know my name?” The beautiful woman who had been busy could not help looking up at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","!!","In fact, she did not have a name.","Ah Ba was named after her when she was a slave. Later, she simply called him Ah Ba.","However, not many people knew her name in this world.","“My name is Jian Wushuang. Xuan Yi is my Ruler,” Jian Wushuang said directly.","“Big Brother Xuan Yi? Are you his disciple?” Eighth’s voice was obviously more anxious than before.","“Big Brother Xuan Yi?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and then smiled. “I am his disciple. If it’s convenient for you, can you talk to me?”","“This...” Eighth looked troubled.","“Are you worried about the Thunder God Palace?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Eighth.","Eighth was silent.","“Don’t worry, the Thunder God Palace won’t disturb us.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","At this time, a figure suddenly appeared beside Jian Wushuang.","“Bai Yang, the outer deacon of the Thunder God Palace, greets Ruler Xue Jian.” The person bowed respectfully to Jian Wushuang.","“Do you know me?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Bai Yang.","“My lord, I have been ordered to protect Eighth lady secretly. Not long ago, my Palace Master personally sent me a message saying that Ruler Blood Sword would come here and ask me to receive you. I will try my best to meet all your requirements,” Bai Yang said.","“I see.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Eighth lady, Ruler Blood Sword is indeed a disciple of Xuan Yi. Previously, he came to my Thunder God Palace because of Xuan Yi’s matter and had some unhappiness with my Thunder God Palace. Of course, now that the conflict has been resolved, now that Ruler Blood Sword wants to talk to you, My Thunder God Palace will naturally avoid him.” Bai Yang was very modest.","Hearing Bai Yang’s words, Eighth was very surprised.","Although Bai Yang had been secretly protecting her, Eighth knew that Bai Yang had always been very cold and aloof. He had only protected her under orders and had never really looked up to her.","But now, this cold and aloof Bai Yang was actually so humble and polite to her?","Eighth instantly understood that it was not her who had changed Bai Yang’s attitude, but the Ruler Blood Sword who had suddenly appeared, who was also her brother Xuan Yi’s disciple.","“I’ll go with you,” Eighth said directly.","“Okay, let’s find a place to talk.” Jian Wushuang smiled and then glanced at Bai Yang. “You stay here.”","“Yes.” Bai Yang did not dare to disobey.","Soon, Jian Wushuang left with Eighth.","After he left, the people in the tavern were in an uproar.","“Who was that man?”","“I don’t know who he was, but that Bai Yang called himself an outer deacon of the Thunder God Palace. That’s the palace. Even an outer deacon is usually a fourth-level Ruler, right?”","“He is indeed a fourth-level Ruler. And if I’m not mistaken, he must be the one who has been secretly protecting this Eighth lady. Like He Yun from before, he doesn’t even care about Bai Yang. He probably doesn’t even care about the Wan Yan Ruler behind He Yun, but when he faces that person just now, he’s as respectful as a grandson.”","“Tut, tut, to be able to make the deacons of the Thunder God Palace so respectful, he must be a real big shot.”","The customers in the tavern were all praising him, but it had nothing to do with them. They just enjoyed talking about it.","...","In an empty space not far from the tavern, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and completely blocked the surrounding time and space.","“Miss Eighth, I’m here to ask you about my Ruler.” Jian Wushuang went straight to the point.","“Ruler Blood Sword, since you’re brother Xuan Yi’s disciple, you should know more about brother Xuan Yi than I do, right?” Eighth was puzzled.","“To tell you the truth, I’m his disciple, but when I took him as my Ruler, I was not in this Star Field at all. I was in another Star Field far away, and I separated from him a long time ago.” Jian Wushuang said with a bitter smile.","“Is that so?” Eighth took a deep look at Jian Wushuang, wondering if he was suspecting something.","“Miss Eighth, May I know what is the relationship between you and my Ruler?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Me? I am just a maid by Big Brother Xuan Yi’s side,” Eighth said.","“Maid?” Jian Wushuang could not help being surprised.","He knew that Xuan Yi had killed Lei Yi, the number one genius of the Thunder God Palace, for Eighth, and had completely offended the palace.","Later, he even went to the Thunder God Palace to beg for death for Eighth.","Was a mere maid worth his Ruler doing this?","“I am indeed just a maid by Brother Xuan Yi’s side. I didn’t even know him 100,000 years ago. But once, when I was in danger, Brother Xuan Yi happened to pass by and saved me. At that time, it was the people of the Thunder God Palace who wanted to harm me. They wanted to capture me and offer me to the number one genius of the Thunder God Palace.”","“Not long after Brother Xuan Yi saved me, the number one genius of the Thunder God Palace came to find me. I thought brother Xuan Yi would hand me over, but I didn’t expect brother Xuan Yi to kill the number one genius of the Thunder God Palace,” Eighth said.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was even more confused.","They had only met by chance. It was one thing for his Ruler to save Eighth, but why did he bring it with him?","Moreover, when the number one genius of the Thunder God Palace came to him, he directly killed the number one genius?","“Miss Eighth, do you know why my Ruler did this?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“I know.” Eighth nodded slightly. “I only found out later. It turns out that he looks very similar to Brother Xuan Yi’s wife.”","“What?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Wife?","His Ruler had a wife?","“That’s the reason. When brother Xuan Yi saw Lei Yi harboring evil intentions toward me, he killed him directly. Then he took me to hide in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy and lived for nearly 100,000 years. During these 100,000 years, Brother Xuan Yi only looked at me quietly most of the time and hardly spoke to me. In the past 100,000 years, he probably said less than 10 words to me,” Eighth said.","..."]},{"number":4086,"title":"Chapter 4086 - Drastic Changes","paragraphs":["After a brief conversation with Eighth, Jian Wushuang knew that this woman, Eighth, and his Ruler had only met by chance because she looked like his Ruler’s wife, that was why his Ruler had saved her.","“Miss Eighth, do you know why my Ruler took the initiative to seek death in the Thunder God Palace?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","“I don’t know.” Eighth shook his head. “But Brother Xuan Yi said before he left that he had already done what he wanted to do. There is no need for him to continue existing.”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted.","He had already done what he wanted to do?","!!","There was no need for him to continue existing?","It felt as if he had completed his mission and could retire.","But what did his Ruler do in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy?","According to the intelligence he had received from the Nine Emperor Pavilion, his Ruler had been keeping a low profile in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy. Apart from the conflict with Thunder God Palace, he had not caused any major commotion in the galaxy?","Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","While Jian Wushuang was talking to Eighth, no one knew that a huge storm was about to sweep through the entire Nine Luminaries Galaxy.","In the dark void around the Thunder God Palace’s lair, an ancient and majestic universe boat arrived.","In the universe boat, three figures gathered together.","“Is that the lair of Thunder God Palace in front?” A hoarse voice came from one of the figures, “Keke, it’s the reward from Thunder God Palace that allowed us to find a trace of him. Speaking of which, we really have to thank Thunder God Palace.”","“But not long ago, the Thunder God Palace quietly withdrew that reward. Perhaps, the Thunder God Palace has already found him and killed him?” Another low voice sounded.","“What a joke. It’s not that you don’t know about that guy’s ability. How could a mere Thunder God Palace kill him? However, the Thunder God Palace had gone through so much trouble to place a reward on him. Now, they quietly withdrew the reward. There must be some reason behind it. We should go and ask about it personally. Devour Seven, come with me.” One of the human figures stood up.","This figure was more than three meters tall and looked like a small mountain.","“Haha, I’d be happy to.” The first figure who spoke also stood up.","Soon, the two figures left the universe boat and rushed toward the lair of the Thunder God Palace.","The lair of the Thunder God Palace was like an iron bucket in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy.","After all, the foundation of the Thunder God Palace was there. Even an ordinary supreme-being would be able to defeat the palace protection formation of the palace. This was why Jian Wushuang could only stand in front of the gate of the palace, but he could not get in.","But today —","A burly man in crimson-gold armor appeared in front of the towering formation and slapped the palace protection formation with his big hand.","A rich golden light burst forth, bringing with it an earth-shattering might as it descended upon the palace-protecting array.","The palace-protecting array did not have any ability to resist. In an instant, it crumbled and disintegrated.","This sudden change caused countless experts within the Thunder God Palace to turn pale with fright.","“The palace-protecting array has been destroyed?”","“How is this possible? How can the palace-protecting array of my Thunder God Palace be destroyed?”","“Who? Who destroyed the array?”","Countless experts in Thunder God Palace raised their heads in terror.","The three Ultimate Rulers of Thunder God Palace, the Thunder God Palace Master, the First Elder of Thunder God Palace, and the Blood Thunder General also looked up in terror.","There was a figure covered by a dense golden light. The golden light illuminated the sky and earth like a Golden War God. As the Golden War God looked down with a cold gaze.","A terrifying aura that was so powerful that even an Ultimate Ruler would find it hard to breathe instantly spread out, suppressing the entire area.","At this moment, the entire Thunder God Palace was completely silent.","“Ruler...Ruler!”","The Thunder God Palace Master was utterly shocked!","In truth, it was easy to understand why the defensive formations of the Thunder God Palace could not be destroyed by someone without the power of an Ruler.","However, the opponent had destroyed the Thunder God Palace’s Protective Array Formation with just one move. This strength was definitely at the supreme-being level.","However, why would a supreme-being come to the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field? Why did he come to the Thunder God Palace? And why did he directly destroy the Thunder God Palace’s Protective Array Formation without saying anything?","At this moment, the Golden War God’s eyes happened to sweep over the Thunder God Palace Master.","In the next moment, the Golden War God waved his hand, and a huge palm rushed toward the Thunder God Palace Master, the First Elder of Thunder God Palace, and the Blood Thunder Army Ruler.","The three of them wanted to flee in fear, but they found that they couldn’t move at all. They could only watch helplessly as the palm grabbed them.","The three powerful Ultimate Rulers, especially the Thunder God Palace Master, were still top-tier existences among the Ultimate Rulers. However, in front of the Golden War God in the void, they were like chickens, unable to resist at all.","Boom!","The giant hand suddenly clenched, and the bodies of the Thunder God Palace Master and the other two instantly exploded. In fact, more than 90% of their divine power had been destroyed.","In the blink of an eye, the three Supreme Rulers had all fallen into an extremely weak state, with only their last breaths remaining.","“Devour Seven, I’ll leave him to you.” The Golden War God let out a low voice.","“Keke.” A strange laughter rang out as a skinny black-robed elder with an evil aura appeared next to the Golden War God.","A Black Serpent coiled around the black-robed elder’s shoulder. The Black Serpent’s eyes were cold as it stared at the three who were no longer able to fight back.","“Go.” The black-robed elder pointed slightly, and the Black Serpent on his shoulder instantly shot out. It was so fast that it was actually much faster than even an ordinary omega Ruler.","The Black Serpent was like a bolt of lightning, instantly piercing through the heads of the Thunder God Palace Lord, the Grand Elder of the Thunder God Palace, and the general of the Blood Thunder army. It instantly devoured the souls of the three.","The Black Serpent then returned to the black-robed elder’s shoulder, but its eyes remained shut.","A short moment later, the black-robed elder raised his head once more, but the strange smile on his face had already disappeared. “This is bad. That fellow really was killed by the people of the Thunder God Palace.”","“What?” The expression of the burly man who was bathed in golden light changed. “How is this possible? How can the people from the Thunder God Palace kill him?”","“Under normal circumstances, he can’t be killed, but what if that guy comes over and begs for death?” The black-robed old man said in a low voice."]},{"number":4087,"title":"Chapter 4087 - The Disaster of the Nine Luminaries Great Star Area","paragraphs":["“Voluntarily seeking death?” The Golden Man’s face darkened. “You mean that person knows that we’re here?”","“That might not be the case.” The black-robed old man shook his head. “However, we’re a step too late. That person is already dead. This is a fact. Of course, we also have good news.”","“What good news?” The golden-robed man looked over.","He knew exactly what the black-robed elder was capable of.","Just moments ago, the Black Serpent had devoured the souls of the three of them. The Black Serpent had also devoured their memories, which the black-robed elder was able to share with him.","!!","“A few days ago, a third-stage Ruler named Blood Sword came to the Thunder God Palace. He fought a great battle against the palace, and in the end, the palace was forced to lower its head and compromise,” the black-robed elder said.","“A third-stage Ruler?” The muscular golden-robed man was startled.","Although Thunder God Palace did not mean anything to him, and he did not care about it at all, this was only because he was an Ruler.","To a third-stage Ruler, Thunder God Palace should have been an enormous power, but this third-stage Ruler was actually able to force Thunder God Palace to lower its head and compromise?","“In addition, this third-level Ruler named Blood Sword claims to be his disciple,” the black-robed elder continued.","“Oh?” The golden-robed man frowned.","Previously, he had felt that it was inconceivable for a third-level Ruler to actually force the Thunder God Palace to lower its head and compromise.","But now that he knew that this person was his disciple, the golden-robed man was able to immediately accept it.","He was very clear about that person’s supreme ability.","If that person was really the disciple that person had personally taught, then they would be able to accept it no matter how heaven-defying it was.","“That third level Ruler called Blood Sword is still in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field. He hasn’t left yet. We still have a chance to catch him,” said the black-clothed old man.","“In that case, let’s not delay any longer. Tell Devour Nine to set off immediately and capture that little fellow,” said the golden burly man.","“What about the Thunder God Palace?” The black-clothed old man looked down at the Thunder God Palace which was already in a state of panic.","“Thunder God Palace?” The muscular golden man looked down and sneered, “Since that person has appeared here, then it’s not just the Thunder God Palace, but this star area. There’s no need for it to exist anymore.”","“All traces of him must be erased.”","“This star area should be destroyed.”","Hearing the muscular golden man’s words, the old man in black shrugged and a strange smile appeared on his face again.","Soon, a terrifying attack landed on the base of Thunder God Palace and covered every corner of the palace.","In the Thunder God Palace, even if the three Ultimate Rulers who had already died were excluded, there were still quite a number of experts left. There were even quite a few peak fifth-level experts like Emperor Rain King.","But now, under that tyrannical attack, countless cultivators in the Thunder God Palace, including those fourth and fifth-level experts, did not have the chance to escape. They were all affected by this attack, they were instantly annihilated and turned into dust.","Within moments, the entire Thunder God Palace had been reduced to a pile of scorched earth. There were countless cultivators within Thunder God Palace, but none of them had managed to escape from their lairs. All of them had died. Not a single one was left alive.","After completely annihilating Thunder God Palace, numerous figures flew out from within the ancient universe boat at the same time. These figures were all incredibly powerful, and most of them were fifth-level and above Rulers. There were even quite a few final-level Rulers.","Of course, what was truly terrifying was that there were a total of Three Paragon Rulers within the universe boat.","A large number of fifth-level Rulers, including some final-level Rulers, flew out in all directions under the personal guidance of these Three Paragon Rulers.","Two of the teams led by the Rulers charged directly toward the other top-tier powers within the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field. Similarly, it only took a short period of time for the top-tier powers to be uprooted and completely annihilated.","The other teams, under the guidance of one Ultimate Ruler after another, charged toward the various Star Worlds. The Eighth first-class Star Worlds within the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field bore the brunt of this.","This was a disaster for the entire Nine Luminaries Great Star Field.","Furthermore, this disaster was completely effortless. The Nine Luminaries Great Star Field had virtually no ability to resist.","Many forces were annihilated, countless Star Worlds were crushed into dust, and billions of lives were mercilessly killed.","Among the killing teams, there was a special team of less than ten people. They were all made up of an Ultimate Ruler, and they were also a supreme expert. They directly attacked Jian Wushuang’s Dusty Rain Star World.","In the Dusty Rain Star World, Jian Wushuang was still talking with Eighth.","Eighth had already told Jian Wushuang everything he knew.","After hearing it, although Jian Wushuang was still very confused, he had more or less received some information.","For example, his Ruler had a wife.","Also, his Ruler had a mission in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, and it had been completed.","In the end, his Ruler must have been just a clone in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy.","But at this moment —","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang’s expression suddenly changed. He flipped his hand and a communication token appeared in his hand.","“The token of supervisor Feixue of the Nine Emperor Pavilion seems to be very anxious. What happened?” Jian Wushuang looked at the contents of the token in surprise.","“Blood Sword, a large number of mysterious experts, including supreme-level experts, have arrived in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy. They are now killing people in the galaxy. The most powerful forces in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, such as the Thunder God Palace and the Wind God Pavilion, have all been destroyed. The Earth Star where the Nine Emperor Pavilion is located has been destroyed. Two of the three Rulers have died, and I’m the only one who escaped!”","“If you’re still in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, run!”","“If I’m not mistaken, their goal is to wipe out the entire Nine Luminaries Galaxy!”","There was an unprecedented fear in his message.","After receiving the message, Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“The most powerful forces in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, such as the Thunder God Palace and the Wind God Pavilion, have been wiped out?","“Even the branches of the Nine Emperor Pavilion have been destroyed, and two of the three supervisors have died?” Jian Wushuang knew very well how shocking the news was.","Just now, the outer deacon of the Thunder God Palace, Bai Yang, had received a message from the Thunder God Palace Master. How long had it been, and the Thunder God Palace had already been destroyed?","There was also the Nine Emperor Pavilion. That was a super force in the universe, a super overlord. Who Was it that dared to touch the Nine Emperor Pavilion?"]},{"number":4088,"title":"Chapter 4088 - Crisis!","paragraphs":["Although it was unbelievable, Jian Wushuang did not doubt the authenticity of the news.","After all, he was ranked on the Nine Emperor List and had an extraordinary status. Director Feixue did not dare to lie to him, so there was no need for her to lie to him. The reason why she could send him a message to warn him was because he was ranked on the Nine Emperor List.","After understanding this, Jian Wushuang did not dare to think too much. He did not have the time to figure out what was going on.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand, and the pitch-black universe boat immediately appeared in the void in front of him.","“Shuang ‘er, Devil Flame, quickly enter the universe boat,” Jian Wushuang said.","!!","“Husband, what’s wrong?” Leng Rushuang looked over in confusion.","“Don’t ask so many questions. Go in quickly,” Jian Wushuang urged.","Leng Rushuang did not ask any more questions. She immediately entered the universe boat with Devil Flame.","“Eighth, you should go in as well,” Jian Wushuang said.","Eighth nodded slightly and entered the universe boat.","When the three of them entered the universe boat, Jian Wushuang willed the universe boat in front of him to shrink again and put it into his arms.","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang immediately got up and prepared to escape.","But just as he was about to move...","Boom!","The world shook and a suffocating and terrifying power was transmitted from the void above.","“Oh no!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically. He subconsciously looked up and saw that the entire world had become completely dark. Endless darkness was slowly crushing down. If one looked carefully, there were huge gullies in the darkness, it was as if they were the lines of a palm.","“Could this endless darkness be a palm?” Jian Wushuang thought in horror.","It was indeed the case.","Jian Wushuang was now in the Dusty Rain Star World, so he naturally could not see clearly what the endless darkness that covered the top void was.","However, if he was in the cosmic void outside the Dusty Rain Star World, he could see that what covered the Dusty Rain Star World was a hand, a huge, endless black hand.","This gigantic black hand had already completely covered the entire Dusty Rain Star World, and it held the Dusty Rain Star World in its palm.","Immediately after, this gigantic black hand exerted a slight force, and just like crushing a bean, a level two Star World was directly crushed and exploded.","The Dusty Rain Star World instantly exploded, and the countless mountains and rivers within the Star World were all crushed and crushed into pieces. Countless living beings were instantly buried, and they did not have any chance to struggle at all.","In the void outside the Star World, a cold man with a pitch-black saber on his back stood there coldly. He stared at the void in front of him and watched the Star World explode and turn into cosmic dust.","The giant hand just now was cast by the cold man.","The cold man was called Devour Nine. He was one of the three supreme-beings who had arrived in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy and was on a killing spree. He was the supreme-being who had come to capture Jian Wushuang.","“Huh?”","The cold man’s expression suddenly changed. As a supreme-being expert, his soul perception was far superior to that of a Ruler. After the Dusty Rain Star World collapsed, he immediately sensed that all the living beings in the Dusty Rain Star World had been annihilated.","However, only one person had survived, and the aura he emitted was that of a third-level Ruler.","“Is he the target?” The cold man’s eyes turned cold, and he dashed forward.","In the void in front of the cold man, an ancient universe boat had appeared. Jian Wushuang was in the universe boat, and he was controlling the universe boat to flee as fast as he could.","As he fled, Jian Wushuang saw the cold man chasing after him, and his eyes were full of fear and shock.","“Supreme!”","“The supreme is here!”","Jian Wushuang never thought that he would meet a supreme-level expert so early.","And apparently, this supreme did not just happen to meet him. He probably came straight for him.","After all, when Supervisor Feixue sent the message just now, he also said that the group of people who started a massacre in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy and wanted to completely destroy the Nine Luminaries Galaxy might have many experts, but those at the paragon level...there were only a few supreme-level experts.","However, the Nine Luminaries Galaxy was huge, and there were many Star Worlds. There should be at least a hundred second-level Star Worlds, not to mention others?","How could there be a supreme-level expert who happened to come to his Star World?","Therefore, Jian Wushuang guessed that the supreme-level expert’s target was him.","As for the reason...Jian Wushuang could only think of one possibility from the way these people acted. It was related to his Ruler, Xuan Yi!","“These people should be here for my Ruler. They destroyed the Thunder God Palace. They must have learned of my existence from the palace, so they also came to deal with me.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, his expression was extremely grave.","“Darling, are you okay?” Leng Rushuang looked at Jian Wushuang with worry because she saw that Jian Wushuang’s body was covered in blood and his aura was much weaker than before.","“I’m fine.” Jian Wushuang shook his head, but he was very shocked.","Just now, the cold man had crushed the Dusty Rain Star World, killing countless creatures in it.","Jian Wushuang was also in the Dusty Rain Star World, so the cold man’s attack had also affected him. Although it only slightly affected a part of his power, the one who had attacked was a supreme expert. In that instant..! Even though Jian Wushuang had an incredible protective ability, his divine body was immediately severely injured, and nearly 30 percent of his divine power was destroyed!","Nearly 30 percent of his divine power barely affected him.","In other words, if the supreme expert had only attacked him, he would have been killed in one move.","“This is the strength of a supreme expert. It’s indeed terrifying.” Jian Wushuang was shocked, and his eyes were fixed on the cold man who was chasing after him.","The cold man did not take out his universe boat, but he was an supreme-level expert. Even if he flew by himself, his speed in the universe void was not much slower than that of universe boat.","Jian Wushuang would not be very worried if he continued to chase and escape. However, universe boat did not travel far before Jian Wushuang sensed an extremely powerful aura ahead of him.","Although this aura was not that of an supreme-being, it was definitely at the level of an Ultimate Ruler.","“Oh no.” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","When he sensed the aura of an Ultimate Ruler in front of the universe boat, Jian Wushuang immediately understood that the other party had long planned to encircle and kill him.","The supreme-being who had attacked him must have thought that he had escaped from the Dusty Rain Star World, so he had already arranged for an Ultimate Ruler to intercept him in the surrounding void.","“I have no choice but to fight.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. The Wuqi Divine Sword had already appeared in his hand.","..."]},{"number":4089,"title":"Chapter 4089 - Collision","paragraphs":["In the dark void of the universe, a barefoot old man stood there quietly. His eyes were like poisonous snakes, staring at the universe boat that was rapidly approaching at the end of the universe.","“Keke, it’s coming toward me. It seems that I’m really lucky.”","The barefoot old man was one of the Ultimate Rulers under the command of the cold man, Devour Nine. This time, there were Eighth Ultimate Rulers accompanying Devour Nine to capture Jian Wushuang.","These Eighth Ultimate Rulers were scattered in different directions around the Dusty Rain Star World. Thus, even if the Dusty Rain Star World collapsed and Jian Wushuang escaped from it, he would not be able to escape from their interception.","Now, the barefoot elder was in charge of blocking Jian Wushuang’s escape.","!!","“I heard from Lord Devour Seven that this third-level Ruler named Blood Sword is extraordinary. Lord Devour Nine also ordered us to capture him alive. We must not kill him. It seems that this third-level Ruler named Blood Sword is indeed very important. If I can capture him directly, it will be a credit to me.” The barefoot elder sneered, he was ready to stop the universe boat and capture Jian Wushuang.","The universe boat was extremely fast. In just a moment, it had arrived in front of the barefooted old man, and they were getting closer and closer.","“Keke, stay.” The barefooted old man sneered and moved forward.","At the same time, a figure shot out from the universe boat.","“You still want to resist?” The barefoot old man’s smile grew wider.","Jian Wushuang, who rushed out from the universe boat, had an extremely cold expression, and his eyes were filled with shocking killing intent.","He rushed directly to the barefoot old man, and his strength burst out at this moment. “Swish!”","A cold sword light shot out directly.","The smile on the barefoot old man’s face instantly froze, and it was replaced by a look of horror.","“How could it be so fast?”","This was the thought that came to the barefooted old man’s mind the moment he saw Jian Wushuang’s sword.","It was too fast, indeed too fast.","After reaching the first level of the Purple Blood Secret Manual, Jian Wushuang’s application of the universal principles and swordsmanship had been perfectly combined. He had spent a long time to create the ‘Netherworld Mo Wen’ sword.","The speed of this sword was so fast that even the Ultimate Ruler would find it difficult to block it.","For example, the Blood Thunder General Ruler in the Thunder God Palace could not block Jian Wushuang’s sword.","As for the barefoot old man, his strength was almost the same as that of the Blood Thunder General Ruler. Even if he was slightly stronger, he was not much stronger.","But the key problem was that he could not block Jian Wushuang’s sword either.","The cold sword light directly cut through the barefoot old man’s body. The barefoot old man narrowed his eyes slightly.","The moment the sword light cut through his body, the power of the sword attack was almost completely blocked by the principle supreme treasure armor on his body. In other words, Jian Wushuang’s sword attack did not cause any damage to him.","“Is it just the speed?” Just as the barefooted old man thought of this, an unprecedented pain suddenly rose from the depths of his soul.","“No!”","The barefooted old man let out a shrill cry. In the next moment, the skin on his body turned black and gray at a speed visible to the naked eye. His vitality was fading at an alarming rate.","In just a moment, the barefooted old man’s divine body had turned into dust. Only a few treasures and his interspatial ring remained.","Jian Wushuang had used a drop of poison worth 5,000 origin stones. In just one move, the barefooted old man, who was an Ultimate Ruler, had died instantly.","After killing the barefoot old man, Jian Wushuang did not hesitate at all. He waved his hand and put the treasures left by the barefoot old man into his interspatial ring. Then he rushed onto the universe boat and continued to flee.","In the void not far behind, the cold man had been following the universe boat. He was not in a hurry. After all, he had already arranged for his Ultimate Ruler to intercept Jian Wushuang.","However, the cold man had never expected that the Ultimate Ruler he had sent to intercept Jian Wushuang would be killed by Jian Wushuang in one move.","This was completely beyond the cold man’s expectations.","“A third-level Ruler killed the Ultimate Ruler in one move? Although he used some special things, it’s still incredible. He deserves to be the disciple of that man.” The cold man’s eyes were cold.","The more heaven-defying Jian Wushuang was, the more murderous intent he felt.","Without the experts in front of him, it seemed difficult to stop Jian Wushuang’s universe boat.","“Humph, I wanted to save some energy, but now it seems that I can’t. In that case...” The cold man narrowed his eyes slightly. He waved his right hand, and a universe boat appeared in the void in front of him, a universe boat also appeared out of thin air.","This universe boat was not as big as the one Jian Wushuang was on, but it looked extremely delicate. Its body was like a flat surface, and the front part was extremely sharp, it was like a sharp spear.","It was worth mentioning that the universe boat that the cold man took out was much more powerful than Jian Wushuang’s universe boat.","“Let’s go after them.”","The cold man had already arrived on the universe boat. Under his control, the exquisite purple universe boat instantly burst out with a terrifying speed, piercing through the void and chasing after Jian Wushuang’s universe boat.","The purple universe boat was too fast. It was at least several times or even nearly ten times faster than the universe boat Jian Wushuang and the others were on.","With such a terrifying speed, the universe boat caught up with them in just a moment.","“Crash!”","Jian Wushuang’s universe boat was already in front of him, but the cold-looking man did not slow down at all. Instead, he fiercely crashed toward Jian Wushuang’s universe boat.","“Oh no!”","Inside the universe boat, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically.","Bang!","A terrible crash suddenly sounded in the universe void.","The black universe boat that Jian Wushuang was riding on was directly smashed into pieces.","The moment the universe boat collapsed, Jian Wushuang directly waved his hand and put Leng Rushuang and the Devil Flame into the suppression-type principle true treasure. Then, the divine power in Jian Wushuang’s body began to burn crazily.","He immediately performed the dragon-killing secret skill.","“Huh? Divine Power Burning Secret Skill?”","On the purple universe boat, the cold man looked at Jian Wushuang who was still running crazily and smiled disdainfully. “Is it useful?”","As soon as he finished his words, the cold man slowly extended his right hand and pointed in the direction of Jian Wushuang.","..."]},{"number":4090,"title":"Chapter 4090 - Human Face","paragraphs":["It was a casual finger, and it was quite far away.","However, the moment the cold man pointed, Jian Wushuang felt all the pores on his body stand up, and an unprecedented sense of fear emerged in his heart.","It had been many years since he had experienced this kind of fear.","This feeling was as if he had walked to the edge of hell and would die in the next moment.","Boom!","A finger as warm as jade appeared behind Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang could not care about anything else. At this moment, he directly displayed the innate divine power granted by the universal principle, the primitive universe!","The primordial universe and the dragon-extinguishing secret skill!","These were the two strongest trump cards in Jian Wushuang’s hands. But now, he did not hesitate to use them at the same time.","Moreover, after using these two secret skills, Jian Wushuang did not even think of destroying the jade-like finger. Instead, he immediately used the earth-guarding sword formation to the best of his ability.","Buzz! Waves of the Earth Sword Realm instantly rose up. With the support of the primordial universe and the dragon-extinguishing secret skill, the Earth Sword Formation became even tougher and stronger.","The layers of sword domain formed a complete defense of the sword formation and blocked in front of Jian Wushuang.","However, the moment the warm jade-like finger touched the sword formation, it was as if the finger had pierced through a layer of window paper.","One of Jian Wushuang’s most powerful protective measures, the earth-protecting sword formation, collapsed in an instant.","The finger continued to strike Jian Wushuang’s divine body with terrifying power. The principle Supreme Treasure armor on Jian Wushuang’s body could only weaken part of the power of the finger, the remaining power continued to transfer to his divine body.","Jian Wushuang’s divine body, which was comparable to a principle supreme treasure, was also very weak in the face of this finger.","Rumble...Jian Wushuang’s divine body directly collapsed, but it immediately regenerated.","However, after the recombination, his aura was extremely weak.","“50%!”","“This finger has destroyed more than 50% of my divine power!”","Jian Wushuang was extremely shocked.","When the cold man crushed the Dusty Rain Star World, he was affected and lost nearly 30% of his divine power. However, he was not alert at all.","But now, it was different.","He had used all his strength to resist this finger. He had even used his two trump cards, the dragon-killing secret skill and the original universe. Moreover, he had relied on the earth-guarding sword formation to resist it, he had also used his divine body, which was comparable to a principle true treasure. He was confident that even Ultimate Rulers who had comprehended universe principles might not be able to shake him.","However, such a powerful protective technique was so weak in front of a paragon.","The cold man had clearly not used his full power. He had just casually pointed at him.","However, that casual finger attack had wiped out 50% of his godly power. In addition to the 30% he had used previously, he now had less than 20% of his godly power left.","With less than 20% of his divine power and the cold man still behind him, how could he escape?","“Am I really going to die here today?” Jian Wushuang’s face was gloomy and his heart was full of unwillingness.","However, just as the cold man was about to attack again...","“Roar!”","An angry roar suddenly exploded in the dark universe void.","“Eh?” The cold man’s face suddenly changed. He could not help but look at the Void to the side, where a huge face had appeared out of nowhere.","The face was hundreds of millions of feet tall and infinitely large, almost covering the entire universe void.","A suffocating pressure was also transmitted from the face.","“Another supreme-being?” Jian Wushuang’s pupils suddenly shrank.","“Aren’t you being a little too arrogant in my Nine Luminaries Galaxy?” A cold voice came from the giant face.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was delighted.","He immediately understood that the face must be a supreme-being expert hiding in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy.","The Nine Luminaries Galaxy was an extremely ancient Star Field. It had produced many experts, including supreme-level experts. However, most of them had left the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, they had gone deep into the universe.","As for whether or not there was an Ruler in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field, that had been a secret for over ten chaos cycles. No Ruler had ever appeared in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field.","However, it now seemed as though there really was an Ruler within the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field. This Ruler had been in hiding and hadn’t shown his face.","However, now that a Ruler was leading a large group of experts to slaughter in the nine luminaries grand celestial domain, it was clear that this hidden Ruler had been alerted.","“I didn’t expect to encounter a Ruler in such a grand celestial domain. From the looks of it, you shouldn’t be considered weak amongst Rulers.” The sinister-looking man smiled as he looked at the enormous human face in front of him, however, he changed the topic and said, “Unfortunately, we have decided that the Nine Luminaries Galaxy must be eliminated. Since you want to stop us, Let’s kill you together.”","“You’re talking big!” The huge face shouted. In the next moment, the face continued to enlarge, and its terrifying power crushed toward the cold man.","The cold man’s expression became serious.","After all, his opponent was also a supreme-being, and his strength was not weak. Naturally, the cold man did not dare to be careless, and he could not be distracted to deal with Jian Wushuang.","“I’ll leave the Blood Sword to you guys,” the cold man said in a low voice. A long shuttle appeared in his hand, and he rushed toward the giant face.","The next moment, a terrifying explosion sounded in the universe.","The cold man had clearly engaged the owner of the giant face in a fierce battle.","As for Jian Wushuang, he immediately seized the rare opportunity and fled into the distant void.","Behind him, there were also pursuers. They were the Ultimate Rulers under the cold man.","These Ultimate Rulers had been in charge of intercepting Jian Wushuang in the void around the Dusty Rain Star World. Although the barefoot elder who had intercepted Jian Wushuang was killed by Jian Wushuang, the others were still alive and well, now, they had also followed him.","While the cold man was fighting with the giant face, these Ultimate Rulers had been chasing after Jian Wushuang with all their strength.","Now, Jian Wushuang had less than 20% of his divine power left. His strength had been greatly reduced, and he only had one drop of poison worth 5,000 origin stones. Naturally, he could not compete with these Ultimate Rulers.","However, the good news was that it was better to be chased by these Ultimate Rulers than to be chased by the cold man."]},{"number":4091,"title":"Chapter 4091 - The Great Escape","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang was fleeing rapidly in the dark universe void. Behind him, there were seven Ultimate Rulers who were pursuing him relentlessly!","Jian Wushuang had stopped burning his divine power. After all, there was not much divine power left.","Even so, the distance between him and the seven Ultimate Rulers was not shortened.","“A mere third-level Ruler is not much slower than us?”","“We are all Ultimate Rulers, how can we not catch up with him?”","The seven Ultimate Rulers who were chasing him were secretly speechless.","This was one of the benefits that Jian Wushuang gained after reaching the first stage of the Purple Blood Secret Manual and greatly improving his use of the universal principles.","Previously, Jian Wushuang’s use of the universal principles could only be used in his own attacks, but he did not know the various wonderful uses of the universal principles.","But now, Jian Wushuang was surrounded by the universal principles, and his speed was no less than that of an Ultimate Ruler.","The seven Ultimate Rulers were already a certain distance away from Jian Wushuang. After a turn, Jian Wushuang was still quite far away from them.","“We can’t keep chasing like this. Let’s use the universe boat.”","One of the Ultimate Rulers said.","As soon as he finished speaking, a universe boat emitting a faint bronze light appeared in front of him. The level of this universe boat was not very high, but it was much higher than the universe boat that Jian Wushuang had taken before.","Most importantly, this was the dark void of the universe. The speed of the universe boat traveling through the dark void of the universe was much faster than the speed of a cultivator.","In an instant, the Seven Ultimate Rulers entered the universe boat. The universe boat, which was emitting a bronze light, immediately burst out with amazing speed and chased after Jian Wushuang.","The speed of the universe boat was much faster than Jian Wushuang’s fleeing speed. In an instant, the distance between Jian Wushuang and them was shortened.","But suddenly...","Jian Wushuang, who had been fleeing in a straight line, suddenly turned around and changed his direction to rush toward the Void to the side.","“He changed his direction. Quick, let’s change our direction too.”","On the universe boat, the Ultimate Ruler who controlled the universe boat also immediately controlled the universe boat to turn around.","However, the universe boat was indeed fast in a straight line in the dark void of the universe, but it did not mean that the universe boat could change its direction so quickly.","It was easy to imagine that it would be much more difficult for a universe boat with such a huge body to change its direction than for a cultivator.","When universe boat finished changing its direction, Jian Wushuang had already continued to move forward for some distance. When universe boat was ready to continue chasing after him, Jian Wushuang, who was fleeing in front, immediately began to change his direction.","“This kid...is really cunning!”","“There’s no other way. Universe boat is fast, but it’s much more difficult to change direction while flying. This kid knows this, which is why he did this.”","“This is troublesome. If he continues to change direction like this, even if we take universe boat, it will be difficult to catch up with him.”","The seven Ultimate Rulers in the universe boat looked gloomy.","They had already felt that Jian Wushuang, a third-level Ruler, was too difficult to deal with.","But they did not give up.","“Let’s give up the universe boat and chase after him with our own speed. Although his speed is not much slower than ours, don’t forget that he has been severely injured by Lord Devour. He probably has less than 20% of his divine power left. Now, it’s obvious that he relies on the universe principles to be able to burst out with such amazing speed. However, using the universe principles all the time consumes a lot of his divine power. How long can he last with that little divine power?","“When his divine power is almost used up, his speed will naturally increase. Then we’ll chase after him and capture him.”","One of the Ultimate Rulers spoke, instantly gaining the approval of the others.","Immediately, the seven Ultimate Rulers put away the universe boat and began to chase after Jian Wushuang again with their own speed.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang did not need to continue changing directions. Instead, he maintained this distance and continued to flee forward.","While fleeing, Jian Wushuang looked back at the Ultimate Rulers who were chasing him from time to time, sneering in his heart, “Knowing that I was severely injured by the previous supreme-being and that I don’t have much divine power left, and that I’m only a third-level Ruler, you want to waste your time with me and kill me after I run out of divine power?”","“Humph, your plan is good, but I’m afraid you’ll disappoint them.”","Jian Wushuang could see the thoughts of the Ultimate Rulers behind him, but he was not anxious.","Yes, he was severely injured, and he did not have 20% of his divine power left.","But don’t forget, he was a perfect life. How vast was his divine power?","Even if he had less than 20% of his divine power left, it was still much more vast than ordinary Rulers. At least, the seven Ultimate Rulers were chasing him, even if their divine power was at its peak, however, Jian Wushuang did not think that he had less divine power left than them.","As for the consumption of divine power by using the universal principles...it was indeed a consumption. However, the seven Ultimate Rulers were also chasing him with all their strength, so did they also have to consume divine power?","It could be said that he was not at a disadvantage in the consumption of divine power.","Now, the competition was about whose divine power was more vast.","Even if Jian Wushuang had less than 20% of his divine power left, it was not a waste of his divine power.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","In the void of the dark universe, a figure quickly across, the speed is incredible.","The seven Ultimate Rulers had been chasing Jian Wushuang for almost an hour. They thought that Jian Wushuang’s divine power would be used up, but it turned out that Jian Wushuang was still so fast, has not weakened in the slightest.","“How is it possible? It has been nearly an hour since he escaped using the principles of the universe. His remaining divine power should have been used up long ago.”","“Even the few of us have used up quite a bit of our own divine power after chasing after him at all costs. I reckon that we’ve already used up more than ten percent of our divine power. However, this kid clearly doesn’t have much divine power, yet he hasn’t shown any signs of weakness at all.”","“What’s going on?”","The seven Ultimate Rulers were confused.","They had been staring at Jian Wushuang, who looked extremely weak. However, no matter how weak he was, his speed did not slow down.","At this moment...","“Huh?”","The seven Ultimate Rulers who were chasing Jian Wushuang with all their strength had a change in expression. Some of them immediately turned gloomy."]},{"number":4092,"title":"Chapter 4092 - Escape","paragraphs":["“So soon?” One of the Rulers said in a low voice.","“There’s nothing we can do. This is their territory, after all,” another Ruler said.","“His lordship gave the order for us to immediately leave. It seems we need to leave as soon as possible. Unfortunately, we weren’t able to catch that kid up ahead,” the third Ruler said.","These Ultimate Rulers all came from the same force, and they absolutely followed the orders of the higher-ups.","Now that they had received the order to leave immediately, they naturally would not stay any longer.","“Let’s go!”","With a sigh, the seven Ultimate Rulers immediately turned around and left in the direction they had come from.","Jian Wushuang, who had been observing the scene behind him, felt relieved when he saw the seven Ultimate Rulers turn around and leave.","“They finally left?” Jian Wushuang was still afraid.","Although the seven Ultimate Rulers had indeed disappeared from his sight, Jian Wushuang did not dare to stop. He continued to flee as fast as he could.","In the void of the universe where the Dusty Rain Star World was located, the huge human face had become even bigger and more ferocious than before.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","A series of earth-shaking and terrifying explosions kept ringing out from the center of the human face.","Each of the explosions seemed to be earth-shattering.","Each collision of divine power contained a terrifying strength that could destroy the world.","If the Dusty Rain Star World had still existed, it would have been destroyed countless times by the shockwaves.","The battle between Rulers could only be described as shocking.","This battle did not last for long.","Buzz...a figure suddenly appeared around the battlefield.","“Devour, stop,” the Golden War God, who was bathed in golden light, said in a sonorous voice.","In the middle of the huge human face, the cold man retreated and came to the Golden War God’s side.","“Their people have arrived. We have to leave immediately,” the Golden War God said.","“Hehe, they are really fast.” The cold man smiled. “Unfortunately, they are too late. This Star Field has been almost destroyed. The only regret is that the little guy escaped.”","“It doesn’t matter if he escaped. After all, he is only a third-level Ruler. Even if he really is that person’s disciple, he probably doesn’t know much.” The Golden War God said, then, he waved his hand. “Let’s go.”","The two immediately left.","As they left, the Golden War God coldly glanced at the enormous human face behind them. This glance caused the owner of the human face to be secretly shocked.","Hu! The huge human face vanished into thin air. At the center of the human face, an elderly figure slowly appeared.","It was a white-haired elder with a child’s face. He was standing on a purple beast that was over a hundred feet tall. Not only was the beast huge, but it also looked exceptionally ferocious. Its aura was also extremely terrifying.","“It’s actually a supreme-being!”","The old man with a child’s face and white hair looked in the direction where the two people had left. There was still a hint of shock in his eyes.","He was the owner of that human face. He was also the supreme-being who had been hiding in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy. His strength could also be considered quite strong among the supreme-beings.","The cold-looking man who had just exchanged blows with him had fought him in a fierce battle. The two of them were evenly matched. Clearly, their strength was not weaker than his.","He could still deal with this cold-looking man, but the Golden War God who had just arrived and told the cold-looking man to leave had given him a great deal of pressure.","Especially the cold glance that the Golden War God had given him when he had left. That glance had made the white-haired elder confirm that the other party had the strength of a supreme-being.","“A supreme-being. Even in the depths of the universe, he is a supreme being who can open up a divine kingdom alone. How could such a supreme being come here? And even start a massacre in this Star Field?”","“Who are they? And what is their purpose?”","The white-haired elder frowned and kept thinking in his heart.","...","In the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, Jian Wushuang fled to the dark void near the edge of the Star Field and finally stopped.","With a wave of his hand, Leng Rushuang and the Devil Flame immediately appeared in the surrounding void.","“Darling, are you okay?” Leng Rushuang looked at Jian Wushuang with a worried face.","Although she had been staying in the independent space of the Heaven Suppression Tablet, she could clearly see what had happened in the outside world.","She knew very well what kind of danger her husband had just experienced.","“Fortunately, although I used 90% of my divine power, I still saved my life.” Jian Wushuang exhaled lightly, but a relieved smile appeared on his face. “I almost died. I almost died.”","“Why are you laughing when you know you almost died?” Leng Rushuang rolled her eyes at Jian Wushuang.","“Hahaha!” Jian Wushuang laughed even more heartily, “This is what an adventure is like. This is what it’s like to travel in the universe. I haven’t felt like I’m on the brink of death for many years.”","Jian Wushuang sighed from the bottom of his heart.","Indeed, when he was in the Divine Beginning Realm, although he had potential enemies and met with danger, he was able to survive because his life-saving ability was too heaven-defying.","Even though some of the crises were dangerous, Jian Wushuang still had great confidence. He knew that he would not die so easily.","But the scene just now was completely different.","Even he himself did not have any confidence that he could survive the situation just now.","He could only try his best to live as long as possible.","Yes, when he was being chased by that supreme expert, he indeed thought that he could live as long as he could.","Because he really did not have any ability to resist the supreme expert. In the end, if the mysterious supreme expert who had been hiding in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy had not attacked him, he would have definitely died, at the very least, he would’ve been captured alive.","“This is the universe.”","Demonic Flame’s voice suddenly rang out, “Ruler, the universe is filled with danger. All sorts of dangers can be found in the universe. Cultivators who wander the universe often have their heads on their belts. It’s possible that a sudden crisis can cause them to die.”","“Just like this time, the crisis also came out of nowhere. Ruler, you were lucky enough to survive. However, the countless living beings and cultivators in this Star Field were killed without any preparation.”","“The slaughter in the universe is so ordinary and so sudden.”"]},{"number":4093,"title":"Chapter 4093 - Someone Came","paragraphs":["Chapter 4093: Someone Came","Hearing Devil Flame’s words, Jian Wushuang could not help but fall silent.","Indeed, although this encounter was extremely dangerous for him, he still survived in the end. But what about the other cultivators in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy?","Previously, when Supervisor Feixue sent him a message, she told him that these people had started a massacre in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy to completely destroy it.","With their strength, would it not be easy for them to destroy a great Star Field?","Although the Nine Luminaries Galaxy had many Star Worlds and countless living beings, after this battle, how many Star Worlds could be preserved and how many living beings could survive?","Compared to the countless living beings and cultivators killed in this disaster, he was indeed extremely lucky.","“This is the universe!” Jian Wushuang sighed.","Although he had been wandering in the universe for more than 100,000 years, it was not until today that he truly understood the cruelty of the universe.","Compared to the Divine Beginning Realm, the universe boat’s slaughter was crazier, more sudden, and more bottomless.","For some experts in the universe, destroying a large Star Field and killing billions of creatures was like crushing an ant. It was very common.","However, Jian Wushuang had never seen these things with his own eyes.","“Hu!”","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang took out a communication token.","“Supervisor Feixue.” Jian Wushuang sent a message to Supervisor Feixue.","“My friend Blood Sword, you survived?” Supervisor Feixue replied quickly.","“Thank you for sending the message in time so that I can be prepared. Otherwise...” Jian Wushuang thanked Supervisor Feixue.","Indeed, if Supervisor Feixue had sent him a message in advance, he would have been alert. Otherwise, he might not have been able to escape from that Ruler.","And even if he could escape, his wife and Devil Flame might not have been so lucky.","After all, it was precisely because he had received a message from Supervisor Feixue that he had immediately sent his wife, Devil Flame, and that Eighth into the universe boat so that he could carry them with him.","If they had not entered the universe boat earlier and that Ruler had attacked, the Dusty Rain Star World would have instantly collapsed. He might not have had the time to protect Leng Rushuang.","“Little friend, you are too polite. You are a friend of my Nine Emperor Pavilion. As the supervisor of the Nine Emperor Pavilion in the nine effulgent great star region, it is only right for me to give you a warning beforehand.” Supervisor Feixue laughed, then he asked, “Blood Sword, have you left the Nine Luminaries Galaxy?”","“Not yet, but I’m at the edge of it,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Then there’s no need for you to run now, my friend. The experts sent by some big forces in the depths of the universe have arrived. Those who killed in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy can only run for their lives now,” Supervisor Feixue said.","“Have the experts from the depths of the universe arrived?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, but he was not surprised.","Although the Nine Luminaries Galaxy was not located in the depths of the universe, it was very close. Moreover, the Nine Luminaries Galaxy had existed for a very long time. It was an extremely ancient Star Field, and there were many experts born in history, there were probably many Supreme experts.","Such a great galaxy must have many connections in the depths of the universe. How could some of the top experts or forces in the universe allow the Nine Luminaries Galaxy to be destroyed so easily?","It was certain that some experts would arrive.","However, Jian Wushuang did not expect that these experts would be so fast.","It would take tens of thousands of years, or even hundreds of thousands of years, or even longer, to travel from the depths of the universe to the Nine Luminaries Galaxy slowly with the help of the universe boat.","However, not long after that group of people had rampaged in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, the experts from the depths of the universe had arrived. It was obvious that they had used some of the universe passages that led directly to the Nine Luminaries Galaxy.","The cost of opening such passages was extremely shocking.","“Supervisor Feixue, can you tell me which forces have sent experts from the depths of the universe this time?” Jian Wushuang asked casually.","“It’s not a secret, so it’s okay to tell you.” Supervisor Feixue smiled. “This time, the Nine Luminaries Galaxy has encountered a great disaster, and five forces in the depths of the universe have been alarmed. Among the five forces, three of them are under the command of experts. Some of them are related to the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, and another one belongs to a special camp which contains a mission. And the last one is the Nine Emperor Pavilion!","“The reason why the experts of the Nine Emperor Pavilion came here is because the branch of the Nine Emperor Pavilion was destroyed by those people.”","Jian Wushuang nodded secretly.","“Blood Sword, since the experts from the depths of the universe have arrived, there will be no more trouble in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field. You Don’t have to leave in a hurry. You can come to the Nine Emperor Pavilion again when you have time. The position of the Lord sent by the Nine Emperor Pavilion is extraordinary. If you come to the Nine Emperor Pavilion, maybe I can introduce you,” said Supervisor Feixue.","“Thank you, Supervisor Feixue.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Soon, he cut off the communication with Supervisor Feixue.","At this moment, in the dark void in the center of the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field.","Rumble! A terrifying pressure gathered and formed a huge storm.","In this storm, towering figures stood there casually. No matter how strong the storm was, it could not move these figures at all.","There were a total of six people standing in the storm.","These six people were all Supreme-beings.","And one of them was a white-haired elder with a child’s face. He was the Supreme-being who had been hiding in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field.","However, this white-haired elder was clearly inferior when facing the other five people.","“Five people, this is all I know. As for the origins of those people, I don’t know anything about their goals,” said the white-haired elder with a child’s face.","After hearing the white-haired elder’s explanation, the five people in the storm frowned.","“You’re saying that there’s a Supreme-being amongst them?” An arrogant man with eagle-like eyes asked. His voice was filled with a metallic pressure.","“That’s right. Although he didn’t really make a move and merely glanced at me, I could sense the pressure he was giving me. The pressure he was giving me was definitely on the level of a Supreme-being,” the white-haired elder said.","“This is going to be interesting.” The wild man grinned. “How many Supreme Ruler-level experts are there in the entire universe? It’s fine if you can’t recognize them, but when you saw us rush over, you immediately left without saying a word...”","“...”"]},{"number":4094,"title":"Chapter 4094 - Sensing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4094: Sensing","“Although the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field does have quite a few connections with the experts of some of the major powers in the depths of the universe, the side that attacked this time was able to send out a Supreme-being. Naturally, their strength wouldn’t be too far off. At the very least, they should be one of the top powers in the universe. Logically speaking, there shouldn’t be any need for such a top-tier power to hide. It’s just a grand celestial domain. If it wasn’t destroyed, it would’ve been destroyed. There shouldn’t be a need for us to escape in advance,” A gentle female voice said from within the storm.","“It’s strange indeed. The people who attacked us were extremely fast. However, when they sensed that we had arrived, they immediately left without leaving any traces behind. This way of doing things doesn’t seem to be the work of those big forces in the universe. Instead, it seems to be the work of those people.” An aged voice sounded.","“Those people?”","The super existences in the storm instantly became solemn.","“If those people really did it, then there must be a big secret hidden in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field. The reason why they want to wipe out the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field is probably to cover up that secret,” said the arrogant man.","The people around also nodded in unison.","They were all top existences in the universe, and each of them had an extraordinary background. Naturally, they knew more about the secrets of the universe.","And the style of the group of experts who attacked the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field this time did indeed remind them of a mysterious organization.","If it really was that group of experts who attacked, then this Nine Luminaries Great Star Field was definitely not ordinary.","“Unfortunately, we came a little late. This Nine Luminaries Great Star Field has been almost destroyed. Those people have also escaped long ago, leaving no trace behind. If we want to find that secret, I’m afraid it won’t be that easy,” said the ancient voice.","“Even if we can not find it, we must find it. We can not come here in vain.” A gentle female voice sounded.","While these few Rulers were conversing within the storm.","The expression of one of the human figures, the wild and arrogant man whose eyes were as sharp as an eagle, changed at this moment.","“Huh?”","“This kind of sensing, could it be...”","A trace of surprise flashed across the wild and arrogant man’s eyes. “There is clearly a great distance from me, yet this sensing is still so intense?”","“This is interesting.”","The untamed man gave a strange smile and looked around at the people around him. “Everyone, it wasn’t easy for me to make this trip. I don’t intend to return just like this. I’ll just wander around the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field. If there’s anything, just send me a message.”","After the untamed man finished speaking, he directly turned around and left.","Most of the other Rulers in the storm didn’t feel anything wrong when they saw the arrogant man leave. However, one of the Rulers, a yellow-robed old man, cast a glance in the direction the arrogant man had left.","“This guy is usually very lazy. This time, he probably came to the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field because he received orders from the higher-ups. Given his personality, if those people had already left, he wouldn’t have bothered to look for them. Instead, he would have returned. However, why does he have so much free time today to wander around this great star area?” The yellow-robed old man narrowed his eyes.","Soon, the yellow-robed elder left in the same direction as the arrogant man.","...","In the dark, cold void of the universe.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged, recovering his divine power.","As for Leng Rushuang, Devil Flame, and Eighth, they stood in the surrounding void and did not disturb him.","Jian Wushuang had lost too much divine power in this crisis, so it would take a long time for him to recover.","Even if he recovered his divine power, Jian Wushuang did not dare to enter some Star Worlds. Although there were still many Star Worlds left in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, because of the frenzied slaughter of those people, Jian Wushuang still felt that it was safer to recover his divine power in the dark void of the universe.","However, what Jian Wushuang did not expect was that even though he was in the dark void of the universe, someone still found him.","Whoosh!","A stream of light suddenly flashed in the surrounding void and disappeared. A figure slowly appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and the others.","The figure was not very tall and looked very ordinary. However, the most noticeable thing was that he had a pair of eagle-like sharp eyes. After he came to this void, his sharp eyes spread out, his eyebrows were full of arrogance.","“Is it you?” The arrogant man asked, but his eyes were completely fixed on Jian Wushuang.","“Who is it?”","Devil Flame, who had been protecting Jian Wushuang, rushed over at the first moment and stared at the arrogant man with vigilance.","At the peak of Devil Flame, he was an Ultimate Ruler and had traveled in the depths of the universe. Naturally, he had a broad vision. Although he could not see the specific strength of the arrogant man in front of him, he knew intuitively that...this unruly man was not someone to be trifled with.","“I’m looking for him, not you. It’s best for you to leave,” the unruly man said with a faint smile. He did not even make a move, but as soon as he finished speaking, a powerful pressure pressed down on him.","Under this pressure, Devil Flame’s body suddenly trembled, and he immediately fell to his knees. No matter how hard he struggled, he was unable to stand up.","“Supreme expert!” Devil Flame’s eyes were full of fear.","Leng Rushuang and Eighth, who were in the void, were also shocked.","In the void in front of them, Jian Wushuang, who had been concentrating on recovering his divine power, also sensed the movement and opened his eyes immediately.","“Another Supreme expert?”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the arrogant man with an extremely ugly expression.","Supreme-being was the pinnacle expert in the universe.","Even in the depths of the universe, where experts were as numerous as clouds, Supreme-being experts were Supreme existences. It was usually very difficult to meet them, let alone at the edge of the universe.","But today, in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, in just half a day, he had met a total of three Supreme-beings!","The first one was the one who had crushed the Dusty Rain Star Field and almost killed him.","The second one was the Ruler of the giant face who had saved him at the critical moment. He was the Supreme-being expert hiding in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy.","And the arrogant man in front of him was the third one!","In half a day, he had met three Supreme-beings. Since when did a Supreme-being expert become so worthless?","“My Lord, are you looking for me?”","Although he was a little nervous, Jian Wushuang still asked calmly.","“Yes, I’m looking for you.” The arrogant man smiled, but then he extended his right hand and pointed at Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":4095,"title":"Chapter 4095 - Ruler Heart Slayer","paragraphs":["Chapter 4095: Ruler Heart Slayer","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was a casual finger. It looked as if it contained no power at all.","However, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically when he saw it.","It should be known that not long ago, the Supreme who had chased him outside the Dusty Rain Star World had also casually pointed out a finger. He had used all his strength and all his trump cards, but he had failed to resist that finger, he had almost died in that finger.","But now, he had only recovered less than 20% of his divine power. How could he resist the finger of the Supreme-being again?","Boom!","The terrifying power instantly acted on Jian Wushuang’s body. Indeed, Jian Wushuang did not have any room to struggle and resist.","The remaining divine power in his body was almost completely annihilated in an instant.","Fortunately, the arrogant man did not seem to have any intention of killing him directly and left him with a breath of life. Chapter 4095: Ruler Heart Slayer","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was a casual finger. It looked as if it contained no power at all.","However, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically when he saw it.","It should be known that not long ago, the Supreme who had chased him outside the Dusty Rain Star World had also casually pointed out a finger. He had used all his strength and all his trump cards, but he had failed to resist that finger, he had almost died in that finger.","But now, he had only recovered less than 20% of his divine power. How could he resist the finger of the Supreme-being again?","Boom!","The terrifying power instantly acted on Jian Wushuang’s body. Indeed, Jian Wushuang did not have any room to struggle and resist.","The remaining divine power in his body was almost completely annihilated in an instant.","Fortunately, the arrogant man did not seem to have any intention of killing him directly and left him with a breath of life. Chapter 4095: Ruler Heart Slayer","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was a casual finger. It looked as if it contained no power at all.","However, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically when he saw it.","It should be known that not long ago, the Supreme who had chased him outside the Dusty Rain Star World had also casually pointed out a finger. He had used all his strength and all his trump cards, but he had failed to resist that finger, he had almost died in that finger.","But now, he had only recovered less than 20% of his divine power. How could he resist the finger of the Supreme-being again?","Boom!","The terrifying power instantly acted on Jian Wushuang’s body. Indeed, Jian Wushuang did not have any room to struggle and resist.","The remaining divine power in his body was almost completely annihilated in an instant.","Fortunately, the arrogant man did not seem to have any intention of killing him directly and left him with a breath of life. Chapter 4095: Ruler Heart Slayer","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was a casual finger. It looked as if it contained no power at all.","However, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically when he saw it.","It should be known that not long ago, the Supreme who had chased him outside the Dusty Rain Star World had also casually pointed out a finger. He had used all his strength and all his trump cards, but he had failed to resist that finger, he had almost died in that finger.","But now, he had only recovered less than 20% of his divine power. How could he resist the finger of the Supreme-being again?","Boom!","The terrifying power instantly acted on Jian Wushuang’s body. Indeed, Jian Wushuang did not have any room to struggle and resist.","The remaining divine power in his body was almost completely annihilated in an instant.","Fortunately, the arrogant man did not seem to have any intention of killing him directly and left him with a breath of life. Chapter 4095: Ruler Heart Slayer","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was a casual finger. It looked as if it contained no power at all.","However, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically when he saw it.","It should be known that not long ago, the Supreme who had chased him outside the Dusty Rain Star World had also casually pointed out a finger. He had used all his strength and all his trump cards, but he had failed to resist that finger, he had almost died in that finger.","But now, he had only recovered less than 20% of his divine power. How could he resist the finger of the Supreme-being again?","Boom!","The terrifying power instantly acted on Jian Wushuang’s body. Indeed, Jian Wushuang did not have any room to struggle and resist.","The remaining divine power in his body was almost completely annihilated in an instant.","Fortunately, the arrogant man did not seem to have any intention of killing him directly and left him with a breath of life."]},{"number":4096,"title":"Chapter 4096 - Saved","paragraphs":["Chapter 4096: Saved","“Supervisor Feixue?” Ruler Heart Slayer’s expression changed, “After I came to this Star World, there was indeed a supervisor who contacted me, but I don’t know his name. Let me ask him.”","Ruler Heart Slayer immediately took out his communication talisman and began asking questions.","The arrogant man beside him had a gloomy expression.","A moment later, Ruler Heart Slayer finished asking.","!!","“You are Blood Sword?” Ruler Heart Slayer stared at Jian Wushuang with a strange light in his eyes.","He had indeed asked Supervisor Feixue about Jian Wushuang just now, and he had gotten the answer he wanted.","“A third-level Ruler whose combat strength is comparable to an Ultimate Ruler?”","“A Supreme genius who has comprehended a trace of universe principle at the level of a principle Ruler, a rare sight even in billions of Star Worlds!”","Even Ruler Heart Slayer could not help exclaiming in his heart after learning about Jian Wushuang.","In the next moment, he had made up his mind.","“Blackhawk, you can leave now,” Ruler Heart Slayer said casually.","“What did you say?” The untamed man frowned. “Ruler Heart Slayer, what do you mean?”","“Don’t you understand? I said you can leave now.” Ruler Heart Slayer smiled faintly. “This kid named Blood Sword is a genius on the Nine Emperor List. He’s also highly regarded by the upper echelons of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. Naturally, I won’t let you kill him.”","“Heart Slayer!” The arrogant man’s voice turned cold, there was still a trace of anger on his face, but it was quickly suppressed by him. The arrogant man’s expression eased up again, he chuckled and said, “Ruler Heart Slayer, even if this kid is on the Nine Emperor List, it has nothing to do with you. Why Don’t you do me a favor? How about this? As long as you leave now, I’m willing to pay three portions of the Heaven Lake Divine Fruit. How about it?”","The arrogant man was indeed eager to kill Jian Wushuang.","After all, killing a perfect life meant a lot to him, and he would be able to get more.","“Three portions of the Heaven Lake Divine Fruit?” Ruler Heart Slayer raised his eyebrows. “Blackhawk, you’re really generous. I’m really tempted.”","“Heart Slayer, think carefully. Even if you protect him now, what will you get?”","“Even if the top management of the Nine Emperor Pavilion knew about this, they would only praise you a little. But these three Heaven Lake Divine Fruits, even for you, it’s not easy to get them, right?” The arrogant man continued to seduce him.","On the other hand, Ruler Heart Slayer had a faint smile on his face, as if he was hesitating.","In the void beside him, Jian Wushuang was very anxious, but he did not dare to speak. He knew very well that his life and death depended on the will of this Ruler Heart Slayer.","“Blackhawk, you’re really generous. Unfortunately, you’re going to be disappointed,” said Ruler Heart Slayer.","The smile on the arrogant man’s face suddenly froze. He quickly said, “Heart Slayer, are you really not giving me face at all?”","“What a joke. How much is your face worth?” Ruler Heart Slayer was disdainful, “I can only tell you that you have found the wrong person. If it were some other Supreme-being from the Nine Emperor Pavilion, perhaps they would have given you face because of the three Heaven Lake Divine Fruits. It’s a pity that you have met me. I sincerely work for the Nine Emperor Pavilion. I don’t have much selfishness. Not to mention that this little fellow is highly valued by the higher-ups of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. Even if he is not highly valued, as long as he is a person on the Nine Emperor List, I will not let you kill him right under my nose.”","“You should have heard my words clearly. I won’t repeat them again. Blackhawk, leave.”","“Heart Slayer!” The untamed man was finally completely enraged. A berserk killing intent rose from his body as well.","“What? Do you still want to fight me?” Heart Slayer smiled coldly. “It’s not that I’m underestimating you. Even if two or Three Rulers of your level came at the same time, they wouldn’t be enough to defeat me. Scram!”","“If you don’t scram, I’m going to teach you a lesson.”","The wild-looking man gritted his teeth in anger as he stared fixedly at Ruler Heart Slayer. He felt as though there was a wormhole in his heart that he wanted to fight to the death with Ruler Heart Slayer.","However, this was indeed just a wormhole.","Ruler Heart Slayer was far more famous in the depths of the universe than he was, Ruler Blackhawk. In terms of power, Ruler Heart Slayer had risen to prominence through slaughter, and he was terrifyingly powerful.","Although he was also a Supreme and was not weak among Supreme-beings, he was still far inferior to an expert like Ruler Heart Slayer.","“Hmph, you win!”","The arrogant man snorted angrily. He glanced at Jian Wushuang unwillingly, then turned and left.","Seeing the arrogant man leave, Jian Wushuang finally let out a long sigh.","Leng Rushuang and Devil Flame, who were behind him, also felt relieved.","Whoosh!","The yellow-robed elder, Ruler Heart Slayer expert, floated toward Jian Wushuang.","“Blood Sword, thank you for saving me, sir.” Jian Wushuang immediately bowed with gratitude in his heart.","Indeed, if this Ruler Heart Slayer expert had not noticed the strange behavior of the arrogant man and followed him, he would have died at the hands of the arrogant man.","It was true that he had saved his life this time. Jian Wushuang had to remember this favor.","“You’re welcome, young man.” He waved his hand. “You’re on the Nine Emperor List. As a Supreme of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, I won’t let the Blackhawk kill you.","“However, you’re really lucky this time. If I hadn’t noticed the strange behavior of the Blackhawk and followed him, you would have been dead.”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded, but then he looked puzzled. “Sir, I haven’t met Ruler, nor have I had any communication or contact with him. How could he kill me for no reason? And how could he find my location?”","Jian Wushuang was sure that the arrogant man had come to find him.","However, he was in the dark void of the universe, which was vast and boundless. How could the arrogant man find him directly?","“Haha, little guy, I can tell that you haven’t been to the universe for long. If I’m not mistaken, you haven’t been to the depths of the universe, have you?” Ruler Heart Slayer looked at Jian Wushuang with interest.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","He was very eager to go to the depths of the universe, but he would not go until the matter of the Nine Luminaries Galaxy was completely settled. However, the matter of the Nine Luminaries Galaxy had not yet been truly settled.","“Little guy, you heard the conversation between me and the Blackhawk just now. The Blackhawk killed you because you are a special life form,” Ruler Heart Slayer said.","“He wants to kill me because I’m a special life form?” Jian Wushuang frowned."]},{"number":4097,"title":"Chapter 4097 - Cosmos Temple","paragraphs":["Chapter 4097: Cosmos Temple","He wanted to kill him just because he was a special life-form?","This puzzled Jian Wushuang.","After all, how many special life-forms were there in the vast universe?","A single Star World could give birth to all kinds of special life-forms. For example, Jian Wushuang had encountered special life-forms in the Divine Beginning Realm.","In other words, there could be two or three special life forms in an Star World and an era. How many special life forms could there be in the entire vast universe?","!!","There were countless of them, right?","If they had to be killed because they were special life forms, how many would they have to kill?","Moreover, since the vast universe gave birth to all kinds of special life forms, these special life forms naturally had their own meaning and reasons. They would not affect the balance of the universe, so why would they have to be killed?","“Little guy, don’t misunderstand.” Ruler Heart Slayer waved his hand, he said, “Since the vast universe has given birth to so many special life forms, these special life forms should naturally exist. However, because of the uniqueness of their life levels, they are naturally very different from other cultivators","“For example, special life forms have huge innate advantages that many ordinary cultivators do not have. However, as long as one is strong enough, even ordinary cultivators can think of ways to take away the innate advantages of these special life forms.”","“Take away?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Yes, in the depths of the universe, there are many experts. In order to increase their strength, they will constantly study the blood essence, hair, and so on of the special life forms to find ways to improve their life level,” Ruler Heart Slayer explained.","“To give a simple example, the power of the divine power of an ordinary life form is only at the most basic level. However, if he absorbs and refines some of the core things of the special life forms in various ways to improve his life level, his divine power power will increase by ten times or a hundred times from its original level!”","Jian Wushuang was stunned.","He was a special life-form and a perfect life-form. Naturally, he knew that there was a huge gap between a perfect life-form and an ordinary cultivator.","First of all, the power of his divine power was much, much stronger.","For example, he was only a third-level Ruler, but because of his perfect life-form, his basic divine power was slightly stronger than an ordinary fourth-level Ruler. There was a whole realm between them, the difference was hundreds of times, or even more.","And the power of divine power was only one of them. In terms of divine power, he was far more vast and majestic than Rulers of the same level.","These were the innate advantages given to him by the perfect special life-forms. Moreover, this was only a part of his innate advantage. He had more innate advantages, and he had not fully utilized them.","All in all, the innate advantages of the special life forms compared to ordinary cultivators were simply too great.","And if an ordinary cultivator could raise his level of life through all sorts of research, or by absorbing the blood essence of the special life forms or some other things...he believed that many experts in the universe would be willing to do so.","“It is precisely because the innate advantages of the special life forms are too great that many experts yearn to raise their level of life. And to do so, they have to act against the special life forms. Therefore, in the depths of the universe, experts often act against the special life forms. Moreover, the higher the level of life, the more people yearn for it.”","After a pause... “Of course, there are only a few of them. Even special life forms have to grow to a certain level before their blood essence and life level can slowly take effect. However, many special life forms that have yet to grow and become Rulers are useless even if they are caught.”","“Is that why Ruler wanted to kill me?” Jian Wushuang frowned and looked at Ruler Heart Slayer.","“No, he didn’t kill you to get your blood essence and improve his life level. He killed you because of his faction,” Ruler Heart Slayer said.","“Faction?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","“Little guy, you haven’t been in the universe for long. I’m afraid you haven’t heard of the Cosmos Temple,” Ruler Heart Slayer asked with a smile.","“The Cosmos Temple?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","He had heard of the Cosmos Temple.","Back in the Divine Beginning Realm, during the decisive battle with Devil Cloud Star, Devil Cloud Star Ruler had taken out that special spear. At that time, Devil Cloud Star Ruler had said that the spear came from the Cosmos Temple.","And Blackhawk, who had just tried to kill him, had taken out the same spear!","“It seems that you’ve heard of the Cosmos Temple?” Ruler Heart Slayer looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise, then he smiled and said, “The Cosmos Temple is a top force in the universe. To be exact, it’s a loose alliance at the top level. The purpose of this alliance is to hunt and kill special life forms. No one knows why.”","“There are many experts under the Cosmos Temple. These experts do not need to follow the orders of the Cosmos Temple. They only need to kill special life forms when they see them. Moreover, killing a special life form will be rewarded according to its level of life and strength.”","“For example, when Ruler was about to kill you, he took out that special spear. It is the Cosmos Temple’s unique star-exterminating spear. This star-exterminating spear has a great restraining effect on special life forms. Anyone from the Cosmos Temple will have one. In the beginning, this star-exterminating spear was of a lower level. However, as you kill more and more special life forms, this star-exterminating spear will become higher and higher, and its power will become more and more tyrannical.”","“As long as a special life is killed by the star-exterminating spear, it will be recorded on the spear. You can take the spear to the Cosmos Temple to collect the reward.”","“Ruler is a member of the Cosmos Temple. He wants to kill you to improve the power of the star-exterminating spear. On the other hand, he can get a great reward from the Cosmos Temple if he kills you. That’s why he’s willing to give me three Heaven Lake Divine Fruits and ask me to leave.”","Jian Wushuang immediately understood.","Ruler could have killed him at the beginning, but he did not kill him right away. Instead, he took out the spear and prepared to kill him with it the second time.","It turned out that Ruler could only get what he wanted by killing him with the spear.","It was estimated that the first time Ruler made a move, it was only to determine his level of life. The second time was when he intended to truly kill him. Unfortunately, by the time he made his second move, Ruler Heart Slayer had already arrived.","..."]},{"number":4098,"title":"Chapter 4098 - Comparable to a Supreme-Being?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4098: Comparable to a Supreme-Being?","“Of course, Blackhawk is a Supreme-being. He shouldn’t have bothered to fight against a weak and low-level special life-form. But today, he attacked you and was willing to take out three Heaven Lake Divine Fruits to ask me to leave...after all, the Heaven Lake Divine Fruits are extremely valuable. A single one is enough to make a Supreme-being envious, but he was willing to take out three of them. It seems that your life-level is very high.”","“My lord, to tell you the truth, I am a perfect life-level cultivator,” Jian Wushuang said.","“A perfect life-level cultivator?” Ruler Heart Slayer’s eyes lit up. “Haha, I Knew It. I was wondering how Blackhawk could be so generous. It turns out that he has his eyes on a perfect life-level cultivator. There are countless special life-forms in the vast universe, but only a handful of them can reach the perfect life-level. In the current universe alone, there are no more than five living perfect life-forms!”","“Although Blackhawk is a Supreme-being, he has never met a perfect life-form. If he can kill you, he will be rewarded handsomely from the Cosmos Temple. In comparison, three Heaven Lake Divine Fruits are nothing.”","!!","Heart Slayer understood why Blackhawk was willing to take out three Heaven Lake Divine Fruits and ask him to leave.","If it were him, he would be willing to give him five or ten portions of the Heaven Lake Divine Fruits as long as he could kill Jian Wushuang, not to mention three portions of the Heaven Lake Divine Fruits.","Killing a perfect life in the Cosmos Temple was definitely a great merit.","“Little guy, you are actually a cultivator at the level of a perfect life?” Ruler Heart Slayer looked at Jian Wushuang with a fiery gaze.","He had learned about Jian Wushuang from Supervisor Feixue. He knew that Jian Wushuang had comprehended a trace of the universe principle at the level of a principle Ruler. He was already a super genius rarely seen in billions of Star Worlds, there were probably no more than ten such super geniuses in an era of the universe.","Such a genius was already amazing enough. In addition to his even rarer status of a perfect life-level, how great was Jian Wushuang’s potential?","Although Ruler Heart Slayer was very knowledgeable, he could not predict Jian Wushuang’s future achievements.","Because in his eyes, Jian Wushuang had a bright future. As long as he did not die halfway, it was possible for him to reach any level in the future.","What he could guess now was Jian Wushuang’s lowest achievement.","“Little guy, with your potential, as long as you don’t die halfway, you will definitely become an Ultimate Ruler. And if nothing goes wrong, when you become an Ultimate Ruler, you should be comparable to an ordinary Supreme-being,” Ruler Heart Slayer said with a smile.","“Comparable to a Supreme-being?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","How powerful was a Supreme-being?","Jian Wushuang had not known about it before the fight, but after the fight, he realized that there was a huge gap between a Supreme-being and a Ruler that could not be bridged.","Before he met the Supreme-being who had killed him, he had fought with an Ultimate Ruler, or even a top-tier Ultimate Ruler. With his powerful body-protection techniques, Thunder God Palace Master had used all his skills, but he could not do anything to him.","Logically speaking, Jian Wushuang was strong enough. But when he met the Supreme-being, he realized how ridiculous his strength and body-protection technique were in front of the Supreme-being.","The Supreme-being who had chased him in the Dusty Rain Star World had just casually attacked him, but he had been severely injured and almost died. The difference in strength was like heaven and earth.","It was because the difference was too great that Jian Wushuang was not sure whether he could match an ordinary Supreme-being after becoming an Ultimate Ruler.","“Little guy, I know you’re only a third-level Ruler, but your battle strength is barely comparable to an Ultimate Ruler?” Heart Slayer looked over.","“I guess so, but I also used some special methods,” Jian Wushuang said.","“No matter what method you use, it’s a fact that you have such battle strength.” Ruler Heart Slayer smiled, “If you can reach this level in the third level, then when you break through to the fourth level, your battle strength should be comparable to that of a superior Ultimate dominator. When you reach the fifth level...I’m afraid that few Ultimate Dominators will be your match. Once you break through to the Ultimate dominator level, your strength will undergo a qualitative change again. When that time comes, it’s not an extravagant hope to be comparable to a Supreme.”","Jian Wushuang nodded secretly.","Indeed, he already had such battle strength at the third level, and he still had three major realms, the fourth level, the fifth level, and the Ultimate Ruler level. If he could surpass all three major realms...especially when he broke through from the fifth level to the Ultimate Ruler level, it would be a huge transformation.","By that time, his strength would definitely soar to a whole new level. He might even be comparable to or even stronger than an ordinary Supreme-being!","“My lord, is there an Ultimate Ruler in the universe who is comparable to an ordinary Supreme-being?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Well...yes, but very rarely. Under normal circumstances, every 10,000 chaos cycles or so, there will be a super genius who is comparable to an Ruler at the level of an Ultimate Ruler. There are even super geniuses who can kill an Ruler in a head-on fight at the level of an Ultimate Ruler. For example, 100,000 chaos cycles ago, a super genius named Jie Dong was a Ruler who had reached the Ultimate level. He was not a special life form and was merely an ordinary cultivator. However, his comprehension of the principles of the universe was frighteningly high, even higher than that of an ordinary top-tier Ruler. Coupled with some special encounters, his strength was incomparably terrifying.”","“In his era, he was recognized as the number one Ruler in the vast universe. He was so strong that he had killed an Ruler in a head-on fight!” Said Heart Slayer.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but take a deep breath.","An Ultimate Ruler who had achieved the status of an ordinary life-form had killed an Ruler in a head-on fight?","This Ultimate Ruler named Jie Dong was so terrifying!","“Unfortunately, it was because this Supreme genius named Eastworld was simply too heaven-defying that all of his enemies were terrified of him. As a result, his enemies paid an enormous price and even lost the lives of several Rulers to kill this genius named Eastworld. If Eastworld hadn’t died, he would’ve long ago become an Ruler by now. Given his talent, he would’ve long ago surpassed Supreme Rulers and reached the virtually invincible level.” Ruler Heart Slayer sighed softly."]},{"number":4099,"title":"Chapter 4099 - Mortal Enemy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4099: Mortal Enemy","“He’s dead?” Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly.","How terrifying and heaven-defying was it for an Ultimate Ruler to kill an Ruler directly?","It was a pity that such a super genius had died a long time ago.","“Young man, in terms of innate advantage and potential, you’re stronger than Jie Dong. My guess is that as long as you become an Ultimate Ruler, your strength will not be any weaker than Jie Dong’s. If you improve faster in the universe principles, your strength might be even stronger than Jie Dong’s!","!!","“In the future, if you can break through to become an Ruler, then you will truly soar. With your innate advantage, as long as you become an Ruler, you will definitely be a top-notch Ruler,” Heart Slayer said with a faint smile, but then he changed the topic. “However, because of your life level, you will have more potential enemies. The appearance of the Cosmos Temple is one of them. In the future, if you travel in the depths of the universe, you have to be careful. After all, the universe is dangerous. If you are not careful, you might directly die. By then, no matter how much talent and potential you have, it will be useless.”","Jian Wushuang nodded heavily.","He also knew that a genius was only a genius.","Before he really grew up, he just had more talent than others.","Only when he really grew up and reached the top level could he be qualified to be called a real expert.","But now, he was still far from being one of the top experts in the universe.","“By the way, Ruler Heart Slayer, even if Ruler wants to kill me, how could he find my location so accurately?” Jian Wushuang asked.","He had always been puzzled by this question.","Previously, he had been chased to this universe void, and the universe dark void was vast and boundless. It was too difficult to find a person here. That was why he had stayed here to recover his divine power.","However, he did not expect that Ruler would actually directly find him.","“Haha, this problem is actually very simple. That Ruler is not only a powerhouse of the Grand Cosmos Temple. Moreover, his status in the Grand Cosmos Temple is very high. If I’m not wrong, he should have a unique treasure bestowed by the Grand Cosmos Temple that can sense special life forms. This unique treasure can have a certain sense of those special life forms. Moreover, the higher the level of the life form, the stronger the sense will be.” Ruler Heart Slayer smiled.","“I guess Ruler didn’t know about your existence before, but when he arrived in this Star Field, the treasure on his body sensed you, which attracted his attention. Then he followed the direction of the treasure and found your location.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","A treasure that could sense the existence of special life forms?","Jian Wushuang could understand this kind of sensing ability.","After all, the universe was vast and there were countless kinds of life forms. In addition to the birth of countless experts, they had created all kinds of treasures. It was normal for some treasures to have special senses toward certain things.","Not to mention treasures, even life forms also had these special senses.","Devil Flame, for example, was from the gold-devouring clan. He was born with a strong sense for all kinds of special crystals. The higher the level of the special crystals, the stronger his sense would be.","“If the experts of the Cosmos Temple all have these special treasures, won’t it be dangerous for me to travel in the universe in the future?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He was now in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy and not in the depths of the universe. He had met an expert of the Cosmos Temple, a Supreme-being, and almost died.","But if he went to the depths of the universe in the future, there would be experts everywhere, and there would be many experts from the Cosmos Temple. If all the experts of the Cosmos Temple had these treasures, which could sense special life forms, wouldn’t that mean that powerful beings would come looking for him at any time? This time, it would be a Supreme-being. However, in the depths of the universe, it was possible that a group of Supreme-beings or even top-tier Supreme-beings would make a move.","Even Ruler Heart Slayer had said that killing a perfect life-form was a very generous reward from the Cosmos Temple. It was enough to tempt any Supreme-being. It was reasonable for a top-tier Supreme-being to kill him for the reward from the Cosmos Temple.","“Kid, you don’t have to worry too much. The Cosmos Temple is very powerful, and they do have many experts under their command. Their power extends to every corner of the universe. However, the experts of the Cosmos Temple aren’t able to kill those special lifeforms without fear. They also have many restrictions,” Ruler Heart Slayer explained with a smile.","“First of all, those special life-forms have enormous innate advantages. Anyone who grows up and dares to venture into the depths of the universe is quite powerful. Many special life-forms, in particular, have even more heaven-defying life-saving methods. Even if an Ruler were to personally attack them, they wouldn’t be absolutely confident in being able to kill them.","“Secondly, those special life-forms aren’t stupid. They know that they are weak on their own, which is why when they venture into the depths of the universe, they often find a good backer. For example, if they join a top-tier power or become a subordinate of an expert, the experts under the command of the Grand Cosmos Temple wouldn’t dare to provoke them.","“After all, the Cosmos Temple is just a loose alliance. They can’t completely gather their power together. The experts under the Cosmos Temple don’t dare to rashly provoke the major powers in the depths of the universe. Take Ruler Blackhawk, for example, for example. He came here today to kill you.","“It’s true that Ruler is a Supreme. He dared to kill you because you’re a solitary expert with no background. The only thing he has is a status on the Nine Emperor List. However, he’s only a friend of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. After all, he’s not a core expert on the Nine Emperor List. However, if you’re determined to join the Nine Emperor Pavilion and become a core expert under the Nine Emperor Pavilion, I can guarantee that Ruler won’t dare to kill you.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was quite shocked.","“Yes, the experts under the Cosmos Temple are all individuals. They don’t dare to provoke the big forces in the depths of the universe.” Jian Wushuang nodded secretly.","“In addition to these two points, the most important point is that the special life forms also know how to work together. In the depths of the universe, there is an extremely powerful top force, the Life Palace!” Heart Slayer’s voice suddenly became solemn.","“The Life Palace can accommodate all the special lifeforms in the universe. It is the home of all the special lifeforms in the vast universe, and the Life Palace and the Cosmos Temple are arch-enemies. They have been fighting nonstop for countless years!”","..."]},{"number":4100,"title":"Chapter 4100 - Not Reconciled","paragraphs":["Chapter 4100: Not Reconciled","“The Life Palace.” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","He was a member of the Life Palace. A long time ago, in the Blood Wave Realm, under the guidance of the Ruler of the Blood Wave Realm, he joined the Life Palace and cultivated the life abhijna.","Now that he was adventuring in the universe, the Life Palace was also his home.","“The Life Palace can compete with the Cosmos Temple?” Jian Wushuang looked at Ruler Heart Slayer.","!!","“On the surface, it can.” Ruler Heart Slayer nodded. “Of course, the Cosmos Temple is stronger overall. However, the Cosmos Temple is very loose and its experts are not united. Most of them join the Cosmos Temple for the reward of the Cosmos Temple. As for those who sincerely serve the Cosmos Temple, very few of them do.","“But the Life Palace is a group formed by many special lives. For their own safety and for their own interests, the strength of the Life Palace is closely related to their own strength. Naturally, the overall strength of the Life Palace is stronger.","“Little guy, you are a perfect life. The Life Palace should really hope that you can integrate with them. When you reach the depths of the universe, you can find an opportunity or a channel to contact the divine power of life and ask the experts of the Life Palace to come and receive you. With the help of the experts of the Life Palace, you don’t have to worry about being targeted by the experts of the Cosmos Temple in the depths of the universe.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“Haha, it’s actually very simple. The Life Palace is very powerful and can refine special treasures that can sense the presence of special life forms. However, there are also Supreme experts in the Life Palace who have created some special skills that can hide their life level. If you go to the Life Palace, you can cultivate that skill. Once you cultivate it, although there is no guarantee that experts from the Life Palace will not find you, in the depths of the universe, even if they have that special treasure behind them, they will have to be very close to you in order to barely sense your location.”","“I see.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","He had been worried that his perfect life level would be too eye-catching and bring him endless trouble when he entered the depths of the universe. But now it seemed that there was a solution in the Life Palace.","“I have the message token left by the Ruler of the Blood Wave Realm. He told me that I could use this token to send a message to him when I enter the depths of the universe. He would come to receive me personally.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands. “I’m still at the edge of the universe. I’ll send a message to him directly when I reach the depths of the universe or when I’m close to the depths of the universe.”","The depths of the universe were too dangerous, especially because he was a perfect life form, which attracted even more attention.","It was certainly the best choice to enter the Life Palace when he did not have enough strength to stand firm in the depths of the universe.","“Little guy, you should be preparing to venture into the depths of the universe, right?” Ruler Heart Slayer looked at him.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Although this Star Field is not the depths of the universe, it is close enough. From here to the depths of the universe, you will arrive at the first divine kingdom. If you take an ordinary-level universe boat, you will only have about 10,000 years left. You are planning to go into the depths of the universe by yourself, right?” Ruler Heart Slayer asked.","“I thought so before, but now...” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Are you worried about Blackhawk?” Ruler Heart Slayer asked with interest.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “According to you, if you kill me, Ruler will receive a huge reward. This time, because of you, he can’t do it. But I’m sure he won’t let it go. I even think that he hasn’t gone far. He might be hiding in the nearby void. As soon as you leave, he will immediately kill me. Under such circumstances, I won’t even be able to go to the depths of the universe. Even a simple operation would be very difficult.”","“Haha, you know what to do.” Supreme Heart Slayer laughed, “Don’t worry, I’ll be a good person to the end. Since I’ve already saved you, I won’t only save half of you. Just stay by my side for the time being. It Won’t be long before the matter in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field is settled. Then, you’ll take your wife and leave for the depths of the universe,” Supreme Heart Slayer said.","“Thank you, my Lord!”Jian Wushuang was overjoyed.","“You’re welcome.” Supreme Heart Slayer waved his hand, he smiled and said, “You have so much potential. Maybe you can break through to become a Supreme, or even the top existence in the universe. When that time comes, I might ask you for help.”","“If that time comes, I will help you with all my strength,” Jian Wushuang said solemnly.","This time, it was indeed Ruler Heart Slayer who had saved his life. This was a great favor, much more than the favor given to him by Lord Xiao, who had given him the Purple Blood Secret Manual.","When he grew up in the future, he would certainly repay this great favor.","“Haha, then I’m really looking forward to that time. Well, bring your wife and guards. Let’s go,” Ruler Heart Slayer said with a smile. With a wave of his hand, a silver universe boat appeared in the void in front of him.","Jian Wushuang immediately took Leng Rushuang, Devil Flame, and Eighth with him and boarded the universe boat. Soon, the universe boat flew forward and disappeared into the void space in the blink of an eye.","Not long after the silver universe boat left, sou!","A figure suddenly appeared in the dark void space. It was none other than the unruly man, Blackhawk, who had left earlier.","The Ruler looked in the direction of the silver universe boat with a gloomy expression.","Jian Wushuang was right. He was unwilling to let the meat that was right in front of his mouth fly away. He was also unwilling to waste such a great opportunity to kill a perfect life form. Therefore, he seemed to have left directly, in fact, he had just left when he stopped and hid in the void to observe the situation.","He did want to kill Jian Wushuang as soon as Ruler Heart Slayer left.","But in the end, Ruler Heart Slayer left with Jian Wushuang and the others. Jian Wushuang had been following Ruler Heart Slayer, so he could not find a chance to kill him.","“Heart Slayer, damn Heart Slayer!”","Ruler gritted his teeth and cursed. He was full of resentment toward Ruler Heart Slayer.","“Hmph. It seems you’ve guessed that I’m nearby. But it doesn’t matter. I don’t believe that you’ll keep him with you. As long as you leave that kid’s side, I’ll immediately kill him.” Blackhawk’s gaze was cold, he then continued to fly in the direction of silver universe boat."]}]);
